msgid "Retour"
msgstr "Назад"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9c94136cd7"
msgid "Dormir avec {{yasuka.n}}"
msgstr "Спати з {{yasuka.n}}"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3d059beaf4"
msgid "Retour"
msgstr "Назад"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_55337f7b"
msgid "Je peux dormir avec toi cette nuit ?"
msgstr "Можна я сьогодні з тобою посплю?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_4eb64f5b"
msgid "Bien sûr, mais... pourquoi ?"
msgstr "Так, звичайно, але... Чому?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_77da0087"
msgid "Est-ce que j'ai besoin d'une raison ?"
msgstr "Мені потрібна причина?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_6d5c1b23"
msgid "Mon lit est trop grand et trop froid."
msgstr "Моє ліжко занадто велике і холодне."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_cdd2639c"
msgid "Alors, je vais te faire un peu de place dans le mien."
msgstr "Добре, я звільню місце у своєму."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_f99870e1"
msgid "Merci mon chéri."
msgstr "Дякую, любий."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_cd082b5a"
msgid "Le problème, c'est que moi, je ne dors plus..."
msgstr "Проблема в тому, що я не зможу спати..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_140aced7"
msgid "...mais je suppose que c'est le prix à payer pour dormir en compagnie d'une femme aussi sexy que {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "...але я гадаю, це ціна, яку потрібно заплатити за те, щоб спати з такою сексуальною жінкою, як {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_00838fdb"
msgid "Je ne devrais vraiment pas me plaindre..."
msgstr "Мені не варто нарікати..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_c4254423"
msgid "Bonjour, mon chéri, tu as passé une bonne nuit ?"
msgstr "Привіт, любий. Ти добре спав?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_057b853f"
msgid "...excellente."
msgstr "...Безумовно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_b95c5620"
msgid "Je dors toujours merveilleusement bien avec toi."
msgstr "Мені неймовірно добре спалося поруч з тобою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_61d3b746"
msgid "La prochaine fois, il faudra dormir dans ma chambre, nous aurons un peu plus de place."
msgstr "Наступного разу спатимемо в моїй спальні. У нас буде більше місця."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_87ebd839"
msgid "Je suppose que tu veux dormir avec moi cette nuit ?"
msgstr "Гадаю, ти хочеш поспати зі мною сьогодні?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_d51ada21"
msgid "Oui !"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_b459c5af"
msgid "Ça devient de plus en plus compliqué de contrôler mon érection..."
msgstr "Приховувати мою ерекцію стає все важче і важче..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_d3ef1345"
msgid "Je ne sais pas si elle s'en rend compte ou s'en amuse."
msgstr "Не знаю, чи вона це помітила, чи її це розважає."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_194fdee8"
msgid "...Peu importe, tant qu'elle dort paisiblement, je suis prêt à tout endurer."
msgstr "... Усе ж, я витримаю все, аби вона могла спати спокійно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_ce44d3c0"
msgid "Encore une nuit merveilleuse..."
msgstr "Ще одна чудова ніч..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_4a5609e2"
msgid "Je suis content que tu dormes aussi bien."
msgstr "Я радий, що ти добре спала."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_c4bbc95b"
msgid "N'hésite pas à me le dire si jamais je suis trop envahissante."
msgstr "Не соромся сказати мені, якщо я надто нав'язлива."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_6388eb64"
msgid "Woah, mais pourquoi tu..."
msgstr "Ого, але чому..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_5336898e"
msgid "N'en fais pas toute une histoire..."
msgstr "Не роби з мухи слона..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_651206ef"
msgid "C'est juste qu'habituellement, je préfère dormir sans nuisette."
msgstr "Просто зазвичай я віддаю перевагу спати без нічного вбрання."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_9aa21c61"
msgid "Ça ne te dérange pas ?"
msgstr "Тебе це турбує?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_edfc0c5a"
msgid "Si ça me dérange ? Pas du tout. J'ai juste été surpris."
msgstr "Турбує мене? Зовсім ні, я просто здивувався."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_e2124d11"
msgid "Tant mieux alors !"
msgstr "Тоді чудово!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_b92000fc"
msgid "...Merde, j'en peux plus."
msgstr "...Чорт, я більше не можу."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_4e1cf904"
msgid "Sa poitrine est pressée contre moi, je vais devenir fou."
msgstr "Її груди притискаються до мене. Я зараз збожеволію."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_863890e6"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}}... Pourquoi tu me tortures comme ça ?"
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}... Чому ти мене так мучиш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_a44fda81"
msgid "Bien dormi, je suppose ?"
msgstr "Ти добре спала?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_30932222"
msgid "Oh que oui, c'est bien plus agréable de dormir ainsi..."
msgstr "О так, спати так набагато приємніше..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_35214d2f"
msgid "Et toi mon chéri ?"
msgstr "А ти, любий?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_saito_room_9dd72774"
msgid "...On va dire que j'ai eu le sommeil un peu agité."
msgstr "...Скажімо, у мене була неспокійна ніч."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_3763ebab"
msgid "Mon chéri... J'ai fini mon service... Il te reste encore un peu d'énergie pour moi ?"
msgstr "Любий... Я закінчила свою зміну... У тебе ще залишилося трохи енергії для мене?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_bcb2b567"
msgid "J'ai tellement envie de toi."
msgstr "Я так тебе хочу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_28c4fc3e"
msgid "Mmmpff, je vois que monsieur dort encore comme une marmotte !"
msgstr "Бачу, ти спиш як убитий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_09c5bbee"
msgid "Alors, je vais venir m'occuper de toi en douceur."
msgstr "Тоді я прийду і ніжно подбаю про тебе."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_ef80cbba"
msgid "Tu es enfin tout à moi !"
msgstr "Нарешті, ти весь мій!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_283c7dca"
msgid "Mmmh..."
msgstr "Мммх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_b401ed1d"
msgid "Je ne peux plus attendre !"
msgstr "Я не можу більше чекати!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_0ca160af"
msgid "Mmmmh..."
msgstr "Ммммх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_8c53ad96"
msgid "Je vais bien m'occuper de toi."
msgstr "Я подбаю про тебе."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_053ca8d6"
msgid "Tu sais que tu peux t'occuper de moi aussi..."
msgstr "Знаєш, ти можеш і про мене подбати..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_283c7dca_1"
msgid "Mmmh..."
msgstr "Мммх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_5715bf7c"
msgid "À vrai dire, j'aimerais sentir ta langue en moi !"
msgstr "Насправді я хочу відчути твій язик всередині себе!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_f38cee9e"
msgid "Oui, voilà, comma ça !"
msgstr "Так, саме так!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_39b311c0"
msgid "Mmmmh, mmmmh, mmmmh..."
msgstr "Ммммх, ммммх, ммммх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_f5940bc4"
msgid "*Slurp*"
msgstr "*Сьорб*"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_5d6eb5fa"
msgid "Surtout continues, ne t'arrêtes pas..."
msgstr "Не зупиняйся! Будь ласка, не зупиняйся..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_431eb3d7"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "О, Боже..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_3043a446"
msgid "Je la sens vibrer entre mes mains."
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як він тремтить у моїх руках."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_5a9c4d03"
msgid "Je... Je sens que ça vient !"
msgstr "Я... Я відчуваю, що воно наближається!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_44f113a6"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu, c'est tellement bon."
msgstr "Боже, це було так добре."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_e1d94b1c"
msgid "Je jouis !!!"
msgstr "Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_7fd608cf"
msgid "Eh bien..."
msgstr "Що ж..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_d8b6927f"
msgid "C'était un délice."
msgstr "Це було смачно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_6676220d"
msgid "Merci pour ce repas !"
msgstr "Дякую за їжу!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_a281332e"
msgid "À te voir encore aussi dur, j'ai comme l'impression que tu n'as pas eu ton compte."
msgstr "Коли я бачу, що ти все ще так наполегливо працюєш, у мене виникає відчуття, що тобі ще не вистачило."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sixtynine_with_yasuka_6d2d5a28"
msgid "Ne t'en fais pas, je continuerai jusqu'à ce que tu t'endormes d'épuisement !"
msgstr "Не хвилюйся! Я буду продовжувати, поки ти не заснеш від втоми!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_2a00695d"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que tu veux encore ?"
msgstr "Що ти хочеш на цей раз?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_a5360e52"
msgid "Je pensais que tu avais compris, mais j'attendais peut-être trop de toi."
msgstr "Я думав, що ти знаєш, але, мабуть, я очікував від тебе занадто багато."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_02fe8308"
msgid "...Tu veux encore que je te suce, c'est ça ?"
msgstr "...Ти все ще хочеш, щоб я тобі відсмоктала?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_bf31bd63"
msgid "Je retire ce que je viens de dire."
msgstr "Забираю свої слова назад."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_3a5e9e11"
msgid "...Tu me donneras l'enregistrement après ?"
msgstr "...Ти віддаси мені потім касету?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_96b96480"
msgid "Je te promets que je te le donnerai à la condition que tu rembourses toutes les crasses que tu as pu me faire."
msgstr "Обіцяю, що віддам її тобі, якщо ти попросиш вибачення за все, що ти мені зробила."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_2d9a5a28"
msgid "Montre-moi que tu peux aussi être douce quand tu veux."
msgstr "І покажи мені, що ти можеш бути милою, коли захочеш."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_898b1990"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_04dab9af"
msgid "Mais rien ne t'y oblige, tu restes maitresse de tes décisions."
msgstr "Тебе ніхто не змушує. Це твоє рішення."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_16056077"
msgid "Et..."
msgstr "То..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_e23ad811"
msgid "Ça va, c'est bon, je vais le faire !"
msgstr "Добре, я зроблю це!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_c7399b2d"
msgid "Tu peux commencer dès que tu te sens prête !"
msgstr "Не змушуй мене чекати!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_3c40e8fa"
msgid "...tu es vraiment le pire !"
msgstr "...Ти справді жахливий!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_7d49025e"
msgid "Tu dis ça, mais..."
msgstr "Ти так кажеш, але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_baa9ba84"
msgid "Tu n'as pas refusé de le faire non plus."
msgstr "Ти теж би не відмовилася від цього."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_9fc616da"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_ad69c30e"
msgid "Je vais finir par croire que tu apprécies ce genre de moment qu'on passe ensemble..."
msgstr "Я починаю думати, що тобі подобаються ці моменти, які ми проводимо разом..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_d087c812"
msgid "Mmhh, n'importe quoi..."
msgstr "Ммх, неважливо..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_5a6e25b7"
msgid "Je le fais parce que..."
msgstr "Я роблю це, тому що..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_9361fdd7"
msgid "Parce que..."
msgstr "Тому що..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_c45e4a7f"
msgid "Peu importe ta raison, je m'en fiche."
msgstr "Якою б не була твоя причина, мені байдуже."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_9fc616da_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_0af93333"
msgid "Oh, c'est... toujours aussi maladroit, mais..."
msgstr "О, це... все ще незграбно, але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_fd2ed764"
msgid "C'est un peu mieux que la dernière fois."
msgstr "Це краще, ніж першого разу."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_02e06eaf"
msgid "Mmmm, mmmh, mmmmmmmh..."
msgstr "Мммм, мххммх, мхххмхмххммм..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_45aae9cc"
msgid "Je ne comprends pas un mot de ce que tu dis !"
msgstr "Ти ж знаєш, що я не розумію, коли ти говориш з повним ротом."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_f76ed324"
msgid "Doucement..."
msgstr "Повільно..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_fb0eb261"
msgid "Voilà."
msgstr "Ось так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_f0987198"
msgid "C'est beaucoup mieux !"
msgstr "Так набагато краще!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_92ff7c70"
msgid "Je sens que ça vient."
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як це наближається."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_8a7d480d"
msgid "C'était mieux, mais..."
msgstr "Так було краще, але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_5fa5e9c5"
msgid "Tu es encore trop maladroite."
msgstr "Це все ще не ідеально."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_cbae24fd"
msgid "Ce... C'est pas ma faute aussi, elle est trop g-"
msgstr "Це не моя провина, це занадто в-"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_ca24597e"
msgid "Grosse ?"
msgstr "Великий?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_dc1cb828"
msgid "Tu finiras par t'y habituer !"
msgstr "Ти звикнеш до цього!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_ec7911b2"
msgid "Tu peux sortir de ma chambre !"
msgstr "А тепер забирайся з моєї кімнати!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "blackmail_noriko_bj_4d486858"
msgid "Connard !"
msgstr "Мудак!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_47207c6d"
msgid "Vous faites entrer {{asami.n}} dans votre chambre."
msgstr "Ви впустили {{asami.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_c417b31f"
msgid "Faudra bien un jour que tu te décides à rentrer par la porte."
msgstr "Одного дня тобі доведеться почати заходити через двері."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_60687675"
msgid "Peut-être, mais c'est bien trop excitant de passer par la fenêtre."
msgstr "Можливо, але входити через вікно — це занадто захопливе..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_b004fa64"
msgid "Je n'ai pas arrêté de penser à toi aujourd'hui."
msgstr "Я не могла сьогодні не думати про тебе."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_df8483ed"
msgid "J'espère que je t'ai manquée ?"
msgstr "Сподіваюся, ти за мною скучив?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_e1830a25"
msgid "Tu n'as pas idée !"
msgstr "Ти навіть не уявляєш!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_asami_ece80b5a"
msgid "Prouve-le-moi."
msgstr "Доведи це."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t20237ad233"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_40d64a8e"
msgid "{{asami.n}} s'allonge, l'air ravi, sur le dos et semble vous attendre."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} лежить на спині, виглядаючи задоволеною. Ніби чекає на тебе."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_4a6ae3d0"
msgid "Allez, dépêche-toi, tu vas me faire attendre encore longtemps comme ça ?"
msgstr "Нумо, поквапся! Скільки ти збираєшся змушувати мене чекати?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_d4f6c526"
msgid "Eh bien voila..."
msgstr "Що ж, почнемо..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_9e54dd0a"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "Мммм..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_3f28a2e7"
msgid "Je me lasserai jamais de cette sensation !"
msgstr "Я просто не можу натішитися цим відчуттям!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_3f743077"
msgid "Continues, ne t'arrêtes surtout pas !"
msgstr "Продовжуй і не зупиняйся!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_7224e860"
msgid "Je sens que ça viens encore !"
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як воно наближається!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_afc5d48a"
msgid "Hann, c'est trop bon !"
msgstr "Мммм, це так добре!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_3c6756de"
msgid "Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_f6037220"
msgid "Reste en moi !"
msgstr "Залишся усередині!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_38253fe5"
msgid "Tu es toujours aussi vigoureux..."
msgstr "Ти все такий же енергійний..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_5d1e7e0d"
msgid "Tu crois qu'il te reste assez d'énergie pour..."
msgstr "Як ти думаєш, у тебе достатньо енергії для..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_9e2ee756"
msgid "Tu sais..."
msgstr "Ти знаєш..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_30116bda"
msgid "L'autre chemin ?"
msgstr "Туди...?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_c5cc7f09"
msgid "Pervers !"
msgstr "Збоченець!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_fb39bbb6"
msgid "Mais tu l'aimes bien ce pervers, non ?"
msgstr "Але ти кохаєш цього збоченця, чи не так?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_f9688cab"
msgid "Je l'adore !"
msgstr "Я кохаю його!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_393f1fd8"
msgid "Mhhhh..."
msgstr "Мхххх..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_378927be"
msgid "N'hésite pas, vas-y plus fort !"
msgstr "Не стримуйся! Сильніше!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_8143cf97"
msgid "Oui, oui ! Voilà comme ça !"
msgstr "Так! Саме так! Ідеально!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_bc73fb0f"
msgid "Je vais... jouir !"
msgstr "Я зараз... кінчу!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_4c0a28d7"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "О, Боже..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_444730b5"
msgid "J'adore ça !"
msgstr "Я в захваті!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc7fccc7dd7"
msgid "Je n'attendais que ça."
msgstr "Я чекав цього."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t842a808256"
msgid "Pas cette fois-ci."
msgstr "Не цього разу."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_8345ef06"
msgid "Tu veux remettre ça ?"
msgstr "Хочеш повторити?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1787126215"
msgid "Prendre les choses en main."
msgstr "Узяти ініціативу."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_64a06227"
msgid "{{asami.n}} se positionne sur vous avec un petit sourire en coin."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} накидається на тебе з легкою усмішкою."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_e66cbe9f"
msgid "Alors comme ça on aime bien être soumis ?"
msgstr "А? То ти любиш бути підкореним?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_29f68ec5"
msgid "Dans ce cas, je vais m'occuper de toi !"
msgstr "Тоді я подбаю про тебе!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_8837f808"
msgid "Hmmm, voilà ce que j'attendais !"
msgstr "Мммм, це те, на що я чекала!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_f2d84b84"
msgid "C'est juste... parfait."
msgstr "Це просто... ідеально."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_8bcff85e"
msgid "Je vais juste... accélérer... un peu."
msgstr "Я просто... прискорю темп... трохи."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_100b1f14"
msgid "Plus vite, plus vite, plus vite !"
msgstr "Швидше, швидше, ще швидше!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_21f83010"
msgid "Ah ! Ça vient ! Je sens que ça vient !"
msgstr "Ах! Я кінчаю! Я відчуваю це!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_18b6a6fa"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_51df532a"
msgid "C'est normal que je la sente toujours aussi dure en moi ?"
msgstr "Чому це все ще тверде всередині мене?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_5d30abca"
msgid "Eh bien..."
msgstr "Ну..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_03f99e40"
msgid "Tu n'as pas eu ton compte ?"
msgstr "Цього було недостатньо?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_b14bf260"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_93cb9029"
msgid "C'est bon, j'ai compris... Tu vas voir !"
msgstr "Добре, я зрозуміла... Ось побачиш!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_95ce7b93"
msgid "Mhhh..."
msgstr "Мххх..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_6da78720"
msgid "Tu vas me supplier d'arrêter."
msgstr "Ти благатимеш мене зупинитися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_a92f5a94"
msgid "Aucune chance !"
msgstr "Нізащо!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_fd4623b5"
msgid "Ah oui ?"
msgstr "Та невже?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_a129f5eb"
msgid "Et maintenant ?"
msgstr "А зараз?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_32a4c441"
msgid "C'est encore mieux !"
msgstr "Так навіть краще!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_ae6e0565"
msgid "Tu es une bête !"
msgstr "Ти звір!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_80c88352"
msgid "Oh, c'était tellement bon..."
msgstr "Ох, це було так чудово..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_76b78381"
msgid "Tu en veux encore ?"
msgstr "Ти все ще хочеш більше?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8ea5791392"
msgid "Se laisser faire."
msgstr "Дозволити їй взяти ініціативу."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1b165a1672"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t6975cd7d15"
msgid "Oh que oui !"
msgstr "О так!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_799b75ab"
msgid "{{asami.n}} s'endort épuisée contre vous, le sourire aux lèvres."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} засинає біля тебе, з усмішкою на її обличчі."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_961fa25f"
msgid "Aucune chance que tu te débarrasses de moi après une nuit comme ça !"
msgstr "Після такої ночі ти від мене нізащо не позбудешся!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sexe_asami_l_3540fb10"
msgid "J'ai déjà hâte d'être ce soir !"
msgstr "Я уже рада побачитись сьогодні ввечері."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t81798b50c6"
msgid "J'ai eu mon compte."
msgstr "З мене досить."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t814c558c8e"
msgid "Tu n'as pas peur que ma mère nous surprenne ?"
msgstr "Ти не боїшся, що моя мама може побачити нас?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ta2dccf3a0b"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tccb792b07d"
msgid "Je le savais !"
msgstr "Я знала це!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t7ae0480eb5"
msgid "Tu as intérêt à rester discret."
msgstr "Тоді тобі краще бути тихішою."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc056176144"
msgid "Tu as juste à te laisser faire."
msgstr "Тобі просто потрібно дозволити цьому статися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc8831c52b9"
msgid "Et si j'ai envie de résister ?"
msgstr "А якщо я почну чинити опір?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t39523ed3cc"
msgid "Tu peux toujours essayer..."
msgstr "Ти можеш спробувати..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc4131958bc"
msgid "Mais...[w] Je ne te laisserais pas faire."
msgstr "Але... [w] Я тобі не дозволю."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0ff550a756"
msgid "Humph !!"
msgstr "Хммф!!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t580883d222"
msgid "Moi non plus !"
msgstr "І я також ні!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2addd821bd"
msgid "Je n'ai pas beaucoup dormi mais ça en valait la peine !"
msgstr "Я мало поспав, але воно того варте."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8c65630d"
msgid "Bon..."
msgstr "Що ж..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34547958"
msgid "On a connu mieux comme départ."
msgstr "Бували й кращі дні..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34636eaa"
msgid "Je ne dois pas me laisser abattre, demain est un autre jour."
msgstr "Але нічого страшного. Завжди є завтра."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_21779e42"
msgid "Au moins {{noriko.n}} devrait me foutre la paix à présent..."
msgstr "Принаймні {{noriko.n}} тепер може дати мені спокою..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0e592d0b"
msgid "C'est déjà ça de gagner !"
msgstr "А це вже перемога!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_62b2743c"
msgid "Mais quelle salope !"
msgstr "Яка стерва!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fa159124"
msgid "J'avais oublié à quel point elle pouvait me casser les couilles..."
msgstr "Я вже й забув, як їй подобалося лускати мене по яйцях..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ea520bc"
msgid "Je vais devoir trouver une solution urgente pour la gérer..."
msgstr "Я мушу якомога швидше з нею розібратися."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_babc80ff"
msgid "Sinon, c'est moi qui l'étranglerai !"
msgstr "Інакше я її задушу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a7b80dff"
msgid "Demain..."
msgstr "Завтра..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3afd7d2c"
msgid "Ça va chier !"
msgstr "Будуть неприємності!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a21e86ee"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_83a33027"
msgid "Je sens plus mon bras..."
msgstr "Я не відчуваю руки..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_17d1d49e"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_45e10f61"
msgid "Quelle nuit..."
msgstr "Що за ніч..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4a5f9199"
msgid "Pourquoi fallait-il qu'elle dorme collée à moi en nuisette ?!"
msgstr "Чому вона мала спати приклеєною до мене в нічній сорочці?!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a21e86ee_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6428052b"
msgid "Faudra recommencer..."
msgstr "Треба буде повторити..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b7dd0b24"
msgid "Bon, aujourd'hui pas d'excuses, je commence par le [color=yellow]parc[/color]."
msgstr "Що ж, сьогодні більше ніяких відмовок. Треба йти до [color=yellow]парку[/color]."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4b9737d5"
msgid "Avec un peu de chance, je pourrais esquiver {{noriko.n}} !"
msgstr "Якщо пощастить, я зможу уникнути {{noriko.n}}!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_beffb810"
msgid "Bon, je crois que mon vieux baladeur n'est pas loin..."
msgstr "Мій старий плеєр має бути десь тут..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_03775ec8"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_87261a2b"
msgid "Rien..."
msgstr "Немає..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1e8ceb0d"
msgid "Pourtant, j'étais sûr qu'il était là !"
msgstr "Облиш, я знаю, що поклав його сюди. Якщо тільки...!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b71e31d7"
msgid "Je ne pense pas que {{noriko.n}} soit venue dans ma chambre..."
msgstr "Я не думаю, що {{noriko.n}} заходила до моєї кімнати..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8c6330db"
msgid "Pas après la discussion qu'on a eue en tout cas..."
msgstr "Після цієї невеликої розмови вона мала б знати краще..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8c443b7b"
msgid "Je devrais plutôt demander à {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Може, {{yasuka.n}} щось знає."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a7d9c0c3"
msgid "Avec un peu de chance..."
msgstr "Це краще, ніж йти в [color=yellow]лігво демона...[/color]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_428206e3"
msgid "{{noriko.n}}..."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_55b92307"
msgid "Quel sal...."
msgstr "О, чорт..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_484be334"
msgid "Je vais devoir trouver une solution pour entrer dans [color=yellow]l'antre du démon[/color]..."
msgstr "Мені доведеться знайти шлях до [color=yellow]лігва демона...[/color]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Lock quest if player goes back to corridor Character:`notice`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t57126a6dfd"
msgid "Vous récupérez le baladeur MP3."
msgstr "Ти отримуєш MP3-плеєр назад"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3d76fd1f"
msgid "Enfin !!!"
msgstr "Нарешті!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_80cf7884"
msgid "Avec un peu de chance, {{macumba.n}} sera encore là !"
msgstr "Якщо пощастить, {{macumba.n}} все ще буде там!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8acab977"
msgid "Je suis sûr que {{macumba.n}} doit avoir une solution."
msgstr "Я впевнений, що {{macumba.n}} має знайти рішення."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7c07a7cf"
msgid "Pour qu'un mec frêle comme moi gagne en force rapidement."
msgstr "Щоб такий кволий хлопець, як я, міг швидко набрати сили."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_5f67f0ea"
msgid "Je peux savoir ce que tu fais dans ma chambre, {{noriko.n}} ?"
msgstr "Можеш пояснити, що робиш у моїй кімнаті, {{noriko.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_0cd7fbf8"
msgid "Oh, attends..."
msgstr "О-о, стривай-но..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_1234d562"
msgid "Laisse-moi deviner..."
msgstr "Дай вгадаю..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_69f8e65a"
msgid "T'as passé ta matinée à fouiller ma chambre et tu n'as rien trouvé ?"
msgstr "Ти весь ранок нишпорила у моїй кімнаті й нічого не знайшла?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_898b1990_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_e3cfbf1b"
msgid "Je veux que tu effaces la conversation..."
msgstr "Я хочу, щоб ти видалив той запис..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_fd517036"
msgid "Pourquoi je ferai ça ?"
msgstr "Навіщо мені це робити?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_73ee8bea"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que j'y gagne ?"
msgstr "Що я отримую від цього?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_b97be1f3"
msgid "Je... je promets de ne plus t'embêter et..."
msgstr "Я... Обіцяю, що більше не турбуватиму тебе, і..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_84789409"
msgid "Non ! Je n'ai aucune garantie que tu tiendras ta parole."
msgstr "Ні! Я не маю жодних гарантій, що ти дотримаєшся свого слова."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_ffa3d66a"
msgid "De plus, j'ai déjà un moyen de pression sur toi plutôt efficace, pourquoi je m'en séparerais ?"
msgstr "Мало того, у мене вже є досить ефективний спосіб тиску на тебе, тож навіщо мені від нього відмовлятися?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_27394f48"
msgid "...[w] Bon j'ai compris.[w] Tu veux quoi ?"
msgstr "...[w] Добре, я зрозуміла.[w] Що ти хочеш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_67f86906"
msgid "Ce que je veux ?"
msgstr "Що я хочу?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_d6f83c2a"
msgid "Je n'ai pas d'idée vraiment..."
msgstr "Поняття не маю, чесно кажучи..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_99409b01"
msgid "Et puis, je ne vois pas trop ce que tu pourrais m'apporter."
msgstr "І я не бачу, що ти можеш мені дати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_5c6f58c4"
msgid "J'ai déjà vu ta poitrine et il n'y avait pas grand-chose à voir."
msgstr "Я вже бачив твої груди, і там особливо нема на що дивитися."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_1e13324a"
msgid "Hey ! Espèce de-"
msgstr "Агов! Довбаний..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_e73a231d"
msgid "De quoi ?"
msgstr "Довбаний що?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_7cd2ffc1"
msgid "Ahem, non, rien..."
msgstr "Кхе-кхе, ні, нічого..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_bb3e3007"
msgid "...Et si je... je te suçais ?"
msgstr "...А якщо я... відсмокчу тобі?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_8c34a254"
msgid "Attends, quoi ?! Elle a bien dit ça ?"
msgstr "Чекайте, що?! Вона справді так сказала?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_523cc4b2"
msgid "Merde, ça va pas trop loin là ?"
msgstr "Дідько, не заходить це вже занадто далеко?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_a21e86ee"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_97fb76e2"
msgid "Je suis sûr qu'elle bluffe..."
msgstr "Упевнений, вона блефує..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_7406790b"
msgid "Pardon {{noriko.n}}, mais je n'ai pas très bien entendu."
msgstr "Вибач, {{noriko.n}}, але я тебе погано розчув."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_56aebb9c"
msgid "...Je peux te sucer."
msgstr "...Я можу тобі відсмоктати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_96176578"
msgid "...Alors là, je suis sans voix."
msgstr "...Що ж, тепер я втратив дар мови."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_fa2fc293"
msgid "Mais en échange, tu me donnes l'enregistrement."
msgstr "Але натомість ти маєш віддати мені цей запис."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_3c91a114"
msgid "À voir... Mais seulement si c'est bien fait."
msgstr "Побачимо... Але тільки якщо ти добре попрацюєш."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_a6a070f1"
msgid "Mais..."
msgstr "Проте..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_943ae61a"
msgid "C'est à toi de voir, mais tu as beaucoup à te faire pardonner."
msgstr "Вирішувати тобі, але тобі потрібно багато чого надолужити."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_ec0d361a"
msgid "Mais soit, j'accepte ta proposition."
msgstr "Тобто я приймаю твою пропозицію."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_31bfd4b1"
msgid "...T'es vraiment le pire des..."
msgstr "...Ти справді найгірший з..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_2ecdf241"
msgid "{{noriko.n}}, moins d'agressivité et plus de langue s'il te plait."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}, трохи менше ставлення і трохи більше язика, будь ласка."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_a64eff09"
msgid "Allez, tu peux l'attraper. Elle ne va pas te mordre, tu sais."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, можеш схопити його. Він не кусається, ти ж знаєш."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_c501cb42"
msgid "Je... je sais."
msgstr "Я... Я знаю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_2a2fdcd3"
msgid "Ne me dis pas que..."
msgstr "Не кажи мені цього..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_7f545b1a"
msgid "C'est la première fois que tu fais ça ?"
msgstr "Уперше це робиш?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_9fc616da"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_6a2ef199"
msgid "Tu m'as pris pour qui ?"
msgstr "За кого ти мене приймаєш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_b14bf260_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_c8a7ae17"
msgid "Je comprends, je vais être gentil, je vais te guider."
msgstr "Я розумію. Я буду обережним і направлятиму тебе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_5d7d431a"
msgid "Pour commencer, tu vas doucement sortir ta langue et me lécher le gland."
msgstr "Для початку ти повільно висунеш язика та оближеш мій кінчик."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_cd2384b5"
msgid "Voilà comme ça, le bout est sensible, évite de le croquer à pleine dent."
msgstr "Ось так. Кінчик чутливий, тому не зачіпай його зубами."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_dd4f1173"
msgid "Tu peux donner quelques coups de langue comme si léchait une glace."
msgstr "Можеш погладити його язиком, ніби лижеш морозиво."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_c9de58d8"
msgid "À présent, tu peux commencer à la glisser un peu plus profond dans ta bouche."
msgstr "Тепер почни брати його трохи глибше в рот."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_d0386a06"
msgid "Ensuite, tu fais des vas-et-viens avec ta bouche..."
msgstr "Потім рухай ротом туди-сюди..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_e2c114f7"
msgid "Utilise ta salive, ce sera plus facile."
msgstr "Обслинюй, так буде легше."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_1df51157"
msgid "Hmmmm, mmh, hmmmm, hmm..."
msgstr "Хмммм ммх хмммм хмм..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_4910a59a"
msgid "Doucement..."
msgstr "Легше..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_628457c6"
msgid "Attention à tes dents !"
msgstr "Обережно з зубами!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_0305e5b9"
msgid "Voilà, comme ça."
msgstr "Так, саме так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_cce64115"
msgid "Retire-toi !"
msgstr "Відійди!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_4925fe57"
msgid "Je... Je crois que ça vient {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Я... Я походу кінчаю, {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_c2edaa54"
msgid "Bon, je vais être honnête avec toi, c'était bien, mais je n'ai pas ressenti beaucoup d'amour."
msgstr "Тож буду з тобою відвертим. Це було чудово, але я не відчув особливого кохання."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_b1f57db0"
msgid "Surtout des coups de dents."
msgstr "Я здебільшого відчував твої зуби."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_48cbcb12"
msgid "Tu as vraiment besoin de t'entrainer davantage."
msgstr "Тобі дійсно потрібно більше практикуватись."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_84d2c057"
msgid "Tu me le paieras au centuple !"
msgstr "Ти заплатиш за це сторицею!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_62e4b7e4"
msgid "J'ai déjà payé pour tes conneries, c'est à toi de me rembourser à présent !"
msgstr "Я вже заплатив за твої помилки. Тепер твоя черга відплатити мені!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_b2375319"
msgid "Tu n'es pas obligée de faire tout ce que tu fais, tu as juste à te tenir tranquille et me foutre la paix."
msgstr "Ти не мусиш робити все, що ти робиш. Просто мовчи та дай мені спокій."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_3aebeb11"
msgid "Non, je ne te fais pas confiance là-dessus."
msgstr "Ні, я тобі не вірю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_9ddfc9aa"
msgid "Comme tu voudras, mais en tout cas ce n'est pas suffisant pour moi."
msgstr "Як хочеш, але мені цього замало."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_29cd7803"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_25026a8f"
msgid "Tu gagnes le droit de rester en vie, voilà ce que tu gagnes."
msgstr "Ти отримуєш право на життя, ось що ти отримуєш."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_d4f7e951"
msgid "Attends, quoi ? C'est quoi ton délire ?"
msgstr "Стривай, що? Що це за дурниці?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_ccda7d24"
msgid "Tu m'as entendu si tu ne me rends pas tout de suite..."
msgstr "Ти мене почув. Якщо ти не віддаси його зараз же..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_7ab1a389"
msgid "J'irai voir certaines personnes."
msgstr "Я піду до певних людей."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_c0523942"
msgid "Et tu auras beau faire le malin."
msgstr "І яким би розумним ти не був..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_8e212572"
msgid "Tu ne pourras pas négocier avec eux."
msgstr "Ти з ними не домовишся."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_26d9316e"
msgid "Je vois..."
msgstr "Зрозуміло..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_0994ca9b"
msgid "Alors ?"
msgstr "То ж?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_5d6b26e1"
msgid "Alors, je pense que je vais aller voir {{yasuka.n}} tout de suite ?"
msgstr "Тоді мені варто поговорити з {{yasuka.n}} прямо зараз?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_35c13fbc"
msgid "Pfff, j'y crois pas une seule seconde."
msgstr "Пф-ф-ф, ні на секунду не вірю, що ти це зробиш."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_15c90a83"
msgid "C'est du bluff !"
msgstr "Ти блефуєш!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_cbc6d353"
msgid "Cet enregistrement est bien trop important pour toi."
msgstr "Цей запис дуже важливий для тебе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_452cbf7c"
msgid "Peut-être bien, mais en derniers recours je n'hésiterai pas à m'en servir."
msgstr "Можливо, так і є, але в крайньому разі я без вагань скористаюся ним."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_7cb23f4f"
msgid "Et moi, je suis prête à tout pour le récupérer."
msgstr "І я готова зробити все, щоб його повернути."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_87ac14e5"
msgid "Je t'aurais prévenu {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "Я попередила тебе, {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_17c8b9ff"
msgid "Et à la fin, tu n'auras plus que tes yeux pour pleurer."
msgstr "І врешті-решт у тебе не залишиться іншого вибору, окрім як плакати."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_5a9244c2"
msgid "À tous les coups, elle va m'envoyer les trois thugs..."
msgstr "Б'юся об заклад, вона пошле тих трьох бандитів за мною..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_8351e58b"
msgid "Et que leur a-t-elle promis en échange ?"
msgstr "І що вона пообіцяла їм натомість?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_noriko_d0f1124f"
msgid "Il va falloir faire encore plus attention à présent."
msgstr "Тепер мені потрібно бути ще більш обережним."

#. Character:`notice`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t442db1e7a7"
msgid "Vous déposez les haltères dans votre chambre."
msgstr "Ти ставиш гантелі у своїй кімнаті."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1c4581e3"
msgid "Bon, je vais les poser là, ce sera parfait."
msgstr "Добре, просто покладу їх туди, і все буде добре."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d70d07ed"
msgid "J'espère que les décharges ne seront pas trop fortes."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, виділення будуть не надто сильними."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_c8558839"
msgid "J'ai assez donné pour aujourd'hui, je pense."
msgstr "Гадаю, на сьогодні я зробив достатньо."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_61c34b06"
msgid "On verra demain."
msgstr "Завтра побачимо."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2aa9fab2bb"
msgid "Je me suis déjà pas mal entraîné. On verra plus tard."
msgstr "Я вже достатньо потренувався. Подивимось пізніше."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_a47363ab"
msgid "Bon, quand faut y aller, faut y aller."
msgstr "Добре, потрібно йти."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`-sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_6031261b"
msgid "Selon {{macumba.n}}, le bandeau devrait se brancher ici..."
msgstr "Як казав {{macumba.n}} пов'язка на голову з'єднується тут із коробкою..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_e2547d9a"
msgid "Et le boitier devrait être relié aux haltères."
msgstr "А цю штуковину слід з'єднати до гантелей."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_b8d673b7"
msgid "Sans déconner, c'est quoi ce truc ?"
msgstr "Серйозно, що це таке?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_2834fb1e"
msgid "Y'a même des écouteurs !"
msgstr "Є навіть навушники!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_495b1fdc"
msgid "Ce gars est complètement accro à la musique, c'est grave."
msgstr "Цей хлопець повністю залежний від музики, це божевілля."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_873272f6"
msgid "Tout est prêt, il ne me reste plus qu'à appuyer sur ce bouton."
msgstr "Усе готово, залишилося лише натиснути цю кнопку."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_3c83d0f7"
msgid "[i]Salut petit frère et bienvenue dans le dernier entraînement sur-mesure pour les fiottes comme toi.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Привіт, братику, і ласкаво просимо до останнього тренування, створеного для таких кицьок, як ти.[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_5a838110"
msgid "Je ne sais pas si je dois être reconnaissant ou..."
msgstr "Не знаю, дякувати мені чи..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_a53f6970"
msgid "[i]Je savais que tu aurais besoin de ce type d'entrainement à un moment ou un autre.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Я знав, що колись тобі знадобиться таке тренування.[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_23b78f7a"
msgid "[i]J'ai tout préparé rien que pour toi, petit frère.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Я усе приготував тільки для тебе, братик.[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_fd1c9a2e"
msgid "[i]La seule façon de progresser, c'est de se dépasser constamment.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Єдиний спосіб прогресувати — постійно перевершувати себе.[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_8b4685b7"
msgid "[i]Mettre sa vie en jeu.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Постав своє життя на карту.[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_adb086e9"
msgid "Allez... c'est inspiré de quel animé cette fois-ci ?"
msgstr "Нумо, якою аніме-фразою це натхнено?"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_55de9ed1"
msgid "[i]La première chose à expérimenter, c'est la douleur.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Перше, що потрібно відчути — це біль.[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_575353fe"
msgid "Attends, la quoi ?!"
msgstr "Чекай, що мені треба пережити?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_7a015bc2"
msgid "Aaaaahhh ! Putainnnn !"
msgstr "А-а-а-а-ах-х-х, бляха муха!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_2aba6c9c"
msgid "[i]Petit frère, ce que tu viens de sentir c'est une décharge électrique.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Брате, ти щойно відчув удар струмом.[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_5037100d"
msgid "[i]De la plus faible intensité.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Найнижчої інтенсивності.[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_6e05b588"
msgid "[i]Si tu ne fais pas le mouvement comme il se doit...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Якщо ти виконуєш рух неправильно...[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_0b9293d5"
msgid "[i]Si tu n'es pas assez rapide...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Або якщо ти недостатньо швидкий...[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_c39161ed"
msgid "Je commence à comprendre... Je dois enlever ce truc et vite."
msgstr "Я починаю усвідомлювати... Мені потрібно швидко зняти цю річ, і швидко."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_22f82d57"
msgid "[i]Ou si tu retires l'équipement avant d'avoir terminé...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Або якщо ти знімеш річ, перш ніж закінчити...[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_c4d1b0c1"
msgid "[i]Tu te prendras à nouveau la décharge.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Ти знову отримаєш удар струмом.[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_4f05de0c"
msgid "Putain..."
msgstr "Дідько..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_cf2b5177"
msgid "[i]Et je viendrais personnellement te sodomiser avec les haltères.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]І я б особисто прийшов і запхнув гантелю у твою дупу.[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_edce6269"
msgid "...Pourquoi toujours vouloir me mettre des trucs dans le cul ?"
msgstr "...Чому він завжди хоче запхати мені щось у дупу?"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_e63c5639"
msgid "[i]Prêt ?[w] 3...[w] 2...[w] 1...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Готовий?[w] 3...[w] 2...[w] 1...[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_66c29d9d"
msgid "[i]Go ![/i]"
msgstr "[i]Руш![/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_fe385e16"
msgid "[i]On commence doucement par 50 séries.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Почнемо повільно з темпом 50[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_90f9dace"
msgid "[i]Et voilà petit frère. L'entrainement est terminé pour aujourd'hui.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Ось і все, брате. На сьогодні тренування закінчено[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_e62355ab"
msgid "[i]Si tu ressens de la douleur dans les bras et les pecs, c'est que tu as bien travaillé.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Якщо в тебе болять руки та грудні м'язи, ти добре попрацював.[/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_64609877"
msgid "[i]On recommence demain ![/i]"
msgstr "[i]Завтра починаємо знову![/i]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t36a9506a5f"
msgid "Vous sentez avoir gagné en force."
msgstr "Відчуваєш себе сильнішим."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_16a58356"
msgid "...Je suis mort, je ne sens même plus mes bras."
msgstr "...Я наче мертвий. Навіть рук уже не відчуваю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_9c44c8a5"
msgid "Je ne sais même plus pourquoi je me donne autant de mal."
msgstr "Я навіть не знаю, чому я мушу проходити через усі ці проблеми."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_fdbaa622"
msgid "Je dois continuer malgré tout..."
msgstr "Але я мушу продовжувати..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "halteres_2701e0eb"
msgid "Après une ou deux séances de plus, je pense que le chef changera d'avis..."
msgstr "Після ще одного-двох сеансів, я думаю, шеф-кухар передумає..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t354ea68646"
msgid "Aie aie aie, j'ai mal partout !"
msgstr "Ай-ай-ай, у мене все болить!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t84f7dbe1ba"
msgid "Tout mon corps me fait souffrir..."
msgstr "У мене болить усе тіло..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc500b97f36"
msgid "Ce n'est pas possible d'avoir aussi mal après une séance de sport."
msgstr "Не може бути, щоб після тренування так сильно все боліло."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t44cd473260"
msgid "Je ne dois pas faire les choses correctement."
msgstr "Мабуть, я щось роблю не так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2eeb843e1f"
msgid "Je dois aller demander à {{macumba.n}}."
msgstr "Мені потрібно спитати {{macumba.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ddd07557"
msgid "Mon chéri, j'espère que je ne te dérange pas, mais je crois qu'il y a quelqu'un pour toi devant la maison."
msgstr "Любий, сподіваюся я тобі не заважаю, але мені здається, що на тебе хтось чекає перед будинком."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e8b03ae9"
msgid "À cette heure-ci ? C'est {{minato.n}} ?"
msgstr "О такій годині? Це {{minato.n}}?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3ad7cebc"
msgid "Non, c'est une belle jeune fille en kimono."
msgstr "Ні, це красива молода дівчина в кімоно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_463b4fe1"
msgid "Ah, les jeunes grandissent tellement vite de nos jours."
msgstr "Ох, молодь так швидко росте в наш час."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_30ab7faa"
msgid "Assure-toi de la raccompagner chez elle."
msgstr "Не забудь провести її додому."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2682d351"
msgid "Entendu."
msgstr "Добре."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1d421d3e"
msgid "Bon, récapitulons un peu tout ce qui vient de se passer ces derniers jours."
msgstr "Що ж, нумо підсумуємо те, що сталося за останні кілька днів."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a448bba5"
msgid "L'entrainement physique avec {{macumba.n}} semble en bonne voie."
msgstr "Фізична підготовка з {{macumba.n}}, здається, йде по плану."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb5a1536"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} est de plus en plus hors de contrôle."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} виходить з-під контролю."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d646781e"
msgid "...Mais c'est grave, excitant."
msgstr "...Але це охрініти як цікаво."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4d3b664b"
msgid "Je me demande bien jusqu'où elle sera prête à aller la prochaine fois ?"
msgstr "Цікаво, як далеко вона захоче зайти наступного разу?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aef7d87d"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} semble se soumettre et se laisser faire."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}, здається, підкорилася і пустила речі на самоплив."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_70381e96"
msgid "Je dirais même qu'elle semble y trouver son plaisir."
msgstr "Я б навіть сказав, що їй, здається, це подобається."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dc3cace1"
msgid "Si j'avais su ça dans ma première vie, les choses auraient été bien différentes."
msgstr "Якби я знав про це в минулому житті, все було б зовсім по-іншому."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ad1cd180"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} semble prête à tout pour cet enregistrement."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}, здається, відчайдушно хоче цього запису."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8bf9d8e9"
msgid "Est-ce que je ne vais pas trop loin avec elle ?"
msgstr "Чи не перегинаю я з нею палицю?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_268482dc"
msgid "...Je dois rester prudent."
msgstr "...Мені треба бути обережним."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9532ff97"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} a été menaçante la dernière fois."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} погрожувала мені минулого разу."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f27c88f0"
msgid "Plus que d'habitude. Ce n'est pas son style de prévenir de cette façon."
msgstr "Більше, ніж зазвичай. Це не в її стилі — попереджати мене таким чином."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b792b9d3"
msgid "Je vais devoir redoubler de prudence."
msgstr "Мені потрібно бути більш пильним."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_af8db181"
msgid "Je vais pouvoir commencer à travailler et gagner un peu d'argent pour aider {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Я зможу почати працювати та заробити трохи грошей, щоб допомогти {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4736b600"
msgid "Ça fait des années qu'elle donne tout ce qu'elle a pour nous."
msgstr "Вона роками віддавала всі свої сили, щоб утримувати нас."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3b4aa89c"
msgid "Je ne peux pas la laisser tomber[w], pas maintenant que je suis en mesure de l'aider."
msgstr "Я не можу її підвести[w], не тепер, коли я можу їй допомогти."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9434d360"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} travaille en tant qu'hôtesse et je vais pouvoir commencer à gagner de l'argent aussi."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}} працює хостес, і я теж зможу трохи заробити."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ff9d06e8"
msgid "À deux, on remboursera plus vite toutes les dettes accumulées."
msgstr "Удвох ми швидше повернемо всі ці борги."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fb933882"
msgid "Dommage que {{noriko.n}} n'en fasse pas autant..."
msgstr "Шкода, що {{noriko.n}} не зробить те саме..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c7f9abf0"
msgid "{{asami.n}} me voit comme un ami."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} сприймає мене як друга."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a46e9516"
msgid "Est-ce que je vais réussir à sortir de la friendzone avant qu'il ne soit trop tard ?"
msgstr "Чи вдасться мені вийти з френдзони, поки не пізно?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b107da12"
msgid "C'est un défi intéressant, d'une certaine manière."
msgstr "Це по-своєму цікавий виклик."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aec28531"
msgid "{{asami.n}} veut se servir de moi pour rendre jaloux {{minato.n}}."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} хоче використати мене, щоб змусити {{minato.n}} ревнувати."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5b326824"
msgid "J'aurais pu refuser, mais je ne l'ai pas fait."
msgstr "Я міг відмовитися, але не став."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2e3626fb"
msgid "Si elle y tient tant que ça, il n'y a pas de raisons que je n'en profite pas non plus."
msgstr "Якщо вона так сильно цього хоче, то чому б і мені не скористатися цією можливістю."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c1111ed6"
msgid "J'ai repoussé la proposition d'{{asami.n}} et je pense que j'ai bien fait."
msgstr "Я відмовився від пропозиції {{asami.n}} і гадаю, що це було правильне рішення."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_16c260e9"
msgid "Faire ce qu'elle me demande aurait été malhonnête."
msgstr "Зробити, як вона просила, було б нечесно."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c6e5e226"
msgid "Je n'ai aucune envie d'utiliser une quelconque faiblesse phsycologique pour mon plaisir personnel."
msgstr "Я не хочу використовувати будь-які психологічні недоліки для особистого задоволення."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f247f83e"
msgid "{{sakuya.n}} m'a aidé à décrocher ce job, est-ce que je serais en mesure de l'aider ?"
msgstr "{{sakuya.n}} допомогла мені отримати ту роботу. Чи зможу я їй допомогти?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fdf0c349"
msgid "Et surtout, est-ce que je ferais les bons choix ?"
msgstr "І, що важливіше, чи зроблю я правильний вибір?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc04a1e1"
msgid "Putain, ma nouvelle vie est tellement plus intéressante."
msgstr "Чорт, моє нове життя набагато цікавіше."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3b55a832"
msgid "J'espère vraiment que les choses vont continuer dans ce sens."
msgstr "Я дуже сподіваюся, що все буде продовжуватися в цьому напрямку."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_92b37223"
msgid "La prochaine étape... C'est le dojo, je dois trouver un moyen d'y entrer."
msgstr "Далі... мені потрібно буде знайти спосіб записатися у доджьо."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e0b7465a"
msgid "Je dois absolument apprendre à me défendre seul et ne plus compter sur {{minato.n}} pour arrondir les angles."
msgstr "Мені конче потрібно навчитися захищатися, не покладаючись на {{minato.n}}, щоб згладити ситуацію."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3095a32f"
msgid "Demain est un autre jour !"
msgstr "Завтра буде новий день!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2eda1198a2"
msgid "Mince je crois que j'ai dormis un peu trop longtemps."
msgstr "Чорт, здається, я проспав трохи довше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1943fb3548"
msgid "Si je me dépêche je devrais pouvoir arriver a temps."
msgstr "Якщо покваплюсь, то маю встигнути вчасно."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9758fa4840"
msgid "J'espère qu'{{asami.n}} ne m'en voudra pas trop."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, {{asami.n}} не буде на мене надто сердитою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c31ba091"
msgid "Je dois absolument voir {{macumba.n}} ce matin."
msgstr "Мені конче потрібно побачити {{macumba.n}} сьогодні вранці."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b5dc3d27"
msgid "Il est le seul à pouvoir me sortir de ce pétrin."
msgstr "Він єдиний, хто може витягнути мене з біди."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_628821ba"
msgid "De plus, je crois savoir qu'il a des comptes à régler avec eux."
msgstr "Щобільше, я думаю, що він мав з ними певні рахунки."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2fed8b87"
msgid "Aujourd'hui va être une journée compliquée."
msgstr "Сьогодні буде складний день."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e9c23be2"
msgid "Je dois retourner voir {{minato.n}}."
msgstr "Мені потрібно повернутися до {{minato.n}}..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4bfa90ac"
msgid "Retrouver les filles au parc cet aprèm."
msgstr "Зустрітися з дівчатами в парку після обіду..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ac1053ab"
msgid "Et cette nuit, {{macumba.n}} mettra probablement du mobilier urbain dans le cul des trois connards."
msgstr "І сьогодні ввечері {{macumba.n}}, ймовірно, запхає трохи вуличних лавок у дупи цих трьох виродків."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6a7a9a6b"
msgid "J'ai hâte."
msgstr "Не можу дочекатися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2ed812b1"
msgid "Je ne dois pas oublier {{asami.n}} cet après-midi."
msgstr "Я не повинен забути про {{asami.n}} сьогодні вдень."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5f77ecc2"
msgid "J'ai hâte de voir cette fameuse surprise."
msgstr "Не можу дочекатися, як вона здивується."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f98565cc"
msgid "Woah, ta chambre est absolument géniale."
msgstr "Ого, твоя кімната виглядає просто приголомшливо."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7bf9d8ea"
msgid "Si j'avais su, je serais venu bien plutôt."
msgstr "Якби я знала, то прийшла б набагато раніше."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_10b4e546"
msgid "Oh, tu as même une Dreamcast !"
msgstr "О, у тебе навіть є Dreamcast!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a550acf9"
msgid "Tu as tout plein de jeux aussi..."
msgstr "І ще багато ігор..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dba85259"
msgid "Et tous ces mangas..."
msgstr "І вся ця манга..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_efe553f2"
msgid "Ça, j'ai lu, ça aussi... Ça je connais pas... Oh ça, ça a l'air bien, tu pourras me les prêter ?"
msgstr "Цю я вже читала, і цю теж... Цю я не знаю... О, ця виглядає чудово, можна взяти?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_103af63a"
msgid "T'es pas tenable ma parole."
msgstr "Боже, ти себе не контролюєш."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4bb2fbd0"
msgid "Désolé, désolé, mais ta chambre est vraiment bien !"
msgstr "Вибач, вибач, але твоя кімната занадто крута!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1caa64ba"
msgid "Du coup, tu viens pour lire des mangas, ou..."
msgstr "То ти прийшла сюди просто почитати мангу, чи..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dfe643ae"
msgid "T'es bête, c'est pour toi que je suis là."
msgstr "Дурник, я прийшла сюди заради тебе."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d1a7966f"
msgid "Mais ça n'empêche pas que je suis contente d'en apprendre davantage sur toi."
msgstr "Але я також рада дізнатися про тебе більше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7ef1b233"
msgid "J'aurais le droit de voir l'endroit où tu vis moi aussi ?"
msgstr "Тож чи зможу я колись побачити, де ти живеш?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3405ca2d"
msgid "Bien sûr !"
msgstr "Звичайно!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9aa8855a"
msgid "Mais pas tout de suite, on n'entre pas dans la chambre d'une femme comme ça."
msgstr "Але не відразу. У жіночу кімнату так просто не потрапиш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_090686d0"
msgid "J'ai deux trois choses à y faire avant."
msgstr "Спершу я маю подбати про кілька речей."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a134aa51"
msgid "Mouais, c'est le bordel, c'est ça ?"
msgstr "Так, там безлад, чи не так?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ffb23d7f"
msgid "...Peut-être."
msgstr "...Може."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0afffae2"
msgid "Assez parlé de moi. Si on passait aux choses sérieuses ?"
msgstr "Але досить про мене. Як щодо того, щоб стати серйозними?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e6052c29"
msgid "J'attends ça depuis cet aprèm."
msgstr "Я чекала на це цілий день."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb273d05"
msgid "À vos ordres !"
msgstr "Як побажаєш!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_52190cc4"
msgid "Allonge-toi, c'est moi qui m'occupe de tout."
msgstr "Лягай. Я про все подбаю."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_56476ac3"
msgid "Je crois que je me suis assez documentée ces derniers jours..."
msgstr "Думаю, що за останні кілька днів я провела достатньо досліджень..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1382a1a8"
msgid "Voilà, un peu plus ici... Juste là, voilà !"
msgstr "Ще трохи... Ось так, ідеально!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_83ae4ffa"
msgid "Ohhh...[w] C'est...[w] Ça n'a vraiment rien à voir avec..."
msgstr "О-ох...[w] Це...[w] Це зовсім не схоже на..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_902e2327"
msgid "Avec quoi ?"
msgstr "На що?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2d5cf1fb"
msgid "T'occupe pas !"
msgstr "Не хвилюйся!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4ce1783c"
msgid "Quelle idiote d'avoir attendu aussi longtemps."
msgstr "Я відчуваю себе дурною, що так довго чекала."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_09905697"
msgid "Assez parlez, si on passait à l'action ?"
msgstr "Досить балачок, хочеш, щоб шоу розпочалося?"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f8179796"
msgid "[i]Environ 2 heures plus tard...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Приблизно дві години потому...[/i]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5ff94d3a"
msgid "Je... Je vais encore jouir. Bon sang, pourquoi es-tu si endurant ?!"
msgstr "Я... Я зараз знову кінчу, звідки в тебе стільки витримки?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3c6756de"
msgid "Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d4ef6525"
msgid "Ne te retire pas, je prends la pilule !"
msgstr "Не витягуй! Я приймаю таблетки!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_598a3246"
msgid "Oh, euh, okay !"
msgstr "Ох, е-е, добре!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e6c45fef"
msgid "Je la sens qui vibre... C'est trop bon."
msgstr "Відчуваю, як він смикається... Так добре."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85ad7651"
msgid "Hannnn, mon Dieu..."
msgstr "Боже мій..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8d0753e7"
msgid "J'ai cru que tu ne t'arrêterais jamais !"
msgstr "Я думала, ти ніколи не зупинишся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6f4bf4af"
msgid "Tu te sens mieux à présent ?"
msgstr "Тобі вже краще?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d478d60"
msgid "Oui, j'ai des fourmis dans les jambes."
msgstr "Так, ноги просто затерпли."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_62571bf0"
msgid "...[w] Je constate que Monsieur est encore dur !"
msgstr "...[w] Здається, пан усе ще твердий!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a405ef10"
msgid "C'était difficile à cacher en effet..."
msgstr "Це важко приховати, напевно..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b9efe951"
msgid "Ne dis rien, j'aimerais essayer autre chose."
msgstr "Нічого не кажи. Я хочу спробувати щось інше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b939dd22"
msgid "Quel genre ?"
msgstr "І що?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_28b04b8e"
msgid "Tu verras bien."
msgstr "Побачиш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dacceea4"
msgid "Voila... Un peu plus bas..."
msgstr "Ось... Трохи нижче..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_03270625"
msgid "Doucement..."
msgstr "Повільно..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8f55201f"
msgid "Oh, c'est vraiment différent..."
msgstr "О, це зовсім інше..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9697883f"
msgid "Surprenant, mais ça reste agréable."
msgstr "Дивно, але мені подобається."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a2ee12ef"
msgid "Je m'attendais pas à ça..."
msgstr "Я не очікував такого..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a7b78844"
msgid "C'est vraiment serré, je ne sais pas si je tiendrai aussi longtemps."
msgstr "Дуже туго. Не знаю, чи витримаю ще довго."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_adf067a7"
msgid "Ha, j'ai donc trouvé ton point faible !"
msgstr "Ха! То я знайшла твоє слабке місце!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_601952a0"
msgid "Alors, je n'aurais aucune pitié pour toi !"
msgstr "Тоді я не помилую тебе!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7d3226d6"
msgid "Mhhh..."
msgstr "Мх-х-х..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4831083e"
msgid "Hann, c'est pas juste, je sens encore l'orgasme venir..."
msgstr "Гм-м-м, це несправедливо... Я вже відчуваю свій оргазм..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0278b082"
msgid "[i]Encore 1 heure plus tard...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Ще годину потому...[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7232deea"
msgid "J'en peux plus... Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я більше не можу... Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_70889256"
msgid "Enfin !"
msgstr "Нарешті!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d7b881a5"
msgid "J'en peux plus..."
msgstr "Я закінчив..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ae6b74fd"
msgid "Héhé, je gagne !"
msgstr "Хе-хе, я виграла!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8ffe75d7"
msgid "...C'est étrange, mais j'ai pas la sensation d'avoir perdu quoi que ce soit."
msgstr "...Дивно, але я не відчуваю, що я програв."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f854f4b7"
msgid "[i]Quelques minutes après s'être rhabillés...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Через кілька хвилин після того, як я вдягнувся...[/i]"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3d89d54f"
msgid "{{saito.n}}..."
msgstr "{{saito.n}}..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_64ae250a"
msgid "Quoi ?"
msgstr "Що?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1d3e1c9d"
msgid "Merci... J'ai jamais été aussi heureuse que maintenant."
msgstr "Дякую... Я ніколи не була щасливішою, ніж зараз."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_59356810"
msgid "Je ne sais pas comment l'expliquer, mais..."
msgstr "Я не знаю, як це пояснити, але..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f075d353"
msgid "J'ai passé tellement de temps à attendre de quelqu'un pour rien."
msgstr "Я витратила стільки часу на те, щоб когось чекати, і все даремно."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1a1f5a06"
msgid "Chut... Inutile de parler de ça."
msgstr "Тс-с... Не варто про це говорити."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ef6a5aab"
msgid "Je ressens la même chose."
msgstr "Я відчуваю те саме."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9fc879e7"
msgid "S'il y a un seul endroit où je voudrais me retrouver dans le monde, c'est ici avec toi."
msgstr "Якщо і є місце у світі, де я хочу бути, то це тут, з тобою."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6a1adb7c"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5fdfa439"
msgid "{{saito.n}}... ? J'ai encore envie de toi, c'est normal ?"
msgstr "{{saito.n}}?.. Я усе ще хочу тебе. Це нормально?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4ca23141"
msgid "Quoi ? Encore ?"
msgstr "Що? Усе ще?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_df63139d"
msgid "Oui..."
msgstr "Так..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d68835fb"
msgid "Bon, bon, je vais faire un effort."
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд, я постараюся."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9b20c8c9"
msgid "C'est ça, plains-toi, mais je crois que ton corps est plus honnête que toi."
msgstr "Ти скаржишся, але твоє тіло чесніше за твої слова."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a461164e"
msgid "Possible..."
msgstr "І правда..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9bd4eb96"
msgid "[i]Après une nuit de folie, {{asami.n}} et {{saito.n}} se sont endormis complètement épuisés.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Після пристрасної ночі {{asami.n}} та {{saito.n}}[/i] заснули, повністю виснажені."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b5568f37"
msgid "J'ai passé une nuit formidable..."
msgstr "У мене була неймовірна ніч..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_425d1edc"
msgid "Par contre, je ne sens plus mon vagin, c'est normal ?"
msgstr "Але я більше не відчуваю свою вагіну. Так має бути?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2cb68c75"
msgid "Moi aussi..."
msgstr "Я також..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_088eff29"
msgid "Mais ça, c'est normal, je crois."
msgstr "Але, гадаю, це нормально."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5f4ba104"
msgid "T'es bête, ma parole !"
msgstr "О, який же ти дурник!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_60277716"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr "Ха-ха."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6184f945"
msgid "Je n'ai pas envie de te quitter."
msgstr "Я не хочу залишати тебе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_92203f8a"
msgid "Tu es ici chez toi, tu veux revenir ce soir ?"
msgstr "Тобі тут завжди раді. Хочеш повернутися сьогодні ввечері?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2875ad2"
msgid "Oui !"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6dd50818"
msgid "Je t'attendrai devant, tu viendras me chercher ?"
msgstr "Я чекатиму на вулиці. Прийдеш за мною?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0c9fdc47"
msgid "Ça marche !"
msgstr "Це працює!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0b6d656d"
msgid "À ce soir, mon petit poney !"
msgstr "До вечора, мій маленький жеребець!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_26f212c6"
msgid "C'est la meilleure nuit que j'ai jamais passée."
msgstr "Це була найкраща ніч у моєму житті."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7083c355"
msgid "J'ai déjà hâte être à ce soir !"
msgstr "Я вже з нетерпінням чекаю на вечір!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4b32853e"
msgid "Je me demande bien ce qu'elle va faire aujourd'hui ?"
msgstr "Цікаво, що вона робить сьогодні..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_17cef6ac"
msgid "J'irai faire un tour au parc cet aprèm, peut-être que je la croiserai !"
msgstr "Піду прогуляюся парком. Може, зустріну її!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_59fd633d"
msgid "Hahaha !"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_974908c1"
msgid "Oh bon sang ! T'es folle de faire un truc pareil !"
msgstr "О чорт! Треба бути божевільною, щоб зробити щось подібне!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c807789a"
msgid "Allons, allons, je suis sûre qu'elle te considèrera autrement à présent."
msgstr "Ну-ну, я впевнена, що тепер вона буде думати про тебе по-іншому."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_22007af1"
msgid "Mouais... Je ne suis pas sûr qu-"
msgstr "Так... Я не впевнений, що..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3bbda0f5"
msgid "Oh, mais ta chambre est géniale !"
msgstr "О, але у тебе чудова кімната!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1fbd243e"
msgid "Tous ces mangas ! Ça j'ai... Ça aussi... Ah, ça j'ai pas... Oh, ça non plus !"
msgstr "Уся ця манга! У мене є ця і ця. О, у мене немає цієї, і цієї теж!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fe5acd24"
msgid "Je sens que je vais squatter chez toi plus souvent !"
msgstr "У мене таке відчуття, що я буду приходити до тебе частіше!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`-happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5e3bf39d"
msgid "Et ça, c'est quoi ? Slave maker... Je ne connais pas, c'est un film ?"
msgstr "А це що? «Рабовласник». Не знаю, це фільм?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_341ec0ee"
msgid "Oh, euh... C'est rien, juste un souvenir..."
msgstr "О, е-е... Це просто маленький сувенір..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4e27322c"
msgid "Mince alors, DreamCast ! J'en avais une y'a quelques années, j'ai tellement de bons souvenirs dessus !"
msgstr "Дідько, Dreamcast! У мене був такий кілька років тому. У мене стільки хороших спогадів про нього!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2db8cd27"
msgid "Oh, et tous ces jeux !"
msgstr "О, і всі ці ігри!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d38e2dc9"
msgid "T'es pas tenable, sérieux !"
msgstr "Ти вийшла з-під контролю, серйозно!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_404ec96d"
msgid "Allez, arrête Monsieur le rabat-joie, laisse-moi profiter un peu !"
msgstr "Ти зупинишся, пане веселуне? Дай мені трохи насолодитися цим!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4b148213"
msgid "Allez, viens t'assoir, faire une petite partie !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, сідай і давай пограємо в гру!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9cd333b6"
msgid "Je n'ai fait que m'entrainer et essayer d'arranger les choses depuis mon retour."
msgstr "Відтоді, як я регресував, я тільки тренувався і намагався все виправити."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eedf26a3"
msgid "Prendre une pause me fera du bien."
msgstr "Невелика перерва піде мені на користь."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_133fe5f3"
msgid "Okay, c'est bon, tu veux jouer à quoi ?"
msgstr "Гаразд, давай. У що хочеш зіграти?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2af26ec4"
msgid "J'ai juste besoin de retrouver mes réflexes..."
msgstr "Мені просто потрібно заново відкрити свої рефлекси..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_87b996d2"
msgid "Et tu vas prendre la branlée de ta vie !"
msgstr "І я виб'ю з тебе все лайно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_86652f17"
msgid "Merde, t'es plus coriace que je croyais !"
msgstr "Дідько, а ти сильніша, ніж я очікував!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6340f145"
msgid "Ah, tu vois ! T'es pas si nul que ça non plus."
msgstr "Звісно! Ти теж непоганий."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1b4d3149"
msgid "J'ai beau y réfléchir, je n'ai aucun souvenir d'avoir passé du temps avec quelqu'un comme ça."
msgstr "Скільки б я не думав про це, я не пам'ятаю, щоб я проводив час з кимось подібним."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cdba6eb0"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} m'as toujours humiliée, et moins elle avait affaire avec moi, mieux elle se portait."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} завжди принижувала мене, і чим менше вона мала зі мною справи, тим краще."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_204760a9"
msgid "Je me souviens lui avoir proposé une fois et elle m'avait répondu qu'elle préférait crever."
msgstr "Пам'ятаю, якось я запитав її, і вона відповіла, що краще б померла."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c0292ec8"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} n'avait jamais eu de temps pour jouer, mais en y réfléchissant, c'était normal."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}} ніколи не мала часу на ігри, але думаючи про те, це було нормально."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1080f087"
msgid "Elle était occupée à rembourser sa dette en silence sans nous inquiéter."
msgstr "Вона була зайнята тим, що потихеньку віддавала борг, щоб ми не хвилювалися."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ec7e2532"
msgid "J'étais si aveugle sur ce qui se passait autour de moi à cette époque."
msgstr "Тоді я був настільки сліпий, що не бачив, що відбувається навколо."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ca653292"
msgid "Mais, maintenant que j'y pense..."
msgstr "Але тепер, коли я думаю про це..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_442359e1"
msgid "Ce bâtard de {{minato.n}} n'était jamais venu jouer une seule fois dans ma chambre non plus."
msgstr "Той мудак {{minato.n}} жодного разу не заходив до мене в кімнату погратися."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4db80d69"
msgid "Et voilà ce qui se passe quand on passe son temps à rêvasser !"
msgstr "Ось що трапляється, коли ти мрієш під час гри!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d1c800c6"
msgid "Ah merde !"
msgstr "О, чорт!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0348000c"
msgid "Haha !"
msgstr "Ха-ха!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c3481bc8"
msgid "Okay, revanche !"
msgstr "Гаразд, час для помсти!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ccf52a28"
msgid "Cette fois-ci, je vais te perfect !"
msgstr "Цього разу я тебе не вдарю!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c576f6c9"
msgid "On se calme, c'était juste un coup de chance !"
msgstr "Заспокойся, тобі просто пощастило!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_543cdd68"
msgid "Bah voyons !"
msgstr "Та невже?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e4951d76"
msgid "Tu verras bien."
msgstr "От побачиш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34378c3e"
msgid "D'accord, mais dans ce cas, pimentons un peu tout ça."
msgstr "Гаразд, але в такому разі давай додамо трохи пікантності."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_52fa2bec"
msgid "Le gagnant a le droit de poser une question, et le perdant est obligé d'y répondre."
msgstr "Переможець ставить запитання, а той, хто програв, має на нього відповісти."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_234a2357"
msgid "Ohoh, c'est un jeu dangereux ça !"
msgstr "Охо-хо, це небезпечна гра!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1530b501"
msgid "Alors, tu te dégonfles ?"
msgstr "То що, злякався?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_57edf221"
msgid "Non,[w] je marche !"
msgstr "Ні,[w] я у грі!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_baedc717"
msgid "Alors, c'est parti !"
msgstr "Тоді поїхали!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f77e3eca"
msgid "Haha, tu vois ?!"
msgstr "Ха-ха, бачиш?!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_528d67b0"
msgid "Appelle-moi maitre."
msgstr "Називай мене майстринею."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4dee8d76"
msgid "Ça va, j'ai juste besoins d'un peu plus de temps pour me chauffer, c'est tout."
msgstr "Усе гаразд. Мені просто потрібно трохи більше часу, щоб розігрітися, ось і все."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_71d1f97c"
msgid "Oui, oui, c'est cela[w] en attendant..."
msgstr "Так, так, точно.[w] А тим часом..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_01006059"
msgid "Vas-y, pose ta question."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, запитуй."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5c531143"
msgid "Laisse-moi savourer le moment un peu."
msgstr "Дозволь мені трохи насолодитися цим моментом."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_946d0662"
msgid "Laisse-moi goûter les larmes du vaincu."
msgstr "Дай мені скуштувати твоїх сліз невдахи."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bc511248"
msgid "Putain, t'es complètement folle."
msgstr "Чорт, ти божевільна."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0348000c_1"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr "Ха-ха."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_81d54650"
msgid "Bon... Voici ma question !"
msgstr "Що ж... Ось моє питання!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_23faffd5"
msgid "Comment tu t'es retrouvé à vivre ici ?"
msgstr "Як ти опинився тут?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_223b5744"
msgid "Oh ! Je ne m'attendais visiblement pas à ça."
msgstr "А! Я точно не очікував, що ти це запитаєш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_912aae5c"
msgid "J'en sais trop peu sur toi comme j'en savais peu au final sur {{minato.n}}."
msgstr "Я так мало знаю про тебе, так само як я зрештою нічого не знала про {{minato.n}}."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3fbb9290"
msgid "Je ne veux pas reproduire les mêmes erreurs."
msgstr "Я не хочу повторити ту саму помилку."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5073c6da"
msgid "Okay, alors ça va être un peu long."
msgstr "Гаразд, але це займе деякий час, щоб пояснити."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_adf13165"
msgid "Aussi loin que je me souvienne, j'ai très peu de souvenirs de ma mère."
msgstr "Наскільки пам'ятаю, у мене дуже мало спогадів про матір."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_43766ce1"
msgid "Mon père m'avait dit à l'époque qu'elle manquait cruellement de maturité et qu'elle préférait passer son temps à s'éclater plutôt qu'à s'occuper de moi."
msgstr "Тоді мій батько сказав мені, що їй дуже бракувало зрілості, і вона вважала за краще проводити час, розважаючись, замість того, щоб піклуватися про мене."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aef35214"
msgid "Elle m'a complètement délaissé au fil du temps, elle ne rentrait même plus à la maison."
msgstr "Згодом вона повністю покинула мене, поки одного разу навіть не повернулася додому."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_73aa2c1e"
msgid "Mon père l'ayant très mal vécu, s'est complètement laissé aller."
msgstr "Мій батько дуже важко це переніс і повністю запустив себе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed268e4f"
msgid "Après quelques mois passer à vivre ensemble, lui non plus ne voulait pas me gérer."
msgstr "Після кількох місяців спільного життя він також не хотів піклуватися про мене."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_35b0589d"
msgid "Il a rencontré une femme beaucoup plus jeune, et est parti refaire sa vie ailleurs."
msgstr "Він зустрів набагато молодшу жінку і поїхав, щоб почати нове життя в іншому місці."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_27e0cdc5"
msgid "Il m'a laissé entre les mains de {{yasuka.n}} sans trop lui demander son avis."
msgstr "Він залишив мене в руках {{yasuka.n}}, навіть не спитавши її думки."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7476257e"
msgid "J'ai résumé vite fait, mais l'essentiel est là."
msgstr "Це був короткий підсумок, але основні моменти тут викладені."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_46a0e28c"
msgid "Mais, mais, mais...[w] C'est trop triste !"
msgstr "Але, але, але...[w] Це так сумно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c21a4b4e"
msgid "Je sais, mais c'est ma vie..."
msgstr "Знаю, але таке життя..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a2d47c4e"
msgid "Tu as déjà recroisé ta mère en ville ?"
msgstr "Ти коли-небудь зустрічав свою матір у місті?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_16d2c35a"
msgid "Non, je sais qu'elle y travaille encore, mais ça fait au moins 15 ans que je ne l'ai plus vue."
msgstr "Ні. Я знаю, що вона все ще працює там, але я не бачив її протягом останніх п'ятнадцяти років."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d9f94b55"
msgid "Tu n'as pas envie de la revoir ?"
msgstr "Ти не хочеш її більше бачити?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4fd30fa5"
msgid "C'est une autre question ça, dites-moi ?"
msgstr "Хіба це не інше питання?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d938e917"
msgid "Zut !"
msgstr "Прокляття!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_303ce132"
msgid "Non, maintenant, je m'en fiche, ma famille est ici et c'est tout ce qui m'importe."
msgstr "Але ні, мені вже все одно. Моя родина тут, і це все, що має значення."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_18b6a6fa"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_425df753"
msgid "Tu vas t'en remettre ?"
msgstr "Ти збираєшся пережити це?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8e3a67e9"
msgid "Nooon, ça m'a rendu trop triste, je ne sais pas comment tu fais pour gérer ça..."
msgstr "Ні-і-і-і, це так сумно. Не знаю, як ти можеш це пережити..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_855254ec"
msgid "J'ai le droit d'être triste pour toi ?"
msgstr "Хіба мені не можна сумувати за тебе?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f856f870"
msgid "Toi alors, t'es pas croyable !"
msgstr "Ти, ти дійсно щось особливе!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tcd792c740d"
msgid "Échouer lamentablement."
msgstr "Програти з тріском"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c896d582"
msgid "Heyyy !!!"
msgstr "Ой..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_37a12fff"
msgid "Je crois que quelqu'un vient de perdre."
msgstr "Здається, хтось щойно програв гру."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aff0cd97"
msgid "Mais, mais comment t'as fait ça ?!"
msgstr "Але, але, як ти це зробив?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_49eb75f5"
msgid "Je t'ai dit que tu avais eu de la chance."
msgstr "Я ж казав, що тобі вже пощастило."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_72fedc5f"
msgid "Pffff, allez, pose ta question !"
msgstr "Пфф, запитуй все, що завгодно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f51d7287"
msgid "Hmmm, voyons voir..."
msgstr "Гм, подивимось..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_60092e29"
msgid "Je peux demander n'importe quoi ?"
msgstr "Я справді можу запитати все, що завгодно?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7e3c8660"
msgid "Oui, n'importe quoi !"
msgstr "Так, що завгодно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c93745f1"
msgid "Même des trucs... Genre... Sexuel ?"
msgstr "Навіть як... сексуальні... речі?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_266529ea"
msgid "Je savais que t'étais un pervers, mais... Oui."
msgstr "Я знала, що ти збоченець, але... Так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_575d038f"
msgid "...Tu l'auras voulu !"
msgstr "...Ти сама напросилася!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d1783f1c"
msgid "Attends, attends..."
msgstr "Чекай, чекай..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_96d778af"
msgid "Tu pouvais demander n'importe quoi et tu choisis de me demander... ça ?"
msgstr "Ти міг запитати про що завгодно, і ти вирішив запитати... про це?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba1461d2"
msgid "Mais... Tu avais dit n'importe quoi !"
msgstr "Але... Ти сказала, що я можу запитати про що завгодно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9e40947b"
msgid "T'es un idiot ![w], Mais je vais te répondre."
msgstr "Ти ідіот![w] Але я тобі відповім."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e861ede6"
msgid "Je fais partie du club de natation."
msgstr "Я членкиня клубу плавання."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_22f7a736"
msgid "Et tous les jours, je vais nager."
msgstr "І я плаваю щодня."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_16024a2d"
msgid "La piscine reste ouverte pendant les vacances pour les membres du club."
msgstr "Басейн залишається відкритим у святкові дні для членів клубу."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_abef9cd4"
msgid "J'aime pas vraiment ces marques, mais je n'ai pas vraiment le choix."
msgstr "Мені не дуже подобаються ці лінії засмаги, але у мене немає вибору."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_706d5ae2"
msgid "Voilà, ta curiosité est satisfaite ?"
msgstr "Гаразд, це задовольнило твою цікавість?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_da7b2265"
msgid "Je suis satisfait !"
msgstr "Так, я задоволений!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t307dbfbab0"
msgid "D'où viennent toutes ces traces de bronzage?"
msgstr "Звідки всі ці лінії засмаги?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_21b09b1e"
msgid "...[w] T'es sérieux là ?"
msgstr "...[w] Ти серйозно?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_af97ee9d"
msgid "Mais... Tu avais dit n'importe quoi, alors je..."
msgstr "Але... Ти нічого не сказала, тож я..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9936cd5f"
msgid "Je te fais marcher, idiot !"
msgstr "Я жартую з тебе, ідіоте!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba8cd248"
msgid "Je pensais juste que tu n'aurais pas l'audace de demander un truc pareil."
msgstr "Я просто думала, що у тебе не вистачить духу запитати щось подібне."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_efc3c03b"
msgid "C'est quoi votre problème à vous les mecs avec la sodomie ?"
msgstr "Як бути з хлопчиками та аналом?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc3a2579"
msgid "Pourquoi vous voulez toujours le mettre là où c'est pas prévu à l'origine ?"
msgstr "Чому тобі завжди хочеться покласти інструмент туди, куди його не потрібно?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c76cbcf6"
msgid "Euhhh..."
msgstr "Е-е-е..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7f1f4933"
msgid "Peut-être que c'est justement parce que ce n'est pas prévu que ça en devient excitant ?"
msgstr "Може, саме той факт, що він не призначений для того, щоб туди потрапити, робить його захопливим?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_91174305"
msgid "Alors, pourquoi pas dans le nez ou dans l'oreille ?"
msgstr "То чому б тобі не вставити його в ніс або вухо?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a1f65fff"
msgid "Ça ne rentrerait pas..."
msgstr "Він не влізе..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_32741ce7"
msgid "Je vois... J'te savais pas aussi pervers, {{saito.n}} !"
msgstr "Зрозуміло... Я не знала, що ти такий збоченець, {{saito.n}}!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_72ff6166"
msgid "Mais pour répondre à ta question... Non, d'ailleurs j'ai jamais vraiment fait quoi que ce soit."
msgstr "Але, відповідаючи на твоє запитання... Ні. Насправді я ніколи не робила нічого подібного."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_29967a4a"
msgid "...Oh, mais attend une seconde toi !"
msgstr "...О, але постривай!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aeaec45c"
msgid "Tu as eu droit à deux réponses à cause de ta question !"
msgstr "Ти отримав дві відповіді на своє запитання!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a082fbad"
msgid "Héhé ! Alors, c'est qui l'idiot ?"
msgstr "Хехе! То хто тепер ідіотка?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_87e51afa"
msgid "Bien joué."
msgstr "Гарно зіграно."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ta2eae5e91e"
msgid "Tu as déjà testé la sodomie?"
msgstr "Ти коли-небудь пробувала анальний секс?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_acdff2ef"
msgid "Alors là, je m'y attendais pas."
msgstr "Я цього не очікувала."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a09d8e25"
msgid "Tu doutes de ma sincérité ?"
msgstr "Ти сумніваєшся у моїй щирості?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5e3e7928"
msgid "Je ne te suffis pas, c'est ça ?"
msgstr "Мене тобі мало, чи не так?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ff4d3041"
msgid "Hein... ?!"
msgstr "Що?!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dcacad1d"
msgid "Moi, je pensais qu'on se rapprocherait au fur et à mesure..."
msgstr "І я думала, що з часом ми зблизимося..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_60ab485f"
msgid "On finirait ensemble."
msgstr "Урешті-решт ми були б разом."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cdf88caf"
msgid "On ferait nos études dans la même fac."
msgstr "Ми навчалися б в одному коледжі."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6bab48a9"
msgid "On finirait par se marier quelques années plus tard."
msgstr "За кілька років одружилися."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_df75b51c"
msgid "On aurait des jumeaux, un chat qu'on appellerait Charlie."
msgstr "У нас були б двійнята, а кота ми назвемо Чарлі."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_70d64e88"
msgid "On finirait par s'éteindre tous les deux dans notre sommeil à l'âge de 85 ans, après une longue vie et de nombreux petits enfants..."
msgstr "Ми обоє б померли уві сні у віці 85 років, проживши довге життя з багатьма онуками..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_65dfc68a"
msgid "Bon, t'as fini tes conneries ?"
msgstr "Ти вже закінчила зі своїми дурницями?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6989fc35"
msgid "Haha, mais avoue, ce serait bien, non ?"
msgstr "Ха-ха, але погодься, хіба це не було б приємно?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_adcd23f1"
msgid "...Peut-être."
msgstr "...Може."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0d026cde"
msgid "Oui {{saito.n}}, j'ai quelques copines que je pourrais te présenter vu que je ne suffis pas à Monsieur !"
msgstr "Так, {{saito.n}}, у мене є кілька подруг, з якими я могла б тебе познайомити, оскільки мене, очевидно, тобі недостатньо!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dcf00a30"
msgid "Tu me donnes mal au crâne."
msgstr "У мене від тебе голова болить."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8dea4c525f"
msgid "Tu as vraiment des copines à me présenter?"
msgstr "У тебе справді є подруги, щоб познайомити мене?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t98a3b4d0b7"
msgid "Gagner avec un combo infini."
msgstr "Виграти з нескінченною комбінацією"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8a429a93"
msgid "{{asami.n}} et {{saito.n}} passèrent leur après-midi à jouer..."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} і {{saito.n}} провели півдня, граючи..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_078d7ae2"
msgid "Bon, j'ai passé une superbe journée avec toi."
msgstr "Що ж, я чудово провела з тобою день."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_90694b88"
msgid "Ça m'a fait tellement de bien."
msgstr "Було дуже добре."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e9fbb809"
msgid "Elle n'a pas tort."
msgstr "Вона не помиляється."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d1d79f8"
msgid "Ça m'a fait oublier tous mes soucis."
msgstr "Це змусило мене забути про всі мої проблеми."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_340bf209"
msgid "Tu reviens quand tu veux !"
msgstr "Приходь, коли захочеш!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0568b846"
msgid "Alors, je n'hésiterai pas, j'ai beaucoup de temps libre en ce moment."
msgstr "Тоді я не буду вагатися. Останнім часом у мене дуже багато вільного часу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d92907d1"
msgid "Je vais te raccompagner chez toi."
msgstr "Я проведу тебе додому."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8fdea9c4"
msgid "Ça alors, monsieur {{saito.n}} est bien élevé !"
msgstr "Що ж, пан {{saito.n}} — вихований джентльмен!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_57ad2fe6"
msgid "Tu t'arrêtes jamais ma parole ?"
msgstr "Агов, ти коли-небудь зупиняєшся?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e7655520"
msgid "Impossible, je suis de trop bonne humeur."
msgstr "Не можу! У мене занадто гарний настрій."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b823c101"
msgid "J'ai passé une super journée avec toi ! Je suis désolé de terminer sur quelque chose de triste, mais je trouverais un moyen de me faire pardonner."
msgstr "Я провела з тобою такий чудовий день! Мені шкода, що день закінчився на чомусь сумному, але я знайду спосіб загладити свою провину."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e5f47e14"
msgid "Tu peux revenir quand tu veux !"
msgstr "Можеш приходити, коли захочеш!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d60307fe"
msgid "Alors, je n'hésiterai pas une seconde."
msgstr "Тоді я не буду вагатися ані секунди."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_98566d55"
msgid "Je vais te raccompagner."
msgstr "Я проведу тебе."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b42ec755"
msgid "Tu n'es pas obligé, je suis grande !"
msgstr "Не треба. Я вже велика дівчинка!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_af89296a"
msgid "Certes, mais si je ne le fais pas, {{yasuka.n}} me demandera de le faire."
msgstr "Звичайно, але навіть якщо я цього не зроблю, {{yasuka.n}} попросить мене зробити це."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4f2944db"
msgid "Quel gentil garçon !"
msgstr "Який хороший хлопчик!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_04749801"
msgid "Bon... {{minato.n}} s'est comporté comme un connard."
msgstr "Що ж... {{minato.n}} поводився як мудак."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f5849919"
msgid "Ça peut arriver, tout le monde à ses mauvais jours."
msgstr "Таке трапляється. У всіх бувають погані дні."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_807bed81"
msgid "Mais venant de lui, ça me parait quand même étrange."
msgstr "Але з його вуст це все ще здається мені дивним."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d3744d5a"
msgid "Je vais y retourner, je dois mettre les choses au clair."
msgstr "Я повинен повернутися. Мені потрібно все прояснити."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0a7a0ec0"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que voulait {{yasuka.n}} ?"
msgstr "Чого хотіла {{yasuka.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c7d6e5d4"
msgid "Elle m'a dit que {{noriko.n}} n'avait pas cessée de nous espionner la dernière fois que tu es venue."
msgstr "Вона сказала мені, що {{noriko.n}} продовжувала шпигувати за нами, коли ти була тут востаннє."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4415cdf5"
msgid "Elle m'a demandé si on pouvait jouer avec elle..."
msgstr "Вона запитала, чи можна запросити її пограти..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ca0fd05c"
msgid "Dis-moi, elle est au courant que tu n'as plus 7 ans ?"
msgstr "А? Скажи мені, що вона знає, що тобі вже не сім."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_421ffa21"
msgid "Ouais, ouais, je sais..."
msgstr "Так, так, я знаю..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8f17b46e"
msgid "Mais elle restera dehors, si elle veut venir avec nous, elle n'a qu'à le demander elle-même."
msgstr "Але вона залишається ззовні. Якщо вона захоче зайти, їй доведеться самій про це попроситися."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f2cee9c6"
msgid "Allez, maintenant que les choses ont été mises au clair."
msgstr "Отже, тепер коли ми все прояснили..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f8199168"
msgid "Il est temps pour toi de connaitre l'amertume de la défaite."
msgstr "Настав час відчути гіркоту поразки."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e29b2b65"
msgid "Des promesses, toujours des promesses..."
msgstr "Обіцянки, завжди обіцянки..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_21eb3b76"
msgid "Les actes sont plus parlants."
msgstr "Дії говорять голосніше."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3174d435"
msgid "Jouer sans enjeux n'a aucun intérêt."
msgstr "Немає сенсу грати без ставок."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_86ceb08f"
msgid "Quoi, tu veux faire comme la dernière fois ?"
msgstr "Що, хочеш зробити те ж саме, що і минулого разу?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_635646fb"
msgid "Oh que oui."
msgstr "О так, чорт забирай."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_65c66ccc"
msgid "Je n'ai toujours pas digéré ma défaite !"
msgstr "Я досі не оговталася від поразки!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1121762f"
msgid "Ma vengeance sera terrible."
msgstr "Моя помста буде швидкою і страшною."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9535cd38"
msgid "Pour moi, ça sonne comme quelqu'un qui va perdre lamentablement !"
msgstr "Як на мене, це звучить так, ніби хтось збирається жалюгідно програти!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_36083c09"
msgid "C'est ce qu'on verra !"
msgstr "Це ми ще побачимо!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f8756e44"
msgid "Est-ce que tu sais que je t'avais laissé gagner au moins ?"
msgstr "Ти хоч розумієш, що я дозволив тобі перемогти?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4a6a6d9d"
msgid "Bah voyons, voyez-vous ça ?"
msgstr "Ну-ну, як щодо цього?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_77421135"
msgid "Non, non, c'est vrai, je t'assure."
msgstr "Ні, ні, це правда, присягаюся."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9e40420d"
msgid "C'est l'excuse la plus merdique que j'ai jamais entendu."
msgstr "Це найгірша відмовка, яку я коли-небудь чула."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bf5f7753"
msgid "Dans ce cas, prouve-le !"
msgstr "У такому разі, доведи це!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1f5889e9"
msgid "Tu t'es bien battu, mais..."
msgstr "Ти добре бився, але..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1929eb48"
msgid "C'est toujours insuffisant pour te mesurer à moi."
msgstr "Цього все одно недостатньо, щоб бути для мене парою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3087d6da"
msgid "Un jour, je te ferai ravaler ton arrogance."
msgstr "Одного разу я змушу тебе проковтнути свою гордість."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_58838551"
msgid "Oui, mais pour ça, tu dois gagner contre moi et ça semble plutôt mal parti."
msgstr "Так, але для цього тобі потрібно виграти у мене, а шанси не надто високі."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a6925106"
msgid "Pfff, bon, j'ai compris, pose ta question."
msgstr "Пф, я зрозумів. Запитуй."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_18b6a6fa_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0d378190"
msgid "Soit franc s'il te plait, tu sortirais avec une fille comme moi ?"
msgstr "Скажи чесно, ти б зустрічався з такою дівчиною, як я?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_74d93e76"
msgid "Euh... Je comprends pas trop, une fille qui te ressemble comme deux gouttes d'eau ou plutôt une fille dans le même style que toi ?"
msgstr "Е-е... Не зовсім розумію. Дівчина, яка виглядає точно так само, як ти, чи просто дівчина з таким самим стилем, як у тебе?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4d2a6f60"
msgid "Pourquoi faut-il toujours que tu compliques les choses ?"
msgstr "Чому ти завжди все ускладнюєш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_86cd37ad"
msgid "Mais, mais j'essaye juste de répondre au mieux à ta question."
msgstr "Я просто намагався відповісти на твоє запитання якнайкраще."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9e73a27c"
msgid "Disons que j'ai une sœur jumelle..."
msgstr "Скажімо, у мене є сестра-близнючка..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_206911c7"
msgid "Hmm, ça dépend, est-ce qu'elle me connait aussi bien que toi ?"
msgstr "Гм, це залежить від того, чи знає вона мене так само добре, як ти?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a521392c"
msgid "Je... On va dire que oui."
msgstr "Я... Скажімо так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8d172366"
msgid "Eh bien, je ne sais pas trop si je sortais avec ta sœur jumelle, ce serait étrange entre nous après, je passerais plus de temps avec elle qu'avec toi."
msgstr "Ну, я не знаю. Якби я зустрічався з твоєю сестрою-близнючкою, між нами було б дивно, тому що я проводив би з нею більше часу, ніж з тобою."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7471baac"
msgid "Mais... Rhaaaa, tu ne comprends rien !"
msgstr "Але... А-а-а-а, ти не розумієш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e8b98b75"
msgid "Ah ? Mais je croyais que-"
msgstr "А? Але я думав, що я..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d8a84cda"
msgid "Je vais reposer la question pour que ton cerveau de mâle bêta puisse comprendre."
msgstr "Я запитаю ще раз, щоб твій мозок бета-самця нарешті зрозумів."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2fd39583"
msgid "Es-tu attiré par moi ?"
msgstr "Я тобі подобаюся?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b14bf260"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d5aaedbf"
msgid "J'attends une réponse {{saito.n}} et tu n'as pas le droit de te défiler."
msgstr "Я чекаю на відповідь, {{saito.n}}, і ти не можеш втекти."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_60e9ae0f"
msgid "...Ça dépend en fait, tu veux dire sexuellement ou..."
msgstr "...Це залежить. Ти маєш на увазі сексуально чи..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_956352dc"
msgid "Je vais te tuer !"
msgstr "Я зараз тебе вб'ю!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_45a820c6"
msgid "{{asami.n}} saute sur {{saito.n}} pour se venger."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} накинулась на {{saito.n}}, щоб помститися."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_02939866"
msgid "{{saito.n}} retourne la situation assez facilement et se venge à son tour."
msgstr "{{saito.n}} досить легко переломив ситуацію і взяв реванш своєю чергою."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd4e05e7"
msgid "Ahh, ahh, arrête... S'il te plait... Stop..."
msgstr "Ах-х, ах-х, зупинись... Будь ласка... Зупинися..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aa8a782e"
msgid "Hahaha, pitié !"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха, благаю тебе!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_27ff255d"
msgid "Je vais finir par me pisser dessus si tu continues !"
msgstr "Я обмочуся, якщо ти не припиниш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5c47007d"
msgid "Hey, pas dans ma chambre !"
msgstr "Гей, тільки не в моїй кімнаті!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6549154a"
msgid "Il commence à se faire tard, je vais rentrer."
msgstr "Уже темніє. Мені пора додому."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_193682fa"
msgid "Oui, tu as raison, je vais te raccompagner."
msgstr "Так, ти маєш рацію. Я проведу тебе."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c7ec3687"
msgid "Inutile, je dois passer ailleurs avant."
msgstr "Не треба. Спочатку я маю ще кудись зайти."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7a4b5b14"
msgid "Tu es sûre ?"
msgstr "Ти впевнена?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_67744467"
msgid "Oui, on se retrouve demain ?"
msgstr "Так. Побачимося завтра?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b89c484b"
msgid "Bien sûr !"
msgstr "Звичайно!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t83d8532f2b"
msgid "Perdre de justesse."
msgstr "Програти з невеликим відривом"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cc7ba014"
msgid "C'est quoi ce b-"
msgstr "Що в біс..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ea8b59c5"
msgid "T'es juste née 30 ans trop tard pour pouvoir me battre."
msgstr "Ти просто народилася на тридцять років пізніше, щоб перемогти мене."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1e74942c"
msgid "Mais comment c'est possible ?!"
msgstr "Але як таке може бути?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_20a79d0e"
msgid "Pourquoi ce serait si difficile de penser que je pourrais être meilleur que toi ?"
msgstr "Чому так важко повірити, що я можу бути кращим за тебе?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a66e11b1"
msgid "Je suis sûre que tu triches !"
msgstr "Я впевнена, що ти обманюєш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e8dbf920"
msgid "Tu es dans le dénie ma pauvre."
msgstr "Бідолашна, ти заперечуєш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dde46679"
msgid "Ça va, j'ai compris... Pose ta question !"
msgstr "Гаразд, я зрозуміла... Питай!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd7b3880"
msgid "...[w] Ce n'est pas une cicatrice."
msgstr "...[w] Це не шрам."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d148a933"
msgid "Ah ? C'est quoi alors ?"
msgstr "А? І що ж це?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_28bbb1ad"
msgid "C'est juste une tache de naissance."
msgstr "Це просто родимка."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bb7f1fc1"
msgid "Quoi c'est tout ?!"
msgstr "Що, і це все?!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e7e95615"
msgid "Tu viens de gaspiller une question bêtement."
msgstr "Ти просто тупо змарнував питання."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed9cf253"
msgid "Tu es vraiment un amateur !"
msgstr "Ти дійсно любитель!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b14bf260_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t09e727c286"
msgid "D'où vient cette cicatrice sur ton visage?"
msgstr "Звідки цей шрам на твоєму обличчі?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8596ba33"
msgid "Oh, question intéressante..."
msgstr "О, це цікаве питання..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1fcff14b"
msgid "Mais au final, la réponse est facile !"
msgstr "Але, зрештою, відповідь проста!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_143b3ce6"
msgid "Ah ? Dans ce cas, ça m'intéresse !"
msgstr "А? У такому разі, я б хотів знати відповідь!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0014b80d"
msgid "Investir dans la crypto !"
msgstr "Інвестую в криптовалюту!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_19382569"
msgid "Quoi ?!"
msgstr "Що?!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_73801f79"
msgid "Réfléchis un peu... Le bitcoin ne valait rien, il y a quelques années..."
msgstr "Подумай про це... Кілька років тому біткойн нічого не коштував..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3ca3ed6a"
msgid "Et regarde maintenant."
msgstr "Але погляньте на нього зараз."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3fb46b7c"
msgid "Merde, t'as raison, pourquoi je n'ai jamais fait attention à ce genre de truc..."
msgstr "Чорт, ти маєш рацію. Чому я не звертав уваги на такі думки..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2b48ca6a"
msgid "Parce que tu es idiot !"
msgstr "Бо ти ідіот!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t872ac3fbf1"
msgid "Si tu avais la possibilité de revivre à nouveau ta vie, qu'est-ce que tu changerais?"
msgstr "Якби у тебе була можливість прожити своє життя знову, що б ти змінила?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a18f1347"
msgid "Ça dépend... Si une fille a le droit d'avoir plusieurs mecs, je suis pour !"
msgstr "Це залежить від того. Якщо дівчина може мати багато хлопців, я тільки за!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b14bf260_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9f57a936"
msgid "Aaaah, je comprends mieux ! Monsieur {{saito.n}} veut son harem."
msgstr "А-а-а-а, тепер я розумію краще! Пан {{saito.n}} хоче свій гарем."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_be179aae"
msgid "Mais dans ce cas, il n'y a aucun problème."
msgstr "Але в такому випадку це не проблема."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_03229e05"
msgid "Tu as le droit d'avoir toutes les femmes que tu désires !"
msgstr "Ти можеш мати всіх жінок, яких захочеш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c202e4eb"
msgid "Quoi, c'est vrai ?"
msgstr "Що, справді?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ff47faa2"
msgid "Non, idiot ! Et puis quoi encore ?"
msgstr "Ні, дурню! Звісно, ні!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7d75bd47"
msgid "Je me disais aussi que ça paraissait trop beau pour être vrai !"
msgstr "Мені здалося, що це занадто добре, щоб бути правдою!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0dedc86b"
msgid "Vous avez vraiment la folie des grandeurs, vous, les mecs."
msgstr "Ви, чоловіки, справді маєте манію величі."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb9c212ce1c"
msgid "Pour ou contre la polygamie?"
msgstr "Ти за чи проти полігамії?"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ad1f560f"
msgid "Ils finirent par passer tout l'après-midi à discuter..."
msgstr "Зрештою, вони провели цілий день за розмовами..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_71acc9a8"
msgid "J'ai encore passé une superbe journée."
msgstr "У мене знову був чудовий день."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_145a923a"
msgid "Malgré toutes tes défaites ?"
msgstr "Навіть попри всі ці поразки?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b423f27a"
msgid "Tu me cherches visiblement..."
msgstr "Ти просто знущаєшся з мене..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_15648bf8"
msgid "Haha, je plaisante."
msgstr "Ха-ха, я просто жартую."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bb523555"
msgid "Dis... Tu vas vraiment aller voir l'autre cinglé ?"
msgstr "Агов... Ти справді збираєшся зустрітися з іншим божевільним?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_86f06b1a"
msgid "Oui, j'ai certaines choses importantes à régler et sa présence est nécessaire."
msgstr "Так, мені потрібно розібратися з деякими важливими справами, і він мені потрібен."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_849b8a7e"
msgid "Je vois... Je pourrais revenir demain ?"
msgstr "Зрозуміло... Можна я прийду завтра?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ada58ea"
msgid "Tu sais bien que tu es ici chez toi."
msgstr "Ти ж знаєш, тобі тут завжди раді."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c01f11c4"
msgid "...Merci.[w] Je vais y aller, j'ai un truc à faire en ville avant de rentrer chez moi."
msgstr "...Дякую.[w] Я мушу йти. Мені треба дещо зробити в місті, перш ніж піти додому."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_35e4be4e"
msgid "Tu veux que je t'accompagne ?"
msgstr "Хочеш, я піду з тобою?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_546b2288"
msgid "Je suis une grande fille, ne t'inquiète pas."
msgstr "Я доросла дівчинка, не хвилюйся."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d87507bb"
msgid "D'accord."
msgstr "Гаразд."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d8f91ba0"
msgid "À demain !"
msgstr "До завтра!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf67d81233a"
msgid "Gagner avec un Perfect."
msgstr "Виграти з ідеальною комбінацією"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c9ebf3f7"
msgid "[font_size=14]Oh, tiens, salut {{noriko.n}} ! Tu vas bien ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]О, привіт, {{noriko.n}}! Як справи?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e7957402"
msgid "[font_size=14]Comment ça chut ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Чому це?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bfcb2c09"
msgid "[font_size=14]Ah, tu ne veux pas qu'il sache que tu es là ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]О, не хочеш, щоб він знав, що ти тут?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b4e69ca9"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_97bde7ab"
msgid "Je ne sais même pas si je dois rire ou en pleurer."
msgstr "Я навіть не знаю, сміятися мені чи плакати."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_70f4554f"
msgid "Héhé."
msgstr "Хе-хе."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e686d42a"
msgid "Toi... T'as fait un truc !"
msgstr "Ти що... Ти щось зробила!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5d1607dc"
msgid "J'ai discuté avec {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Я розмовляла з {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_799167fe"
msgid "Ah !"
msgstr "А!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_28cd6777"
msgid "T'es un vrai petit coquin toi."
msgstr "Ти такий негідник..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cb173ff1"
msgid "De... de quoi vous avez parlé ?"
msgstr "Що... Про що ви говорили?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a995f721"
msgid "Mhhh alors, on panique, monsieur {{saito.n}} ?"
msgstr "М-м-м, ви панікуєте, пане {{saito.n}}?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7bafc801"
msgid "Auriez-vous quelque chose à vous reprocher ?"
msgstr "Може, тобі є чого соромитися?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cbf84f4f"
msgid "C'est-à-dire..."
msgstr "Ну..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_27a8cde6"
msgid "Haha, aller t'en fais pas, on a juste discuté entre filles."
msgstr "Ха-ха, не хвилюйся. Це була просто дівоча балаканина."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_83c5c856"
msgid "Elle est plutôt sympa en fait !"
msgstr "Насправді вона досить мила!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d591a6da"
msgid "Merde, si les deux se mettent à passer du temps ensemble."
msgstr "Дідько, якщо вони почнуть тусуватися разом..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0f236b27"
msgid "Je suis certain que quelque chose va me tomber dessus à un moment ou un autre."
msgstr "Я впевнений, що рано чи пізно зі мною щось станеться."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8a70484f"
msgid "Et ça ne va pas être beau à voir."
msgstr "І це буде неприємно."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d5f6b96d"
msgid "Allez, assis !"
msgstr "Ось, сідай!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6cf0b6fa"
msgid "Tu dois prendre ta revanche, ton honneur d'hétéro est en jeu."
msgstr "Ти повинен помститися, тому що на кону твоя пряма чоловіча гордість."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2b7b4eb4"
msgid "J'ai une revanche à prendre, ça va chier des bulles !"
msgstr "Я маю помститися, і за це доведеться поплатитися!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a2d4ffa0"
msgid "D'accord, d'accord, mais il faudra que je te parle de quelque chose de sérieux après."
msgstr "Гаразд, але потім мені треба буде поговорити з тобою про дещо важливе."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_714abf65"
msgid "Ça tombe bien, moi aussi."
msgstr "Чудово, мені теж."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8439f810"
msgid "Quelque chose d'étonnant est arrivé."
msgstr "Сталося щось дивовижне."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cb592dda"
msgid "Ah, tu vas en dire plus ?"
msgstr "О, ти збираєшся розповісти мені більше?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb062009e0f"
msgid "{{asami.n}} ?"
msgstr "{{asami.n}} ?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e0e9e025"
msgid "Et bim ! Voilà ce qui se passe quand on manque de concentration !"
msgstr "Ось тобі! Ось що трапляється, коли відвертаєшся від призу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e02f4912"
msgid "Hey, c'était complètement déloyal !"
msgstr "Гей, це абсолютно нечесно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_31862cb5"
msgid "Tututu, c'est un discours de perdant ça."
msgstr "Тихо, так кажуть невдахи."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1521367b"
msgid "Bon, très bien, pose ta question..."
msgstr "Гаразд, запитуй..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eaceec5f"
msgid "Non ! Changement de règles."
msgstr "Ні! Дозволь змінити правила."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_74b68a8a"
msgid "Tu changes les règles comme ça sans prévenir ?"
msgstr "Ти змінюєш правила так без попередження?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba406c7c"
msgid "Exactement."
msgstr "Саме так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d8055131"
msgid "Bon, c'est quoi les nouvelles règles ?"
msgstr "Тоді які нові правила?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_68359ed2"
msgid "{{asami.n}} fait ce qu'elle veut !"
msgstr "{{asami.n}} робить те, що хоче!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d737fb30"
msgid "Smack !"
msgstr "Чмок!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_678b18f1"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Ох..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6135b048"
msgid "Me regarde pas comme ça, c'est gênant !"
msgstr "Не дивись на мене так, мені незручно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_92471cc3"
msgid "Mais... c'est toi qui-"
msgstr "Але... ти ж..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_540bd033"
msgid "...[w] Le gagnant fait ce qu'il veut, c'est ça ?"
msgstr "...[w] Переможець робить, що хоче, так?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_02ae8a4e"
msgid "Exactement."
msgstr "Саме так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0981ea7d"
msgid "Okay, alors plus aucune pitié !"
msgstr "Гаразд, тоді я не буду милувати!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_628d6ac2"
msgid "Genre, tu te retenais depuis tout ce temps ?"
msgstr "Ніби ти весь цей час стримувався..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a9ae8365"
msgid "Tu n'as pas idée de quoi je suis capable."
msgstr "Ти навіть не уявляєш, на що я здатен."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_81e8f53a"
msgid "En attendant, j'ai encore gagné !"
msgstr "А поки що я знову виграю!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc29ab2d"
msgid "Quoi, mais..."
msgstr "Що, гей..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b8a05d78"
msgid "Peut-être que c'est moi qui me retenais depuis le début ?"
msgstr "Може, це я стримувала себе від самого початку?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d737fb30_1"
msgid "Smack !"
msgstr "Чмок!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2d0f7163"
msgid "Tu vas y arriver mon petit {{saito.n}} !"
msgstr "Ти можеш це зробити, мій любий {{saito.n}}!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3e3e71a0"
msgid "Tchh !"
msgstr "Тьху!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3cc739bc"
msgid "Oh, encore perdu, on dirait."
msgstr "Схоже, ти знову програв."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f7b2e235"
msgid "Mais c'est une blague..."
msgstr "Це що, жарт?.."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9c45479c"
msgid "Abandonne tout espoir de me vaincre."
msgstr "Залиш будь-яку надію перемогти мене."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_237e3ea2"
msgid "{{saito.n}} a été incapable de battre {{asami.n}} durant tout le temps qu'ils ont joué ensemble..."
msgstr "{{saito.n}} не зміг перемогти {{asami.n}} за весь час, коли вони грали разом..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_110ac637"
msgid "Après s'être fait embrasser sur la joue tout l'après-midi, {{saito.n}} décide de try-hard comme jamais."
msgstr "Після того, як його цілували в щоку цілий день, {{saito.n}} вирішив постаратися більше, ніж будь-коли."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_20e5e1a5"
msgid "Si j'avais su que tu étais une pro."
msgstr "Якби я знав, що ти профі..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ead02f2e"
msgid "Je me serais entrainé davantage."
msgstr "Я б більше тренувався."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e9b52997"
msgid "Je suis invaincue depuis 5 ans quand je joue sérieusement."
msgstr "За останні п'ять років я ніколи не програла, коли граю серйозно."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e9118676"
msgid "Tu es destiné à être ma chose."
msgstr "Ти приречений бути моїм."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2df7c737"
msgid "[font_size=14]C'est ce qu'on verra...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Це ми ще побачимо...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f23d3ba2"
msgid "Après quelques parties supplémentaires, {{saito.n}} a enfin une ouverture."
msgstr "Після кількох ігор {{saito.n}} нарешті знайшов вихід."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7294cf18"
msgid "DOUBLE KO !"
msgstr "ПОДВІЙНИЙ НОКАУТ!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb00b89c"
msgid "QUOI ?!!"
msgstr "ЩО?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2254f84"
msgid "Invaincue mon cul !"
msgstr "Непереможний, чорт забирай!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_89bb8793"
msgid "Il suffit juste de try-hard un peu pour te mettre en difficulté !"
msgstr "Достатньо було лише трохи постаратися, щоб потрапити в халепу!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_96987a04"
msgid "...Oui, mais tu n'as pas gagné."
msgstr "...Так, але ти все одно не виграв."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a6611b72"
msgid "Toi non plus."
msgstr "Як і ти."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7070d6b2"
msgid "Tchh."
msgstr "Тьфу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2d4d165"
msgid "Allez, vas-y, fais le ton bisou."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, поцілуй мене."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e4c6556b"
msgid "Héhé."
msgstr "Хе-хе."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8182c707"
msgid "Fais pas genre tu déteste ça."
msgstr "Не вдавай, що тобі не подобається."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb70794a"
msgid "Non, mais à force de me provoquer..."
msgstr "Ні, але покарання за те, що ти мене спровокувала..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ac8c155f"
msgid "Mmmh..."
msgstr "М-м-м-х..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b18d5d64"
msgid "Tu en as mis du temps !"
msgstr "А ти не поспішав!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_986b4148"
msgid "Merde, alors depuis tout ce temps, elle envoyait des signaux et je ne voyais rien..."
msgstr "Чорт, виходить, весь цей час вона подавала сигнали, а я нічого не бачив..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2295fd00"
msgid "Putain, mais quel idiot !"
msgstr "Чорт, який ідіот!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f6658284"
msgid "Quand j'y pense, c'est mon premier baiser."
msgstr "Якщо подумати, то це був мій перший поцілунок."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f85e6a38"
msgid "C'est plutôt bien en fait."
msgstr "Насправді він був досить хорошим."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f359e6b2"
msgid "Dire que dans ma précédente vie, je n'ai jamais pu embrasser une fille de mon âge."
msgstr "У моєму попередньому житті я ніколи не міг поцілувати дівчину мого віку."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a34991c6"
msgid "Mmmmh ! Reste avec moi, tu es encore dans la lune !"
msgstr "М-м-м-х! Залишайся зі мною, ти витаєш у хмарах!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd35b7a1"
msgid "Oui pardon, je profitais juste du moment."
msgstr "Так, вибач, я насолоджувався моментом."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34c926bd"
msgid "Bon garçon !"
msgstr "Хороший хлопчик!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5042c4c1"
msgid "Pour un puceau, tu te débrouilles pas trop mal !"
msgstr "Як цнотливий, ти не так вже й погано справляєшся!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_78142383"
msgid "Il n'aura pas fallu attendre longtemps pour que tu détruises l'ambiance."
msgstr "Тобі не знадобилося багато часу, щоб зіпсувати настрій."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b6bc7e1c"
msgid "Héhé, c'est tout moi ça !"
msgstr "Хе-хе, це я!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_288c0851"
msgid "Bon... Tu as dit que tu voulais me parler tout à l'heure."
msgstr "Отже... Раніше ти сказала, що хочеш поговорити зі мною."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_30b810bc"
msgid "Oh ! Oui, c'est vrai, avec tout ça, j'avais oublié."
msgstr "О! Так, вірно. Усе це змусило мене забути."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_28b96298"
msgid "Devine qui j'ai croisé aujourd'hui ?"
msgstr "Вгадай, кого я сьогодні зустріла?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_02945bfd"
msgid "J'en ai aucune idée..."
msgstr "Гадки не маю..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_09e81e2c"
msgid "{{minato.n}} !"
msgstr "{{minato.n}}!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd5aebf3"
msgid "Merde !"
msgstr "Дідько!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9aa9170e"
msgid "À force de passer mon temps à flirter, je l'avais oublié !"
msgstr "Я стільки часу фліртував, що забув про нього!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_abf31771"
msgid "Eh bien, tu ne vas pas y croire, mais..."
msgstr "І ти не повіриш, але..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bebbe981"
msgid "Il est venu me voir et m'a fait des avances."
msgstr "Він прийшов до мене і почав залицятися."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_571af8bb"
msgid "QUOI !?"
msgstr "ЩО?!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c131ad2c"
msgid "Mais je l'ai rembarré bien comme il faut."
msgstr "Але я відштовхнула його як слід."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0ab9b963"
msgid "Si tu avais vu sa tête !"
msgstr "Якби ти бачив його обличчя!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fcb804d5"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que tu lui as dit ?"
msgstr "Що ти йому сказала?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b8a771a1"
msgid "Euh... Mais on est plus dans le contexte là..."
msgstr "Е-е... Але це вирвано з контексту..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_24b10405"
msgid "Si je le répète, ça n'aura pas le même effet..."
msgstr "Якщо я скажу це ще раз, це не матиме такого ж ефекту..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b997a32c"
msgid "J'espère qu'elle ne l'a pas trop énervé."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, вона не дуже його розлютила."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cb5540ab"
msgid "Sinon, on va être grave dans la merde."
msgstr "Інакше ми будемо в глибокому лайні."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dab755b6"
msgid "Je lui dis... Que j'avais déjà un étalon et que je ne voulais pas d'un poney..."
msgstr "Я сказала йому... У мене вже є жеребець, тому я не хочу поні..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b4e69ca9_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61af355f"
msgid "{{saito.n}} arrête de rester silencieux."
msgstr "Скажи щось, {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_23b1e0c2"
msgid "Tu m'en veux, c'est ça ?!"
msgstr "Ти злишся на мене?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6931a169"
msgid "...Non... Bien sûr que non."
msgstr "Ні... Звичайно, ні."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e363a421"
msgid "À vrai dire, je suis partagé entre une certaine fierté et une grosse gêne."
msgstr "Чесно кажучи, я розриваюся між гордістю і збентеженням."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8320aa97"
msgid "Oh bah, ça va alors !"
msgstr "А, ну тоді все гаразд!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_152eedf2"
msgid "Allez, raccompagne-moi, mon bel étalon !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, ти можеш провести мене, мій прекрасний жеребець!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_caf8a57a"
msgid "Je n'ai plus qu'à attendre {{asami.n}}."
msgstr "Я усе ще маю дочекатися {{asami.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a1a2d311"
msgid "Elle m'a dit qu'elle viendrait me voir tard dans la soirée..."
msgstr "Вона сказала, що прийде пізно ввечері..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0b6854c4"
msgid "Je me demande bien ce qu'elle avait en tête."
msgstr "Цікаво, що вона мала на увазі."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6aa5b382"
msgid "Probablement encore des bêtises..."
msgstr "Напевно, знову якась дурниця..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0ed7b24b"
msgid "Bon...[w] Je commence à croire qu'elle m'a oublié."
msgstr "Що ж...[w] Починаю думати, що вона забула про мене."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_30ac16f2"
msgid "Oh !"
msgstr "О!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6851da78"
msgid "{{asami.n}} passe par la fenêtre de la chambre avec un grand sourire."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} увійшла у вікно кімнати з широкою посмішкою."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_616cd835"
msgid "Héhé, me voilà comme convenu."
msgstr "Хе-хе, ось і я, як і обіцяла."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1615b82b"
msgid "Tu pouvais tout aussi bien passer par la porte d'entrée."
msgstr "Можна було просто зайти через парадні двері."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6527dce4"
msgid "Oui, mais ce n'est pas drôle sinon !"
msgstr "Так, але це було б не так весело!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`-happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3b13529d"
msgid "Et puis, je ne voulais pas déranger {{yasuka.n}} à une heure aussi tard."
msgstr "І я не хотіла турбувати {{yasuka.n}} так пізно ввечері."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_84f187ed"
msgid "Prêt pour la surprise ?"
msgstr "Готовий до сюрпризу?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4ba2b695"
msgid "J'ai hâte de voir ça !"
msgstr "Не можу дочекатися, коли побачу!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8a516ada"
msgid "Alors, ferme les yeux et ne triche pas."
msgstr "Тому заплющ очі й не підглядай."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_49838c21"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Добре..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b5fd1373"
msgid "Toujours, en fermant les yeux, viens un peu par ici."
msgstr "Тримай заплющеними очі та підійди трохи ближче."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0dbec912"
msgid "Voilà met toi là, comme ça... Parfait."
msgstr "Добре, йди сюди, ось так... Чудово."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d8f555a"
msgid "Maintenant, attend une petite minute !"
msgstr "А тепер зачекай хвилинку!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_295444c7"
msgid "Je rêve ou elle est en train d'enlever ses vêtements ?"
msgstr "Мені здається, чи вона роздягається?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_617bb2b2"
msgid "Me dites pas que..."
msgstr "Не кажи мені..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0f86ee7b"
msgid "Lève les bras et... donne-moi... ça !"
msgstr "Підніми руки та... Віддай мені... його!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3acce439"
msgid "Elle est en train de me déshabiller !"
msgstr "Вона мене роздягає!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_51292041"
msgid "On va vraiment le faire ?"
msgstr "Ми дійсно збираємося це зробити?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e6953ebf"
msgid "Tadaaammmm !"
msgstr "Та-да!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_224e4ab1"
msgid "Oh merde alors !"
msgstr "О, чорт!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb2f7ed0"
msgid "Alors ?"
msgstr "Як тобі?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_15449fe7"
msgid "Je... Je m'y attendais vraiment pas."
msgstr "Такого я точно не очікував."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f676aab3"
msgid "Tu es sûre de vouloir le faire ?"
msgstr "Ти впевнена, що хочеш цього?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6494b5a3"
msgid "Ça fait longtemps qu'on est plus des enfants !"
msgstr "Ми вже не діти!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c22eb923"
msgid "Et puis... Je t'aime beaucoup."
msgstr "І... Я справді кохаю тебе."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_07f6d1ef"
msgid "Je ne pense pas avoir ressenti quelque chose d'aussi fort avant."
msgstr "Не думаю, що я коли-небудь відчувала щось настільки сильне раніше."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_33539fb4"
msgid "Et puis... [font_size=14]Je suis très excitée.[/font_size]"
msgstr "І... [font_size=14]Я дуже схвильована.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8e679428"
msgid "Je n'ai pas envie d'attendre un jour de plus."
msgstr "Я не можу більше чекати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d808ef4b"
msgid "Je suis désolé, je prenais le temps, je ne voulais pas brusquer les choses."
msgstr "Вибач. Я не поспішав, не хотів квапити події."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_46f46988"
msgid "Je t'aime aussi beaucoup {{asami.n}}."
msgstr "Я теж кохаю тебе, {{asami.n}}."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d5780f6e"
msgid "Alors, ne dis plus rien et rejoins-moi maintenant."
msgstr "Тоді не кажи більше нічого і приєднуйся до мене зараз."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d0f70235"
msgid "À vos ordres !"
msgstr "Як побажаєш!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b9196165"
msgid "Mmmhh, enfin !"
msgstr "М-м-м-х, нарешті!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7400d495"
msgid "C'est tellement mieux avec une vr-"
msgstr "Це набагато краще, коли є справж..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f96b83c9"
msgid "...de quoi ?"
msgstr "...Справжній що?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8b102d16"
msgid "Euh, oublie ça et continue..."
msgstr "Е-е, забудь. Нумо продовжимо..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7cb92c06"
msgid "C'est tellement bon..."
msgstr "Так добре..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ec872fe5"
msgid "Pourquoi j'ai attendu aussi longtemps ?"
msgstr "Чому я чекала так довго?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7aa7b9a0"
msgid "Mmmmmmhm, oui..."
msgstr "М-м-м-м-м-х, так..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3f01a234"
msgid "{{saito.n}} et {{asami.n}} continuèrent ainsi longtemps..."
msgstr "{{saito.n}} і {{asami.n}} продовжували ще довго..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_48884421"
msgid "{{saito.n}}... J'en peux plus, ça fait au moins le 4ème orgasme..."
msgstr "{{saito.n}}... Я більше не можу! Це щонайменше 4-й оргазм!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b630ee03"
msgid "Je sens que ça vient..."
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як я зараз..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4d74c09a"
msgid "Reste en moi, je veux le sentir."
msgstr "Не витягуй. Я хочу відчути."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cbf017f3"
msgid "Tu es sûre... ?"
msgstr "Ти впевнена?.."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c3ac27a9"
msgid "Oui, j'ai pris mes précautions, ne t'en fais pas !"
msgstr "Так. Я на таблетках, так що не хвилюйся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ae14922"
msgid "Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_206dbb95"
msgid "Oh, mon Dieu, oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "О Боже, о Боже..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_09f5caf7"
msgid "Je ne sens plus mes jambes !"
msgstr "Я більше не відчуваю ніг!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_548135f1"
msgid "C'était tellement bon..."
msgstr "Це було так добре..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7c3a8218"
msgid "Je pourrais rester comme ça pendant des heures..."
msgstr "Я могла б сидіти так годинами..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b796f4c8"
msgid "Haha... Je pense que moi aussi..."
msgstr "Ха-ха... Думаю, я теж міг би..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_18b6a6fa_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_536b95c7"
msgid "Attend un peu toi, comment ça se fait que tu sois encore dur ?"
msgstr "Хвилинку, чому він все ще такий твердий?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1854845e"
msgid "Euh... eh bien, je peux encore continuer..."
msgstr "Е-е... Ну, я ще можу продовжити..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cf335cf2"
msgid "Tu es un monstre."
msgstr "Ти чудовисько."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e46b645b"
msgid "J'ai réfléchi à ce que tu m'as dit l'autre jour..."
msgstr "Я думала про те, що ти мені сказав днями..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b3520611"
msgid "À quel sujet ?"
msgstr "Про що саме?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4d77c21e"
msgid "Tu sais bien... l'autre... chemin."
msgstr "Знаєш... У інший... шлях."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a59683c8"
msgid "Si tu me promets d'y aller doucement par contre !"
msgstr "Але тільки якщо ти пообіцяєш бути ніжним!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9abb9008"
msgid "C'est vrai ?![w] C'est promis !"
msgstr "Справді?![w] Обіцяю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_50198690"
msgid "Doucement... Doucement..."
msgstr "Повільно... Повільно.."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_45a8dd0c"
msgid "Je vais commencer à bouger."
msgstr "Я починаю рухатися."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f5ffc0c8"
msgid "Ahh, mais... Pourquoi c'est aussi bon ?"
msgstr "А-а-а, але... Чому так добре?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b39cbadd"
msgid "C'est tellement... serré."
msgstr "Вона така... туга."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b2e2bdea"
msgid "Plus vite !"
msgstr "Швидше!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_57343779"
msgid "Oh, euh, d'accord !"
msgstr "О, е-е, добре!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d8f29350"
msgid "Une bonne heure plus tard..."
msgstr "Хорошу годину потому..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd0102bb"
msgid "Je ne savais même pas que c'était possible d'avoir autant de plaisir..."
msgstr "Я не знала, що це може бути так приємно..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bc3b1102"
msgid "Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ca01c5fd"
msgid "...Je n'en peux plus !"
msgstr "Ха-а-а-а... Досить... Я більше не можу!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_63bb2849"
msgid "Dis-moi que tu es satisfait..."
msgstr "Будь ласка, скажи, ти задоволений..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b14bf260_3"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ff79c86"
msgid "Mon Dieu, tu vas me tuer..."
msgstr "Боже, ти мене вб'єш..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4728c701"
msgid "Tu ne sembles pas être contre non plus."
msgstr "Здається, ти теж не проти."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_574d1165"
msgid "...[w] Idiot !"
msgstr "...[w] Дурень!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_47e17d91"
msgid "Héhé."
msgstr "Хе-хе."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_acfd1aac"
msgid "Ils continuèrent ainsi une bonne partie de la nuit jusqu'à finir par tomber d'épuisement."
msgstr "І так вони продовжували майже всю ніч, поки не знепритомніли від виснаження."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3c9fc132ab"
msgid "Attends, mais on vient à peine de commencer !"
msgstr "Зачекай, але ж ми тільки почали!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ae5c8af1"
msgid "Merci mon Dieu..."
msgstr "Дякувати Богу..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e8fa2ba1"
msgid "Ça devrait être interdit d'être aussi endurant !"
msgstr "Мати стільки витривалості не можна!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_21df8fe7"
msgid "Je n'y suis pour rien."
msgstr "Це не моя вина."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_852a4545"
msgid "C'est toi qui me donnes envie de me dépasser."
msgstr "Саме завдяки тобі я хочу перевершити себе."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c82b4384"
msgid "...C'est vrai ?"
msgstr "...Правда?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bc8c59ae"
msgid "Bien sûr !"
msgstr "Звичайно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9cc169cc"
msgid "{{saito.n}}... Je peux dormir contre toi ?"
msgstr "{{saito.n}}... Можна я посплю з тобою?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_72f5fac5"
msgid "Bien sûr, de toute façon, c'était inclus dans la prestation."
msgstr "Звісно. Так чи інакше, це була частина досвіду."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_36667a21"
msgid "Idiot !"
msgstr "Дурень!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_df0f63b1"
msgid "Ils finirent par s'endormir paisiblement, complètement épuisé..."
msgstr "Повністю виснажені, вони врешті-решт мирно заснули..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_547b8656"
msgid "Mais {{asami.n}} se réveilla en pleine nuit, car elle avait de nouveau envie..."
msgstr "Але {{asami.n}} прокинулася серед ночі, бо їй усе ще не вистачило..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2093494a"
msgid "Ils continuèrent ainsi jusqu'au petit matin."
msgstr "І так вони продовжували до світанку."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t06eb7c9776"
msgid "J'ai eu mon compte moi aussi."
msgstr "З мене теж досить"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_97461bc2"
msgid "Bon, eh bien continuons alors..."
msgstr "Ну що ж, продовжимо..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_719f1acd"
msgid "Jusqu'à ce que Monsieur {{saito.n}} soit rassasié."
msgstr "Поки пан {{saito.n}} не буде задоволений."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_38c8ffac"
msgid "Ils continuèrent ainsi une bonne partie de la nuit pour finir par s'endormir l'un sur l'autre complètement épuisé."
msgstr "І так вони продовжували більшу частину ночі, поки не заснули один на одному, повністю виснажені."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1e666c2b"
msgid "Bonjour mon étalon !"
msgstr "Привітик, мій жеребець!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_af371a76"
msgid "Ça y est, tu recommences avec ça..."
msgstr "Ти знову це робиш..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_348eda98"
msgid "Oui, mais pour le coup, j'avais raison."
msgstr "Так, але я мала рацію."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_72bcde99"
msgid "Dis... Tu crois que {{noriko.n}} a passé sa nuit à écouter à travers la porte ?"
msgstr "Скажи... Думаєш, {{noriko.n}} провела ніч, підслуховуючи під дверима?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_514e4f77"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr "Ха-ха."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`-happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2c71ca6"
msgid "Je vais repartir discrètement et prendre une douche chez moi et probablement dormir le reste de la journée."
msgstr "Я вислизну і прийму душ, як тільки буду вдома, а потім, буду спати до кінця дня."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0f88284d"
msgid "Tu aurais pu me ménager pour ma première fois, on l'a fait toute la nuit !"
msgstr "Для мого першого разу можна було б не поспішати, але ми займалися цим цілу ніч!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e46bb26b"
msgid "Ah ! Désolé."
msgstr "О-о! Вибач."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85b4146d"
msgid "Pour te faire pardonner, tu devras recommencer ce soir !"
msgstr "Аби загладити свою провину... Ти повинен будеш повторити це сьогодні ввечері!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_03775ec8_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0b5fd794"
msgid "À plus tard, mon amour."
msgstr "Побачимося пізніше, коханий."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2d22968b"
msgid "La vache, quelle nuit de fou."
msgstr "Дідько, яка божевільна нічка."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_df1482fe"
msgid "Je me sens comme un homme nouveau."
msgstr "Відчуваю себе новою людиною."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb532800"
msgid "Je suis remonté à bloc."
msgstr "Я набрався сил."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4a7822b6"
msgid "Je sens que plus rien ne m'arrêtera à présent !"
msgstr "Відчуваю, що тепер мене ніщо не зупинить!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_35dd7eb4"
msgid "Bon, je fais quoi à présent ?"
msgstr "Що ж мені тепер робити?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61ae5cd9"
msgid "Je ne sais pas si je peux sortir discrètement sans avoir de remarque de {{noriko.n}} ou de {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Не знаю, чи зможу я вислизнути так, щоб {{noriko.n}} чи {{yasuka.n}} не помітили."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d7eafe50"
msgid "Ça se tente quand même."
msgstr "Спробувати варто."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9b853a37"
msgid "{{asami.n}} vous fait signe et rentre par la fenêtre."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} махає тобі рукою і заходить через вікно."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a7ced0d4"
msgid "Héhé. Prêt pour une nouvelle nuit de folie ?"
msgstr "Хе-хе. Готовий до ще однієї божевільної ночі?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_78a43c6a"
msgid "Il n'y a qu'une seule façon de le savoir."
msgstr "Є лише один спосіб це з'ясувати."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eb58ad34"
msgid "Par contre..."
msgstr "Проте..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d2018b57"
msgid "Oui ?"
msgstr "А?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_66f64632"
msgid "J'aimerais essayer une autre position."
msgstr "Я б хотіла спробувати іншу позицію."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2eb7cc0e"
msgid "Oh ! D'accord, laquelle ?"
msgstr "Без проблем. Яку саме?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7deb97d8"
msgid "J'aimerais être sur toi cette fois-ci !"
msgstr "Цього разу я хочу бути зверху!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b4e69ca9_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6fbcd221"
msgid "Tu ne veux pas ?"
msgstr "Ти не хочеш?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8b1bca2e"
msgid "Je ne veux pas essayer une autre position..."
msgstr "Я не хочу пробувати іншу позицію..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_32f7439f"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "О..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_447bbf0c"
msgid "Je veux essayer toutes les positions !"
msgstr "Я хочу спробувати їх усі!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e42031d2"
msgid "Idiot, tu m'as fait peur !"
msgstr "Дурень, ти налякав мене!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fb75f144"
msgid "Peur ? Mais de quoi tu aurais peur ?"
msgstr "Налякав? Чого тобі лякатися?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4ae92c9a"
msgid "Oubli, c'était ridicule..."
msgstr "Забудь. Це було тупо..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7c7b5f3a"
msgid "Allez, dis-le-moi, sinon ça va te rester dans la tête."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, розкажи мені, інакше це буде у тебе в голові."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_30e69be5"
msgid "...[w] J'avais peur que tu te lasses de moi, que tu ne me trouves ennuyante."
msgstr "...[w] Я боялася, що набридну тобі, ти вважатимеш мене нудною."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_481487b0"
msgid "Tu as tout à fait raison au final."
msgstr "Зрештою, ти мала рацію."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c99971cb"
msgid "Mais..."
msgstr "Але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3884ebe6"
msgid "C'était complètement ridicule !"
msgstr "Це було справді абсолютно тупо!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85c7ce25"
msgid "J'aimerais pouvoir te manger à tous les repas si je le pouvais !"
msgstr "Я б із задоволенням їв тебе щоразу, якби міг!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d6f3a639"
msgid "Haha, tu es bête... Mais juste pour être sûr, prouve-le."
msgstr "Ха-ха, ти такий дурник... Але щоб бути впевненою, доведи це."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b469ce4a"
msgid "À vos ordres, madame !"
msgstr "Як побажаєш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a8ef0bd8"
msgid "Oh, j'allais oublier, {{noriko.n}} nous a entendu la dernière fois."
msgstr "Ох. Мало не забув. {{noriko.n}} чула нас минулого разу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c0db767e"
msgid "Elle voudrait qu'on fasse moins de bruit."
msgstr "Вона хотіла б, щоб ми були тихішими."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5ea8771f"
msgid "Hmmm, sinon propose-lui de nous rejoindre au pire."
msgstr "Гм, у гіршому випадку, ти можеш просто попросити її приєднатися до нас."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_49caef5a"
msgid "Mais... Quoi ?! Tu veux que... Attends... Répète ça !"
msgstr "Але... Що?! Ти хочеш... Стривай... Повтори!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ec822c5c"
msgid "Haha, si tu voyais ta tête !"
msgstr "Ха-ха, якби ти бачив своє обличчя!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e138aad2"
msgid "...[w] T'abuses !"
msgstr "...[w] Та ти жартуєш!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4b2a9a30"
msgid "Mais c'est grave, j'aurai ma vengeance !"
msgstr "Ось побачиш... Я помщуся!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_05a4de1c"
msgid "{{asami.n}} se déshabille et s'installe sensuellement à cheval sur vous."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} роздягається і спокусливо сідає на тебе верхи."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_07ece017"
msgid "Tu es sûre de toi ? C'est toi qui mènes la danse ?"
msgstr "Ти впевнена? Візьмеш на себе ініціативу?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_13923984"
msgid "Shhht, tu parles trop, à ton tour de te laisser faire."
msgstr "Цить, ти забагато говориш. Тепер твоя черга відпочити."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a8d4e28e"
msgid "Mhhh, c'est... beaucoup mieux comme ça !"
msgstr "М-х-х-х, так... набагато краще!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_de49554f"
msgid "Je la ressens encore plus..."
msgstr "Я відчуваю його ще більше..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_95d98977"
msgid "Je suis en train de devenir complètement accro."
msgstr "Я стаю повністю залежною..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_795e47c3"
msgid "Pour mon plus grand plaisir !"
msgstr "На радість!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_edcf9bba"
msgid "Dans ce cas, accroche-toi, je vais accélérer."
msgstr "Тоді приготуйся. Я прискорююсь."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c9d33e37"
msgid "C'est tellement... bon."
msgstr "Це так... добре..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b2e2bdea_1"
msgid "Plus vite !"
msgstr "Швидше!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f8179796_1"
msgid "[i]Environ 2 heures plus tard...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Приблизно дві години потому...[/i]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61b2285e"
msgid "Je n'en peux plus, je sens que ça vient encore !"
msgstr "Я більше не можу! Я відчуваю, що зараз кінчу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f9dc300a"
msgid "Moi aussi !"
msgstr "Я також!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed194c5c"
msgid "Hannn, hannn..."
msgstr "Ах-х-х, а-х-х-х..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d94b2a3d"
msgid "Mais bon sang, tu es infatigable..."
msgstr "Дідько, ти невтомний..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4fdacb26"
msgid "C'est un problème ?"
msgstr "Хіба це проблема?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aab8730a"
msgid "...[w] Ne me fait pas dire ce que je n'ai pas dit !"
msgstr "...[w] Не вкладай слова в мої вуста!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6b0eccc2"
msgid "De toute façon, je finirais bien par avoir le dessus à un moment ou un autre !"
msgstr "Так чи інакше, я зрештою візьму перевагу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_41d9879f"
msgid "Peut-être, mais dans ce cas..."
msgstr "Можливо, але в не зараз..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5642cfc3"
msgid "Il va falloir s'entrainer bien plus sérieusement !"
msgstr "Тобі потрібно тренуватися набагато серйозніше!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c7802742"
msgid "D'ailleurs, il y a un endroit qui manque encore d'entrainement."
msgstr "До речі, є місце, яке все ще потребує тренування."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_18b6a6fa_3"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5df782ec"
msgid "Je vois, monsieur {{saito.n}} voudrait me la mettre dans le cul, c'est ça ?"
msgstr "О-о, зрозуміло. Пан {{saito.n}} хотів би засадити мені в дупу, чи не так?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_11dd3f99"
msgid "...Je peux ?"
msgstr "...Можна?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85bb671e"
msgid "Je m'en charge !"
msgstr "Я розберуся з цим!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_44130b8f"
msgid "Han, c'est tellement étrange..."
msgstr "Ах-х, це так дивно..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dd567901"
msgid "J'en ai des frissons."
msgstr "У мене мороз по шкірі..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_23f0987c"
msgid "Tu veux que j'arrête ?"
msgstr "Хочеш, аби я зупинився?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_13504329"
msgid "Hors de question ! Je vais plutôt augmenter la cadence !"
msgstr "Нізащо! Я збираюся прискорити темп!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eeae6b82"
msgid "C'est vraiment trop bon !"
msgstr "Це так файно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c0b5084d"
msgid "Mhhhh, je vais encore jouir..."
msgstr "М-м-м, я зараз знову кінчу..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f82040e2"
msgid "Après un certain moment..."
msgstr "За деякий час..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8bf9e128"
msgid "Ça vient, ça vient, ça viennnnnt !"
msgstr "Я кінчаю, кінча-а-аю!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_83ef680d"
msgid "Mhhhh..."
msgstr "Мх-х-х-х..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85a779d7"
msgid "C'est bon, c'est terminé, j'ai tout donné."
msgstr "З мене досить. Я зробив усе, що міг."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd7eab77"
msgid "Héhé... Je suis contente, tu as bien travaillé."
msgstr "Хе-хе... Я щаслива. Ти молодець."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_baa05f85"
msgid "Je suis une femme généreuse, je t'accorde le droit de te reposer."
msgstr "Я щедра жінка. Дарую тобі право на відпочинок."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bddd7b8e"
msgid "N'importe quoi !"
msgstr "Нісенітниця якась!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b6e294a3"
msgid "{{asami.n}} complètement exténuée, s'allonge et se blottie contre vous."
msgstr "Зовсім знесилена, {{asami.n}} лягає і притискається до тебе."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_47ab689d"
msgid "La tête posée sur votre torse."
msgstr "Вона кладе голову на твої груди."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_07bd6b80"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "О, Боже..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_51ad8997"
msgid "Tu sais \"mon chéri\" ou {{saito.n}} ira très bien."
msgstr "Знаєш, «милий» або «{{saito.n}}» було б просто чудово."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0aedc599"
msgid "Pfff, t'es bête !"
msgstr "Пф-ф-ф, дурненький!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_92e053fb"
msgid "Comment ça se fait que tu sois aussi endurant ?"
msgstr "Звідки у тебе така витривалість?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8b1f4b36"
msgid "Et toi, comment ça se fait que tu sois aussi sexy ?"
msgstr "А ти? Чому ти така сексуальна?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a41c4211"
msgid "T'as de la merde dans les yeux, c'est sûr !"
msgstr "Ти, мабуть, сліпий!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_90bde7e5"
msgid "Mais... Je suis heureuse que tu penses ça de moi."
msgstr "Але... Я щаслива, що ти так про мене думаєш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7e7a073f"
msgid "{{saito.n}}..."
msgstr "{{saito.n}}..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_910fc94a"
msgid "Oui, quoi ?"
msgstr "А?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1ac47a6d"
msgid "Tu resteras avec moi ?"
msgstr "Ти залишишся зі мною?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_68cb9d6b"
msgid "...Il n'y a qu'un seul endroit où j'ai envie d'être en ce moment, c'est contre toi !"
msgstr "...Є тільки одне місце, де я хочу бути зараз, і це біля тебе!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8aa04941"
msgid "Héhé, ce charmeur..."
msgstr "Хе-хе, який чарівний..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9353a5ae"
msgid "Tu resteras... avec moi... pour toujours ?"
msgstr "Ти залишишся... зі мною... назавжди?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_de6496f5"
msgid "Je... {{asami.n}} ?"
msgstr "Я... {{asami.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_75f87286"
msgid "Elle s'est endormie..."
msgstr "Заснула..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3345b668"
msgid "Je resterai avec toi jusqu'à la fin des temps..."
msgstr "Я залишуся з тобою до кінця світу..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c4b32c72"
msgid "Alors ? La nuit a été bonne ?"
msgstr "І що? Як пройшла ніч?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2f8d28d"
msgid "Géniale !"
msgstr "Фантастично!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_48801991"
msgid "Je passe les meilleures vacances d'été depuis bien longtemps !"
msgstr "У мене найкращі літні канікули у моєму житті!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cd39e483"
msgid "J'ai des petites choses à faire aujourd'hui, on se retrouve ce soir ?"
msgstr "У мене є кілька справ на сьогодні. Побачимося ввечері?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_55beb688"
msgid "Tu ne devrais même pas à avoir me demander !"
msgstr "Навіть не питай!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d4b69ecc"
msgid "Tu es ici chez toi !"
msgstr "Це тепер твій другий дім!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_693ccc68"
msgid "T'es un amour !"
msgstr "Ти такий милий!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b1032264"
msgid "Fais attention, je suis en train de tomber amoureuse, tu vas plus pouvoir te débarrasser de moi après !"
msgstr "Обережно, я закохуюсь! Після цього ти вже не зможеш від мене позбутися!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4eb591f9"
msgid "Mouaha, mon plan diabolique fonctionne alors !"
msgstr "Тоді мій диявольський план працює ідеально!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7524a9ae"
msgid "À ce soir !"
msgstr "Побачимось ввечері!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2768e5f0"
msgid "C'est quoi cette douce chaleur que je ressens au fond de moi ?"
msgstr "Що це за солодке тепло, яке я відчуваю всередині себе?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ca48a4e6"
msgid "C'est si... agréable..."
msgstr "Це так... приємно..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6811ccda"
msgid "Ça doit être ça être heureux..."
msgstr "Це, мабуть, і є щастя..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_679de70c"
msgid "[font_size=14]Non, ça, c'est parce que t'es gay ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ні, це тому, що ти гей![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1b9da0f2"
msgid "Putain {{noriko.n}}, arrête d'écouter aux portes !"
msgstr "Чорт, {{noriko.n}}, перестань підслуховувати!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a05a93c0"
msgid "[font_size=14]J'écoute pas aux portes... Les murs sont fins, on entend tout, malheureusement...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я не підслуховую... Стіни тонкі, тому ми все чуємо, на жаль....[/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d88c5dc8"
msgid "[font_size=14]Je suis certaine qu'elle simule de toute façon.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я впевнена, що вона все одно прикидається.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2408aa1d"
msgid "Je dois t'avouer que je ne m'étais pas autant amusée depuis longtemps..."
msgstr "Зізнаюся, я давно не отримувала такого задоволення..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_09befec6"
msgid "Venir ici était définitivement une bonne idée."
msgstr "Прийти сюди було безперечно гарною ідеєю."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc8b3430"
msgid "Et puis {{noriko.n}} n'était pas si horrible que ça."
msgstr "І {{noriko.n}} була не така вже й погана."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a221c0ed"
msgid "C'est parce qu'elle n'a pas vraiment montré son côté sombre."
msgstr "Це тому, що вона не показала свою темну сторону."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5bdbc391"
msgid "Je me doute... mais je n'ai pas l'impression qu'elle te déteste vraiment."
msgstr "Мабуть, так... Але у мене не складається враження, що вона тебе справді ненавидить."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_81a8c84b"
msgid "Tu dois être aveugle dans ce cas !"
msgstr "Тоді ти, мабуть, сліпа."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cd6868d6"
msgid "Ah oui ? Et maintenant ?"
msgstr "Ох? А зараз?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c5a3b811"
msgid "Ah fuck ! Tu te débrouilles plutôt bien !"
msgstr "Чорт! Ти занадто хороша!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8aad5af5"
msgid "Je suis sûr qu'avec un peu de try hard je pourrais..."
msgstr "Я впевнений, що, докладаючи певних зусиль, я міг би..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d824ae10"
msgid "C'est beau de rêver !"
msgstr "Мріяти не шкідливо!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5f8f6c8e"
msgid "Alors ta déprime s'est envolée ?"
msgstr "Отже, твій поганий настрій зник?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_be604254"
msgid "Oui ! Je fermerai les yeux sur le livre que tu me dois !"
msgstr "Так! І я навіть готова заплющити очі на книжку, яку ти мені винен!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ac754e82"
msgid "J'espère bien !"
msgstr "Сподіваюся на це!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6c53aefa"
msgid "Il se fait tard, je devrais peut-être rentrer..."
msgstr "Вже пізно. Мабуть, мені варто повернутися додому..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b2719591"
msgid "Oui tu as probablement raison."
msgstr "Так, напевно, ти права."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d891e03c"
msgid "Je suis contente d'avoir appris à te connaître {{saito.n}}, j'espère sincèrement qu'on pourra se revoir."
msgstr "Я рада, що познайомилась з тобою, {{saito.n}}. Я щиро сподіваюся, що ми зможемо зустрітися знову."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f25ff73a"
msgid "Tu ne crois pas qu'on te laisserait partir comme ça ?!"
msgstr "Гадаєш, що ми дозволимо тобі ось так піти?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_05c95170"
msgid "Suis-moi dans le salon !"
msgstr "Йди за мною у вітальню!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e4546f91"
msgid "Okay !"
msgstr "Гаразд!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ee0b927c"
msgid "Est-ce que je suis juste une blague pour vous ?"
msgstr "Я для тебе якійсь жарт?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_db7bd06d"
msgid "Est-ce qu'{{asami.n}} sera là aujourd'hui ?"
msgstr "{{asami.n}} прийде сьогодні?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c8fac591"
msgid "J'en sais rien... Elle fait ce qu'elle veut de sa vie."
msgstr "Гадки не маю... Вона робить зі своїм життям те, що хоче."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a3543a67"
msgid "Pour une fois qu'une autre femme que maman s'intéresse à toi tu pourrais te sentir plus concerné !"
msgstr "Це перший раз коли жінка, крім мами, зацікавлена в тобі. А ти навіть трішечки про неї не турбуєшся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3a6ec138"
msgid "...si je l'ai invité à la base c'est parce qu'elle s'était faite lâchement jeter par {{minato.n}} alors qu'elle lui avait fait sa déclaration."
msgstr "...Спочатку я запросив її лише тому, що її викинув той боягуз {{minato.n}}, щойно після того, як вона йому зізналася."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_41585cac"
msgid "Et comme il l'avait vraiment traité comme de la merde je me suis vraiment senti mal pour elle."
msgstr "І мені було дуже шкода її, оскільки він дійсно поводився з нею як з лайном."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0dccc8af"
msgid "Je voulais seulement lui faire penser à autre chose ou au mieux lui redonner le sourire..."
msgstr "Я просто хотів, щоб вона подумала про щось інше або принаймні змусити її посміхнутися."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_08756560"
msgid "Pfff t'es un idiot... Si ce type est trop con pour ne pas se rendre compte qu'{{asami.n}} est géniale c'est qu'il a de la merde dans les yeux."
msgstr "Пфф, ти ідіот... Якщо цей хлопець надто дурний, щоб не помічати, що {{asami.n}} чудова, то у нього просто лайно замість очей."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4750cfe8"
msgid "Tu comptes faire quoi maintenant ?"
msgstr "Що ти плануєш зараз робити?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc73d998"
msgid "Courir au parc."
msgstr "Я збираюся на пробіжку в парку."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_896104e0"
msgid "Et {{asami.n}} ?"
msgstr "А що на рахунок {{asami.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_92143c6c"
msgid "et bien quoi ?"
msgstr "А що з нею?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_47ce4d96"
msgid "...Bon sang mais quel abrutis!"
msgstr "...Чорт, що за ідіот!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_90e11990"
msgid "Bon sang mais pourquoi faut-il toujours qu'elle vienne se mêler de mes affaires ?!"
msgstr "Якого біса, чому вона постійно втручається в моє життя?!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b5c9be74"
msgid "J'ai vraiment passé une nuit de merde..."
msgstr "У мене була справді погана ніч..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5ae3b3c6"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que j'aurais aimé lui mettre mon poing dans la gueule."
msgstr "Я хочу вмазати йому в пику своїм кулаком."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_51fb23ce"
msgid "Ça explique probablement le fait qu'on se soit perdus de vue dans ma vie précédente..."
msgstr "Напевно, це пояснює, чому ми втратили зв’язок у моєму попередньому житті..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4726d1f1"
msgid "Il en avait tout simplement rien a branler de moi."
msgstr "Йому просто було наплювати на мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a1ac40ed"
msgid "Bonjour mon chéri..."
msgstr "Доброго ранку, любий..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_285f9d18"
msgid "Tu en fais une tête ! Ça ne va pas ?"
msgstr "Що в тебе з обличчям? Щось не так?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_51053150"
msgid "Ca va aller, je dois juste digérer ça, ça passera avec le temps."
msgstr "Все добре, мені просто потрібно обдумати дещо. Це займе трохи часу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_407ddccb"
msgid "Je sais ce qui te remontera le moral, il y a quelqu'un qui est venu pour te voir !"
msgstr "Я знаю, що підніме тобі настрій. Хтось прийшов до тебе!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3f0d95b7"
msgid "Ohlala ta tête au réveil !"
msgstr "О господи, це твоє ранкове обличчя..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_23219c9b"
msgid "J'aimerais bien voir la tienne au réveil toi aussi, ça doit pas être beau à voir."
msgstr "Я також хотів би побачити твоє. Я припускаю, що це теж не приємне видовище."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0e555676"
msgid "Haha...[w] Peut-être un jour."
msgstr "Ха-ха... [w] Можливо, колись."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d0ea9372"
msgid "Je vous laisse, amusez vous bien !"
msgstr "Мені треба йти. Весело проведіть час!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f6e229bf"
msgid "Alors t'es venue pour quelque chose en particulier ?"
msgstr "То ти прийшла за чимось конкретним?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6b937e74"
msgid "Ai-je besoin d'une raison pour aller voir un ami ?"
msgstr "Чи потрібна мені причина, щоб побачити друга?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_076531de"
msgid "...Tu marques un point. Mais honnêtement après ce qui m'est arrivé hier soir avec {{minato.n}} je ne sais plus trop comment fonctionne l'amitié."
msgstr "...Ти маєш рацію. Але, чесно кажучи, після того, що трапилося зі мною вчора ввечері з {{minato.n}}, я більше не знаю, як працює дружба."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f80c4bc0"
msgid "Allons au canal ! Tu me raconteras ça là-bas!"
msgstr "Ходімо до каналу! Там ти зможеш мені все розповісти!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ae66cf47"
msgid "Je crois que je vais avoir besoins d'aller courir pour me vider l'esprit."
msgstr "Думаю, мені потрібно сходити на пробіжку, щоб очистити свій розум."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6cbc267c"
msgid "Dormir n'aura pas été suffisant..."
msgstr "Мені не вистачило часу щоб виспатися..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2cbca10"
msgid "Bon, aujourd'hui, {{yasuka.n}} se repose, c'est à moi de régler le problème avec l'autre..."
msgstr "Що ж, сьогодні {{yasuka.n}} відпочиває, тож я маю розв'язати проблему зі старим..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_816aa981"
msgid "J'espère qu'il ne fera pas de vague."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, він не здійме багато хвиль."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0159153b"
msgid "Je devrais pouv-"
msgstr "Я маю бути..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_af525fe0"
msgid "{{saito.n}} !"
msgstr "{{saito.n}}!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_83b3da5b"
msgid "Y a le putain de gros porc qui attend devant la maison !"
msgstr "Ця довбана жирна свиня чекає перед будинком!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d04f7e8"
msgid "Quoi ?!"
msgstr "Що?!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2cd0b172"
msgid "Fais-le partir, ce mec me donne encore plus la gerbe que toi !"
msgstr "Прожени його звідси! Цей мужик ще більш огидний, ніж ти!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed6623a0"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9e580008"
msgid "Bon eh bien, quand faut y aller."
msgstr "Що ж, якраз вчасно."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34c5dbba"
msgid "Courage {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "Хай щастить, {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fa5296c9"
msgid "Tu vas passer une journée de merde, mais tu as déjà connu pire dans ta vie antérieure."
msgstr "У тебе буде паскудний день, але в минулому житті ти вже пережив і гірше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8565c3a2"
msgid "N'oublie pas pour qui tu le fais !"
msgstr "Не забувай, для кого ти це робиш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_af532164"
msgid "Une journée de plus en enfer."
msgstr "Ще один день у пеклі."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6e25996c"
msgid "Je dois tenir bon !"
msgstr "Я маю стояти на своєму!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e4a06382"
msgid "Le matin à la boutique et l'après-midi au restaurant."
msgstr "Того ранку в крамниці, а того дня в ресторані."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f17f151b"
msgid "Mais putain, pourquoi j'ai autant ouvert ma gueule moi ?!"
msgstr "Якого біса я так роззявив рота?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_beed8b40"
msgid "Fait chier, je ne voulais pas tout déballer."
msgstr "Чорт забирай, не хотів їй все розповідати."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b8c32421"
msgid "Je ne sais même plus comment me comporter avec elle maintenant."
msgstr "Я навіть не знаю, як тепер з нею бути."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_04491401"
msgid "Bon tant pis... ce qui est dit est dit."
msgstr "Ну, хай там як... Що сказано, те сказано."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a8716a29"
msgid "Et je suis déjà revenu en arrière une fois, il y a des limites à ce que la chance peut faire."
msgstr "І я вже одного разу повернувся. Везіння може допомогти."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0696fd86"
msgid "T'ES UN PUTAIN DE CONNARD !"
msgstr "ТИ ДОВБАНИЙ МУДАК!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8aa82321"
msgid "Quoi, mais ?"
msgstr "Що? Але..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_90e07e50"
msgid "Ma mère pleurait, et ça juste après que tu as quitté sa chambre !"
msgstr "Моя мама плакала, щойно ти вийшов з її кімнати!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ad6a7795"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que tu lui as dit ?"
msgstr "Що ти їй сказав?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3504f98c"
msgid "Euh..."
msgstr "Е-е..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dd23cd57"
msgid "Putain, je croyais que t'avais changé."
msgstr "Чорт, я думала, ти змінився."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_00fe535b"
msgid "Mais tu restes un putain de connard !"
msgstr "Але ти все одно довбаний мудак!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b1c00d89"
msgid "Je te hais !"
msgstr "Я ненавиджу тебе!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e711565e"
msgid "Bordel..."
msgstr "Дідько..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1bda16dc"
msgid "Les choses sont en train de partir en couille, ça me rend fou."
msgstr "Усе йде шкереберть, і це зводить мене з розуму."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_94d3991d"
msgid "Je ferais mieux d'aller me coucher."
msgstr "Я краще піду посплю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_60f6f9a9"
msgid "Les choses ont pris une tournure bien plus intéressante avec {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Справи {{yasuka.n}} пішли на краще."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0fe2587e"
msgid "Jamais je n'aurais pu imaginer avoir cette chance."
msgstr "Ніколи не міг уявити, що мені випаде такий шанс."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d3b34d22"
msgid "Mais ça ne résout pas mon problème avec l'autre ordure."
msgstr "Але це не вирішує моєї проблеми зі старим виродком."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3fb24dca"
msgid "Je n'ai toujours pas de solution."
msgstr "У мене досі немає рішення."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_da478645"
msgid "Je me demande si mon cher patron a eu une bonne nuit ou si {{noriko.n}} est resté tranquillement à la maison."
msgstr "Цікаво, чи мій дорогий бос добре провів ніч, чи {{noriko.n}} спокійно залишилася вдома."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e9d25848"
msgid "Je sens qu'on approche de la conclusion de cette histoire."
msgstr "Відчуваю, що вся ця історія скоро закінчиться."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a25e74d7"
msgid "Il est tard et je n'ai plus trop le temps, dépêche-toi !"
msgstr "Уже пізно й у мене мало часу, тож поквапся!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b2d6792b"
msgid "Que... qu'est-ce que tu voulais ?"
msgstr "Що... Чого ти хочеш?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c1da6f66"
msgid "Je ne sais pas ce que tu as fait avec le patron de {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Я не знаю, що ти зробила з босом {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ec60091f"
msgid "Mais ça a fonctionné à merveille."
msgstr "Але це чудово спрацювало."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_898b1990"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2568afa6"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} ?"
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_63743849"
msgid "C'était pas moi..."
msgstr "Це була не я..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1ce1fed2"
msgid "Attend quoi ? M-"
msgstr "Стривай, що? Але..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7842df2b"
msgid "Je voulais aider, mais je n'ai rien pu faire..."
msgstr "Я хотіла допомогти, але нічого не могла зробити..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4880190a"
msgid "Mais si c'est pas toi, c'est..."
msgstr "Але якщо це була не ти, то хто..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1efbf06e"
msgid "Oh putain, je le crois pas !"
msgstr "О, чорт, я не можу в це повірити!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2c4ef952"
msgid "Tu sais qui c'est ?"
msgstr "Ти знаєш, хто це зробив?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cbc0dfe8"
msgid "Oui... Et si ça se confirme, les ennuis qu'on a eus avec l'autre con sont le cadet de nos soucis."
msgstr "Так... І якщо я правий, то неприємності, які ми мали з тим мудаком — найменша з наших проблем."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`cute`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8a1a0a17"
msgid "Peu importe, si maman n'a plus de problème, tu remercieras cette personne pour moi !"
msgstr "Неважливо. Якщо у мами більше немає проблем, можеш подякувати цій людині від мене!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c89a97c5"
msgid "Merde, je pensais en avoir bientôt terminé."
msgstr "Чорт, я думав, що все скоро закінчиться."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd5a04f3"
msgid "Et je sens que je vais m'attirer de nouveaux problèmes."
msgstr "Але відчуваю, що у мене будуть ще якісь неприємності."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_485b3ca8"
msgid "Je suis bien dans la merde moi maintenant."
msgstr "Тепер я в такій сраці..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f9ca7a3c"
msgid "Que... Qu'est-ce que tu fais là ?"
msgstr "Якого... Що ти тут робиш?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_29cd7803"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_57c7606a"
msgid "Je vous ai entendu tout à l'heure..."
msgstr "Я чула тебе раніше..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_570be51a"
msgid "Oh bordel, encore des problèmes !"
msgstr "Прокляття, знову проблеми?!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9f5b1953"
msgid "J'en peux plus, laissez-moi respirer un peu."
msgstr "Я так більше не можу. Дай мені спокій."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba952046"
msgid "Je... Moi aussi, tu pourras me faire des massages ?"
msgstr "Можеш і мені зробити масаж?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_04357d38"
msgid "De... de quoi ?!"
msgstr "Щ... Що?!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d4ec1412"
msgid "Maman avait l'air d'apprécier, tu pourras me faire la même chose ?"
msgstr "Мамі, здається, сподобалося. Можеш зробити те саме для мене?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9156b917"
msgid "Je..."
msgstr "Я..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_288dae72"
msgid "Oh et puis merde."
msgstr "Фух-х, ну його нафіг."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a063683c"
msgid "Bien sûr {{noriko.n}}, quand tu voudras !"
msgstr "Звісно, {{noriko.n}}, коли завгодно!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`cute`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6a1d68ba"
msgid "Merci ![w] Je te laisse dormir, bonne nuit !"
msgstr "Дякую![w] Я дам тобі поспати. Добраніч!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_03775ec8_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2a277a68"
msgid "Mon cas est désespéré, je crois..."
msgstr "Моя ситуація безнадійна, я думаю..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c4254423"
msgid "Bonjour mon chéri, tu as passé une bonne nuit ?"
msgstr "Доброго ранку, милий. Добре спав?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5ba7d6d9"
msgid "Ça va... Tu as l'air un peu étrange ce matin."
msgstr "Так... Ти якась дивна сьогодні вранці."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_48862c8b"
msgid "Oui, je crois que j'ai un peu trop abusé de l'alcool."
msgstr "Так... Здається, я випила забагато алкоголю."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`depressed`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cc58d789"
msgid "Nous sommes censés boire avec les clients, mais je n'ai pas l'habitude de boire autant."
msgstr "Ми повинні пити з клієнтами, але я не звикла пити так багато."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_853290b2"
msgid "Je n'ai qu'une envie, c'est d'aller dormir."
msgstr "Я просто хочу лягти спати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a911951f"
msgid "...Je comprends, repose-toi bien."
msgstr "... Я розумію. Відпочивай."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3d930e81"
msgid "J'ai pas envie de lui imposer de nouveaux problèmes alors qu'elle se donne a fond pour essayer d'en résoudre d'autres."
msgstr "Не хочу нав'язувати їй нові проблеми, в той час, як вона вже віддає всі сили для вирішення інших."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eff67ecd"
msgid "Je peux pas passer mon temps à fuir."
msgstr "Я не можу витрачати весь свій час на втечу."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eafb4276"
msgid "Et {{akira.n}} ne pourra pas éternellement m'empêcher de m'inscrire au dojo non plus."
msgstr "{{akira.n}} не може завжди не давати мені записатися у доджьо."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fe08084b"
msgid "{{kimochi.n}} se fait traquer depuis longtemps aussi, à deux cerveaux, on arrivera surement à une solution."
msgstr "{{kimochi.n}} теж вже деякий час стежить за розвитком подій. Маючи дві голови, ми, мабуть, знайдемо рішення."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_26f9291f"
msgid "J'ai bien réfléchi et..."
msgstr "Я подумала про це, і..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2a973b4d"
msgid "Si c'est pour aider maman..."
msgstr "Якщо це допоможе мамі..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e65b518c"
msgid "J'accepte la proposition."
msgstr "Я приймаю твою пропозицію."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed6623a0_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4a9e9861"
msgid "C'est trop tard, je me suis débrouillé sans toi."
msgstr "Занадто пізно. Я впорався без тебе."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6599870f"
msgid "M-"
msgstr "Але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_84154f67"
msgid "Maintenant, si tu permets, je vais aller travailler."
msgstr "А тепер вибач, мені треба йти на роботу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_185d010b"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mon chéri... Tu es réveillé ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Любий... Ти не спиш?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_37c70972"
msgid "[font_size=14]Je peux entrer ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Можна зайти?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_20d5a37e"
msgid "[font_size=14]..........[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14].........[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_f8864334"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tant pis, j'entre quand même ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]На жаль, я все одно зайду![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_a6cae15e"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}}... ?"
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}...?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_8791e309"
msgid "Mais...Pourquoi tu..."
msgstr "Але... Чому ти..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_06e23992"
msgid "Tu es si distant avec moi dernièrement."
msgstr "Останнім часом ти так віддалився від мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_bce20e5c"
msgid "Pourquoi tu ne prends pas en compte mes sentiments ?"
msgstr "Чому ти не хочеш зважати на мої почуття?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_039d4a89"
msgid "Quoi ? Tes sentiments ?"
msgstr "Що? Твої почуття?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_ab0366a3"
msgid "Exactement !"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_76b469d2"
msgid "...Mais... Tu n'aurais pas encore abusé de l'alcool ?"
msgstr "Але... Ти забагато випила?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_21e1d8e1"
msgid "Rhoo..."
msgstr "Ооо..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_8c1a1799"
msgid "Tu comptes me laisser comme ça sur le pas de la porte ?"
msgstr "Ти збираєшся залишити мене на порозі ось так?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_efc6a08c"
msgid "J'ai même retrouvé un ensemble que je n'avais jamais eu l'occasion de porter."
msgstr "Я навіть знайшла комплект, який ніколи не мала можливості одягнути."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_37d4a94a"
msgid "Tu n'as pas envie de... me l'enlever ?"
msgstr "Ти не хочеш... зняти його з мене?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_5bb035d8"
msgid "....[w] Bon ça suffit, je te raccompagne à ta chambre, il est tard."
msgstr "....[w] Добре, досить. Я проведу тебе до твоєї кімнати. Уже пізно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_bfd37731"
msgid "Rhooooo, rabat-joie !"
msgstr "Ууууу, веселуха!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_9b1e7057"
msgid "{{saito.n}} raccompagna {{yasuka.n}} jusqu'à sa chambre, elle se laissa faire."
msgstr "{{saito.n}} провів {{yasuka.n}} до її кімнати. Вона не чинила опору."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_863d32ba"
msgid "Elle semblait déçue, mais également dans un état d'ébriété qu'il n'avait jamais vu encore."
msgstr "Вона виглядала розчарованою, але також була така п’яна, якої він ніколи раніше не бачив."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_8d334278"
msgid "La raccompagner était la meilleure chose à faire."
msgstr "Провести її було найкращим варіантом."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_798a60bb"
msgid "Bon... La soirée a dû être compliqué pour elle visiblement."
msgstr "Що ж... Вечір, мабуть, був складним для неї."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_32950e81"
msgid "Je verrai avec elle demain matin."
msgstr "Я зайду до неї завтра вранці."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_ec727f0b"
msgid "Je n'ai plus que quelques heures de sommeil, je ferais mieux de retourner me coucher."
msgstr "Мені залишилося поспати лише кілька годин. Я краще піду спати."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_7679b7d4"
msgid "{{saito.n}} retourna se coucher, il retrouva vite le sommeil."
msgstr "{{saito.n}} повернувся у ліжко й швидко заснув."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_cb70a201"
msgid "La tenue sexy de {{yasuka.n}} l'ayant bien trop excité."
msgstr "Сексуальне вбрання {{yasuka.n}} занадто його збудило."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_0a30d387"
msgid "Il sentit un poids sur lui l'écraser progressivement."
msgstr "Він відчув, як на нього навалилася якась вага, що поступово розчавлювала його."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_a32beda6"
msgid "Ainsi qu'un petit courant d'air tiède souffler sur sa verge."
msgstr "Слабкий струмінь теплого повітря, здавалося, дмухав на його вал."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_7f5c845d"
msgid "Il pensait être en train de rêver..."
msgstr "Він думав, що це сон..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_137e4db1"
msgid "[font_size=14]Héhé, enfin ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Хе-хе, нарешті![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_05a005be"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu es moi ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ти мій![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_a6ab536e"
msgid "[font_size=14]J'attends ce moment depuis si longtemps ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я так довго чекала цієї миті![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_2cc6b7be"
msgid "[font_size=14]Bon appétit ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Гарного апетиту![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_283c7dca"
msgid "Mhhh..."
msgstr "Мххх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_46277eb4"
msgid "Pourquoi je ne suis pas venu faire ça plus tôt ?"
msgstr "Чому я не прийшла раніше?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_8b339172"
msgid "Mhhhh..."
msgstr "Мхххх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_89fddab2"
msgid "C'est ça..."
msgstr "Це воно..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_9932d178"
msgid "Continue de rêver mon chéri."
msgstr "Продовжуй мріяти, любий."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_8c53ad96"
msgid "Je vais bien m'occuper de toi."
msgstr "Я подбаю про тебе."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_91f28a95"
msgid "[i]**Mhh, j'ai l'impression que ma mâchoire va se décrocher.**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Мхх, я відчуваю, що щелепа ось-ось відвалиться.**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_9cd48d5c"
msgid "[i]**Qui aurait pu imaginer qu'il serait si bien membré.**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Хто б міг подумати, що він такий обдарований...**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_8bc14683"
msgid "[i]**Je pourrais faire ça pendant des heures !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Я можу робити це годинами!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_530eed26"
msgid "[i]**Je suis certaine que je pourrais l'avaler encore plus...**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Я впевнена, що можу взяти ще глибше...**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_1da99494"
msgid "[i]**Il faut que j'essaye !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Я мушу спробувати!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_4c4b7967"
msgid "[i]**Mhh, oui, un vrai régal !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Мхх, так, це справжня насолода!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_26793075"
msgid "[i]**Continue mon chéri, ta langue me donne beaucoup de plaisir.**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Продовжуй, любий! Твій язик приносить мені таку насолоду!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_a4968597"
msgid "[i]**Oh mon Dieu, tout ça me rend tellement excitée.**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Боже, я так схвильована.**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_ea456f3f"
msgid "[i]**J'en veux plus !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Я так більше не можу!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_54596397"
msgid "[i]**Donne-moi ton jus.**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Дай мені свій сік!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_abc89dbd"
msgid "[i]**Je veux y gouter !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Я хочу спробувати!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_87c78aed"
msgid "[i]**Mmmmhhh...**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Ммммххх...**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_196d30c1"
msgid "[i]**Quel délice !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Яке задоволення!**[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_2f2de5c6"
msgid "[i]**Je vais tout prendre, donne-m'en plus !**[/i]"
msgstr "[i]**Я візьму весь! Дай мені ще!**[/i]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_a96a756c"
msgid "[font_size=14]Merci pour ce délicieux repas mon chéri.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Дякую за насолоду, мій любий.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_3321aa6a"
msgid "[font_size=14]Je reviendrais te voir très vite...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я скоро повернуся до тебе...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_wake_up_saito_9c0c6d04"
msgid "[font_size=14]C'est promis ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Обіцяю![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_19ce67d5"
msgid "Mais c'était quoi ce rêve ?!"
msgstr "Що це був за сон?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_afaa9704"
msgid "C'était si réel..."
msgstr "Це було так по-справжньому..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_be93d1d3"
msgid "Elle s'est jetée sur moi comme si..."
msgstr "Вона накинулася на мене, наче..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aa6cacbb"
msgid "Comme si..."
msgstr "Наче..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8a401c7c"
msgid "Je vais avoir du mal à la regarder dans les yeux à présent..."
msgstr "Тепер мені буде важко дивитися їй в очі..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_886dc99d"
msgid "Ça va être la conversation la plus étrange que j'ai jamais eu de ma vie..."
msgstr "Це буде найдивніша розмова в моєму житті..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e23f1a87"
msgid "Alors ? Je t'ai manquée ?"
msgstr "І що? Скучив за мною?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4f421450"
msgid "Wow {{yasuka.n}}, tu es magnifique..."
msgstr "Нічого собі, {{yasuka.n}}. Ти прекрасна..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba24a1cf"
msgid "Je suis sans voix, vraiment !"
msgstr "У мене немає слів. Справді!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0b6b3fcb"
msgid "Quel charmeur !"
msgstr "Який чарівник!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cb783ed0"
msgid "Allez, allonge-toi !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, лягай!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_29e85b7d"
msgid "Il est grand tant que je m'occupe de mon chéri."
msgstr "Настав час подбати про мого солоденького."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ecb2db59"
msgid "Tu veux dire que tu vas..."
msgstr "Тобто ти збираєшся..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_01d3e1f8"
msgid "Shhttt !"
msgstr "Цить!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_31700847"
msgid "Bon appétit !"
msgstr "Приємного!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e3ee658c"
msgid "Laisse-toi faire pour l'instant, j'ai envie de m'occuper de toi."
msgstr "Приляж поки що. Я хочу подбати про тебе."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a5b7595b"
msgid "Vois ça comme une récompense pour t'être donné autant de mal pour moi ces derniers jours."
msgstr "Вважай це винагородою за те, що нещодавно доклав стільки зусиль заради мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_65b17911"
msgid "Alors... On résiste ?"
msgstr "Ну що... Усе ще опираєшся?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2216e8ce"
msgid "Mmmhh, viens ici toi !"
msgstr "М-м-м, іди сюди!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4f3e7b5a"
msgid "Mmmhh... C'est tellement bon."
msgstr "М-м-м... Це так добре."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_449d1c04"
msgid "Tu as l'autorisation de t'occuper de moi à présent !"
msgstr "Тепер ти можеш подбати про мене!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_50c93929"
msgid "Mhh..."
msgstr "Мх-х..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cee4e74a"
msgid "Je vois que Monsieur apprécie..."
msgstr "Бачу, панові подобається..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f1441fa4"
msgid "Je vais t'avaler en entier !"
msgstr "Я проковтну його цілком!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cf640c4b"
msgid "Oh... Mais... C'est que tu es doué avec ta langue."
msgstr "О-о... Проте... Ти добре володієш язиком."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_051910e3"
msgid "C'est... Une très bonne surprise."
msgstr "Це... Дуже приємний сюрприз."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1f043358"
msgid "Continues, ne t'arrêtes surtout pas mon chéri !"
msgstr "Не зупиняйся! Будь ласка, не зупиняйся, любий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dcfa0341"
msgid "Mmmh... **slurp**"
msgstr "М-м-м... **хлюп**"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0f59e7cb"
msgid "Je te sens venir !"
msgstr "Відчуваю, що ти кінчаєш!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c9fe00e3"
msgid "Donne-moi tout !"
msgstr "Віддай мені все!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3f7e3682"
msgid "Hmm, hmmm, mouiiiii..."
msgstr "М-м-м, м-м-м, та-а-а-ак..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d2d64d0e"
msgid "Mmmmh, encore..."
msgstr "М-м-м-м, ще..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ef61c1e4"
msgid "Mhh, il y en a tellement !"
msgstr "М-м-м, так багато!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_226b7fe5"
msgid "Je ne veux pas en perdre une goutte !"
msgstr "Я не хочу витрачати жодної краплі!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9161405b"
msgid "Ça t'a plus mon chéri ?"
msgstr "Тобі сподобалося, любий?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d005992a"
msgid "Moi, j'ai beaucoup aimé..."
msgstr "Бо мені дуже сподобалося..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f1871dac"
msgid "Je n'aurais jamais imaginé te voir aussi excitée."
msgstr "Ніколи не думав, що побачу тебе такою схвильованою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e5fa9a44"
msgid "Et tu n'as encore rien vu !"
msgstr "А ти ще нічого не бачив!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_351fa9d7"
msgid "Attend de voir le prochain round !"
msgstr "Зачекай, доки не побачиш наступний раунд!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a7ea9a3b"
msgid "Quoi, déjà ?"
msgstr "Що, вже?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_88bd4ee1"
msgid "J'espère que tu ne comptes pas te coucher tôt avec moi à présent !"
msgstr "Сподіваюся, ти не плануєш лягати спати раніше, оскільки я тут!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ebe2b00e"
msgid "On y retourne !"
msgstr "Повернімося до розпочатого!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_301bf95e"
msgid "Eh bien mon chéri, quelle nuit !"
msgstr "Що за ніч, любий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_364770f9"
msgid "J'espère que tu as pu te reposer un peu, car je compte bien recommencer très vite."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, ти зміг трохи відпочити, тому що дуже скоро я планую почати все спочатку."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_20667253"
msgid "Recommencer ? Déjà ?"
msgstr "Знову? Уже?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a0c93c4e"
msgid "Oui, tout ça n'était que la première fois d'une longue série."
msgstr "Так, це була лише перша з довгої серії."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d9e78233"
msgid "Je compte bien rattraper tout le temps perdu !"
msgstr "Я планую надолужити згаяне!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f81f759c"
msgid "J'ai déjà hâte d'y être !"
msgstr "Я вже з нетерпінням чекаю!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c1602416"
msgid "C'EST PAS UN PEU FINI CE BOR-"
msgstr "ТИ, БЛЯХА, ЗАТКНЕШ..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_692c7368"
msgid "Maman ?!"
msgstr "Мамо?!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_320178d2"
msgid "Mais... Qu'est-ce que t- t- tu fais dans... dans sa chambre ?!"
msgstr "Але... Що т-т-ти робиш... у його кімнаті?!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4447721c"
msgid "Et pourquoi tu es nue ?!!"
msgstr "І чому ти гола?!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_57aa84a1"
msgid "{{noriko.n}}, tu vas commencer par surveiller ton langage, je n'ai pas souvenir de t'avoir éduquée ainsi."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}, ти почнеш з того, що стежитимеш за своїм ротом. Не пам'ятаю, щоб я тебе так виховував."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c5e65c63"
msgid "De plus, je suis tout à fait libre de faire ce que bon me semble chez moi et surtout,[w] de choisir comment j'ai envie de m'habiller !"
msgstr "Утім, я абсолютно вільна робити все, що захочу, у власному будинку, і, перш за все,[w] вибирати, як я хочу одягатися!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc2bd13a"
msgid "La prochaine fois que tu désires entrer dans la chambre de {{saito.n}} ou dans n'importe quelle autre chambre, tu attendras qu'on te demande d'entrer !"
msgstr "Наступного разу, коли захочеш зайти в кімнату {{saito.n}} або будь-яку іншу кімнату, зачекай, поки дозволять увійти!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_76b34df1"
msgid "Est-ce que je me suis bien fait comprendre {{noriko.n}} ?"
msgstr "Я зрозуміло висловилася, {{noriko.n}}?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dd989dbc"
msgid "Je... Oui maman, excuse-moi."
msgstr "Я... Так, мамо. Вибач."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0c4cdb6a"
msgid "Ce n'est pas à moi que tu dois des excuses, mais à {{saito.n}} !"
msgstr "{{saito.n}} — це перед ним ти маєш вибачитися, а не переді мною!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_08b23826"
msgid "Oh la vache !"
msgstr "О, чорт!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8d244c5c"
msgid "Je m'attendais pas à voir {{noriko.n}} se faire passer un savon par {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Я не очікував, що на {{noriko.n}} буде кричати {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_66af2c30"
msgid "Elle qui était si laxiste avec sa fille à changer du tout au tout."
msgstr "Раніше вона була такою розслабленою з донькою, але зараз вона повністю змінилася."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6f87ef0d"
msgid "Je dois entrer dans son jeu."
msgstr "Я мушу підіграти."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_309d671e"
msgid "Je... je..."
msgstr "Я... Я..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8c726788"
msgid "Allez, dépêche-toi, ce ne sont que des excuses, ce n'est pas la fin du monde !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, поквапся! Це лише вибачення. Це ж не кінець світу!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_29cd7803_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6baae5ec"
msgid "[font_size=14]Excuse-moi.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Вибач мене.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f46cfbaa"
msgid "Je n'ai rien entendu et je suis sûre que {{saito.n}} non plus !"
msgstr "Я нічого не чула, і впевнена, що {{saito.n}} теж!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bca857f5"
msgid "Mon chéri, tu as entendu ?"
msgstr "Любий, ти щось чув?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t288683e788"
msgid "Je n'ai absolument rien entendu !"
msgstr "Я нічого не чув!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3752ecdc"
msgid "Non, non, non, ça ne va pas."
msgstr "Ні, ні, ні, так не можна."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eada7900"
msgid "Allez, plus fort !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, голосніше!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf1bfadab27"
msgid "Oui, c'était faible, mais j'ai entendu des excuses."
msgstr "Так, це було слабо, але я почув вибачення."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0d9e4373"
msgid "M'MANNN ! Qu'est-ce qui se passe ce matin ?!"
msgstr "МАМО! Що відбувається з ранку?!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bcbe0044"
msgid "Pourquoi tu prends autant la défense de ce... de..."
msgstr "Чому ти на боці цього... Цього..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d7d77105"
msgid "Je pense que j'ai été bien trop conciliante avec toi ces dernières années."
msgstr "Думаю, останні кілька років я була надто м'якою з тобою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_90132ddb"
msgid "Et je veux que ça change !"
msgstr "І я хочу, щоб це змінилося!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0633702e"
msgid "Tu t'excuses ou tu passes les deux prochaines semaine sans internet !"
msgstr "А тепер вибачся, або наступні два тижні проведеш без інтернету!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_490bcc79"
msgid "Mais je...[w] D'accord, c'est bon..."
msgstr "Але я...[w] Гаразд, добре..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c38f000a"
msgid "Excuse-moi {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "Вибач, {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2af78021"
msgid "Ah, ça fait du bien ! J'aurais dû reprendre {{noriko.n}} en main depuis longtemps."
msgstr "О-о, як добре! Я мала б вже давно взяти на себе відповідальність за {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_614caa53"
msgid "Repose-toi bien mon chéri, je vais prendre soins de toi à présent !"
msgstr "А тепер відпочинь, сонечко. Тепер я буду піклуватися про тебе!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_31187cc9"
msgid "Woah... Si je m'attendais à ça... C'était complètement inespéré."
msgstr "Ого... Я такого точно не очікував... Я навіть не сподівався на таке."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d90e3ab0"
msgid "Comme si la {{yasuka.n}} qui s'était effacée depuis des années était de retour plus forte que jamais."
msgstr "Ніби {{yasuka.n}}, яка зникла багато років тому, повернулася, сильнішою ніж будь-коли."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d4df37bc"
msgid "Cette drogue est vraiment étrange... J'espère seulement que sa santé n'est pas en danger."
msgstr "Це дуже дивні ліки... Сподіваюся, її здоров'ю нічого не загрожує."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_39d3c500"
msgid "Quoi qu'il en soit, il reste encore des dettes à payer, je ferais mieux de me remettre au travail au plus vite."
msgstr "Так чи інакше, є ще борги, які треба сплатити, тому мені краще повернутися до роботи якнайшвидше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ebaa9b9b"
msgid "Ce n'est pas vraiment le repos que {{yasuka.n}} aurait voulu, mais tant pis."
msgstr "Це не зовсім те, чого б хотіли інші {{yasuka.n}}, але байдуже."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61ac3b34"
msgid "Je pense que c'est bon à présent."
msgstr "Думаю, тепер все гаразд."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_484070b8"
msgid "Je devrais pouvoir sortir tranquillement sans me faire remarquer."
msgstr "Треба непомітно піти, щоб мене не помітили."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_dabc0738"
msgid "Je n'ai pas envie de faire attendre {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Не хочу змушувати {{yasuka.n}} чекати."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_FAISAIT_UNE_TERNIT_QUE_JE_N_EF0C87"
msgid "Ça faisait une éternité que je n'avais pas passé un moment aussi agréable que ça."
msgstr "Вже давно я не проводив таких приємних хвилин."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_CROIS_M_ME_QUE_A_N_TAIT_JAM_F9CDEB"
msgid "Je crois même que ça n'était jamais arrivé."
msgstr "Навіть думаю, що так ніколи і не траплялося."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NORIKO_N_EST_TOUJOURS_AUSSI_P_0997B1"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} est toujours aussi provocatrice mais j'ai l'impression qu'elle s'adoucit enfin."
msgstr "Норіко все така ж провокаційна, але мені здається, що вона нарешті стала більш м’якою."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YASUKA_N_SEMBLE_AVOIR_RETROUV_C76FCA"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} semble avoir retrouvé le sourire. Je sens que les choses vont enfin aller en s'arrangeant."
msgstr "Здається, {{yasuka.n}} знову почала усміхатися. Я відчуваю, що все нарешті почне налагоджуватися."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HMM_J_AI_BIEN_DORMI_POUR_UNE_F_05FE18"
msgid "Hmm j'ai bien dormi pour une fois..."
msgstr "Хм, цього разу я добре поспав..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_N_AI_PAS_DEMAND_YASUKA_N_CO_156B53"
msgid "Je n'ai pas demandé à {{yasuka.n}} comment s'était passée sa journée."
msgstr "Я не питав {{yasuka.n}}, як пройшов її день."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DEVRAIS_ALLER_LA_VOIR_AVANT_B3E8B4"
msgid "Je devrais aller la voir avant qu'elle ne parte."
msgstr "Мені варто зустрітися з нею, перш ніж вона поїде."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SAKUYA_N_AVAIT_UN_MAUVAIS_PRE_572284"
msgid "{{sakuya.n}} avait un mauvais pressentiment sur cet homme, je devrais peut être lui en parler."
msgstr "У {{sakuya.n}} були погані передчуття щодо цього чоловіка; мабуть, мені варто поговорити з ним про це."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PEUT_TRE_QU_ELLE_SERA_PLUS_ATT_1892DD"
msgid "Peut-être qu'elle sera plus attentive à une autre intuition féminine."
msgstr "Можливо, вона буде уважнішою до іншої жіночої інтуїції."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_PSSSST_T_ES_L_FO_AD2B86"
msgid "[font_size=14]Psssst t'es là ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Шшш, ти тут?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QUE_TU_PEUX_AUSSI_PASS_2E6CC1"
msgid "Tu sais que tu peux aussi passer par la porte d'entrée ?"
msgstr "Ти ж знаєш, що можеш також зайти через вхідні двері?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_MAIS_SINON_CE_N_EST_PAS_DR_730E0B"
msgid "Oui mais sinon ce n'est pas drôle."
msgstr "Так, але інакше це не смішно."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_DE_CETTE_FA_ON_IL_N_Y_A4635B"
msgid "Et puis de cette façon, il n'y a que toi qui sais que je suis là."
msgstr "І таким чином, лише ти знаєш, що я тут."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LES_MURS_SONT_ASSEZ_FINS_TU_SA_4BC8C7"
msgid "Les murs sont assez fins tu sais..."
msgstr "Стіни досить тонкі, знаєш..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "RABAT_JOIE_E2A03B"
msgid "Rabat-joie !"
msgstr "Радісна новина!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_VENUE_EXPR_S_POUR_PASS_A09E10"
msgid "Je suis venue exprès pour passer un peu de temps avec toi !"
msgstr "Я спеціально приїхала, щоб провести з тобою трохи часу!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_UNE_PETITE_PARTIE_ED4BAA"
msgid "Alors ? Une petite partie ?"
msgstr "Ну що? Погратимо трохи?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PFFF_ALLEZ_A_MARCHE_C81473"
msgid "Pfff... Allez ça marche !"
msgstr "Пфф... Гаразд, погодився!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YAY_724D59"
msgid "Yay !"
msgstr "Йейй!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_EN_VRAI_EST_CE_QUE_J_A_4075C3"
msgid "Et puis en vrai... Est-ce que j'ai besoin d'une raison pour venir passer du temps avec mon chéri ?"
msgstr "І, чесно кажучи... Чи потрібен мені якийсь причин, щоб проводити час зі своїм коханим?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_C_EST_VRAI_TU_AS_RAISON_25EC85"
msgid "Non c'est vrai, tu as raison..."
msgstr "Ні, це правда, ти маєш рацію..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VOIS_ALLEZ_TOUT_NU_MAINTENA_446179"
msgid "Tu vois ?! Allez, tout nu maintenant !"
msgstr "Бачиш?! Ну ж бо, тепер повністю голий!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUOI_L_COMME_A_0866E1"
msgid "Quoi là comme ça ?"
msgstr "Що, таке?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_L_TOUT_DE_SUITE_MAINTENANT_627512"
msgid "Oui là tout de suite maintenant !"
msgstr "Так, прямо зараз!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_TU_VAS_RESTER_ME_REGARDE_B84640"
msgid "Alors tu vas rester à me regarder sans rien faire ?"
msgstr "То ти просто будеш стояти та дивитися на мене, нічого не роблячи?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VEUX_TRANSPIRER_UN_PEU_AVEC_2DBCBF"
msgid "Tu veux transpirer un peu avec moi ?"
msgstr "Хочеш трохи потіти разом зі мною?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ON_PEUT_PROPOSER_NORIKO_N_DE_N_89D2F8"
msgid "On peut proposer à {{noriko.n}} de nous rejoindre si cela ne convient toujours pas à monsieur."
msgstr "Ми можемо запропонувати {{noriko.n}} приєднатися до нас, якщо це все ще не підходить пану."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_C_EST_BON_JE_CROIS_QU_ON_V_5CF375"
msgid "Non c'est bon, je crois qu'on va être bien assez occupés toi et moi !"
msgstr "Ні, це ніяк, гадаю, нам і так буде досить чим зайнятися, тобі й мені!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_EXACTEMENT_CE_QUE_JE_VOU_CA00C5"
msgid "C'est exactement ce que je voulais entendre !"
msgstr "Саме це я і хотіла почути!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_JE_CROIS_QUE_J_AI_ENTENDU_Q_BEF60A"
msgid "Oh je crois que j'ai entendu quelqu'un !"
msgstr "О, здається, я чула, як хтось рухається!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_PROBABLEMENT_YASUKA_N_EL_E0B92E"
msgid "C'est probablement {{yasuka.n}}, elle devait faire des heures supplémentaires ce soir !"
msgstr "Це, мабуть, {{yasuka.n}} – вона сьогодні ввечері, мабуть, працювала сверхурочно!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`bored`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VOUS_TRAVAILLEZ_TOUS_D_ARRACHE_12152D"
msgid "Vous travaillez tous d'arrache-pied dans cette maison !"
msgstr "Ви всі так наполегливо працюєте в цьому будинку!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_QU_ON_A_UNE_BONNE_RAISON_64D669"
msgid "C'est qu'on a une bonne raison..."
msgstr "Адже у нас є вагома причина..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_VRAI_DANS_CE_CAS_JE_NE_V_BF614B"
msgid "C'est vrai... Dans ce cas, je ne vais pas trop abuser et je vais te laisser te reposer."
msgstr "Це правда... У такому випадку я не буду занадто турбувати тебе та дам тобі можливість відпочити."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_REVIENDRAI_TE_VOIR_AU_MOMEN_17F595"
msgid "Je reviendrai te voir... Au moment où tu t'y attendras le moins !"
msgstr "Я повернусь, щоб побачитися з тобою... Саме в той момент, коли ти цього найменше очікуєш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_FERAIS_BIEN_D_ALLER_PRENDRE_9E7DAE"
msgid "Je ferais bien d'aller prendre de ses nouvelles."
msgstr "Мені варто б зайти та дізнатися, як у неї справи."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_IL_FAUT_QUE_J_ARRETE_DE_PE_04765F"
msgid "Bon il faut que j'arrête de perdre du temps comme ça."
msgstr "Ну, мені вже треба припиняти так марнувати час."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_CE_TRAIN_L_REMBOURSER_LA_DET_89977C"
msgid "À ce train-là, rembourser la dette prendra une éternité."
msgstr "Такими темпами погашення боргу займе вічність."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_CROIS_QUE_JE_FERAIS_MIEUX_D_EC3F5F"
msgid "Je crois que je ferais mieux d'aller prendre des nouvelles de {{kimochi.n}}."
msgstr "Я думаю, краще мені зайти подивитися, як справи у {{kimochi.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PEUT_TRE_DES_SUGGESTIONS_POUR_80144E"
msgid "Peut-être des suggestions pour gagner de l'argent plus rapidement, légalement j'espère..."
msgstr "Можливо, є якісь поради, як швидше та легально заробити гроші... Сподіваюся."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAMAN_N_EST_TOUJOURS_PAS_RENTR_497AF5"
msgid "Maman n'est toujours pas rentrée..."
msgstr "Мама досі не повернулась додому..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUPPOSE_QU_ELLE_FAIT_DES_HE_37E409"
msgid "Je suppose qu'elle fait des heures supplémentaires."
msgstr "Гадаю, вона працює понаднормово."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_TRAVAILLE_VRAIMENT_BEAUCO_64E8F4"
msgid "Elle travaille vraiment beaucoup en ce moment."
msgstr "Вона зараз справді дуже багато працює."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_SE_DONNE_DU_MAL_ET_FAIT_D_8580E8"
msgid "Elle se donne du mal et fait de son mieux pour rembourser sa dette..."
msgstr "Вона докладає всіх зусиль та робить усе можливе, щоб повернути свій борг..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PEUT_TRE_QUE_JE_DEVRAIS_M_Y_ME_6C095C"
msgid "Peut-être que je devrais m'y mettre aussi..."
msgstr "Можливо, мені теж варто цим зайнятися..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BONNE_NUIT_574C0F"
msgid "Bonne nuit..."
msgstr "Доброї ночі..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_EH_BIEN_A_JE_NE_M_Y_ATTENDA_AF9287"
msgid "...[w] Eh bien ça... Je ne m'y attendais pas, pourvu que les choses continuent comme ça."
msgstr "...[w] Ну, це... Я такого не очікував, сподіваюся, все буде продовжуватися так само."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_20_C_EST_QUOI_CE_BO_C6F205"
msgid "[font_size=20]C'EST QUOI CE BORDEL![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=20]Що за херня![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "WOAH_QU_EST_CE_QUI_SE_PASSE_9BBBBF"
msgid "Woah ! Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?!"
msgstr "Ого! Що відбувається?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_PLUS_L_HABITUDE_D_TRE_R_V_4F8F23"
msgid "J'ai plus l'habitude d'être réveillé en sursaut comme ça..."
msgstr "Я вже не звик прокидатися так раптово..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NORIKO_N_TOUT_VA_BIEN_0FCEF8"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} ?! Tout va bien ?"
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}?! Все гаразд?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_20_NON_FONT_SIZE_D98867"
msgid "[font_size=20]NON ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=20>НІ![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_faede933"
msgid "Oh bon sang..."
msgstr "О, Боже..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a416dec7"
msgid "Je ne sais pas si j'arriverai à tenir physiquement un tel rythme."
msgstr "Не знаю, чи зможу я фізично витримати такий темп."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AU_MOINS_YASUKA_N_SEMBLE_AVOIR_0270D7"
msgid "Au moins {{yasuka.n}} semble avoir retrouvé le sourire..."
msgstr "Принаймні, схоже, що {{yasuka.n}} знову змогла усміхнутися..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YASUKA_N_ESSAIE_DE_RATTRAPER_34D293"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} essaie de rattraper tout le temps perdu et {{asami.n}} est de plus en plus demandant."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}} намагається надолужити весь втрачений час, а {{asami.n}} стає все вимогливішою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YASUKA_N_SEMBLE_BIEN_VOULOIR_324C94"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} semble bien vouloir absolument rattraper tout le temps perdu."
msgstr "Схоже, {{yasuka.n}} дійсно хоче компенсувати всі втрачені часи."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t45cda2bc7c"
msgid "et puis il y a {{sakuya.n}}... Je n'ai aucune idée de comment je vais la gérer."
msgstr "А ще є {{sakuya.n}}...і я не знаю, як з нею впоратися."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_481e905d"
msgid "Tsss, toujours à parler tout seul comme un cinglé !"
msgstr "Тьху, завжди розмовляєш сам з собою, як божевільний!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_427ab2df"
msgid "Tiens te voilà toi ! {{yasuka.n}} ne t'avait pas dit de frapper à la porte ?"
msgstr "А, ось ти де! Хіба {{yasuka.n}} не казала тобі спочатку постукати?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_08033dcc"
msgid "... C'est ça, fais le malin !"
msgstr "...Так, без різниці!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`-shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e77fe449"
msgid "Je ne sais pas ce que tu essaies de faire avec elle, mais crois-moi... J'aurais toujours un œil sur toi !"
msgstr "Я не знаю, що ти намагаєшся з нею зробити, але повір мені... Я завжди буду стежити за тобою!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1042a610"
msgid "Tu sais que ta mère se fait beaucoup de soucis pour toi."
msgstr "Твоя мама дуже піклується про тебе, ти ж знаєш."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_51e2a620"
msgid "On a beaucoup discuté de toi en fait."
msgstr "Ми багато про тебе говорили."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5cafdc3d"
msgid "Elle tient vraiment à ce que je m'occupe de toi."
msgstr "Вона дуже хоче, щоб я піклувалася про тебе."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5caa4240"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que vous avez dit sur moi ?! Je veux savoir tout de suite !"
msgstr "Що ти сказав про мене?! Я хочу знати прямо зараз!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_TOI_TOUJOURS_A_ENTRER_SANS_B478B1"
msgid "Et toi ? Toujours à entrer sans frapper ?"
msgstr "А ти? Досі заходиш без стуку?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EN_M_ME_TEMPS_JE_M_INQUIETE_UN_31DDAE"
msgid "En même temps je m'inquiète un peu, à déblatérer tout seul dans ton coin je ne sais pas si tu es fou ou si tu es en train de faire un AVC."
msgstr "Водночас я трохи хвилююся – коли ти так самотньо бурчиш собі під ніс, я не знаю, чи ти не з’їхав з глузду, чи у тебе не виник інсульт."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_AS_MAL_DORMIS_OU_QUOI_POUR_E46ACE"
msgid "Tu as mal dormis ou quoi pour être si agressive de bon matin ?"
msgstr "Ти, мабуть, погано поспав або щось у тебе таке, що робить тебе настільки агресивним вранці?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c4c896ef"
msgid "Eh bien, c'est animé ici de bon matin !"
msgstr "Що ж, сьогодні вранці тут дійсно жваво!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b53a8895"
msgid "Salut {{noriko.n}} ! Ça te dérange pas si je t'emprunte {{saito.n}} une heure ou deux ?"
msgstr "Привіт, {{noriko.n}}! Ти не проти, якщо я позичу {{saito.n}} на годинку-дві?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ad44a3fc"
msgid "Que... Pfff, fais ce que tu veux, tu es bien la seule à lui trouver quelque chose."
msgstr "Що... Пф-ф, роби, що хочеш. Ти єдина, хто може його витримати."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6fc9c402"
msgid "Haha, c'est vrai ?[w] Tant mieux alors, je n'ai aucune envie de le partager avec qui que ce soit."
msgstr "О-о, невже?[w] Що ж, добре, бо я не маю бажання ні з ким ним ділитися."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`-happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5037f551"
msgid "Mais tu ne sais pas ce que tu rates..."
msgstr "Але ти не знаєш, що втрачаєш..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a1df71ee"
msgid "Et je suis censée rater quoi ?"
msgstr "І що ж я втрачаю?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_891a6fc4"
msgid "Arrête, ne lui raconte pas ce genre de choses !!"
msgstr "Зупинися! Не кажи їй таких речей!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c5200f04"
msgid "Oh, mon petit poney fait son timide ?"
msgstr "О, мій маленький поні тепер сором'язливий?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1172bd24"
msgid "Je veux savoir ! Dis-moi tout ce qu'il y a de croustillant à savoir sur lui !"
msgstr "Я хочу знати! Розкажи мені все найцікавіше, що ти про нього знаєш!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a3a7de68"
msgid "Hey ! Je suis là, je vous entends !"
msgstr "Гей! Я тут, і я тебе чую!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_894457ab"
msgid "Mais pas du tout, tu peux même le garder avec toi toute la journée si tu veux."
msgstr "Зовсім ні. Ти навіть можеш забрати його на цілий день, якщо хочеш."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_117f26f9"
msgid "C'est vrai ? Je peux le garder chez moi aussi ?"
msgstr "Справді? Можна я теж приведу його додому?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5d8c1464"
msgid "J'en voulais un comme ça à la maison justement."
msgstr "Я теж хотіла б мати вдома такого, як він."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_80d52dca"
msgid "Moins je le vois, mieux je me porte !"
msgstr "Чим менше я його бачу, тим краще я почуваюся!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_995918e1"
msgid "Alors c'est décidé ! Tu viens habiter chez moi à partir de maintenant !"
msgstr "Тоді все вирішено! Відтепер ти житимеш у мене!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34d90840"
msgid "Euh..."
msgstr "Е-е..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5684db32"
msgid "....."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1c5746a4"
msgid "Ahah je le savais ! Il te manquerait trop s'il n'était pas là."
msgstr "Ахаха, я знала це! Ти б дуже сумувала за ним, якби його тут не було!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_baa4d065"
msgid "N'importe qu-"
msgstr "Ні, заче..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MON_CH_RI_JE_N_AURAIS_PAS_OUBL_B67B41"
msgid "Mon chéri, je n'aurais pas oublié mes sous-vêtements dans ta chambre ?"
msgstr "Коханий мій, чи могла я б забути свою білизну в твоїй кімнаті?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAMAN_ARR_TE_DE_TE_BALADER_POI_1B2796"
msgid "Maman... Arrête de te balader à poil dans la maison !"
msgstr "Мамо... Припини ходити голою по будинку!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUE_SE_PASSE_T_IL_ICI_J_ENTEND_B52DD4"
msgid "Que se passe-t-il ici ? J'entends beaucoup de bruit."
msgstr "Що тут відбувається? Я чую багато шуму."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`-happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7786d340"
msgid "Bonjour Madame !"
msgstr "Добрий день, пані!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_MON_D_F8D4A8"
msgid "Oh mon d-"
msgstr "О, боже мій..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_CONFUSE_JE_NE_VOUS_AVA_17C326"
msgid "Je suis confuse, je ne vous avais pas entendus."
msgstr "Я розгублена, я вас не почула."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_BORDEL_576DE8"
msgid "Oh bordel !"
msgstr "О, блядь!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_QUOI_CETTE_SITUATION_141768"
msgid "C'est quoi cette situation ?!"
msgstr "Що за ситуація?!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HAHA_ON_NE_S_ENNUIE_PAS_ICI_1B500E"
msgid "Haha ! On ne s'ennuie pas ici !"
msgstr "Ха-ха! Тут зовсім не нудно!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BONJOUR_ASAMI_N_TU_SAIS_QUE_TU_6CAB2C"
msgid "Bonjour {{asami.n}}, tu sais que tu peux passer par la porte d'entrée."
msgstr "Привіт, {{asami.n}} – ти ж знаєш, що можеш заходити через вхідні двері."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CA_NE_ME_D_RANGE_PAS_DU_TOUT_66A98C"
msgid "Ça ne me dérange pas du tout."
msgstr "Це зовсім не заважає мені."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2ae67011"
msgid "C'est ma faute, je voulais faire une surprise à {{saito.n}} en passant par sa fenêtre."
msgstr "Це моя провина. Я хотіла здивувати {{saito.n}}, влізши до нього у вікно."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_80d19a4f"
msgid "Viens avec moi ! Je veux tous tes dossiers sur lui !"
msgstr "Ходімо зі мною! Мені потрібен весь твій компромат на нього!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ab511973"
msgid "Hey ho !"
msgstr "Гей, зачекайте!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e5721c7e"
msgid "À plus tard, mon petit poney !"
msgstr "Побачимося пізніше, мій маленький поні!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a45271fc"
msgid "On se voit tout à l'heure !"
msgstr "Побачимося пізніше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_005b9f43"
msgid "J'aurais plutôt dit un étalon !"
msgstr "Я б сказала «жеребець»!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ef7e7334"
msgid "J'aime beaucoup cette petite {{asami.n}}."
msgstr "Мені дуже подобається ця маленька {{asami.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_158a3558"
msgid "Elle est vraiment gentille et elle a un bon esprit."
msgstr "Вона дуже мила і має добру вдачу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d18476d6"
msgid "Elle pourra probablement avoir une bonne influence sur {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Вона, мабуть, добре вплине на {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba499c99"
msgid "Elle est vraiment mignonne..."
msgstr "Вона справді мила..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3e85771d"
msgid "Oui..."
msgstr "Так..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7d74c337"
msgid "Tu aurais pu en faire ta petite amie."
msgstr "Ти міг би зробити її своєю дівчиною."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d26e1210"
msgid "Ça ne m'aurait pas du tout dérangée."
msgstr "Це б мене зовсім не бентежило."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_41794caf"
msgid "Tu n'es pas jalouse ?"
msgstr "Ти не ревнуєш?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_96e3b444"
msgid "Jalouse ? Au contraire, je suis pour tout ce qui pourrait te faire plaisir..."
msgstr "Ревную? Навпаки, я за все, що може зробити тебе щасливим..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e4e60c9a"
msgid "Tu peux l'inviter à nous rejoindre le soir si tu le souhaites !"
msgstr "Ти навіть можеш запросити її приєднатися до нас вночі, якщо хочеш!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ee09ee3e"
msgid "Oh ! Je... je ne suis pas sûr qu'elle..."
msgstr "О-о! Я... Я не впевнений, що вона..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9c99f1e3"
msgid "Haha[w] C'est dommage !"
msgstr "Ха-ха![w] Це дуже погано!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1010d2cd"
msgid "Je ne pense pas que notre amitié survivra si je lui fais une telle proposition."
msgstr "Я не думаю, що наша дружба продовжилась, якби я зробив їй таку пропозицію."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c05285f4"
msgid "Tu veux que je lui demande pour toi ?"
msgstr "Хочеш, я запитаю її від твого імені?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7d011741"
msgid "Non c'est bon merci pour la proposition !"
msgstr "Ні, все нормально. Все одно, дякую!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_47b04976"
msgid "Wow, depuis qu'elle a pris cette drogue, sa personnalité a radicalement changé."
msgstr "Ого, після прийому цього препарату її особистість кардинально змінилася."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f103faa6"
msgid "Comme si tout ce qu'elle avait gardé au fond d'elle ne demandait plus qu'à sortir au grand jour."
msgstr "Ніби все, що вона ховала глибоко всередині себе, тільки й чекало, щоб вийти назовні."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_49161e60"
msgid "J'espère sincèrement que ça ne va pas lui attirer des problèmes."
msgstr "Я дуже сподіваюся, що це не принесе їй неприємностей."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_58fe9ede"
msgid "Même si elle semble heureuse pour le moment, je dois continuer à veiller sur elle jusqu'à ce que j'en apprenne plus sur ce truc."
msgstr "Хоча зараз вона виглядає щасливою, я маю продовжувати доглядати за нею, поки не дізнаюся більше про цю штуку."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7590e8c3"
msgid "Tu as encore l'esprit ailleurs mon chéri."
msgstr "Здається, твої думки все ще десь в іншому місці, сонечко."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`-happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4c4b9fe5"
msgid "Ne te tracasse pas trop."
msgstr "Не хвилюйся."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_550e2358"
msgid "Je suis désolé."
msgstr "Пробач."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6aad8957"
msgid "Tu essaies toujours de porter le monde sur tes épaules ?"
msgstr "Ти все ще намагаєшся нести світ на своїх плечах?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5c992d02"
msgid "C'est une mauvaise habitude... je sais."
msgstr "Це погана звичка... Я знаю."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_47368745"
msgid "Alors dans ce cas, dis-le-moi quand tu as des ennuis, je porterai ce fardeau avec toi !"
msgstr "У такому випадку, скажи мені, коли у тебе проблеми, і я понесу цей тягар разом з тобою!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_672751b4"
msgid "Allez... Je suis épuisée, je vais aller me reposer."
msgstr "Що ж... Я виснажена. Піду трохи відпочину."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ef3c0d6f_1"
msgid "À plus tard, mon chéri !"
msgstr "Побачимося пізніше, сонечко!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bab1523b"
msgid "Je suis toujours impressionné devant sa lucidité."
msgstr "Мене завжди вражає її ясність."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a31558b8"
msgid "C'est vraiment une femme incroyable."
msgstr "Вона справді дивовижна жінка."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b4ca9368"
msgid "Je n'ai pas le droit de la laisser tomber !"
msgstr "Я не можу її підвести!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_69c846d8"
msgid "Mon petit poney ?"
msgstr "Мій маленький поні?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_770035dd"
msgid "Euh, je..."
msgstr "Е-е, я..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_203be105"
msgid "Ne t'inquiète pas, je sais quel genre de relation tu entretiens avec elle, je ne suis pas idiote."
msgstr "Не хвилюйся. Я знаю, які у вас з нею стосунки. Я не дурна."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8be5a3f2"
msgid "Mais alors t-"
msgstr "Але тоді ти..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2e63303e"
msgid "Si je suis jalouse ?"
msgstr "Чи я ревную?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cd37ebab"
msgid "Elle a l'air vraiment adorable..."
msgstr "Вона виглядає справді чарівно..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2730952b"
msgid "Oui elle l'est."
msgstr "Так, вона така."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_43cb0fe1"
msgid "Je suis étonnée... Je suis certaine qu'elle aurait pu faire une parfaite petite amie."
msgstr "Я здивована... Я впевнена, що вона була б ідеальною дівчиною."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f59ac20f"
msgid "Peut-être mais c'est toi que j-"
msgstr "Можливо, але ти та, кого я..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ee9249fe"
msgid "Mon chéri... Je t'aime de tout mon cœur, mais je suis réaliste."
msgstr "Любий... Я кохаю тебе всім серцем, але я реаліст."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9fc9932f"
msgid "Avec notre différence d'âge, il arrivera un moment où tu trouveras quelqu'un de ton âge qui te correspond mieux."
msgstr "Зважаючи на нашу різницю у віці, настане час, коли ти знайдеш когось свого віку, хто краще тобі підійде."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9398961d"
msgid "Moi, tout ce que je veux, c'est ton bonheur."
msgstr "Я хочу лише твого щастя."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0a9025ee"
msgid "Mais j-"
msgstr "Але я..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f8ee18c7"
msgid "Tant que tu es là pour moi quand j'en ai besoin, je serai comblée de bonheur."
msgstr "Допоки ти будеш поруч, коли я потребую тебе, я буду благословенна."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d7aaa2e1"
msgid "Allez, ne fais pas cette tête !"
msgstr "Ей, не роби таке обличчя!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_46865dc0"
msgid "J'ai beau être le plus âgé mentalement..."
msgstr "Я, мабуть, найстарший тут ментально..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ba750010"
msgid "Je ne suis pas aussi responsable qu'elle."
msgstr "І все ж я не такий відповідальний, як вона."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_87a24281"
msgid "Il serait peut-être temps que j'arrête de penser avec ma bite et plus avec mon cerveau."
msgstr "Мабуть, настав час перестати думати членом і почати думати головою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2f51c3f9"
msgid "Trouvé !"
msgstr "Я знайшла їх!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ef3c0d6f"
msgid "À plus tard, mon chéri !"
msgstr "Побачимося пізніше, любий!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2bf89673"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}}... je te promets que je ne t'abandonnerai jamais."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}... Обіцяю, я ніколи тебе не покину."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8aebc432"
msgid "Je ferai tout pour te rendre heureuse !"
msgstr "Я зроблю все, щоб ти була щаслива!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_SAVAIS_QUE_TA_RELATION_A_1FEC8F"
msgid "Je ne savais que ta relation avec elle avait avancée aussi vite !"
msgstr "Я й не знала, що ваші стосунки розвиваються так швидко!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EUH_C_EST_QUE_JE_751B6F"
msgid "Euh.. C'est que je-"
msgstr "Емм... Це тому, що я..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FAITES_ATTENTION_TOUT_DE_M_ME_B8A1C9"
msgid "Faites attention tout de même, je ne suis pas prête à devenir grand-mère tout de suite !"
msgstr "Але будьте обережні – я ще зовсім не готова стати бабусею!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_PROMIS_4C2904"
msgid "C'est promis."
msgstr "Обіцяю."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_EST_TOUJOURS_AUSSI_MIGNIO_CA09EC"
msgid "Elle est toujours aussi mignionne..."
msgstr "Вона досі така мила..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PEU_TRE_QUE_A_ARRIVERA_UN_JOUR_D19331"
msgid "Peu-être que ça arrivera un jour j'en sais rien... Pour le moment être amis est déjà très bien."
msgstr "Можливо, одного дня це станеться, але я не знаю... Зараз просто бути друзями – це вже дуже хорошо."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_JE_VAIS_TE_LAISSER_JE_DOIS_C4936C"
msgid "Bon je vais te laisser, je dois me préparée pour mon nouveau travail."
msgstr "Гаразд, я піду, мені треба підготуватися до нової роботи."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ENFILER_UN_KIMONO_PREND_BIEN_P_04AA33"
msgid "Enfiler un kimono prend bien plus de temps que je ne l'aurais pensée."
msgstr "Надягати кімоно займає набагато більше часу, ніж я очікувала."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_DEMANDER_UN_COUP_DE_MA_4C3365"
msgid "Je vais demander un coup de mains aux filles."
msgstr "Я збираюся попросити дівчат допомогти мені."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PASSE_UNE_BONNE_JOURN_E_MON_CH_764587"
msgid "Passe une bonne journée mon chéri !"
msgstr "Бажаю тобі гарного дня, коханий мій!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_95b16832"
msgid "Surprise !"
msgstr "Сюрприз!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3569113b"
msgid "Il me semblait bien que tu étais préoccupé ces derniers temps, alors..."
msgstr "Останнім часом ти здавався заклопотаним, тож..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eaa6abb3"
msgid "J'ai tenu à te faire une petite surprise."
msgstr "Я хотіла зробити тобі невеличкий сюрприз."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eae15e50"
msgid "Ça te plaît ?"
msgstr "Тобі подобається?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_597e013d"
msgid "C'est... Tu es magnifique..."
msgstr "Це... Ти прекрасна..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7b53c5c8"
msgid "Mais..."
msgstr "Проте..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_24ab8441"
msgid "Je ne pensais pas devoir te l'annoncer aussi tôt, mais..."
msgstr "Я не думав, що мені доведеться сказати тобі так скоро, але..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85110386"
msgid "Mais... ?"
msgstr "Але?.."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6a991b4b"
msgid "Je dois mettre un terme à cette relation..."
msgstr "Я мушу розірвати ці стосунки..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5f99f838"
msgid "Je suis désolé, je pensais en être capable, mais je ne suis pas aussi fort que je l'aurais souhaité."
msgstr "Пробач, я думав, що зможу, але я не такий сильний, як хотілося б."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cf952348"
msgid "Oh... Je vois, mon chéri, ne t'inquiète pas."
msgstr "О... Я розумію, любий. Не хвилюйся."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e2eb3f63"
msgid "C'est ma faute, c'est moi qui aurais dû agir comme une adulte ici."
msgstr "Це моя провина. Я повинна була поводитися як доросла."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61907fe0"
msgid "Je comprends parfaitement... Je... je vais te laisser."
msgstr "Я все розумію... Я... Я збираюся піти."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d45ae591"
msgid "Bonne nuit, mon chéri."
msgstr "Добраніч, любий."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6bbe0ae3"
msgid "Oh bordel, j'ai envie de hurler tellement ça me fait mal de la voir comme ça."
msgstr "О-о, чорт. Мені так хочеться кричати. Мені так боляче бачити її такою."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4f1181e0"
msgid "Voilà une bonne chose de faite."
msgstr "Одна добра справа зроблена."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_64adb8b1"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que tu fais là ?"
msgstr "Що ти тут робиш?"

#. Character:`sakuya` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1f9f6ac5"
msgid "Je devais m'assurer que tout se passait comme prévu et que tu ne me mentais pas."
msgstr "Я повинна була переконатися, що все йде за планом, і що ти не брешеш мені."

#. Character:`sakuya` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ccfe0fb"
msgid "Je suis satisfaite !"
msgstr "Я задоволена!"

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d0504aa4"
msgid "Au tour d'{{asami.n}} à présent !"
msgstr "Тепер черга {{asami.n}}!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aedad5f6"
msgid "C'est juste une amie, rien de plus."
msgstr "Вона просто друг, не більше того."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4f67aabf"
msgid "Tellement naif..."
msgstr "Ти такий наївний..."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_20cc344f"
msgid "Cette fille est bien trop proche de toi et je suis certaine qu'elle ressent plus que de l'amitié."
msgstr "Ця дівчина занадто близька до тебе, і я впевнена, що вона відчуває щось більше, ніж просто дружбу."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_36f2145d"
msgid "Pas de faux espoirs ! Je serai la seule femme de ta vie !"
msgstr "Навіть не сподівайся! Я буду єдиною жінкою в твоєму житті!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_03775ec8_3"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_02b4f390"
msgid "Tu te sentiras beaucoup mieux après, tu verras !"
msgstr "Після цього ти почуватимешся набагато краще. Ось побачиш!"

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0853c462"
msgid "Et puis, je m'occuperai bien de toi."
msgstr "А потім я подбаю про тебе."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c61eedf4"
msgid "Allez, en route !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо! Уперед!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b2c1f3c7"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}}... Si tu savais à quel point je m'en veux de t'avoir fait de la peine."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}... якби ти тільки знала, як сильно я звинувачую себе за те, що завдав тобі болю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d2afc0f"
msgid "J'aurais voulu tout te dire m-"
msgstr "Шкода, що я не можу розповісти тобі все..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2b06ca2b"
msgid "Shhhht !"
msgstr "Цить!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5969fd3e"
msgid "Ne dis plus rien !"
msgstr "Ні слова більше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e5bf6c40"
msgid "Je suis déjà très heureuse que nous ayons pu tomber d'accord avec {{asami.n}}."
msgstr "Я дуже рада, що ми змогли домовитися з {{asami.n}}."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_16524246"
msgid "Cette situation est complètement folle !"
msgstr "Досі не можу повірити, що все це сталося!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e1159e59"
msgid "J'en suis consciente, mais pour le moment... aucune de nous ne veut renoncer à toi."
msgstr "Знаю... поки що ніхто з нас не хоче від тебе відмовлятися."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_211d6fe0"
msgid "Ça ne pourra pas durer éternellement."
msgstr "Це не може тривати вічно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ba21f51"
msgid "Il faudra bien choisir à un moment ou un autre, quitte à briser notre cœur."
msgstr "Рано чи пізно тобі доведеться зробити вибір, який може розбити наші серця."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd31d58f"
msgid "Mais en attendant...[w] le mien déborde d'amour pour toi..."
msgstr "Тим часом...[w] моє серце переповнене любов'ю до тебе..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_560746eb"
msgid "Cette nuit n'appartient qu'à nous !"
msgstr "Сьогоднішня ніч належить тільки нам двом!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d792084f"
msgid "Tu veux bien faire ça pour moi ?"
msgstr "Не міг би ти це зробити для мене?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_abf90db8"
msgid "Tu n'avais même pas besoin de demander !"
msgstr "Тобі навіть не треба було просити!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8bc7bceb"
msgid "Quelle nuit mon chéri !"
msgstr "Яка нічка, любий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fd1a6d72"
msgid "Je crois que je peux dire sans me vanter que je suis une femme comblée."
msgstr "Можу сказати, не вихваляючись, що ніколи в житті не відчувала себе такою задоволеною."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8a6dfa14"
msgid "Je vais partir en douce avant que {{noriko.n}} ne se réveille, à plus tard !"
msgstr "Я прослизну до того, як {{noriko.n}} прокинеться. Побачимося пізніше!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_97e0144c"
msgid "Je savais que j'avais manqué à {{yasuka.n}}, mais je ne pensais pas à ce point-là."
msgstr "Я знав, що {{yasuka.n}} сумує за мною, але не думав, що все настільки погано."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7b1f7698"
msgid "Je crois que les choses commencent enfin à s'améliorer pour de bon !"
msgstr "Здається, справи починають налагоджуватися назавжди!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_baafc5c8"
msgid "Qu'est-ce qu-"
msgstr "Що за..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_e8a38e28"
msgid "Tu aimes ? C'est un cadeau de {{sayuri.n}}."
msgstr "Подобається? Це подарунок від {{sayuri.n}}."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b4e69ca9_3"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_81326261"
msgid "On va devoir parler toi et moi !"
msgstr "Нам треба поговорити!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ae5efa48"
msgid "Ne me prends pas pour une idiote !"
msgstr "Не тримай мене за дурну!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bb52aa7f"
msgid "Je ne sais pas comment tu as fait, mais..."
msgstr "Не знаю, як тобі це вдалося, але..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1f5a3873"
msgid "Je sais ce que vous faites ma mère et toi !"
msgstr "Я знаю, що ти робиш з мамою!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_30ac16f2_1"
msgid "Oh !"
msgstr "О-о!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9fce853a"
msgid "Je n'accepterai jamais que ma mère soit avec quelqu'un comme toi qui ne peut pas se débrouiller seul !"
msgstr "Я ніколи не дозволю своїй матері бути з тим, хто не може про себе подбати!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aaa33c37"
msgid "{{asami.n}} accepte peut-être cette situation, mais pas moi !"
msgstr "{{asami.n}}, може, це і нормально, але не для мене!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6dc7ca22"
msgid "Même si tu ne l'acceptes pas, ce n'est pas à toi d'en décider."
msgstr "Можеш не схвалювати це, але ти не маєш права голосу в цьому питанні."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_feec17ee"
msgid "...[w] C'est ce que nous verrons !"
msgstr "...[w] Побачимо!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61f9b272"
msgid "[font_size=14]Idiot ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Придурку![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4fefe14d"
msgid "Boh... Ça ne pourra pas être pire qu'avec {{sakuya.n}}."
msgstr "Що ж... не може бути гірше, ніж мати справу з {{sakuya.n}}."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_acbff3fa"
msgid "Je crois..."
msgstr "Я думаю..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_20dbed08"
msgid "Maintenant, j'ai un doute."
msgstr "Зараз я вже не впевнений."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_73807b0e"
msgid "Bon... Les ennuis avec les filles, c'est terminé."
msgstr "Що ж... Мої проблеми з дівчатами закінчилися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_52d2b391"
msgid "{{sakuya.n}} s'est calmée et ne devrait plus poser de problèmes."
msgstr "{{sakuya.n}} заспокоїлася і більше не має бути проблемою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4e8de882"
msgid "{{asami.n}} m'a pardonné."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} пробачила мене."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f66c44f2"
msgid "Et {{yasuka.n}}... est toujours aussi parfaite."
msgstr "А {{yasuka.n}}... все ще така ж бездоганна, як і раніше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_30dff5fb"
msgid "Il est temps de se prendre en main et d'aller au dojo !"
msgstr "Настав час узяти себе в руки та піти до доджьо!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_9ceb7aa8"
msgid "Je ne pourrai pas compter éternellement sur les autres pour m'aider à chaque fois."
msgstr "Я не можу завжди покладатися на те, що інші допоможуть мені щоразу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a22d2ca0"
msgid "{{akira.n}} ne devrait plus poser de problèmes non plus..."
msgstr "{{akira.n}} також більше не має бути проблемою..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "UNE_SECONDE_ON_EST_D_J_LE_MATI_A00FF1"
msgid "Une seconde, on est déjà le matin ?!"
msgstr "Хвилинку... Вже ранок?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MINCE_JE_NE_ME_SOUVIENS_PLUS_D_B978DA"
msgid "Mince, je ne me souviens plus du tout de ce qu'il s'est passé."
msgstr "Блін, я зовсім не пам’ятаю, що тоді сталося."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YASUKA_N_N_EST_PAS_VENUE_AU_F_E693F8"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} n'est pas venue au final ?"
msgstr "Чи не прийшла в кінцевому підсумку {{yasuka.n}}?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VENUE_O_A_0B0946"
msgid "Venue où ça ?"
msgstr "Де саме?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "WOAH_TU_M_AS_FAIT_PEUR_72C882"
msgid "Woah ! Tu m'as fait peur !"
msgstr "Вау! Ти мене налякала!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_M_ATTENDAIS_PAS_DU_TOUT_718622"
msgid "Je ne m'attendais pas du tout à te voir débarquer à l'improviste comme ça."
msgstr "Я зовсім не очікував, що ти раптово з’явишся тут таким чином."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_PAS_LA_PREMI_RE_FOIS_QUE_526108"
msgid "C'est pas la première fois que je fais ça et il me semble que ça ne t'a jamais gêné auparavant."
msgstr "Це не вперше, коли я так роблю, і, здається, раніше це тебе ніколи не турбувало."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_W_OUI_TU_AS_RAISON_JE_SUIS_6F4246"
msgid "... Je[w], oui tu as raison, je suis un peu sur les nerfs."
msgstr "... Я... Так, ти маєш рацію, я трохи нервую."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_TE_DIT_QU_ON_PASSE_LA_JOURN_39BEB3"
msgid "Ça te dit qu'on passe la journée rien que toi et moi ?"
msgstr "Що скажеш, якщо ми проведемо цілий день лише вдвох?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PAR_EXEMPLE_ON_POURRAIT_RESTER_ABE259"
msgid "Par exemple... On pourrait rester tout nus sous la couette..."
msgstr "Наприклад... Ми могли б залишитися абсолютно голими під ковдрою..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_FAIRE_DES_CHOSES_CF2373"
msgid "Et faire des choses..."
msgstr "І робити різні речі..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_TE_DIT_QU_ON_PASSE_LA_JOURN_B975DA"
msgid "Ça te dit qu'on passe la journée rien que tous les deux ?"
msgstr "Що скажеш, якщо ми проведемо весь день лише вдвох?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_MOI_QUI_INVITE_8764AC"
msgid "C'est moi qui invite !"
msgstr "Це я запрошую!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "RIEN_NE_ME_FERAIT_PLUS_PLAISIR_8C71DA"
msgid "Rien ne me ferait plus plaisir que ça, mais..."
msgstr "Ніщо б не принесло мені більшої радості, але..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_934554"
msgid "Mais ?!"
msgstr "Але?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_INQUIET_QUELQUE_CHOSE_E02F5D"
msgid "Je suis inquiet, quelque chose ne tourne pas rond."
msgstr "Я хвилююся, щось йде не так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DOIS_M_ASSURER_DE_QUELQUE_C_BD692D"
msgid "Je dois m'assurer de quelque chose avant ça."
msgstr "Перш ніж це зробити, мені потрібно переконатися в одній речі."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SAITO_N_ATTENDS_BFC66E"
msgid "{{saito.n}} attends !"
msgstr "{{saito.n}}, зачекай!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d8eb6dfd"
msgid "Hmmm... Je peux savoir ce que j'ai fais de travers ?"
msgstr "Гм... Можу я дізнатися, що я зробив не так?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_53bea5af"
msgid "J'arrive pas à croire que tu puisses être aussi prévenant avec moi, {{yasuka.n}} ou encore {{sakuya.n}}..."
msgstr "Не можу повірити, що ти можеш бути таким уважним до мене, {{yasuka.n}}, чи навіть {{sakuya.n}}..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed03ec27"
msgid "... et mettre {{noriko.n}} de côté à chaque fois..."
msgstr "...і при цьому весь час відкидати {{noriko.n}} в сторону..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b4a86287"
msgid "Cette situation la blesse plus que tu ne crois."
msgstr "Ця ситуація завдає їй більше болю, ніж ти думаєш."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3b4e54a3"
msgid "Elle ? Blessée ? Que devrais-je dire après toutes ces années à avoir subi toutes les pires crasses et humiliations au quotidien."
msgstr "Їй? Боляче? Що я маю сказати після стількох років щоденного терпіння найгіршого лайна та незліченних принижень?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_988b98b7"
msgid "... Tu as effectivement le droit d'être fâché mon cœur."
msgstr "...Ти маєш право гніватися, любий."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_20149f7a"
msgid "Mais je sais que tu es un homme bon."
msgstr "Але я знаю, що ти хороша людина."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4116b948"
msgid "Tu veux reprendre ta vie en main mais ça passe aussi par certaines relations que tu as peut-être un trop négligées ces dernières années."
msgstr "Я знаю, що ти хочеш повернути контроль над своїм життям, але це також має у собі деякі відносини, якими ти, можливо, занадто нехтував останніми роками."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_520c88a3"
msgid "Peut-être..."
msgstr "Може..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_309d4f2b"
msgid "Mais... avec {{noriko.n}}... les choses ont pris de telles proportions que je me vois mal aller lui dire \"Aller on oublie tout et on passe à autre chose !\""
msgstr "Але... З {{noriko.n}}... Усе дійшло до того, що я не бачу, як піду до неї та скажу: «Давай забудемо про все і підемо далі»!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c1881e42"
msgid "Je n'ai jamais dit que ce serait facile."
msgstr "Я ніколи не казала, що буде легко."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8caf1c1e"
msgid "Refléchis bien... À quel moment les choses ont-elles commencé à changer entre vous deux ?"
msgstr "Подумай про це... В який момент між вами все почало змінюватися?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d785556d"
msgid "À quel moment avez-vous commencé à vous éloigner l'un de l'autre ?"
msgstr "В який момент ви почали віддалятися один від одного?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_92539adf"
msgid "À quel moment ? Tiens c'est vrai ça... À quel moment ?"
msgstr "В який момент? Так, це правда... В який момент?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_36956dde"
msgid "Les rares souvenirs que j'ai encore d'elle remontent à ma vie d'avant, un peu avant le drame..."
msgstr "Ті кілька спогадів, які я ще маю про неї, відносяться до мого старого життя, якраз перед трагедією..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cc697f99"
msgid "Elle avait quitté la maison après que {{yasuka.n}} ait pris ma défense."
msgstr "Вона пішла з дому після того, як {{yasuka.n}} заступилася за мене."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ccdebd01"
msgid "Après avoir passé des semaines à traîner avec les thugs et autres fréquentations bien pires..."
msgstr "Після тижнів, проведених з головорізами та іншими, набагато гіршими знайомими."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_efd35198"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} avait été retrouvé morte gisant dans le canal, mais les choses ne semblent pas prendre cette tournure cette fois-ci."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} знайшли мертвою у каналі, але цього разу, схоже, все йде не так."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_63c16f36"
msgid "Avant ça... À quel moment j'ai connu {{noriko.n}} d'ailleurs ?"
msgstr "А до цього... Коли я познайомився з {{noriko.n}}?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3f8d541f"
msgid "Je crois que c'est quand mon père m'a laissé chez {{yasuka.n}} pour ne plus jamais revenir."
msgstr "Гадаю, коли мій батько залишив мене з {{yasuka.n}} і більше не повернувся."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_93f8a8f7"
msgid "Je devais avoir quoi... 7 ou 8 ans."
msgstr "Мені було... сім чи вісім років."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fffb2ccc"
msgid "Tout ça est encore flou."
msgstr "Весь цей час я пам’ятаю як в тумані."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_df50e201"
msgid "Alors ?"
msgstr "Ну?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3e47783e"
msgid "Je ne sais pas, ça remonte à l'enfance."
msgstr "Я не знаю. Це повертає мене в дитинство."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3891b73f"
msgid "Si je veux éclaircir certaines zones d'ombre, je dois en discuter avec elle."
msgstr "Якщо я хочу прояснити деякі сірі зони, мені потрібно поговорити з нею про це."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_72809251"
msgid "Très bien, je t'attends ici."
msgstr "Гаразд. Я почекаю на тебе тут."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2c32dd10"
msgid "Quoi, tu veux que j'y aille maintenant ?"
msgstr "Що, ти хочеш, щоб я пішов туди зараз?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_47e06c5a"
msgid "Pourquoi attendre ? Si tu as l'opportunité d'arranger les choses, fais-le dès que tu en as l'occasion."
msgstr "А навіщо чекати? Якщо є можливість щось виправити, треба робити це якнайшвидше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3669166f"
msgid "... Okay mais je suis à peu près sûr qu'elle ne sera pas receptive."
msgstr "...Гаразд, але я впевнений, що вона не сприйме це."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d6a4e50a"
msgid "Tu dois continuer d'essayer."
msgstr "Усе одно треба спробувати."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_482eab7c"
msgid "Ne baisse pas les bras, montre-lui que le nouveau {{saito.n}} n'abandonne pas !"
msgstr "Не здавайся! Покажи їй, що новий {{saito.n}} не здається!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8376a6f1"
msgid "Tu me le promets ?"
msgstr "Обіцяєш мені?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d1a0e8c3"
msgid "Je te le promets, je n'ai pas envie de te décevoir !"
msgstr "Обіцяю. Я не хочу тебе розчаровувати!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0ff73eec"
msgid "Alors ! Depêche-toi !"
msgstr "Поквапся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1e36043d"
msgid "À vos ordres !"
msgstr "Як скажеш!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_8cf365c8"
msgid "Alors ? Vu ta tête, j'ai pas l'impression que ça se soit bien passé."
msgstr "Ну і? Судячи з виразу твого обличчя, все пройшло не дуже добре."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_37707ae2"
msgid "Je me trompe ?"
msgstr "Хіба не так?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_4bb6eacb"
msgid "Non... Elle m'en veut et apparemment je suis censé me souvenir du pourquoi..."
msgstr "Ні... Вона злиться на мене, і, мабуть, я повинен згадати, за що..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_dfefbdbb"
msgid "Mais honnêtement, je n'en ai aucune idée."
msgstr "Але, чесно кажучи, я поняття не маю."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_a4c323c5"
msgid "Une promesse d'enfance peut-être ?"
msgstr "Може, дитяча обіцянка?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_5851f82e"
msgid "Non je...[w] une minute maintenant que tu me le dis..."
msgstr "Ні, я...[w] Стривай, раз ти про це згадала..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_d7a24f39"
msgid "J'ai dû faire quelque chose qui y ressemble il y a longtemps."
msgstr "Мабуть, колись давно я робив щось подібне."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_4a58df84"
msgid "Mais tu ne t'en souviens plus je suppose ?"
msgstr "Але ти цього не пам’ятаєш, я так розумію?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_694d9bee"
msgid "Oui..."
msgstr "Так..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_cb68d3e2"
msgid "Tu es irrécupérable, c'est pour ça qu'elle t'en veut !"
msgstr "Ти безнадійний! Звісно, тому вона на тебе і злиться!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_a18b35aa"
msgid "Tu lui as promis quelque chose plus jeune et tu n'as pas tenu ta parole."
msgstr "Ти їй щось пообіцяв, коли був малим, і не дотримав слова."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_1d84c8ab"
msgid "Mais... c'était probablement quelque chose d'insignifiant... un truc de gamins, on devait avoir 8 ans."
msgstr "Але... Мабуть, це було щось незначне... Якась дитяча дурниця. Нам було по вісім років, не більше."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_f21587c9"
msgid "Quel genre de promesse peut engendrer autant de vagues après toutes ces années ?"
msgstr "Яка ж обіцянка могла викликати такі хвилі через стільки років?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_8b763422"
msgid "C'est ce qu'on va devoir découvrir si on veut que tu puisses faire enfin la paix avec elle."
msgstr "Це ми маємо з’ясувати, якщо ти хочеш нарешті з нею помиритися."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_d534326c"
msgid "Je vais te laisser y réfléchir tranquillement..."
msgstr "Я дам тобі спокійно про це подумати..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_d5164798"
msgid "Je suis certaine que si je traîne dans les parages tu auras autre chose en tête."
msgstr "Я впевнена, що якщо я залишусь поряд, то ти матимеш на думці зовсім інше."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_3f75ebba"
msgid "N'est-ce pas mon petit poney ?"
msgstr "Чи не так, мій маленький поні?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_4d5b70d7"
msgid "Au moins tu es honnête !"
msgstr "Принаймні ти чесний!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t6d44461e5a"
msgid "C'est pas faux."
msgstr "Ти маєш рацію."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_5f82d70c"
msgid "Mais quel menteur !"
msgstr "Що за брехун!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t5152b3933e"
msgid "Pas du tout, je suis un garçon sérieux !"
msgstr "Зовсім ні, я серйозний хлопець!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_f5709729"
msgid "Plus vite tu résoudras cette histoire avec {{noriko.n}}..."
msgstr "Чим швидше ти вирішиш цю проблему з {{noriko.n}}..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_5b1bb6e5"
msgid "... plus vite on pourra de nouveau passer du temps ensemble !"
msgstr "Тим швидше ми знову зможемо проводити час разом!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_c125f5a8"
msgid "Je compte sur toi !"
msgstr "Я на тебе розраховую!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy,blush`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_1d4ad3b3"
msgid "Et ne tarde pas trop car moi aussi j'ai besoin de ma dose quotidienne de {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "І не зволікай, тому що мені також потрібна щоденна доза {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_c6ce6998"
msgid "Bon... y'a plus qu'à tenter d'élucider ce mystère."
msgstr "Ну... Нічого не залишається, окрім як спробувати розгадати цю таємницю."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "menu_asami_room_waiting_b01a8d00"
msgid "Peut-être que {{yasuka.n}} en saura plus que moi à ce sujet ?"
msgstr "Можливо, {{yasuka.n}} знає про це більше, ніж я?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_137ddb9e"
msgid "Je devrais faire part de ce que j'ai appris à {{asami.n}}, elle aura peut-être une idée ou deux."
msgstr "Я повинен поділитися тим, що дізнався з {{asami.n}}. Може, вона щось підкаже."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0670808a"
msgid "Bon, il est temps de tirer ça au clair !"
msgstr "Гаразд, час все прояснити!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7bfeb0db"
msgid "Outch... J'ai fait le malin mais j'ai mal partout."
msgstr "Ай... Я поводився жорстко, але у мене все болить."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c1be06ea"
msgid "{{kenji.n}} était bien plus compliqué à gérer que {{nobu.n}}."
msgstr "З {{kenji.n}} було набагато складніше, ніж з {{nobu.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b2740550"
msgid "S'ils viennent les uns après les autres ça restera gérable pour le moment..."
msgstr "Якщо вони йтимуть один за одного, то поки що з ними можна буде впоратися..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c904bdbe"
msgid "Dans le cas contraire... on verra plus tard."
msgstr "А якщо ні... Побачимо."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_957ac46e"
msgid "Une seconde... on est déjà le matin ?"
msgstr "Секундочку... Це вже ранок?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4ffd7163"
msgid "J'ai dormi autant ?!"
msgstr "Невже я стільки проспав?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4f2965f9"
msgid "Peu importe... Je suis en pleine forme à présent, il est temps de régler mes comptes avec {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Неважливо... Я у відмінній формі, тож час звести рахунки з {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4ccf1434"
msgid "Et cette fois-ci ça se passera à ma façon !"
msgstr "І цього разу все буде по-моєму!"

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_bd125fec"
msgid "Alors cet ici que dort ce déchet..."
msgstr "Так ось де спить цей шматок лайна..."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`arrogant`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4dee3107"
msgid "Rien que de voir ça j'ai déja un million d'idées sur comment je pourrais faire de sa vie un enfer."
msgstr "Тільки побачивши це, я вже маю мільйон ідей, як перетворити їхнє життя на справжнє пекло."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_136e4665"
msgid "Ne touche à rien ! Je n'ai pas envie d'avoir des problèmes."
msgstr "Нічого не чіпай! Мені не потрібні неприємності."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7cd7a7ef"
msgid "Mais c'est justement ça qui est bien, tu n'auras plus de problèmes dorénavant."
msgstr "Але в цьому вся принадність. Відтепер у тебе більше не буде проблем."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6397bb0c"
msgid "Par contre faut que tu y mettes du tien."
msgstr "Але ти маєш зробити свій внесок."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_13f22f9f"
msgid "Je sais... mais..."
msgstr "Я знаю... Але..."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_996a7e14"
msgid "Allez arrête de parler et commence par me sucer, je commence à en avoir marre d'attendre."
msgstr "Гаразд, годі базікати та починай смоктати. Я втомився чекати."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c7f5865e"
msgid "Il est grand temps que quelqu'un fasse quelque chose dans cette chambre."
msgstr "Пора вже комусь щось зробити в цій кімнаті."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f756ce08"
msgid "Je suis sûr que ce puceau passe son temps à se branler et rien d'autre."
msgstr "Я впевнений, що ця незаймана тільки те й робить, що дрочить, і нічого більше."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_05c569e8"
msgid "...Non ![w] Pas ici, pas dans sa chambre !"
msgstr "...Ні![w] Не тут, не в його кімнаті!"

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_27e1622c"
msgid "Putain mais tu commences à me gonfler {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Чорт, ти починаєш мене дратувати, {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2e7d28b6"
msgid "Décide-toi mais me fais pas perdre mon temps !"
msgstr "Вирішуй, але не витрачай мій час!"

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_34125a16"
msgid "Tu veux mon aide oui ou non ?"
msgstr "Тобі потрібна моя допомога чи ні?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_655c5f4a"
msgid "Je... Oui..."
msgstr "Я... Так..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b07e859a"
msgid "Mais... je ne veux pas faire ça ici."
msgstr "Але... Я не хочу робити це тут."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_831b8c0b"
msgid "... Où dans ce cas ?"
msgstr "...Тоді де?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b8b7bf5c"
msgid "À l'hôtel. Personne ne nous verra ou ne nous dérangera."
msgstr "В готелі. Там нас ніхто не побачить і не потурбує."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`arrogant`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_85da1491"
msgid "Parfait mais si tu te défiles, c'est terminé pour toi."
msgstr "Ідеально. Але якщо ти відмовишся, то для тебе усе буде скінчено."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1ee210c4"
msgid "Bonne chance à toi pour la rentrée à la fac."
msgstr "Успіхів тобі у коледжі."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d655cba"
msgid "Tu vas y laisser des plumes."
msgstr "Ти втратиш там немало своїх нервів."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a93503c0"
msgid "JE SAIS ! TU CROIS QUE JE NE SAIS PAS DÉJÀ TOUT ÇA ?!"
msgstr "Я ВКУРСІ! ТИ ДУМАЄШ, ЩО Я ВСЬОГО ЦЬОГО НЕ ЗНАЮ?!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_28219bc2"
msgid "Ce qui me rend folle c'est pourquoi tu profites de moi comme ça ?!"
msgstr "Це зводить мене з розуму, чому ти так використовуєш мене?!"

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`arrogant`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_51f08a00"
msgid "T'aider ne m'apporte strictement rien, je me fiche complètement de ce qui peut t'arriver."
msgstr "Допомога тобі не приносить мені абсолютно нічого. Мені абсолютно байдуже, що з тобою буде."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_348c4d3a"
msgid "Mais c'est toi qui veux profiter de ma sale réputation pour éloigner tous les emmerdeurs."
msgstr "Це ти хочеш скористатися моєю поганою репутацією, щоб тримати всіх проблемних людей подалі."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7e28193f"
msgid "Et... rien n'est gratuit dans la vie."
msgstr "Але... У житті нічого не буває безкоштовного."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6a6b6234"
msgid "Donc maintenant ça suffit, tu me suces maintenant ou sinon..."
msgstr "Отже, досить. Ти можеш відсмоктати мені зараз, інакше..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aa534eb1"
msgid "[font_size=14]Je suis rentrée ! {{noriko.n}}, {{saito.n}}, vous êtes là ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я повернулася! {{noriko.n}}, {{saito.n}}, ви тут?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a2422fa8"
msgid "Putain, y'a pas moyen d'être tranquille ici."
msgstr "Чорт, ні хвилини спокою."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`arrogant`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b51bc78e"
msgid "Bonjour madame."
msgstr "Доброго ранку, пані."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0cc290bb"
msgid "Mais... que... {{noriko.n}} ? Qu'est-ce que tu fais dans cette chambre ? Toi ! Je te reconnais, tu n'as rien à faire ici, sors d'ici !"
msgstr "Але... Що... {{noriko.n}}? Що ти робиш у цій кімнаті? Ти! я тебе впізнаю! Тобі тут нема чого робити. Забирайся!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_39edaf38"
msgid "Je peux savoir ce que vous faites tous les deux dans la chambre de {{saito.n}} ?"
msgstr "Можна я запитаю, що ви двоє робите в кімнаті {{saito.n}}?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_904a3ae3"
msgid "Et j'aimerais aussi savoir qui est cette personne !"
msgstr "І ще я хотіла би знати, хто цей юнак!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_248b9f5c"
msgid "Maman c'est rien... c'est... juste..."
msgstr "Мамо, нічого страшного... Він... Просто..."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_62919d0b"
msgid "Je suis son petit ami."
msgstr "Я її хлопець."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_d5a5f620"
msgid "J'aurais dû venir me présenter à vous plus tôt mais je n'ai pas eu cette chance."
msgstr "Я повинен був прийти і представитися вам раніше, але не мав нагоди."

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_53a0cb22"
msgid "C'est un plaisir de..."
msgstr "Мені дуже приємно з вами позна..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_5547e02b"
msgid "Sors d'ici tout de suite ! Je sais reconnaitre un menteur quand j'en vois un."
msgstr "Геть звідси негайно! Я знаю, як розпізнати брехуна, коли його бачу."

#. Character:`akira` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6db88bf3"
msgid "... Tchh"
msgstr "...Тц"

#. Character:`akira`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fc9438bf"
msgid "... Tu sais où me trouver {{noriko.n}}, je t'attendrai. Si tu ne viens pas j'en conclurai que notre accord ne tient plus."
msgstr "...Ти знаєш, де мене знайти, {{noriko.n}}. Я чекаю, і якщо ти не прийдеш, я буду вважати, що наша угода більше не діє."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_53d5fbf1"
msgid "{{noriko.n}}, de quoi il parle exactement ? Il n'y a aucun moyen que je te laisse seule avec un garçon pareil."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}, про що саме він говорить? Я ні в якому разі не залишу тебе наодинці з таким хлопцем."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b3978a01"
msgid "Il ne m'inspire pas du tout confiance."
msgstr "Я йому зовсім не довіряю."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_acdcdc52"
msgid "Maman ça suffit laisse-moi ! Je suis adulte, je gère mes affaires comme je le décide."
msgstr "Мамо, досить! Залиш мене! Я вже доросла. Я можу сама займатися своїми справами."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7091dbc3"
msgid "Bon sang {{noriko.n}}... Qu'est-ce que tu es en train de faire ?"
msgstr "Боже, {{noriko.n}}... Що ти робиш?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_14fc7138"
msgid "J'ai beau retourner le probleme dans tous les sens..."
msgstr "Скільки б я не думав про це..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_620a7cd1"
msgid "J'ai toujours la haine.... et en même temps je peux comprendre ce qu'elle a pu ressentir."
msgstr "Я все ще відчуваю ненависть... і в той же час я можу зрозуміти, що вона відчувала."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c5cd4042"
msgid "J'ai voulu me comporter comme un grand frère mais je n'ai jamais réussi à protéger qui que ce soit en particulier moi-même."
msgstr "Я хотів поводитися як старший брат, але я так і не зміг нікого захистити, навіть себе."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1ca967c7"
msgid "Je peux comprendre à quel point j'étais pathétique à ses yeux..."
msgstr "Я розумію, яким я був жалюгідним в її очах..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_426b7010"
msgid "J'ai eu une seconde chance après tout... Si je me comporte comme avant en ayant toujours peur je referai inévitablement les mêmes erreurs."
msgstr "Але у мене є другий шанс... Якщо я поводитимуся так само і продовжуватиму боятися, я неминуче зроблю ті самі помилки знову."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6dadac61"
msgid "Je dois faire les choses differement."
msgstr "Я повинен робити все по-іншому."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_02c2d0f8"
msgid "En particulier avec {{noriko.n}} !"
msgstr "Особливо з {{noriko.n}}!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_eee95c94"
msgid "[font_size=14]hmmmmm tu ne dors pas mon chéri ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ммммм, ти ще не спиш?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1e208893"
msgid "Tout va bien... Je réléchissais seulement un peu."
msgstr "Я в порядку... Я просто задумався."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a21e86ee_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_45e8b8cd"
msgid "...Elle s'est endormie."
msgstr "...Вона заснула."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b86f5905"
msgid "C'est décidé, demain j'arrête d'être un lâche !"
msgstr "Вирішено. Завтра я перестану бути боягузом!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_540a2c18"
msgid "Allez ma décision est prise... Allons voir {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Я прийняв рішення... Ходімо побачимось з {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2da32710"
msgid "En attendant d'aller voir {{noriko.n}}, je ferais mieux d'aller rendre à {{sayuri.n}} ce que {{nobu.n}} lui a volé."
msgstr "Перш ніж побачити {{noriko.n}}, я краще віддам {{sayuri.n}} те, що {{nobu.n}} вкрав у неї."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ede76d37"
msgid "Je suis sur qu'elle va faire une drôle de tête."
msgstr "Я впевнений, що вона зробить смішне обличчя."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aac094ef"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mon chéri, {{asami.n}} est là ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Любий, {{asami.n}} тут![/font_size]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b7862e21"
msgid "[font_size=14]Ah non je voulais lui faire la surprise...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]О ні, я хотіла його здивувати...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c790a87d"
msgid "[font_size=14]Oh désolé j'étais trop enthousiaste.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Вибач, мабуть, я занадто схвильована...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1beb8f86"
msgid "Oh oh..."
msgstr "Ох, ох..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8f8d3454"
msgid "Alors ?! J'étais impatiente de savoir."
msgstr "Ну?! Мені не терпиться дізнатися."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cd3b32d2"
msgid "Savoir quoi ?"
msgstr "Знаєш що?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cb161289"
msgid "Le gâteau bien sûr !"
msgstr "Торт, звичайно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_725984a3"
msgid "C'était bon ?"
msgstr "Це було добре?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_79c691df"
msgid "Ce... ce n'était pas vraiment un gâteau."
msgstr "Це... Насправді це був не торт."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d0f7220"
msgid "Juste un... calin."
msgstr "Просто... обійми."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a0176678"
msgid "Oh ! C'est mignon !"
msgstr "Ох! Це мило!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_310550f0"
msgid "Si tu le dis..."
msgstr "Якщо ти так кажеш..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b9413d34"
msgid "Et maintenant quel est le programme ?"
msgstr "Отже, який план?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_69f16c0f"
msgid "Tu comptes continuer ta vendetta ?"
msgstr "Ти збираєшся продовжувати свою вендету?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_4576d158"
msgid "Je dois finir ce que j'ai commencé... Si j'arrête maintenant..."
msgstr "Мені потрібно закінчити те, що я почав... Якщо я зупинюся зараз..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c2c57c9e"
msgid "Il restera un lâche !"
msgstr "То він так і залишиться боягузом!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b28db227"
msgid "Tu as toujours des mots très durs envers lui !"
msgstr "Ти завжди така жорстка з ним!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_7dc71a9c"
msgid "Vous avez besoin d'aide ?"
msgstr "Тобі потрібна допомога?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b7fe3d3d"
msgid "Bien sur t-"
msgstr "Звичай..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_a3a7d548"
msgid "Non merci, on s'en sortira tout seul !"
msgstr "Ні, дякую, ми впораємось самі!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_f7952ce0"
msgid "{{saito.n}}...[w] Fais attention à toi, j'ai un mauvais pressentiment."
msgstr "{{saito.n}}...[w] Будь обережним. У мене погане передчуття."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b6759527"
msgid "Je te promets de faire attention."
msgstr "Я обіцяю, що буду обережним."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_93681a71"
msgid "Allez je vous laisse, tu as intérêt à me donner des nouvelles et cette fois-ci je ne veux pas l'apprendre de ma mère !"
msgstr "Я піду, але ти краще розкажи мені що сталося, а то цього разу я не хочу чути це від мами!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ed6623a0_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c0216531"
msgid "Tu auras le temps de la retrouver après ne t'inquiète pas pour ça."
msgstr "У тебе буде час зустрітися з нею потім. Не хвилюйся"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_aa6ff12d"
msgid "En attendant la tête de bite m'a envoyé un message, il faut croire qu'il sait se rendre utile."
msgstr "Тим часом цей задрот надіслав мені повідомлення. Схоже, він може бути корисним."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6d3d1cbf"
msgid "On a la prochaine adresse ?"
msgstr "Нам відома наступна адреса?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_adf01100"
msgid "Oui celle de {{kenji.n}}."
msgstr "Так, {{kenji.n}}."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ef0ecd35"
msgid "Il vit avec sa mère qui tient un bar dans le quartier craignos."
msgstr "Він живе зі своєю матір’ю, яка тримає бар у нетрях міста."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_06d7020d"
msgid "C'est pas un endroit que j'apprécie beaucoup..."
msgstr "Це не те місце, яке мені дуже подобається..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_37b48a5d"
msgid "Moi non plus mais ce n'est pas comme si on avait le choix."
msgstr "Мені теж, але у нас немає вибору."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3ce6d4f3"
msgid "Allons-y tout de suite."
msgstr "Ходімо прямо зараз."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_677cc9b4"
msgid "Toi !"
msgstr "Ти!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "T_ES_UN_ENFOIR_J_AI_DU_ATTENDR_F90037"
msgid "T'es un enfoiré, j'ai dû attendre qu'elle s'endorme et ramper pour sortir de sa chambre !"
msgstr "Ти мудак – мені довелося чекати, поки вона засне, а потім пробиратися назовні з її кімнати!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_84be91d0"
msgid "Je retiens ce que tu as fait avec ma mère ! Juste sous mes yeux en plus !"
msgstr "Я пам’ятатиму, що ти зробив з моєю мамою! До того ж прямо у мене на очах!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_8678bf11"
msgid "T'as intérêt à être prêt pour demain..."
msgstr "Тобі краще бути готовим до завтрашнього дня..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_033265a0"
msgid "...Oui"
msgstr "...Так."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_61f9b272_1"
msgid "[font_size=14]Idiot ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ідіот![/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_6e964f09"
msgid "Ca en valait la peine..."
msgstr "Воно було того варте..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ac9eddfd"
msgid "Pas de grasse matinée !"
msgstr "Досить спати!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_09dbb69f"
msgid "Il est temps de régler les problèmes une fois pour toutes."
msgstr "Настав час вирішити наші проблеми раз і назавжди."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_1083ad30"
msgid "On a plus beaucoup de temps !"
msgstr "В нас немає багато часу!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_39f37b06"
msgid "Ah ? Pourquoi ça, tu es pressée, tu as quelque chose d'autre de prévu ?"
msgstr "І чому так? Ти поспішаєш? Чи плануєш щось ще?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_ce4a0329"
msgid "...[w] Juste... Dépêchons-nous."
msgstr "...[w] Просто... Давай не гаяти час."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fd64390e"
msgid "Tête de bite m'a contactée pour la maison de {{takeo.n}}."
msgstr "Задрот зв’язався зі мною щодо будинку {{takeo.n}}."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0c854670"
msgid "On doit passer le voir avant !"
msgstr "Нам треба спочатку з ним побачитися!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_49f1a54a"
msgid "Finalement je constate que tu t'entends bien avec lui..."
msgstr "Принаймні я бачу, що ти нарешті порозумілася з ним."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_311e6589"
msgid "Oh la ferme !"
msgstr "Ой, замовкни!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_b860f44a"
msgid "Bon sang c'est enfin terminé..."
msgstr "Чорт, нарешті все закінчилось..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_26acc2d6"
msgid "Il aura fallu mourir une fois puis revenir en arrière pour se rendre compte qu'au final je pouvais très bien me débarrasser d'eux moi-même."
msgstr "Мені довелося померти й повернутися назад, щоб усвідомити, що зрештою я цілком міг позбутися їх сам."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_db0fad75"
msgid "J'ai vraiment vécu dans le déni jusqu'au bout."
msgstr "Я справді заперечував усе до кінця."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_fa157689"
msgid "Bon... Je ne pourrais pas non plus botter le cul de tout le monde quand je reprendrai les cours mais au moins..."
msgstr "Ну... Не те, що я збираюся всім надерти дупи, коли повернуся до школи, але хоча б..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_86d02a9b"
msgid "Je n'aurais plus peur de faire face."
msgstr "Я більше не буду боятися."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_298e8402"
msgid "Et rien que ça, ça va me changer la vie."
msgstr "І тільки це змінить моє життя."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_10cd5dcd"
msgid "Plus que..."
msgstr "Зовсім трохи..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_039893c4"
msgid "Tu as rempli ta part, tu as même été bien au-delà..."
msgstr "Ти виконав свою частину угоди і навіть вийшов далеко за межі..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cd57738f"
msgid "Honnêtement je ne pensais pas que tu y arriverais."
msgstr "Чесно кажучи, я не думала, що ти зможеш це зробити."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3f087428"
msgid "Les choses auraient pu être plus simples si tu ne m'avais pas envoyé ces trois idiots."
msgstr "Усе могло бути простіше, якби ти не послала тих трьох ідіотів за мною."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_50463f5c"
msgid "Je... Je sais, mais tu devais prendre confiance en toi et..."
msgstr "Я... я знаю, але тобі потрібно було набути впевненості в собі, і..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_3b058536"
msgid "Laisse tomber... Même si sur la forme cette idée était horrible, sur le fond par contre... Je crois que j'avais besoin de cet électrochoc."
msgstr "Неважливо... Навіть якщо ця ідея була жахливою, мені потрібен був такий стимул."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_206b3de7"
msgid "J'ai dû développer un côté masochiste à force de traîner avec toi..."
msgstr "Ймовірно, в мене розвинулися мазохістські схильності від спілкування з тобою..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_69540e18"
msgid "Tu devais déja l'avoir au fond de toi !"
msgstr "Ймовірно, вони вже були глибоко всередині тебе!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`cute`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c763f1b1"
msgid "Mais une promesse est une promesse... Allonge toi !"
msgstr "Але обіцянка є обіцянка... Лягай!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_2273a70f"
msgid "Pourquoi ?"
msgstr "Нащо?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_c894206f"
msgid "C'est la dernière récompense, laisse-moi faire !"
msgstr "Це остання нагорода, тож дозволь мені зробити свій внесок!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tedc6fe1688"
msgid "D'accord..."
msgstr "Гаразд..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t548d97c2af"
msgid "Non, merci"
msgstr "Ні, дякую."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tda40f1ba48"
msgid "Je vais te montrer qu'avec moi..."
msgstr "Я покажу тобі що зі мною..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9dea6986ad"
msgid "Tu es entre de bonnes mains !"
msgstr "Ти в надійних руках."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb716ebdabd"
msgid "Dis comme ça..."
msgstr "Скажи так..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tef1f17f57f"
msgid "Chuut !"
msgstr "Тссс!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ta0070eafc3"
msgid "Je crois que tu es pret pour la suite."
msgstr "Я сподіваюся, ти готовий до того, що буде далі."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t032ac60e82"
msgid "La suite ?"
msgstr "Що далі?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2393a6b2ac"
msgid "Alors ?"
msgstr "І що?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3de8e27e16"
msgid "hmmgmmmg"
msgstr "Хмммгхмммг!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te1ed1dc5de"
msgid "Il ne faut pas parler la bouche pleine !"
msgstr "Не розмовляй із зайнятим ротом!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t432f9eb873"
msgid "Tchh ! facile a dire !"
msgstr "Тц! Тобі легко казати."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te34e69ea45"
msgid "Mhhh"
msgstr "Хммм."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc952efbec2"
msgid "Hann bon sang !"
msgstr "Ох, чорт забирай!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8ea802d425"
msgid "J'arrive toujours pas a le croire..."
msgstr "Я досі не можу в це повірити..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tab5064ee34"
msgid "Quoi ?"
msgstr "Що?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t25f81b343d"
msgid "C'est fou a quel point la nature t'a bien monté."
msgstr "Це божевілля, наскільки він в тебе всеж великий."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0bac9895db"
msgid "Ah... euh merci, je suppose ?"
msgstr "Ем... дякую, напевно?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t881774509e"
msgid "hmmmm"
msgstr "Хмммм."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te8be610c84"
msgid "mhh"
msgstr "Хмм."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0db43209da"
msgid "Hey ! Tu es en train de me mordre !"
msgstr "Гей! Ти мене вкусила!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0e20107904"
msgid "Je sais !"
msgstr "Я знаю."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8d83bec79d"
msgid "Tais toi et continue !"
msgstr "Замовкни і продовжуй!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ta12bed8b17"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_0296dfe7"
msgid "Bon sang quelle nuit..."
msgstr "Чорт, що за ніч..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_cd6a6693"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} ?"
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_room_91707422"
msgid "Elle a dû retourner dans sa chambre."
msgstr "Скоріше за все, вона повернулася до своєї кімнати."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td649d9e95c"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} s'est foutue de moi !"
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} виставила мене дурнем!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te761a5682d"
msgid "C'est toi qui as voulu jouer avec des forces qui te dépassaient."
msgstr "Це ти сам захотів гратися з силами, які не можеш контролювати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t7d8267022d"
msgid "Et franchement, je trouve que tu t'en tires plutôt bien."
msgstr "І чесно кажучи, як на мене, ти справляєшся досить добре."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc62a9947b3"
msgid "Maintenant que tu as eu ce que tu voulais... Est-ce qu'on peut passer au vrai problème ?"
msgstr "Тепер, коли ти дізнався те, що хотів... Ми можемо перейти до справжньої проблеми?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tedd5f57886"
msgid "Parce que tu crois que je t'ai attendu pour obtenir des infos ?!"
msgstr "Ти що, справді думаєш, що я чекав на тебе, щоб дістати інформацію?!"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`frustrated`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc492ea3186"
msgid "J'ai essayé toutes les approches : soit on ne me prend pas au sérieux, soit les agents qui se sont déplacés n'ont rien relevé de suspect."
msgstr "Я спробував усі підходи: або мене не сприймають серйозно, або офіцери, які виїжджали на місце, нічого підозрілого не виявили."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t907e6943e2"
msgid "J'ai même envoyé les services sociaux, pour te dire..."
msgstr "Більш того, я навіть звертався до соціальної служби..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td37b83ef3f"
msgid "Et ?"
msgstr "І?"

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t40e0c08edb"
msgid "Rien !"
msgstr "Нічого!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t75ff9e8e88"
msgid "Bon, eh bien, on peut peut-être considérer qu'il n'y a rien ?"
msgstr "Ну, напевно, тоді можна припустити, що там нічого немає?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t02995efbb1"
msgid "{{minato.n}} est peut-être un parfait connard avec nous, mais ça ne signifie pas pour autant qu'il s'en prendrait à sa sœur."
msgstr "{{minato.n}} може й повний придурок по відношенню до нас, але це ще не означає, що він би нашкодив своїй сестрі."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t464d587fb8"
msgid "Je sais... Mais..."
msgstr "Я знаю... Але..."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`frustrated`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te3fb38b4fb"
msgid "J'ai vraiment la sensation qu'elle est en danger."
msgstr "У мене справді таке відчуття, що вона в небезпеці."

#. Character:`kimochi`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tba2626cef8"
msgid "La seule façon pour moi d'abandonner cette idée et de passer à autre chose serait d'entrer chez lui et de vérifier ça par moi-même."
msgstr "Єдиний спосіб для мене відмовитися від цієї ідеї — це зайти до нього додому і перевірити все самому."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8c06a67b3b"
msgid "Oui, mais pour le coup... c'est illégal."
msgstr "Так, але... Це незаконно."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t54afcd3e2e"
msgid "Mais si {{chiaki.n}} a vraiment des problèmes, ça en vaudra la peine."
msgstr "Але якщо {{chiaki.n}} справді в біді, то це того варте."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te5946ba32c"
msgid "Je comprends..."
msgstr "Я розумію..."

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8c7a4e2dce"
msgid "Allez, raccompagne-moi dehors, j'ai du mal à marcher."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, проведи мене надвір. Мені важко ходити."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tcc1e9589c7"
msgid "À qui la faute aussi ?"
msgstr "А чия ж це провина?"

#. Character:`kimochi` | Attributes:`horny`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0b0b454190"
msgid "À {{noriko.n}}, bien sûr !"
msgstr "Звісно ж, {{noriko.n}}!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc508d85e63"
msgid "Pourquoi avoir demandé un truc aussi débile aussi..."
msgstr "Навіщо ти взагалі спитав таку дурню..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9a035f1b9c"
msgid "J'ai bien dormi cette nuit !"
msgstr "Я добре виспався минулої ночі!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9022eb3200"
msgid "J'irais bien courir avec {{macumba.n}}, ça fait un moment que je n'y suis pas allé et ça me manque un peu."
msgstr "Я б із задоволенням побігав разом із {{macumba.n}}. Минуло вже чимало часу відтоді, як я востаннє це робив, і мені цього трохи бракує."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb344624cc0"
msgid "Honnêtement je sais pas pourquoi elle s'inquiète autant."
msgstr "Чесно кажучи, не знаю, чому вона так хвилюється."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t30c9b9be16"
msgid "A l'entendre dire, on croirait que je ne sais pas me contrôler."
msgstr "Як послухати її, то можна подумати, що я зовсім не вмію себе контролювати."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t523da34848"
msgid "Est-ce que ce serait un brin de jalousie ?"
msgstr "Можливо, це нотка ревнощів?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t995b662168"
msgid "C'est possible.."
msgstr "Можливо..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t7697583e4c"
msgid "Mais ça ne me dit pas ce que je vais bien pouvoir faire avec {{sayuri.n}} demain..."
msgstr "Але це все одно не підказує, що я можу зробити з {{sayuri.n}} завтра..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t57b55900d2"
msgid "Un endroit intéressant... [w]mhhhh..."
msgstr "Цікаве місце... [w]Мммм..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tecf2bc0512"
msgid "Oh je crois que je sais !"
msgstr "О, здається, я знаю!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9c35dc6f40"
msgid "Mais il va me falloir demander l'avis de {{sakuya.n}}."
msgstr "Але спершу {{sakuya.n}} має сказати свою думку."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb580e94b2c"
msgid "Bon... Avec le onsen je pense que j'ai placé la barre assez haut."
msgstr "Що ж... Гадаю, з джерелами я занадто підняв планку."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3912424010"
msgid "Il va être compliqué de trouver quelque chose d'aussi bien à faire."
msgstr "Буде важко знайти щось, що зможе з цим зрівнятися."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t27b7fd4da7"
msgid "Peut-être que quelque chose de simple pourrait fonctionner ?"
msgstr "Можливо, щось просте спрацює?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "taeb126b9d1"
msgid "Pourquoi ne pas se balader en ville ?"
msgstr "Чому б не прогулятися містом?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t29232b9113"
msgid "Ça me paraît une très bonne idée !"
msgstr "Мені здається, що це досить гарна ідея!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td49f03a03f"
msgid "Te revoilà enfin !"
msgstr "Ось ти де, нарешті!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2ab4409215"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} ? Mais que fais tu là ?"
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}? Що ти тут робиш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t4d4084cd9c"
msgid "Tu m'attend depuis longtemps ?"
msgstr "Як довго ти мене чекала?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tbdf43b88a4"
msgid "Je pensais que cela ne me toucherait pas."
msgstr "Я думала, що це на мене не вплине."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te6690cf70f"
msgid "Que j'étais plus forte que ça."
msgstr "Що я сильніша за це."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tead74e837d"
msgid "Mais...[w] Te savoir avec une autre femme que moi me perturbe plus que je ne l'aurais cru."
msgstr "Але...[w] Знати, що ти з іншою жінкою, а не зі мною, хвилює мене більше, ніж я очікувала."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t6d8235a88c"
msgid "Moi aussi j'aimerais que tu m'emmènes en rendez-vous !"
msgstr "Я теж хочу, щоб ти запросив мене на побачення!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t75715b3828"
msgid "Tu ne me laisses même pas la possibilité de m'occuper de toi."
msgstr "Ти навіть не даєш мені можливості подбати про тебе."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td4ec3c3868"
msgid "Pardon... Je me suis laissé porté par la situation."
msgstr "Вибач... Я трошки забувся."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t92c21389d4"
msgid "Non mon chéri, tu n'as pas à t'excuser."
msgstr "Ні, любий, тобі не потрібно вибачатися."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t91e85321a2"
msgid "Après tout, tout ça était mon idée à la base."
msgstr "Зрештою, це була моя ідея."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb93a6105bf"
msgid "C'est moi qui suis égoïste dans cette histoire."
msgstr "У цій історії я егоїстка."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2e4a5f8455"
msgid "Allons, allons, ne sois pas aussi dure avec toi-même."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, не будь такою суворою до себе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2d599e349e"
msgid "Demain sera mon dernier rendez-vous avec elle !"
msgstr "Завтра буде моє останнє побачення з нею!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc83be6fe48"
msgid "Après, nous pourrons essayer de passer plus de temps ensemble, d'accord ?"
msgstr "Після цього ми зможемо проводити більше часу разом, добре?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0256e048c8"
msgid "Oui... Tu es un amour !"
msgstr "Так... Ти такий милий!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf1fb17c8b7"
msgid "Et puis je crois que la jalousie te rend encore plus attachante..."
msgstr "І я також вважаю, що ревнощі роблять тебе ще привабливішою..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1fea4ddc4a"
msgid "Oh toi !"
msgstr "Ой, ти!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tcb6a0f9b28"
msgid "Pour la peine, cette nuit tu es à moi !"
msgstr "У покарання — цієї ночі ти мій!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_COMMENT_A_SE_PASSE_AVEC_70B130"
msgid "Alors comment ça se passe avec {{sayuri.n}} ?"
msgstr "То як справи з {{sayuri.n}}?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_A_RETROUV_LE_SOURIRE_2A861A"
msgid "Elle a retrouvé le sourire ?"
msgstr "Вона знову почала усміхатися?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_JE_PENSE_QU_ELLE_ATTENDAIT_379D17"
msgid "Oui, je pense qu'elle attendait ce genre de chose depuis longtemps."
msgstr "Так, я думаю, вона вже давно чекала на щось подібне."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_FOU_DE_VOIR_COMME_LA_M_R_C466BA"
msgid "C'est fou de voir comme la mère et la fille se ressemblent."
msgstr "Дивно бачити, наскільки схожі між собою мати та донька."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HAHA_EN_EFFET_SAYURI_N_A_TOUJO_CF6D2A"
msgid "Haha... En effet ! {{sayuri.n}} a toujours été comme ça."
msgstr "Ха-ха... Справді! {{sayuri.n}} завжди була такою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VOULAIS_SAVOIR_AUTRE_CHOSE_B8D811"
msgid "Tu voulais savoir autre chose sinon ?"
msgstr "Ти хотів дізнатися щось інше, чи ні?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_NON_JE_VOULAIS_JUSTE_SAVOI_EE3831"
msgid "Non non, je voulais juste savoir si tout se passait bien."
msgstr "Ні, ні, я просто хотіла дізнатися, чи все відбувається гаразд."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TE_VOIR_T_AMUSER_AVEC_UNE_AUTR_D177B4"
msgid "Te voir t'amuser avec une autre femme de mon âge me faisait réfléchir..."
msgstr "Бачити, як ти розважаєшся з іншою жінкою мого віку, змусило мене замислитися..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "R_FL_CHIR_C_EST_PAS_CE_QUE_J_A_D5127F"
msgid "Réfléchir ? C'est pas ce que j'aurais dû faire ? Mais... c'est toi qui a—"
msgstr "Роздумувати? Хіба це не те, що я мав би зробити? Але... це ж ти сам..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MON_CH_RI_NE_T_INQUI_TE_PAS_A_336F2F"
msgid "Mon chéri, ne t'inquiète pas, ça n'a rien à voir."
msgstr "Мій коханий, не хвилюйся, це зовсім не пов’язано."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_PEUT_TRE_UN_PEU_JALOUS_14C080"
msgid "Je suis peut-être un peu jalouse, voilà tout."
msgstr "Можливо, я просто трохи заздрю, і все."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_ME_DEMANDE_JUSTE_COMMENT_AU_CA31E5"
msgid "Je me demande juste comment auraient été les choses si j'avais pris une autre décision."
msgstr "Я просто цікавлюся, як би все виглядало, якби я прийняла інше рішення."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BREF_NE_FAIS_PAS_ATTENTION_JE_FA2217"
msgid "Bref, ne fais pas attention, je divague."
msgstr "Коротше кажучи, не звертай уваги, я просто блукаю думками."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BONNE_NUIT_MON_CH_RI_5EDE4B"
msgid "Bonne nuit mon chéri !"
msgstr "Спокійної ночі, коханий мій!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "WOW_C_TAIT_LA_CONVERSATION_LA_FC2713"
msgid "Wow... C'était la conversation la plus étrange que j'ai eue avec {{yasuka.n}} depuis longtemps..."
msgstr "Вау... Це була найдивніша розмова, яку я вел з {{yasuka.n}} уже давно..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf3120e3de6"
msgid "Mince j'ai encore dormis toute la matinée."
msgstr "Чорт, я знову проспав весь ранок."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t10003e8c21"
msgid "Faut dire qu'avec la nuit passé avec {{yasuka.n}}... Il était impossible de ne pas être épuisé."
msgstr "Повинен сказати, що якщо {{yasuka.n}} проводить зі мною ніч... То після цього неможливо не почуватися виснаженим зранку."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FAUT_DIRE_QU_AVEC_LA_CONVERSAT_49A2D7"
msgid "Faut dire qu'avec la conversation que j'ai eue avec {{yasuka.n}} hier soir... J'ai eu du mal à fermer les yeux."
msgstr "Мабуть, через розмову, яка відбулася вчора ввечері з {{yasuka.n}}, мені було важко заснути."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t115b58a6ae"
msgid "Je vais être en retard !"
msgstr "Я можу запізнитися!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tee4cadabab"
msgid "Alors ?"
msgstr "І що?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td7358f7acf"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1a876b3080"
msgid "Okay c'est bon j'ai compris... Avoir ta tête tu n'as pas pu t'en empêcher !"
msgstr "Гаразд, все ясно... З твого обличчя видно, що ти не зміг втриматися!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf9a6a7da07"
msgid "J'espère pour toi que ça en valait la peine au moins."
msgstr "Принаймні я сподіваюся, що це було того варте."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t53326a9949"
msgid "Qu'est ce que tu comptes faire du coup ?"
msgstr "Що ти збираєшся робити тепер?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te0c0eb7e18"
msgid "Moi ? Rien."
msgstr "Я? Нічого."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8bfa644c7e"
msgid "Tu vis ta vie comme tu veux... Je voulais juste que tu sois honnête dans tes intentions."
msgstr "Ти живеш, як хочеш... Я лише хотіла, щоб ти був чесним у своїх намірах."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t4d9a52cf28"
msgid "Je t'ai déjà dit qu'il ne se passerais rien !"
msgstr "Я вже казав тобі, що нічого не станеться!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td91bd17a22"
msgid "Pourquoi tu n'as pas confiance ?"
msgstr "Чому ти мені не довіряєш?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8c533898ed"
msgid "En même temps.. Avec le nombre de filles avec qui tu as couché. On peut se permettre d'avoir des doutes !"
msgstr "Я маю на увазі... Враховуючи кількість дівчат, з якими ти спав, цілком логічно мати сумніви!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t22ad481a69"
msgid "Okay... J'admet que tu avais peut être raison."
msgstr "Добре... Визнаю, ти може маєш рацію."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`cute`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3fc061c527"
msgid "Sinon..."
msgstr "До речі..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`excited`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t899fea160e"
msgid "La prochaine moi c'est à mon tour de profiter de toi !"
msgstr "Наступного разу моя черга скористатися тобою!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t59da2124a2"
msgid "...[w]En fait...[w]J'ai promis à {{yasuka.n}} d'abord..."
msgstr "...[w]Власне...[w]{{yasuka.n}} хоче бути наступною..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tddb8d02d47"
msgid "Tu fais chier !"
msgstr "Пішов ти!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t4c209fe4c1"
msgid "C'est plus la {{noriko.n}} que je connais ça !"
msgstr "Оце вже {{noriko.n}}, яку я знаю!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t907e05adc7"
msgid "Bon... Avec ce qu'il s'est passé je vais avoir du mal a dormir."
msgstr "Ну... Після того, що сталося, мені буде важко заснути."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t3a34fa703e"
msgid "Autant en profiter pour aller courir un peu !"
msgstr "Можна скористатися цим, щоб піти на пробіжку!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_FAISONS_LE_POINT_BF26CA"
msgid "... Bon, faisons le point."
msgstr "Добре, підведемо підсумки."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LA_POLICE_LA_DESCENTE_CHEZ_MIN_E4465D"
msgid "La police, la descente chez {{minato.n}}, les thugs, les affiches..."
msgstr "Поліція, обшук в будинку {{minato.n}}, бандити, плакати..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TOUT_A_N_A_RIEN_DONN_C3DF7F"
msgid "Tout ça n'a rien donné."
msgstr "Ніщо з цього нам не допомогло."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_REFUSE_DE_RESTER_L_ATTENDRE_20B6D0"
msgid "Je refuse de rester là à attendre !"
msgstr "Я відмовляюся просто сидіти тут і чекати!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_Y_A_BIEN_QUELQUE_CHOSE_QUE_9634B7"
msgid "Il y a bien quelque chose que je dois pouvoir faire ?"
msgstr "Має ж бути щось, що я можу зробити, вірно?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MERDE_D2F294"
msgid "MERDE !"
msgstr "Чорт забирай!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_EST_TEMPS_D_ALLER_VOIR_MACU_DCA98B"
msgid "Il est temps d'aller voir {{macumba.n}}."
msgstr "Треба піти подивитися як там {{macumba.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_ESP_RE_QU_IL_AURA_EU_PLUS_DE_F8DAF6"
msgid "J'espère qu'il aura eu plus de chance que moi."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, йому пощастило більше, ніж мені."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_ES_D_J_DE_RETOUR_24646A"
msgid "Tu es déjà de retour ?"
msgstr "Ти вже повернувся?"

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "POUR_RIEN_AU_MONDE_JE_NE_FERAI_49940B"
msgid "Pour rien au monde je ne ferais attendre mon amour..."
msgstr "Я б нізащо у світі не змусила свого коханого чекати..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_L_AS_TROUV_31888C"
msgid "Tu l'as trouvé ?"
msgstr "Ти знайшла його?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_TOI_LA_MEILLEURE_515B33"
msgid "C'est toi la meilleure !"
msgstr "Ти найкраща!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALLONS_Y_IL_EST_TEMPS_D_AVOIR_245CB5"
msgid "Allons-y, il est temps d'avoir une petite discussion."
msgstr "Ходімо. Час трохи поговорити."

#. Character:`sakuya`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QUE_JE_POURRAIS_TE_REG_D05FEA"
msgid "Tu sais que je pourrais te regarder dormir pendant des heures ?"
msgstr "Знаєш, я міг б годинами дивитися, як ти спиш."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_TE_VOIL_D56BFA"
msgid "Oh... te voilà !"
msgstr "О... Ось ти де!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "COMMENT_A_S_EST_PASS_A539F3"
msgid "Comment ça s'est passé ?"
msgstr "Як все пройшло?"

#. Character:`sakuya` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LA_NUIT_A_T_UN_PEU_LONGUE_MAIS_549570"
msgid "La nuit a été un peu longue, mais c'est bon, il est prêt à parler."
msgstr "Це була довга ніч, але все гаразд. Він готовий розмовляти."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_TU_ES_INCROYABLE_B5F823"
msgid "...[w] Tu es incroyable !"
msgstr "...[w]Ти неймовірна!"

#. Character:`sakuya` | Attributes:`pouting,blush`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NE_ME_DIS_PAS_A_MAINTENANT_JE_31DA21"
msgid "... Ne me dis pas ça maintenant... je risquerais de ne plus me contenir."
msgstr "...Не кажи мені цього зараз... Я можу не стриматися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALLONS_Y_TOUT_DE_SUITE_04B98F"
msgid "Allons-y tout de suite !"
msgstr "Ходімо негайно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_E_POURQUOI_J_AI_AUSSI_MAL_AU_762140"
msgid "Aïe... Pourquoi j'ai aussi mal au crâne ?!"
msgstr "Ауч... Чому в мене так сильно болить голова?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NETORU_N_L_ENFOIR_JE_DOIS_Y_R_FB775A"
msgid "{{netoru.n}} ! L'enfoiré, je dois y retour–"
msgstr "{{netoru.n}}! Цей покидьок. Я маю повернутися..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MON_CH_RI_DAC9DA"
msgid "Mon chéri..."
msgstr "Любий..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YASUKA_N_MAIS_QU_EST_CE_QUE_T_C5A0CF"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} ? Mais qu'est-ce que tu fais là ?!"
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}? Що ти тут робиш?!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_VEILL_SUR_TOI_AVEC_SAKUYA_E919B9"
msgid "J'ai veillé sur toi avec {{sakuya.n}}, nous nous sommes relayées toute la nuit."
msgstr "Ми з {{sakuya.n}} по черзі доглядали за тобою всю ніч."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_M_A_TOUT_RACONT_E_36130C"
msgid "Elle m'a tout racontée."
msgstr "Вона мені все розповіла."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_D_UE_POURQUOI_N_ES_TU_3B96EA"
msgid "Je suis déçue, pourquoi n'es-tu pas venu discuter avec moi de tout ça ?!"
msgstr "Я розчарована. Чому ви не обговорили це зі мною?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_JE_NE_VOULAIS_PAS_DONNER_DE_243EBB"
msgid "Je... je ne voulais pas donner de faux espoirs avant d'avoir la certitude que..."
msgstr "Я... я не хотів давати тобі фальшиву надію, перш ніж переконатися, що..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SHHHT_C_EST_BON_NE_T_EN_FAIS_P_D1A6E8"
msgid "Shhht, c'est bon, ne t'en fais pas. Je suis là maintenant."
msgstr "Тсс, все гаразд. Не хвилюйся. Я тут."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy,blush`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ON_VA_R_GLER_CE_PROBL_ME_ENSEM_96C9B4"
msgid "On va régler ce problème ensemble !"
msgstr "Ми разом вирішимо цю проблему!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAMAN_F91C9E"
msgid "MAMAN !!"
msgstr "МАМО!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUE_SE_PASSE_T_IL_MA_CH_RIE_3A9689"
msgid "Que se passe-t-il, ma chérie ?"
msgstr "Що сталося, люба моя?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LA_POLICE_EST_L_ILS_SONT_VENUS_882BFF"
msgid "La police est là, ils sont venus chercher {{saito.n}} !"
msgstr "Поліція тут! Вони прийшли за {{saito.n}}!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_NE_BOUGEZ_PAS_DE_L_JE_VAIS_6A5176"
msgid "...[w] Ne bougez pas de là ! Je vais régler ça !"
msgstr "...[w] Нікуди не йди! Я з цим впораюся!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SAIS_CE_QUE_TU_VAS_DIRE_JE_4F7C36"
msgid "Je sais ce que tu vas dire... je n'aurais pas dû..."
msgstr "Я знаю, що ти скажеш... Мені не слід було..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_PAS_LE_MOMENT_DE_DISCUTE_19F7E9"
msgid "C'est pas le moment de discuter de ça !"
msgstr "Зараз не час це обговорювати!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_VOUS_NE_POUVEZ_P_AF2E4D"
msgid "[font_size=14]Vous ne pouvez pas entrer comme ça ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ви не можете просто так увірватися сюди![/font_size]"

#. Character:`cop`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_JE_REGRETTE_MAIS_BE3B95"
msgid "[font_size=14]Je regrette, mais nous avons un mandat.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Вибачте, але у нас є ордер.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`cop`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_CARTEZ_VOUS_OU_J_D62075"
msgid "[font_size=14]Écartez-vous ou je vous embarque pour obstruction ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]З дороги, або я вас заарештую за перешкоджання правоохоронним органам![/font_size]"

#. Character:`master`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "GAMIN_C_EST_LE_MOMENT_DE_SE_TI_1414C5"
msgid "Gamin ! C'est le moment de se tirer d'ici !"
msgstr "Учне! Час тікати звідси!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_QU_0022CC"
msgid "Mais qu–"
msgstr "Але що..."

#. Character:`master` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NE_POSE_PAS_DE_QUESTIONS_SI_TU_7B703F"
msgid "Ne pose pas de questions ! Si tu restes ici, tu finiras ta vie en prison !"
msgstr "Не час для запитань! Якщо ти залишишся тут, то проведеш решту свого життя у вʼязниці!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ON_TROUVERA_UNE_SOLUTION_POUR_D11423"
msgid "On trouvera une solution pour {{asami.n}}, mais pense aussi à toi..."
msgstr "Ми придумаємо що робити з {{asami.n}}, але подумай також і про себе..."

#. Character:`master`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALLEZ_29E6F1"
msgid "Allez !!"
msgstr "Давай!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_BON_J_ARRIVE_FF9299"
msgid "C'est bon, j'arrive !"
msgstr "Гаразд, я іду!"

#. Character:`cop`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CETTE_FOIS_CI_JE_TE_T_530FC4"
msgid "Cette fois-ci, je te t–"
msgstr "На цей раз я..."

#. Character:`cop` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_SANG_O_EST_IL_BB2B46"
msgid "Bon sang, où est-il ?"
msgstr "Чорт забирай, де він?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_SAIS_PAS_ET_M_ME_SI_JE_L_5CE45A"
msgid "Je ne sais pas... et même si je le savais, je ne vous dirais rien !"
msgstr "Я не знаю... І навіть якби знала, то нічого б тобі не сказала!"

#. Character:`cop`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FOUILLEZ_LES_ALENTOURS_IL_NE_D_BC0861"
msgid "FOUILLEZ LES ALENTOURS, IL NE DOIT PAS ÊTRE LOIN !"
msgstr "ОБШУКАЙТЕ ТЕРИТОРІЮ! ВІН НЕ МІГ ДАЛЕКО ВТЕКТИ!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_ABRUTIS_FONT_SIZ_94FFB6"
msgid "[font_size=14]Abrutis ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ідіоти![/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_EST_PARTI_F6FDA7"
msgid "Il est parti ?"
msgstr "Він пішов?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_C_EST_BON_DB3F6F"
msgid "Oui, c'est bon."
msgstr "Так, все гаразд."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_N_AI_JAMAIS_AUTANT_D_TEST_Q_924967"
msgid "Je n'ai jamais autant détesté quelqu'un aussi rapidement, c'est viscéral."
msgstr "Я ніколи раніше так швидко і так глибоко нікого не ненавиділа."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_A_PU_S_CHAPPER_SANS_SOUCI_E820A4"
msgid "Il a pu s'échapper sans souci ?"
msgstr "Йому вдалося втекти без жодних проблем?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_JUSTE_TEMPS_9648C9"
msgid "Oui, juste à temps."
msgstr "Ага, якраз вчасно."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PARFAIT_90F307"
msgid "Parfait !"
msgstr "Чудово!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_TE_LAISSER_JE_DOIS_1824EF"
msgid "Je vais te laisser... Je dois..."
msgstr "Я збираюся залишити тебе... Я мушу..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PAS_SI_VITE_JEUNE_FILLE_TU_VAS_DAC56F"
msgid "Pas si vite, jeune fille ! Tu vas rester ici et dire tout ce que tu sais."
msgstr "Не так швидко, юна леді! Ти залишишся тут і розповіси мені все, що знаєш."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_COMME_L_IMPRESSION_QUE_TU_02C594"
msgid "J'ai comme l'impression que tu en sais bien plus que tu ne veux le faire croire."
msgstr "У мене таке відчуття, що ти знаєш набагато більше, ніж говориш."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_JE_SUIS_CERTAINE_QUE_NOTRE_162178"
msgid "Et je suis certaine que notre {{saito.n}} n'a rien fait de mal !"
msgstr "І я впевнена, що {{saito.n}} не зробив нічого поганого!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_C_EST_MINATO_N_LE_RESPONSAB_D5C532"
msgid "...[w] C'est {{minato.n}} le responsable !"
msgstr "...[w]По-справжньому винен {{minato.n}}!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SAVAIS_BIEN_QUE_J_AURAIS_D_43B819"
msgid "Je savais bien que j'aurais dû me douter de quelque chose quand il est venu déposer ce sac avec sa tête de faux-cul."
msgstr "Я справді мала щось запідозрити, коли він підійшов залишити ту сумку з таким дволиким виразом обличчя."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUEL_SAC_D4C3C2"
msgid "Quel sac ?"
msgstr "Яку сумку?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_EST_VENU_HIER_POUR_SOI_DISA_9CDF23"
msgid "Il est venu hier pour soi-disant déposer des affaires que {{saito.n}} aurait oubliées."
msgstr "Він приходив учора, нібито щоб віднести деякі речі, які {{saito.n}} забув."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_PEINE_SI_CES_ENFOIR_S_FO_7EC7D6"
msgid "C'est à peine si ces enfoirés font l'effort de cacher leurs magouilles."
msgstr "Ці покидьки майже не намагалися приховати свої схеми."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TOUT_A_NE_ME_RASSURE_PAS_DU_TO_E4FC0C"
msgid "Tout ça ne me rassure pas du tout. J'ai bien peur que {{saito.n}} ne se soit attiré de gros problèmes."
msgstr "Ніщо з цього мене зовсім не заспокоює. Боюся, що {{saito.n}} потрапив у серйозну халепу."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SI_SEULEMENT_IL_N_Y_AVAIT_QUE_C400D5"
msgid "Si seulement il n'y avait que ça..."
msgstr "Якби ж це було найгірше..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "COMMENT_A_IL_Y_A_AUTRE_CHOSE_A1B22B"
msgid "Comment ça ? Il y a autre chose ?"
msgstr "Що ти маєш на увазі? Є щось ще?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_TE_SOUVIENS_DE_TON_ANCIEN_P_FDA183"
msgid "Tu te souviens de ton ancien patron ?"
msgstr "Памʼятаєш свого колишнього начальника?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_NE_ME_DIS_PAS_QU_IL_EST_AU_05550C"
msgid "Non... Ne me dis pas qu'il est aussi impliqué là-dedans..?"
msgstr "Ні... Тільки не кажи мені, що він також причетний до всього цього...?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_ASSIEDS_TOI_A_VA_PRENDRE_U_613D7C"
msgid "Bon, assieds-toi... Ça va prendre un peu de temps."
msgstr "Гаразд, краще сядь... Це займе деякий час."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MON_CH_RI_JE_NE_SAIS_PAS_O_TU_A511B3"
msgid "Mon chéri... Je ne sais pas où tu te trouves en ce moment..."
msgstr "Любий... Я не знаю, де ти зараз..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_JE_PENSE_FORT_TOI_20E53C"
msgid "Mais je pense fort à toi."
msgstr "Але я багато про тебе думаю."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "REVIENS_MOI_VITE_2C8BF1"
msgid "Reviens-moi vite."
msgstr "Повертайся до мене скоріше."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_TELLEMENT_INQUI_TE_40A261"
msgid "Je suis tellement inquiète..."
msgstr "Я так хвилююся..."

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG: de la chambre d'hopital, bruit de fond ambiant pluie, est-ce qu'on peut animer de la pluie en fond ? Shina preparer la CG avec plusieurs couche pour cet effet.
#. # sfx: Bruit d'un electrocardiogramme faible 40-60 Character:`nurse1`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_NON_LAISSE_TOMBE_D67D3E"
msgid "[font_size=14]Non... Laisse tomber, il n'en a plus pour très longtemps...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ні... Не варто, йому залишилося недовго жити...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`nurse2`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_MAIS_ON_NE_PEUT_069782"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mais on ne peut pas le laisser tout seul ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Але ми не можемо залишити його одного![font_size=14]"

#. Character:`nurse3`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_TU_NE_PEUX_PAS_T_846840"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu ne peux pas t'attendrir sur tous les patients dont tu auras la charge.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ви не можете проявляти співчуття до кожного пацієнта, за яким будете доглядати.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`nurse2`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_MAIS_QUAND_M_ME_D7651A"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mais quand même...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Але все одно...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`nurse1`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_ALLEZ_VIENS_ON_R_2549C0"
msgid "[font_size=14]Allez, viens, on reviendra ici en fin de service.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ходімо, повернемося сюди після закінчення роботи.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_SUIS_PAS_ENCORE_MORT_7504F8"
msgid "Je ne suis pas... encore mort..."
msgstr "Я ще не... помер..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PFFF_CBA264"
msgid "Pfff..."
msgstr "Пффф..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_QUEL_MOMENT_LES_CHOSES_ONT_06227B"
msgid "[i]À quel moment les choses ont-elles pris cette tournure ?[/i]"
msgstr "[i]У який момент ситуація прийняла такий хід?[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_C_EST_PEINE_SI_JE_PEUX_BOUG_3DFC99"
msgid "[i]C'est à peine si je peux bouger aujourd'hui.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Сьогодні я майже не можу рухатися.[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_JE_N_AI_M_ME_PAS_ATTEINT_LA_0065CC"
msgid "[i]Je n'ai même pas atteint la cinquantaine que je suis déjà à la fin de ma vie...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Мені ще й п’ятдесяти немає, а я вже наприкінці свого життя...[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_TOUT_A_CAUSE_DE_MA_FAIBLE_C_DDD5E5"
msgid "[i]Tout ça à cause de ma faible constitution, de la maladie, de la solitude, de tous ces séjours passés dans les hôpitaux...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Все через мою слабку конституцію, хворобу, самотність, усі ті місяці, проведені в лікарнях...[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_TELLEMENT_PITOYABLE_FB5567"
msgid "Je suis tellement pitoyable..."
msgstr "Я настільки жалюгідний..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_NON_JE_DOIS_TRE_HONN_TE_TOU_A22B6A"
msgid "[i]Non... Je dois être honnête, tout ça a commencé bien avant.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Ні... Мушу бути чесним, усе це почалося набагато раніше.[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_JE_N_TAIS_QU_UNE_G_NE_MES_P_B5E7A8"
msgid "[i]Je n'étais qu'une gêne... Mes propres parents n'ont jamais voulu de moi.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Я був лише тягарем... Мої власні батьки ніколи мене не хотіли.[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_JE_ME_SUIS_TOUJOURS_FAIT_DI_672FF6"
msgid "[i]Je me suis toujours fait discret pour essayer de ne déranger personne, et tout ce qui en a résulté, c'est que je suis devenu un simple figurant dans ma propre existence.[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Я завжди тримався осторонь, щоб нікому не заважати, і в результаті став лише статистом у власному житті.[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TELLEMENT_PATH_TIQUE_924835"
msgid "... Tellement pathétique..."
msgstr "Таке жалюгідне..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_JE_N_AI_JAMAIS_CONNU_L_AMOU_6852A4"
msgid "[i]Je n'ai jamais connu l'amour, jamais pu fonder de famille, jamais personne ne se souviendra de moi...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Я ніколи не знав, що таке кохання, ніколи не зміг створити сім’ю, і ніхто ніколи мене не згадає...[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PUTAIN_W_C_EST_TELLEMENT_INJUS_901D18"
msgid "Putain ![w] C'est tellement injuste !"
msgstr "Блядь![w] Це так несправедливо!"

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG: la scene devient flou et s'assombrit comme si le syeux se fermaient
#. # sfx: electrocardiogramme ralentit Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AURAIS_VOULU_448470"
msgid "J'aurais voulu..."
msgstr "Я хотів..."

#. TRANSLATORS: # sfx: electrocardiogramme ralentit encore Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AURAIS_V_8A850F"
msgid "J'aurais v-"
msgstr "Я хотів..."

#. TRANSLATORS: # sfx: electrocardiogramme plat
#. # CG: ecran noir Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AU_47E39D"
msgid "J'au-"
msgstr "Я..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_S_IL_Y_A_UN_DIEU_QUI_M_COUT_1072FE"
msgid "[i]S'il y a un dieu qui m'écoute... Ça peut même être le diable, je m'en fiche...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Якщо є бог, який слухає... Це може бути навіть диявол, мені байдуже...[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_JE_NE_VEUX_PAS_MOURIR_PAS_D_699F64"
msgid "[i]Je ne veux pas mourir... Pas déjà... Pas comme ça...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Я не хочу помирати... Ще не зараз... Не так...[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_S_IL_VOUS_PLA_T_DONNEZ_MOI_161535"
msgid "[i]S'il vous plaît... Donnez-moi juste...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Будь ласка... Просто дай мені...[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_JUSTE_I_AB65A4"
msgid "[i]... juste...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]...просто...[/i]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "I_UNE_SECONDE_CHANCE_I_1CC10E"
msgid "[i]Une seconde chance...[/i]"
msgstr "[i]Другий шанс...[/i]"

#. TRANSLATORS: # sfx: bruit d'oiseaux + bruit de la brise
#. # CG: Chambre de saito lumineuse très eclairée,, tout est flou et la silhouette de sakuya est presente mais ne doit pas être reconnue a cause de l'effet flou Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUE_W_QUI_EST_L_2B723E"
msgid "Que...[w] Qui est là ?!"
msgstr "Що... [w] Хто там?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MHHH_POURQUOI_IL_Y_A_TANT_DE_L_9F9A9A"
msgid "Mhhh pourquoi il y a tant de lumière ?!"
msgstr "Ммм, чому тут так багато світла?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "UNE_SECONDE_CE_N_EST_PAS_DU_TO_B2A5CF"
msgid "Une seconde... Ce n'est pas du tout ma chambre d'hôpital, ça !!"
msgstr "Хвилинку... Це точно не моя палата в лікарні!!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_W_C_EST_UN_R_VE_C_EST_A_1901C2"
msgid "C'est...[w] C'est un rêve, c'est ça ?[w] Je dois me pincer !"
msgstr "Це...[w] Це ж сон, правда?[w] Треба себе вщипнути!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_E_NON_C_EST_R_EL_2E817E"
msgid "Aïe ! Non, c'est réel !"
msgstr "Ой! Ні, це справді!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "POURQUOI_J_AI_CETTE_IMPRESSION_7B49BA"
msgid "Pourquoi j'ai cette impression d'avoir rêvé..?"
msgstr "Чому мені здається, ніби я щойно бачив сон…?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OU_PLUT_T_FAIT_UN_CAUCHEMAR_4FD881"
msgid "Ou plutôt fait un cauchemar..."
msgstr "А точніше, мені наснився кошмар..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_TAIT_SI_R_EL_121306"
msgid "C'était si réel."
msgstr "Це здавалося таким справжнім."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_JE_ME_RETROUVE_NOUVEAU_DANS_0F528F"
msgid "Et je me retrouve à nouveau dans mon ancienne chambre, c'est à ne rien y comprendre."
msgstr "І ось я знову у своїй старій кімнаті. У всьому цьому немає ніякого сенсу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_VOUDRAIT_DIRE_QUE_J_AI_T_EN_D9A18F"
msgid "Ça voudrait dire que j'ai été entendu ?!!"
msgstr "Це означає, що мене справді почули?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_VRAIMENT_OBTENU_UNE_SECON_D9E5D3"
msgid "J'ai vraiment obtenu une seconde chance ?!"
msgstr "Невже я справді отримав другий шанс?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PUT_916EAD"
msgid "PUT-"
msgstr "ЩО ЗА..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "UNE_SECONDE_UNE_SECONDE_EN_QUE_50E088"
msgid "Une seconde, une seconde, en quelle année sommes-nous ?"
msgstr "Стривай, стривай, який зараз рік?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "YEAR_67BE12"
msgid "{{year}} !!"
msgstr "{{year}}!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MERDE_TOUT_A_EST_LOIN_D_TRE_UN_3F7718"
msgid "Merde ! Tout ça est loin d'être un simple hasard. Je suis revenu avant que tout ne parte de travers !"
msgstr "Чорт! Це аж ніяк не збіг. Я повернувся ще до того, як усе пішло шкереберть!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_VEUT_DIRE_QUE_CETTE_FOIS_CI_94A080"
msgid "Ça veut dire que cette fois-ci je peux changer les choses !"
msgstr "Це означає, що цього разу я справді можу щось змінити!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_ENCORE_EN_T_TE_CERTAINS_V_8EE2BC"
msgid "J'ai encore en tête certains événements qui vont se produire."
msgstr "Я досі пам’ятаю певні події, які ще мають відбутися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_AVOIR_UNE_LONGUEUR_D_A_5A391D"
msgid "Je vais avoir une longueur d'avance sur tout le monde !"
msgstr "Я буду на крок попереду всіх!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_20_YEAAAAH_FONT_SIZ_B4EA74"
msgid "[font_size=20]YEAAAAH ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=20]УРАААА![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_MON_CH_RI_EST_CE_7E1F78"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mon chéri, est-ce que tout va bien ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Коханий, у тебе все гаразд?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_SANG_C_EST_C_EST_LA_VOIX_D_378CCD"
msgid "Bon sang... C'est... C'est la voix de {{yasuka.n}} !"
msgstr "Боже мій... Це... Це голос {{yasuka.n}}!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_EST_ENCORE_L_B7DA15"
msgid "Elle est encore là ?!"
msgstr "Вона досі тут?!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_VIDEMMENT_QU_ELLE_EST_L_TO_335D67"
msgid "Non, évidemment qu'elle est là, tout ce qui doit arriver ne s'est pas encore produit !"
msgstr "Ні, звичайно, вона тут! Усе, що мало статися, ще не сталося!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_20_JE_NON_TOUT_VA_B_E679C9"
msgid "[font_size=20]Je... Non, tout va bien, j'avais fait un cauchemar..[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=20]Я... Ні, все гаразд, просто мені наснився кошмар.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_PAR_O_COMMENCER_A01B38"
msgid "Bon... Par où commencer ?"
msgstr "Ну що ж... З чого ж мені почати?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SI_JE_NE_FAIS_RIEN_L_HISTOIRE_63B506"
msgid "Si je ne fais rien, l'histoire va se répéter et je vais à nouveau finir dans cette chambre d'hôpital."
msgstr "Якщо я нічого не зроблю, історія повториться, і я знову опинюся в тій лікарняній палаті."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DOIS_R_SOUDRE_LE_PROBL_ME_D_B9ECCA"
msgid "Je dois résoudre le problème de ma constitution fragile."
msgstr "Мені потрібно зміцнити своє слабке здоров’я."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_COURIR_NE_SUFFIRA_PAS_J_A_FF08A3"
msgid "Mais... courir ne suffira pas. J'ai passé toute ma jeunesse à me faire harceler sans jamais oser répondre, je dois trouver aussi un moyen de me défendre !"
msgstr "Але... Втекти цього буде замало. Усю свою юність я терпів знущання, ніколи не даючи відсічі. Мені теж треба знайти спосіб захищатися!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_POUR_FINANCER_TOUT_A_JE_V_AE595F"
msgid "Mais... pour financer tout ça, je vais avoir besoin d'argent !"
msgstr "Але... Щоб все це профінансувати, мені знадобляться гроші!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MERDE_QUELQUES_ANN_ES_PR_S_J_A_E26581"
msgid "Merde, à quelques années près j'aurais pu acheter du bitcoin et le revendre à son pic..."
msgstr "Чорт, якби я був на кілька років раніше, то міг би купити біткойн і продати його на піку..."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_J_AI_EU_LA_SECONDE_CHANCE_880490"
msgid "Non ! J'ai eu la seconde chance que je voulais, je n'ai pas le droit de faire le difficile !"
msgstr "Ні! Я отримав той другий шанс, якого так хотів, тож не маю права вибагливо ставитися!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_MOI_ET_MOI_SEUL_DE_ME_RE_A26811"
msgid "C'est à moi et à moi seul de me reprendre en main."
msgstr "Тільки я і ніхто інший відповідаю за те, щоб навести лад у своєму житті."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_SI_JE_R_USSIS_JE_POURRAI_EN_CC2425"
msgid "Et si je réussis... Je pourrai enfin apprécier cette vie comme j'aurais dû le faire depuis le début !"
msgstr "І якщо мені це вдасться... я нарешті зможу насолоджуватися цим життям так, як мав би з самого початку!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DONC_POUR_R_CAPITULER_ALLER_CO_B8DDF5"
msgid "Donc, pour récapituler, aller courir au parc, trouver un travail et enfin trouver un endroit qui m'apprendra à me défendre."
msgstr "Отже, підсумуємо: піти побігати в парку, знайти роботу і знайти місце, де можна навчитися захищатися."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_UN_EXCELLENT_PROGRAMME_1E1EF5"
msgid "C'est un excellent programme !"
msgstr "Це чудовий план!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AVAIS_OUBLI_QUEL_POINT_ELLE_FADA41"
msgid "J'avais oublié à quel point {{noriko.n}} pouvait casser les couilles."
msgstr "Я зовсім забув, наскільки {{noriko.n}} може бути справжньою занозою в дупі."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AU_MOINS_ELLE_NE_M_INTIMIDE_PL_55EB00"
msgid "Au moins elle ne m'intimide plus autant qu'avant."
msgstr "Принаймні вона вже не лякає мене так сильно, як раніше."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_SANG_QUELLE_NUIT_571C68"
msgid "Bon sang, quelle nuit..."
msgstr "Боже мій, що за ніч..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_PEINE_SI_J_AI_R_USSI_DOR_D13DCC"
msgid "C'est à peine si j'ai réussi à dormir à force de devoir penser à des trucs horribles pour cacher mon excitation."
msgstr "Мені ледь вдалося заснути, бо доводилося думати про жахливі речі, щоб приховати своє хвилювання."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CE_NOUVEAU_CORPS_R_AGIT_BIEN_P_AB7835"
msgid "Ce nouveau corps réagit bien plus que lorsque j'étais malade."
msgstr "Це нове тіло реагує набагато сильніше, ніж тоді, коли я хворів."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "S_RIEUSEMENT_POURQUOI_FALLAIT_27766D"
msgid "Sérieusement... Pourquoi fallait-il qu'elle dorme collée à moi en nuisette ?!"
msgstr "Серйозно... Чому вона мусила спати, притиснувшись до мене в нічній сорочці?!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FINALEMENT_AVEC_UNE_BONNE_NUIT_D6A481"
msgid "Finalement, avec une bonne nuit de sommeil, ça va mieux !"
msgstr "Зрештою, після гарного нічного сну я почуваюся краще!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_ESP_RE_QUE_YASUKA_N_A_R_USSI_901FCA"
msgid "J'espère que {{yasuka.n}} a réussi à se reposer de son côté."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, {{yasuka.n}} встигла трохи відпочити."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PEUT_TRE_QUE_J_AURAIS_D_ACCEPT_44C81C"
msgid "Peut-être que j'aurais dû accepter sa proposition ?"
msgstr "Може, мені варто було погодитися на її пропозицію?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_EST_TROP_TARD_PR_SENT_337829"
msgid "Il est trop tard à présent."
msgstr "Тепер уже запізно."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AUJOURD_HUI_PAS_D_EXCUSES_JE_V_88ADE8"
msgid "Aujourd'hui, pas d'excuses, je vais directement au parc."
msgstr "Сьогодні ніяких виправдань — я відразу йду в парк."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PERSONNE_NE_M_EN_EMP_CHERA_B0B39E"
msgid "Et personne ne m'en empêchera, pas même {{noriko.n}} !"
msgstr "І ніхто мене не зупинить, навіть {{noriko.n}}!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_O_EST_CE_QUE_J_AI_PU_RANGE_D11213"
msgid "Bon, où est-ce que j'ai pu ranger ce truc ?"
msgstr "Ну що ж, куди я це поклав?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MINCE_JE_NE_LE_VOIS_NULLE_PART_A442DF"
msgid "Mince, je ne le vois nulle part... Je suis pourtant sûr d'en avoir un."
msgstr "Чорт, ніде не бачу... Хоча я впевнений, що він у мене є."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DEVRAIS_PEUT_TRE_ALLER_DEMA_E4021B"
msgid "Je devrais peut-être aller demander à {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Мабуть, мені варто звернутися за допомогою до {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "APR_S_TOUT_LA_DERNI_RE_FOIS_O_C67298"
msgid "Après tout, la dernière fois où je l'ai utilisé remonte à plus de 20 ans pour moi."
msgstr "Власне, востаннє я ним користувався більше 20 років тому."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_PREMIER_JOUR_D_ENTRA_NEMEN_A5C8AA"
msgid "Bon... Premier jour d'entraînement aujourd'hui !"
msgstr "Ну що ж... Сьогодні перший день тренувань!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AVEC_MACUMBA_N_8EF0ED"
msgid "Avec {{macumba.n}}..."
msgstr "За допомогою {{macumba.n}}..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "POURQUOI_J_AI_CETTE_SENSATION_58CDEA"
msgid "Pourquoi j'ai cette sensation que je vais souffrir comme jamais je n'ai souffert ?"
msgstr "Чому у мене таке відчуття, що я зазнаю болю, якого ще ніколи не відчував?"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_PEU_IMPORTE_SI_C_EST_DUR_J_8D8575"
msgid "Non ! Peu importe si c'est dur, je dois changer."
msgstr "Ні! Незалежно від того, наскільки це важко, я мушу змінитися."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_UNE_QUESTION_DE_SURVIE_A_93EB6E"
msgid "C'est une question de survie, après tout."
msgstr "Адже це питання виживання."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_DIRAI_RIEN_SUR_LE_FAIT_Q_289CEC"
msgid "Je ne dirai rien sur le fait que tu traînes dans ma chambre sans me demander mon avis si tu réponds à ma question."
msgstr "Я не буду коментувати те, що ти заходиш у мою кімнату без дозволу, але якщо ти відповіси на моє запитання, це буде досить."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_TOI_TU_N_ES_PAS_ENTR_DANS_L_4F6EFC"
msgid "Et toi, tu n'es pas entré dans la mienne il y a deux minutes ?"
msgstr "А ти ж дві хвилини тому не зайшов у мій?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_OKAY_MAIS_C_TAIT_UN_CAS_DE_024536"
msgid "...[w] Okay, mais c'était un cas de force majeure !"
msgstr "...[w] Гаразд, але це був випадок форс-мажору!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_BESOIN_DE_SAVOIR_DE_QUELL_0CD20E"
msgid "J'ai besoin de savoir, de quelle couleur sont mes yeux ?"
msgstr "Мені потрібно знати, якого кольору мої очі?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_N_AS_QU_REGARDER_DANS_LE_MI_9E0D60"
msgid "Tu n'as qu'à regarder dans le miroir !"
msgstr "Просто подивіться у дзеркало!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "S_IL_TE_PLA_T_J_AI_BESOIN_D_UN_FD80A7"
msgid "S'il te plaît, j'ai besoin d'une confirmation."
msgstr "Будь ласка, мені потрібна підтвердження."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PFF_MARRON_T_ES_CONTENT_MAINTE_A41997"
msgid "Pff... Marron, t'es content maintenant ?"
msgstr "Фф... Марон, ти тепер задоволений?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_ES_S_RE_TU_NE_LES_VOIS_PAS_899A41"
msgid "Tu es sûre ? Tu ne les vois pas d'une autre couleur ?"
msgstr "Ти впевнена? Тобі не здається, що вони мають інший колір?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_ME_SAOULES_ADCAC9"
msgid "Tu me saoûles !"
msgstr "Ти мене зводиш з розуму!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OKAY_OKAY_JE_TE_CROIS_W_ET_DON_83F11B"
msgid "Okay, okay, je te crois...[w] Et donc, qu'est-ce que tu fais là ?"
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд, я тобі вірю... [w] То що ж ти тут робиш?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_RECONNAIS_QUE_J_AI_PEUT_TRE_CA1070"
msgid "Je reconnais que j'ai peut-être... un peu... abusé."
msgstr "Я визнаю, що, можливо, трохи... переборщила."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VEUX_QU_ON_SOIT_QUITTES_85D958"
msgid "Je veux qu'on soit quittes..."
msgstr "Я хочу, щоб між нами все було закінчено..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "COUTE_JE_N_AI_PAS_ENVIE_DE_VO_3F5D84"
msgid "Écoute, je n'ai pas envie de voir ta poitrine une seconde fois."
msgstr "Слухай, я зовсім не хочу бачити твою грудь ще раз."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_JE_NE_VAIS_PAS_FAIRE_A_AA2444"
msgid "...[w] Je ne vais pas faire ça !"
msgstr "...[w] Я не збираюся це робити!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PAR_CONTRE_APR_S_A_PROMETS_MOI_172DE1"
msgid "Par contre, après ça, promets-moi qu'on sera quittes !"
msgstr "Але після цього, обіцяй мені, що між нами все буде гаразд!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_SANG_NORIKO_N_MAIS_DE_QUOI_805570"
msgid "Bon sang, {{noriko.n}}, mais de quoi tu p-[w] WOW ! Mais..."
msgstr "Боже мій, {{noriko.n}}, але про що ти... Вау! Але..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FERME_LA_ET_TAIS_TOI_1A42A5"
msgid "Ferme-la et tais-toi."
msgstr "Замовкни й тихо сиди."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_C_EST_LA_PREMI_R_923718"
msgid "[font_size=14]C'est la première fois que je fais ça, donc reste tranquille.[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я роблю це вперше, тож не рухайся.[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TA_PREMI_RE_FOIS_VRAIMENT_057807"
msgid "Ta première fois, vraiment ?"
msgstr "Твій перший раз... справді?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_W_FONT_SIZE_14_TU_M_AS_PRI_052972"
msgid "Oui...[w] [font_size=14]Tu m'as prise pour qui ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "Так... [w] [font_size=14]За кого ти мене вважаєш?[/font_size]"

#. TRANSLATORS: # acte avec noriko Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HEY_J_AI_JAMAIS_DIS_QUE_J_TAIS_579AD1"
msgid "Hey ! J'ai jamais dit que j'étais d'ac-"
msgstr "Гей! Я ніколи не казала, що я згодна..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VEUX_BIEN_TE_TAIRE_ET_ME_LA_84E934"
msgid "Tu veux bien te taire et me laisser faire ?!"
msgstr "Чи не могла б ти замовкнути й дати мені спокійно зробити свою роботу?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "POURQUOI_TU_VAS_AUSSI_LOIN_CF446B"
msgid "Pourquoi tu vas aussi loin ?"
msgstr "Чому ти йдеш так далеко?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_TE_L_AI_DIS_JE_VEUX_QU_ON_S_E766AF"
msgid "Je te l'ai dit, je veux qu'on soit quittes !"
msgstr "Я ж казала тобі, я хочу, щоб між нами було все гаразд!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_JE_VOIS_BIEN_QUE_A_N_A_303019"
msgid "Et puis... Je vois bien que ça n'a pas l'air de te déplaire !"
msgstr "І потім... Я бачу, що це тобі здається цікавим!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FORCEMENT_TU_8DEFE5"
msgid "Forcément tu..."
msgstr "Звісно, ти..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "RHA_BON_SANG_355B56"
msgid "Rha bon sang !"
msgstr "Блін!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_TAIS_OBLIG_E_DE_M_EN_METTRE_D62BE3"
msgid "Tu étais obligé de m'en mettre partout ?"
msgstr "Тобі справді довелося розкидати їх всюди?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_C_EST_TOI_QUI_AS_INSIST_J_B279CA"
msgid "Mais c'est toi qui as insisté, j'ai rien demandé, moi."
msgstr "Але це ти сам наполягав, я ж нічого не просив."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DU_COUP_C_TAIT_COMMENT_7700CA"
msgid "Du coup, c'était comment... ?"
msgstr "То як це взагалі відбулося...?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DOULOUREUX_ET_FLIPPANT_6E08E9"
msgid "Douloureux et flippant."
msgstr "Болісно й дивно."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`angry`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUOI_MAIS_POURQUOI_TU_NE_L_AS_5C2382"
msgid "Quoi mais... Pourquoi tu ne l'as pas dit ?!!"
msgstr "Але ж... Чому ти цього не сказала?!!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AVEC_LA_T_TE_QUE_TU_FAISAIS_J_59A061"
msgid "Avec la tête que tu faisais, j'avais surtout peur que tu me l'arraches avec les dents."
msgstr "З тим виразом обличчя, який у тебе був, я боявся, що ти можеш відірвати його у мене зубами."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_C_EST_CENS_TRE_DOUX_AL_4DCEF3"
msgid "Et puis c'est censé être doux... Alors pourquoi tu t'es dit qu'il fallait la mâchouiller ?!"
msgstr "І взагалі, воно має бути ніжним... То чому ти вирішив, що потрібно його жувати?!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_EUH_D_SOL_E_BBD5BC"
msgid "Oh... Euh, désolée..."
msgstr "Ой... Е-е, вибачте..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LA_PROCHAINE_FOIS_A_SERA_MIEUX_210982"
msgid "La prochaine fois, ça sera mieux !"
msgstr "Наступного разу все буде краще!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "COMMENT_A_UNE_PROCHAINE_FOIS_342873"
msgid "Comment ça, une prochaine fois ?!"
msgstr "Як це можливо – наступного разу?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PUTAIN_JE_VAIS_DEVENIR_FOU_73D2D4"
msgid "Putain, je vais devenir fou."
msgstr "Блядь, я збираюся збожеволіти."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CE_N_EST_PAS_MON_PROBL_ME_CE_N_83D3C1"
msgid "Ce n'est pas mon problème, ce n'est pas à toi de décider cette fois."
msgstr "Це не моя проблема, цього разу не тобі рішати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_AS_T_TROP_LOIN_CETTE_FOIS_C_58E121"
msgid "Tu as été trop loin cette fois-ci, reconnais-le au moins !"
msgstr "Цього разу ти зайшов занадто далеко – принаймні це визнай!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_TU_AS_RAISON_38973B"
msgid "... Oui, tu as raison..."
msgstr "... Так, ти маєш рацію..."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_PUTAIN_NORIKO_N_QUI_RECONNA_5FFDF9"
msgid "Oh putain ! {{noriko.n}} qui reconnait avoir tort, c'est du jamais vu !"
msgstr "О, блядь! Щоб {{noriko.n}} визнала свою помилку – це просто неймовірно!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUOI_POURQUOI_TU_FAIS_CETTE_T_E95E0D"
msgid "Quoi ?!! Pourquoi tu fais cette tête ?"
msgstr "Що?!! Чому ти так на мене дивишся?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "D_SOL_JE_NE_M_ATTENDAIS_PAS_CE_289EF5"
msgid "Désolé, je ne m'attendais pas à ce que tu reconnaisses tes torts aussi simplement."
msgstr "Вибач, я не очікував, що ти так легко визнаєш свої помилки."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`cute`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VOIS_BIEN_QUE_JE_PEUX_TRE_S_325953"
msgid "Tu vois bien que je peux être sympa aussi !"
msgstr "Бачиш же, що я теж можу бути милою!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_CONSTATE_A_A99FF5"
msgid "Je constate ça !"
msgstr "Я це помічаю!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DU_COUP_TU_VEUX_BIEN_EFFACER_L_41B05D"
msgid "Du coup... Tu veux bien effacer l'enregistrement ?"
msgstr "Тож... Чи можеш ти видалити це запис?"

#. TRANSLATORS: # mise à la porte, bruit de porte qui claque Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_TU_FAIS_CHIER_FO_6DAEF2"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu fais chier ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ти мене дратуєш![font_size=14]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FICHE_MOI_LA_PAIX_B5286C"
msgid "Fiche-moi la paix !"
msgstr "Дай мені спокій!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_CROIS_QUE_MA_NOUVELLE_ROUTI_9AA189"
msgid "Je crois que ma nouvelle routine pour une vie meilleure va pouvoir enfin commencer !"
msgstr "Я думаю, що моя нова рутина, спрямована на краще життя, нарешті може розпочатися!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUAND_JE_PENSE_TOUT_CE_TEMPS_P_EEBBEA"
msgid "Quand je pense à tout ce temps perdu lors de mon ancienne vie... J'ai envie de me gifler."
msgstr "Коли я думаю про всі ті години, які були марними в моєму попередньому житті... Мені хочеться вдарити себе по щокі."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_CERTAIN_QUE_MACUMBA_N_23665E"
msgid "Je suis certain que {{macumba.n}} est déjà là !"
msgstr "Я впевнений, що {{macumba.n}} вже там!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_SANG_CHAQUE_FOIS_QUE_J_AI_C4841E"
msgid "Bon sang... À chaque fois que j'ai une discussion avec cette fille, je dors toujours mal..."
msgstr "Боже мій... Кожного разу, коли я спілкуюся з цією дівчиною, у мене погано спить..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_ME_RETOURNE_LE_CERVEAU_A30C13"
msgid "Elle me retourne le cerveau."
msgstr "Вона зводить мене з розуму."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_FERAIS_MIEUX_D_ALLER_COURIR_5BF30C"
msgid "Je ferais mieux d'aller courir pour me réveiller."
msgstr "Краще піду побігати, щоб пробудитися."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "RESTE_L_DA0CE2"
msgid "Reste là !"
msgstr "Залишайся там!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_J_ALLAIS_SORT_E2C993"
msgid "Mais j'allais sort-"
msgstr "Але я збирався вийти..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_BAH_A_ATTENDRA_89C153"
msgid "Oui, bah ça attendra !"
msgstr "Так, ну це може почекати!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_QU_EST_CE_QUE_TU_ME_VEUX_6A48A6"
msgid "Mais qu'est-ce que tu me veux encore ? Je t'avais demandé de juste me laisser tranquille."
msgstr "Але що ти ще від мене хочеш? Я ж просила тебе просто залишити мене у спокої."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_EH_BIEN_CE_N_EST_PAS_TOI_Q_7358D1"
msgid "Oui, eh bien ce n'est pas toi qui vis avec une épée de Damoclès qui mettrait fin à ma réputation !!"
msgstr "Так, емм... Але не ти живеш з мечем Дамокла, який може знищити мою репутацію!!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_SERA_MIEUX_CETTE_FOIS_CI_628BD4"
msgid "Ça sera mieux cette fois-ci..."
msgstr "Цього разу все буде краще..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VAS_ENCORE_ME_7F894F"
msgid "Tu vas encore me..?!!"
msgstr "Ти знову збираєшся зробити зі мною...?!!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_PAS_ENVIE_QUE_TU_ME_MORDE_33F20A"
msgid "J'ai pas envie que tu me mordes encore !"
msgstr "Я не хочу, щоб ти знову вкусив мене!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_PAS_TE_MORDRE_W_FONT_S_FAE107"
msgid "Je vais pas te mordre ![w] [font_size=14]Je me suis entraînée...[/font_size]"
msgstr "Я не збираюся тебе кусати![w] [font_size=14]Я тренувалась...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CONTENTE_TOI_DE_RESTER_SILENCI_2B1ADF"
msgid "Contente toi de rester silencieux."
msgstr "Цілком достатньо просто мовчати."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "T_EN_FAIS_VRAIMENT_QU_TA_T_TE_ACBC5F"
msgid "T'en fais vraiment qu'à ta tête !"
msgstr "Ти справді робиш все лише так, як хочеш!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PUTAIN_CETTE_SITUATION_EST_COM_1C4B2A"
msgid "Putain cette situation est complètement surréaliste."
msgstr "Блін, ця ситуація просто абсолютно нереальна."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_JAMAIS_DEMAND_UN_TRUC_PAR_004E9C"
msgid "J'ai jamais demandé un truc pareil moi."
msgstr "Я ніколи не просив нічого подібного."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EN_PLUS_SI_YASUKA_N_NOUS_SURPR_17A425"
msgid "En plus si {{yasuka.n}} nous surprend comment je lui explique ça ?!"
msgstr "До того ж, якщо {{yasuka.n}} раптово з’явиться, як мені їй це пояснити?!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "UNE_SECONDE_C_EST_P_UT_TRE_CE_76F861"
msgid "Une seconde... C'est peut-être ce qu'elle cherche à..."
msgstr "Зачекайте хвилинку... Можливо, саме цього вона й шукає..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HEY_ARRETE_DE_PENSER_AUTRE_CHO_265154"
msgid "Hey ! Arrête de penser à autre chose !"
msgstr "Гей! Припини думати про щось інше!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "D_SOL_JE_614014"
msgid "Désolé je..."
msgstr "Вибач, я..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MERDE_ELLE_SE_D_BROUILLE_VRAIM_0508AD"
msgid "Merde ! Elle se débrouille vraiment mieux !"
msgstr "Блін! Вона справді робить усе набагато краще!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_C_TAIT_MIEUX_472277"
msgid "Alors... c'était mieux ?"
msgstr "То... чи було це краще?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DOIS_VRAIMENT_R_PONDRE_A_333C26"
msgid "Je dois vraiment répondre à ça ?"
msgstr "Мені справді потрібно відповісти на це?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_18FC43"
msgid "Oui !!"
msgstr "Так!!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_A_N_AVAIT_RIEN_VOIR_813E2A"
msgid "...Oui... ça... n'avait rien à voir."
msgstr "...Так... це... зовсім не мало нічого спільного."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_ATTENDS_DE_VOIR_LA_PROCHAIN_EA1CD0"
msgid "Et attends de voir la prochaine fois !!"
msgstr "І чекай, щоб побачити це наступного разу!!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_JE_T_AI_DIT_QUE_TU_N_TAIS_8BC533"
msgid "Mais je t'ai dit que tu n'étais pas obligée de-"
msgstr "Але я ж казала тобі, що ти не зобов’язана це робити..."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_N_COUTE_RIEN_7EF399"
msgid "Elle n'écoute rien..."
msgstr "Вона нічого не чує..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_POUR_LE_COUP_JE_NE_M_EN_PLA_9F99A5"
msgid "...[w] Pour le coup, je ne m'en plaindrais pas."
msgstr "...[w] Цього разу я б не поскаржилась."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_D1C6DC"
msgid "Alors... ?"
msgstr "То... що далі?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_QUOI_29B75A"
msgid "Alors quoi ?"
msgstr "Що ж, тоді що?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_T_SYMPA_CES_DERNIERS_TEMP_9B84A6"
msgid "J'ai été sympa ces derniers temps, alors je me disais que..."
msgstr "Останнім часом я поводилась досить добре, тому подумала..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_C_EST_PARFAIT_J_ESP_RE_QUE_3C75CC"
msgid "Et c'est parfait, j'espère que ça va continuer."
msgstr "І це ідеально, сподіваюся, що так і буде й надалі."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_TCHH_2C8814"
msgid "...[w] Tchh !"
msgstr "...[w] Чх!"

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_CETTE_JOURN_E_AURA_T_PLEIN_90A44E"
msgid "Bon, cette journée aura été pleine de surprises..."
msgstr "Ну, сьогоднішній день справді був сповнений сюрпризів..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ASAMI_N_SEMBLE_TRE_UNE_FILLE_3C3495"
msgid "{{asami.n}} semble être une fille pleine de vie."
msgstr "Виглядає, що {{asami.n}} – це дівчина, сповнена життєвої енергії."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_ME_DEMANDE_SINC_REMENT_POUR_DCC893"
msgid "Je me demande sincèrement pourquoi {{minato.n}} n'a jamais cherché à approfondir davantage sa relation avec elle."
msgstr "Я щиро цікавлюся, чому {{minato.n}} ніколи не намагався розвивати свої стосунки з нею далі."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ENFIN_BON_CE_N_EST_PAS_MON_PRO_010F35"
msgid "Enfin bon... Ce n'est pas mon problème..."
msgstr "Ну що ж... Це не моя проблема..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "L_IMPORTANT_PR_SENT_EST_DE_FAI_B3E07C"
msgid "L'important à présent est de faire assez de vagues pour que les éléments de ma vie d'avant ne se reproduisent plus."
msgstr "Зараз важливо створити достатньо „хвиль“, щоб елементи мого минулого життя більше не повторювалися."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DE_CETTE_FA_ON_SON_ENL_VEMENT_9F5826"
msgid "De cette façon, son enlèvement n'aura pas lieu et chacun pourra continuer sa vie normalement."
msgstr "Таким чином, її викрадення не відбудеться, і всі зможуть продовжувати своє життя як зазвичай."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_ME_DEMANDE_SI_JE_CONTINUERA_BECF6E"
msgid "Je me demande si je continuerai ma vie avec elle à l'avenir..."
msgstr "Я замислююся, чи буду я і надалі продовжувати своє життя з нею в майбутньому..."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ELLE_EST_PLUT_T_MIGNONNE_APR_S_B025E3"
msgid "Elle est plutôt mignonne, après tout !"
msgstr "Вона, врешті-решт, досить мила!"

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG: Asami se penche par la fenetre souriante Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "COMMENT_VA_LA_MARMOTTE_D0C51E"
msgid "Comment va la marmotte ?"
msgstr "Як справи у білки?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HUUUH_B08D83"
msgid "Huuuh ?!"
msgstr "Хууу?!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_DORMAIS_COMME_UNE_SOUCHE_4D1431"
msgid "Tu dormais comme une souche."
msgstr "Ти спала так міцно, що нічого не чула."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QUE_JE_TE_REGARDE_DEPU_3B7B19"
msgid "Tu sais que je te regarde depuis cinq minutes ?"
msgstr "Ти знаєш, що я дивлюся на тебе вже п’ять хвилин?"

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG pouting Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_J_AVOUE_QUE_JE_SUIS_D_UE_D636E2"
msgid "Et j'avoue que je suis déçue..."
msgstr "І я зізнаюся, що розчарована..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AH_POURQUOI_76C58D"
msgid "Ah, pourquoi ?"
msgstr "А, чому?"

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG boudeuse Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_NE_DORS_PAS_TOUT_NU_BF2787"
msgid "Tu ne dors pas tout nu !"
msgstr "Ти ж не спиш голим!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_SAIS_PAS_QUOI_DIRE_QU_E_62E840"
msgid "... Je ne sais pas quoi dire. Qu'est-ce que tu dirais si je venais te regarder par la fenêtre pendant que tu dors ?"
msgstr "... Я не знаю, що сказати. Що б ти сказала, якби я прийшов подивитися на тебе крізь вікно, поки ти спиш?"

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG guilty Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EH_BIEN_SI_C_EST_TOI_A_VA_MAIS_B14FCA"
msgid "Eh bien... Si c'est toi, ça va, mais ça dépend à quel moment tu me surprends..."
msgstr "Ну... Якщо це ти, то все гаразд, але це залежить від того, у який момент ти мене здивуєш..."

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG shy Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_Y_A_CERTAINES_CHOSES_QUE_TU_0B5741"
msgid "Il y a certaines choses que tu ne devrais pas voir..."
msgstr "Є деякі речі, які тобі не варто бачити..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ASAMI_N_60E906"
msgid "{{asami.n}}..."
msgstr "{{asami.n}}..."

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG souriante Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_COMPRIS_MOI_ASAMI_N_DONNE_97FDCE"
msgid "J'ai compris ! Moi, {{asami.n}}, donne le droit à {{saito.n}}, ici présent, de venir me mater en douce une fois !"
msgstr "Я зрозуміла! Я, {{asami.n}}, надаю право {{saito.n}}, присутньому тут, один раз таємно спостерігати за мною!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VOIL_COMME_A_ON_SERA_QUITTES_S_C8CEDF"
msgid "Voilà, comme ça on sera quittes ! Satisfait ?"
msgstr "Ось так ми і покінчимо з цим! Задоволена?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_SANS_VOIX_5BCADF"
msgid "Je suis sans voix..."
msgstr "Я без слів..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HEHE_84C5DF"
msgid "Hehe."
msgstr "Хе-хе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DIS_MOI_PLUT_T_COMMENT_TU_AS_F_49D971"
msgid "Dis-moi plutôt comment tu as fait pour passer par ici ?"
msgstr "Краще розкажи, як тобі вдалося потрапити сюди?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_A_J_AI_SUIVI_LES_TRACES_B767E2"
msgid "Oh, ça ? J'ai suivi les traces."
msgstr "О, це? Я просто слідувала за слідами."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "COMMENT_A_LES_TRACES_8B64BF"
msgid "Comment ça, les traces ?"
msgstr "Як це так, сліди?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EH_BIEN_EN_JUGER_PAR_LE_PASSAG_28DD0C"
msgid "Eh bien, à en juger par le passage au sol, ce n'est pas la première fois que quelqu'un s'approche de cette fenêtre."
msgstr "Ну, судячи зі слідів на землі, це вже не вперше, коли хтось підходив до цього вікна."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_FLIPPANT_EA28F1"
msgid "C'est flippant !"
msgstr "Це просто божевільно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_FAIS_BIEN_DE_NE_PAS_DORMIR_389F13"
msgid "Tu fais bien de ne pas dormir les fesses à l'air finalement, quelqu'un pourrait être tenté."
msgstr "Все правильно, що ти врешті-решт не спиш з розстебнутими штанинами – хтось міг би із цього скористатися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_ES_EN_FORME_TOI_CE_MATIN_E8AE07"
msgid "Tu es en forme, toi, ce matin..."
msgstr "Ти сьогодні вранці в гарній формі..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "UNE_SECONDE_JE_CROIS_PAS_T_AVO_CD62EA"
msgid "Une seconde... Je crois pas t'avoir montré où j'habitais !"
msgstr "Хвилинку... Гадаю, я ще не показав тобі, де я живу!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AH_OUI_TIENS_TONNANT_NON_A3E701"
msgid "Ah oui... Tiens... Étonnant, non ?"
msgstr "Ах да... Ось... Дивно, чи не так?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_JE_T_AI_PEUT_TRE_UN_PETIT_9B7E08"
msgid "Bon, je t'ai peut-être un petit peu suivi hier soir pour savoir un petit peu où tu habitais."
msgstr "Ну, можливо, вчора ввечері я трохи стежила за тобою, щоб дізнатися, де ти живеш."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QU_AJOUTER_PETIT_DANS_C06C28"
msgid "Tu sais qu'ajouter « petit » dans ton explication ne diminue pas ta bêtise ?"
msgstr "Ти ж знаєш, що додавання слова „малий“ до своєї пояснення не зменшує розміру твоєї дурості, чи не так?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AVOUE_TU_ES_UNE_STALKEUSE_TU_M_34C5CE"
msgid "Avoue... Tu es une stalkeuse ! Tu me veux du mal, c'est ça ?"
msgstr "Зізнайся... Ти ж така стalkerка! Ти хочеш мені зла, чи не так?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VOULAIS_SIMPLEMENT_V_RIFIER_7A4AB1"
msgid "Je voulais simplement vérifier que tu arrivais chez toi en toute sécurité... Je ne vois pas où est le mal, après tout."
msgstr "Я просто хотіла переконатися, що ти безпечно дістаєшся до свого дому... Адже не бачу в цьому нічого поганого."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VAS_ME_RENDRE_FOU_C1D177"
msgid "Tu vas me rendre fou !"
msgstr "Ти зводиш мене з розуму!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ARR_TE_JE_SAIS_QUE_TU_M_ADORES_F91968"
msgid "Arrête, je sais que tu m'adores déjà..."
msgstr "Зупинись, я знаю, що ти вже обожнюєш мене..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VOIS_TU_NE_PEUX_PAS_R_FUTER_265F74"
msgid "Tu vois ? Tu ne peux pas réfuter ça, je suis entrée dans ta tête, je n'en sortirai plus !"
msgstr "Бачиш? Ти не можеш цьому заперечити – я увійшла в твій розум і вже не вийду звідти!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_SAIS_PAS_SI_JE_DOIS_TRE_3165DC"
msgid "Je ne sais pas si je dois être choqué ou impressionné devant tant de culot."
msgstr "Я не знаю, чи повинен я відчувати шок чи враження від такої наглості."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_TU_NE_LA_M_RITES_ADC510"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu ne la mérites pas ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ти її не заслуговуєш![font_size=14]"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_VOIS_GR_CE_A_JE_ME_SUIS_FAI_78F39B"
msgid "Tu vois ? Grâce à ça, je me suis faite une nouvelle amie !"
msgstr "Бачиш? Завдяки цьому я знайшла собі нову подругу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALLEZ_TU_AS_GAGN_TU_PEUX_ENTRE_790C7F"
msgid "Allez, tu as gagné, tu peux entrer !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, ти виграв, тепер можеш зайти!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_PREVENIR_YASUKA_N_QU_O_F2D9F5"
msgid "Je vais prevenir {{yasuka.n}} qu'on a une invitée surprise."
msgstr "Я поділюся з {{yasuka.n}} новиною, що у нас буде несподівана гостя."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_C_EST_PAS_COMME_SI_ELLE_S_BD589E"
msgid "... Oui, c'est pas comme si elle savait déjà que j'étais là."
msgstr "... Так, адже вона ж не могла знати, що я тут."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_TOI_TU_AS_FAIS_UN_TRUC_DANS_8CA12F"
msgid "Oh toi...! Tu as fais un truc dans mon dos !"
msgstr "О, ти...! Ти щось зробив за моїм спиною!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PFFFF_QUELLE_SOIR_E_55150D"
msgid "Pffff... quelle soirée !"
msgstr "Пфффф... Яка ніч!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AURAIS_TOUT_DONN_DANS_MA_VIE_8D527E"
msgid "J’aurais tout donné dans ma vie d’avant pour vivre quelque chose d’aussi fort."
msgstr "У всьому своєму попередньому житті я б була готова віддати все за те, щоб пережити щось настільки потужне."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_C_TAIT_JUSTE_L_JE_N_AVAIS_Q_986361"
msgid "Et c’était juste là... Je n’avais qu’à mettre le pied dehors et arrêter de me morfondre..."
msgstr "І воно було прямо там... Мені просто треба було вийти назовні та перестати горювати..."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUEL_GASPILLAGE_DE_TEMPS_SINC_3BAA07"
msgid "Quel gaspillage de temps, sincèrement."
msgstr "Серйозно, яка марна трата часу."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_PEUX_PAS_PERDRE_CE_BONHE_7B1F66"
msgid "Je ne peux pas perdre ce bonheur !"
msgstr "Я не можу втратити це щастя!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DOIS_TOUT_DONNER_POUR_PROT_D3A801"
msgid "Je dois tout donner pour protéger {{asami.n}}."
msgstr "Я мушу віддати все, щоб захистити {{asami.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MALHEUREUSEMENT_JE_N_AI_AUCUN_85807B"
msgid "Malheureusement je n’ai aucun indice..."
msgstr "На жаль, у мене немає жодних підказок..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SI_TOUT_EST_CENS_SE_REPRODUIRE_10362F"
msgid "Si tout est censé se reproduire comme avant alors je dois tout faire pour foutre en l’air la chronologie des événements."
msgstr "Якщо все має повторитися так, як і раніше, то я маю зробити все можливе, щоб зіпсувати хронологію подій."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AVEC_ASSEZ_DE_VAGUES_LES_CHOSE_60E037"
msgid "Avec assez de vagues, les choses changeront naturellement... elles le doivent."
msgstr "З достатньою кількістю хвиль все природним чином зміниться... так і має бути."

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG: Dans son lit regardant par la fenetre Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MHHHH_4BEEA7"
msgid "Mhhhh."
msgstr "Мммм."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_BIEN_CALME_POUR_UNE_FOIS_0C6309"
msgid "C'est bien calme pour une fois..."
msgstr "Цього разу дійсно дуже тихо..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_VAIS_PAS_M_EN_PLAINDRE_881E63"
msgid "Je ne vais pas m'en plaindre."
msgstr "Я не збираюся скаржитися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ENCORE_5_MINUTES_2D7EEE"
msgid "Encore 5 minutes...."
msgstr "Ще 5 хвилин..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_C_EST_BIEN_TROP_SILENCIEUX_0885FE"
msgid "Non, c'est bien trop silencieux, c'est pas normal !"
msgstr "Ні, тут занадто тихо, це ненормально!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EN_Y_REPENSANT_C_EST_VRAI_QUE_996559"
msgid "En y repensant, c’est vrai que la soirée d’hier a comme un goût de regret."
msgstr "Якщо задуматися, справді, вчорашній вечір залишив після себе відчуття шкоди."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ASAMI_N_SEMBLAIT_VRAIMENT_D_U_25F533"
msgid "{{asami.n}} semblait vraiment déçue."
msgstr "{{asami.n}} здавалася справді розчарованою."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_DEVRAIS_PEUT_TRE_EN_TOUCHER_69FE85"
msgid "Je devrais peut-être en toucher un mot à {{sakuya.n}}."
msgstr "Мабуть, мені варто поговорити про це з {{sakuya.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_L_IMPRESSION_QUE_SI_JE_LA_D72C36"
msgid "J’ai l’impression que si je laisse les choses comme ça rien de bon ne va en sortir."
msgstr "Мені здається, що якщо я залишу все так, нічого хорошого не вийде."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AAAH_BON_SANG_POURQUOI_113CFB"
msgid "Aaah bon sang, pourquoi ?!"
msgstr "Ааа, боже мій, навіщо?!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DANS_MON_ANCIENNE_VIE_ELLE_M_I_E20F5A"
msgid "Dans mon ancienne vie elle m’ignorait toutes et à présent je suis au centre de l’attention."
msgstr "У моєму попередньому житті вона ігнорувала мене, а тепер я стала центром уваги."

#. Character:`narrator` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_N_Y_RIEN_COMPRENDRE_EB1E54"
msgid "C’est à n’y rien comprendre !"
msgstr "Це просто незрозуміло!"

#. TRANSLATORS: # CG: Asami par la fenetre Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HEY_DEBOUT_LA_MARMOTTE_274F61"
msgid "Hey ! Debout, la marmotte !"
msgstr "Гей! Вставай, білка!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MMH_ENCORE_CINQ_MINUTES_164172"
msgid "Mmh... encore cinq minutes..."
msgstr "Ммм... ще п’ять хвилин..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DIS_C_EST_NORMAL_QUE_J_AIE_TOU_160FE1"
msgid "Dis... c'est normal que j'aie toujours mal à la mâchoire ?"
msgstr "Емм... це нормально, що у мене постійно болить щелепа?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FAUT_QUE_J_AILLE_DEMANDER_NORI_60302B"
msgid "Faut que j'aille demander à {{noriko.n}} si ça lui fait ça aussi."
msgstr "Мені треба піти і спитати у {{noriko.n}}, чи трапляється з нею те саме."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OK_C_EST_BON_JE_SUIS_R_VEILL_4B919F"
msgid "Ok, c'est bon, je suis réveillé !"
msgstr "Гаразд, все гаразд, я прокинувся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DIS_TU_TAIS_OBLIG_E_DE_COMMENC_C56A1E"
msgid "Dis... tu étais obligée de commencer la conversation par ça ?"
msgstr "Емм... чи було обов’язково починати розмову саме з цього?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "HAHAHA_C_EST_TROP_CHOU_DE_TE_V_537C90"
msgid "Hahaha, c'est trop chou de te voir paniquer !"
msgstr "Хахаха, так мило бачити, як ти панікуєш!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CE_SOIR_ON_FAIT_QUELQUE_CHOSE_EC5B67"
msgid "Ce soir, on fait quelque chose d'encore plus fou ?"
msgstr "Цього вечора хочемо зробити щось ще більш божевільне?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PLUS_FOU_QU_HIER_SOIR_JE_NE_SA_0CF08F"
msgid "Plus fou qu'hier soir ? Je ne sais pas si mon cœur le supportera..."
msgstr "Більш божевільний, ніж вчора ввечері? Не знаю, чи витримає моє серце..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_HONN_TEMENT_J_AI_DU_MA_1EF7E1"
msgid "Et puis, honnêtement, j'ai du mal à imaginer ce qui pourrait être encore plus fou qu'hier soir."
msgstr "І, чесно кажучи, мені важко уявити, що могло б бути ще більш божевільним, ніж вчора ввечері."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_AS_VU_CE_QUE_A_DONNE_AVEC_D_A8C4E5"
msgid "Tu as vu ce que ça donne avec deux femmes ?"
msgstr "Ти бачив, що виходить, коли дві жінки..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALORS_IMAGINE_AVEC_TROIS_781A68"
msgid "Alors imagine avec trois !"
msgstr "То уявіть собі, якщо їх буде три!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_NE_M_AURAS_PAS_CETTE_FOIS_6A48F2"
msgid "Tu ne m'auras pas cette fois..."
msgstr "Цього разу ти мене не обдуриш..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PFFFF_84D96A"
msgid "Pffff..."
msgstr "Пфффф..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_SI_TU_ME_LAISSAIS_CHOISIR_L_CA0E34"
msgid "Et si tu me laissais choisir le programme pour toi ce soir ?"
msgstr "А що, якби ти дозволила мені вибрати програму для нас сьогодні ввечері?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_TOI_QUI_FAIS_LA_SURPRISE_FEC8BB"
msgid "C'est toi qui fais la surprise ?"
msgstr "Це ти готуєш сюрприз?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "G_NIAL_QU_EST_CE_QUE_TU_AS_PR_D0CC5A"
msgid "Génial !! Qu'est-ce que tu as prévu ?"
msgstr "Чудово!! Що ти плануєш робити?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SI_JE_TE_LE_DIS_A_N_EN_SERA_PL_E4635E"
msgid "Si je te le dis, ça n'en sera plus une..."
msgstr "Якщо я тобі це скажу, це вже не буде просто „однією з речей“..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OHHH_MAIS_ALLEZ_JE_VAIS_FAIRE_CD3DBD"
msgid "Ohhh, mais allez ! Je vais faire quoi pendant ce temps-là, moi ?"
msgstr "Ох, ну боже мій! А що ж мені робити в цей час?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_C_EST_TON_PROBL_ME_MOI_JE_D_D973D1"
msgid "Ça, c'est ton problème, moi je dois aller travailler !"
msgstr "Це твоя проблема, а мені треба йти на роботу!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TANT_PIS_JE_VAIS_ALLER_VOIR_NO_6F7B6D"
msgid "Tant pis, je vais aller voir {{noriko.n}}, on va débriefer « tu sais quoi »."
msgstr "Ну що ж, я піду поговорити з {{noriko.n}}, ми обговоримо це „знаєш що“."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_JE_SUIS_CURIEUSE_MOI_AUSSI_A6B5F9"
msgid "Oh, je suis curieuse moi aussi ! Je peux participer au débrief ?"
msgstr "О, я теж дуже цікавлюся! Чи можу я взяти участь у аналізі ситуації?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AVEC_PLAISIR_7FA131"
msgid "Avec plaisir !"
msgstr "З радістю!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VOULAIS_CR_ER_UN_MOMENT_INO_98AEAF"
msgid "Je voulais créer un moment inoubliable avec {{saito.n}} et, comme j'avais un peu peur, j'ai demandé de l'aide à {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Я хотіла створити незабутній момент з {{saito.n}}, і оскільки трохи боялася, попросила допомоги у {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_MAIS_TU_AURAIS_D_ME_DEMANDE_80B957"
msgid "Oh, mais tu aurais dû me demander, je me serais faite un plaisir de t'aider !"
msgstr "О, але тобі слід було спитати мене – я б з радістю допомогла тобі!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VRAIMENT_BB0BF1"
msgid "Vraiment ?!"
msgstr "Справді?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AU_SECOURS_CBA935"
msgid "Au secours..."
msgstr "Допоможіть..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QU_AVEZ_VOUS_FAIT_DU_COUP_53590D"
msgid "Qu'avez-vous fait, du coup ?"
msgstr "Що ви взагалі зробили?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "EH_BIEN_ON_A_87DDA7"
msgid "Eh bien, on a..."
msgstr "Ну, ми..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_STOP_J_AIMERAIS_BIEN_AVOIR_11A605"
msgid "Bon, stop ! J'aimerais bien avoir un peu d'intimité."
msgstr "Гаразд, досить! Я б хотіла мати трохи приватності."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "D_SOL_E_MON_CH_RI_POUR_UNE_FOI_879BC6"
msgid "Désolée, mon chéri, pour une fois qu'il se passe quelque chose d'intéressant."
msgstr "Вибач, коханий, адже коли нарешті трапляється щось цікаве..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VOUS_ENVIE_TELLEMENT_F076E1"
msgid "Je vous envie tellement..."
msgstr "Я так вам заздрю..."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "SI_VOUS_VOULEZ_PASSONS_LA_JOUR_5B874D"
msgid "Si vous voulez, passons la journée ensemble !"
msgstr "Якщо хочете, давайте проведемо цілий день разом!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_PLEIN_D_ANECDOTES_INT_RES_74AE45"
msgid "J'ai plein d'anecdotes intéressantes sur {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "У мене є багато цікавих анекдотів про {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TOUTES_CES_CHOSES_DONT_VOUS_N_288F44"
msgid "Toutes ces choses dont vous n'êtes pas au courant !"
msgstr "Усі ці речі, про які ви нічого не знаєте!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VRAIMENT_CE_SERA_AVEC_PLAISIR_ACA8AF"
msgid "Vraiment ?! Ce sera avec plaisir ! Tu es d'accord, {{saito.n}} ?"
msgstr "Справді?! Буду рада це зробити! Ти згодна, {{saito.n}}?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QU_EST_CE_QUE_TU_EN_DIS_MON_CH_3753E8"
msgid "Qu'est-ce que tu en dis, mon chéri ?"
msgstr "Що думаєш, коханий мій?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PARTIR_DU_MOMENT_O_ELLE_S_EST_2B99E7"
msgid "À partir du moment où elle s'est décidée pour quelque chose, impossible de revenir en arrière."
msgstr "Як тільки вона приймає рішення щодо чогось, вже неможливо повернутися назад."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DE_TOUTE_FA_ON_PARTIR_DU_MOMEN_018FB7"
msgid "De toute façon, à partir du moment où son historique web a été dévoilé, il n'a plus grand-chose à cacher..."
msgstr "У будь-якому разі, після того як була розголошена інформація про його історію використання Інтернету, йому вже немає чого приховувати..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_SANG_POURQUOI_FAUT_IL_TOUJ_98DC21"
msgid "Bon sang ! Pourquoi faut-il toujours que tu ramènes tout à ça ?"
msgstr "Боже мій! Чому ти завжди повертаєшся до цього?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_AU_TRAIN_O_VONT_LES_CH_698DC0"
msgid "Et puis, au train où vont les choses... on accueillera bientôt {{asami.n}} dans la famille."
msgstr "І, враховуючи тенденції сьогодення... незабаром ми приймемо {{asami.n}} в нашу родину."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VOUS_EN_TES_D_J_CE_STADE_EF9A5F"
msgid "Vous en êtes déjà à ce stade ?!"
msgstr "Ви вже дійшли до такого етапу?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUEL_STADE_B0AAA3"
msgid "Quel stade ?"
msgstr "Який стадіон?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "A_SE_POURRAIT_BIEN_CBD285"
msgid "Ça se pourrait bien !"
msgstr "Цілком можливо!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ASAMI_N_AUJOURD_HUI_TU_ES_AVE_82E845"
msgid "{{asami.n}}, aujourd'hui tu es avec moi, nous avons plein de choses dont nous devons discuter !"
msgstr "{{asami.n}}, сьогодні ти зі мною, у нас є багато речей, про які потрібно поговорити!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_JE_SENS_QUE_A_VA_TRE_FUN_B28570"
msgid "Oh, je sens que ça va être fun."
msgstr "О, я відчуваю, що це буде весело."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TRAVAILLE_BIEN_8ACD13"
msgid "Travaille bien !"
msgstr "Удачі в роботі!"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QUOI_J_ADORE_TA_CHAMBR_7E46AB"
msgid "Tu sais quoi ? J'adore ta chambre, mais..."
msgstr "Знаєш що? Мені дуже подобається твоя кімната, але..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_125036"
msgid "Mais ?"
msgstr "Але?"

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MAIS_JE_PENSE_QU_ELLE_POURRAIT_D7A318"
msgid "Mais je pense qu'elle pourrait être mieux."
msgstr "Але я думаю, що вона могла б бути кращою."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MIEUX_COMMENT_A_MIEUX_09EE46"
msgid "Mieux ?! Comment ça, mieux ?"
msgstr "Краще?! Що маєш на увазі, краще?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_PENSE_QU_ELLE_A_BESOIN_DE_V_42D27A"
msgid "Je pense qu'elle a besoin de voir des choses encore jamais vues..."
msgstr "Я думаю, їй потрібно побачити те, чого вона ніколи раніше не бачила..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OOOH_CE_GENRE_DE_CHOSES_8E74BE"
msgid "Oooh... Ce genre de choses..."
msgstr "Ооо... Такі речі..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ESSAIE_DE_NE_PAS_ALERTER_TOUT_3B94B8"
msgid "Essaie de ne pas alerter tout le quartier non plus, cette fois-ci."
msgstr "Цього разу спробуй також не привертати уваги всього району."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`pouting`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "W_JE_NE_TE_PROMETS_RIEN_CE_N_F2844E"
msgid "...[w] Je ne te promets rien ! Ce n'est pas ma faute si ton truc fait la taille de mon avant-bras."
msgstr "...[w] Я нічого не обіцяю! Це не моя вина, що твій предмет розміром з мій передпліччя."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_PUIS_NORIKO_N_S_EST_ABSENT_61FD77"
msgid "Et puis {{noriko.n}} s'est absentée et {{yasuka.n}} est même sortie pour nous permettre d'avoir un moment pour nous."
msgstr "А потім {{noriko.n}} відійшла, а {{yasuka.n}} навіть вийшла, щоб дати нам можливість побути наодинці."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "RIEN_VOIR_AVEC_MA_M_RE_QUI_COU_F716C5"
msgid "Rien à voir avec ma mère qui écoute aux portes !"
msgstr "Це зовсім не схоже на мою маму, яка постійно прислуховується за дверима!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`nude,happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DANS_CE_CAS_IL_EST_TEMPS_DE_SE_81FE62"
msgid "Dans ce cas, il est temps de se mettre au travail."
msgstr "У такому випадку настав час приступати до роботи."

#. Character:`asami` | Attributes:`nude,happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TOUT_FAIT_83437A"
msgid "Tout à fait !"
msgstr "Звісно!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "C_EST_QUOI_CETTE_NOUVELLE_POSI_D56723"
msgid "C'est quoi cette nouvelle position ?!"
msgstr "Що це за нова позиція?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_NE_SAIS_PAS_MAIS_J_AIMERAIS_84CBB4"
msgid "Je ne sais pas, mais j'aimerais bien toutes les tester avec toi."
msgstr "Не знаю, але дуже хотів би спробувати всі їх разом з тобою."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CA_RISQUE_DE_PRENDRE_NORMEMENT_0F5A34"
msgid "Ça risque de prendre énormement de temps, tu en es conscient ?"
msgstr "Це може зайняти дуже багато часу, ти усвідомлюєш це?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_EN_AI_BIEN_PEUR_C_EST_UN_PRO_C339D6"
msgid "J'en ai bien peur. C'est un probleme ?"
msgstr "Боюсь, що так. Це проблема?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AU_CONTRAIRE_1EC0C5"
msgid "Au contraire..."
msgstr "Навпаки..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_BON_SANG_QU_EST_874B79"
msgid "[font_size=14]Bon sang... Qu'est-ce qu'elle fout là celle-là ?![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Боже мій... Що вона тут робить?! [/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "UN_PROBLEME_887F94"
msgid "Un probleme ?"
msgstr "Проблема?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_NON_JUSTE_LAISSE_MOI_TIRER_74FF50"
msgid "Non, non, juste... Laisse moi tirer le rideau..."
msgstr "Ні, ні, просто... Дозволь мені зітхнути..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TROP_DE_T_MOINS_53077E"
msgid "Trop de témoins ?"
msgstr "Занадто багато свідків?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_ME_SENT_PLUS_TRANQUILLE_COM_867639"
msgid "Je me sens plus tranquille comme ça !"
msgstr "Так я почуваюся більш спокійною!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ALLEZ_ON_CHANGE_509BB5"
msgid "Allez on change !"
msgstr "Ходімо, змінимо тему!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ON_CHANGE_QUOI_70D944"
msgid "On change quoi ?"
msgstr "Що потрібно змінити?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_AS_BESOIN_QUE_JE_TE_FASSE_U_034616"
msgid "Tu as besoin que je te fasse un dessin ?"
msgstr "Тобі потрібно, щоб я намалювала тобі малюнок?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AURAIS_JAMAIS_PENS_PRENDRE_M_57D355"
msgid "J'aurais jamais pensé prendre mon pied comme ça !"
msgstr "Ніколи б не подумала, що можна отримати настільки багато задоволення в такий спосіб!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MOI_NON_PLUS_81EDDE"
msgid "Moi non plus..."
msgstr "Я теж не..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QUE_SI_ON_DOIT_FAIRE_T_8243FA"
msgid "Tu sais que si on doit faire toutes les positions avec ces deux variations, ça nous en fait deux fois plus ?"
msgstr "Ти ж знаєш, що якщо нам доведеться виконувати всі позиції з цими двома варіаціями, то їх кількість подвоїться, чи не так?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_DONC_TU_TE_D_FILES_B8A93A"
msgid "Et donc tu te défiles ?"
msgstr "То ти просто втікаєш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JAMAIS_DE_LA_VIE_DAB816"
msgid "Jamais de la vie !"
msgstr "Ніколи в житті!"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_SAIS_QUE_SI_ON_INVITE_NORIK_8A5196"
msgid "Tu sais que si on invite {{noriko.n}} à nous rejoindre ça fait encore plus de possibilités."
msgstr "Ти ж знаєш, що якщо ми запросимо {{noriko.n}} приєднатися до нас, це розширить наші можливості ще більше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUAND_TU_ES_COMME_A_JE_NE_SAIS_3C524B"
msgid "Quand tu es comme ça, je ne sais jamais si tu es sérieuse ou pas."
msgstr "Коли ти така, я ніколи не знаю, серйозна ти чи ні."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "H_H_C_EST_VOULU_9ACC9F"
msgid "Héhé ! C'est voulu !"
msgstr "Хе-хе! Це було зроблено навмисно!"

#. TRANSLATORS: # SEX SCENE TIMELAPS Character:`asami` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BON_JE_CROIS_QUE_J_AI_EU_MA_DO_59E518"
msgid "Bon, je crois que j'ai eu ma dose pour le moment..."
msgstr "Ну, гадаю, на цей час мені вже досить..."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_EN_PROFITER_POUR_ME_RE_7C9A99"
msgid "Je vais en profiter pour me reposer ici."
msgstr "Я скористаюся нагодою, щоб відпочити тут."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "DANS_MON_LIT_C34A0E"
msgid "Dans mon lit ?"
msgstr "У моїй ліжку?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "IL_Y_A_TON_ODEUR_7332A0"
msgid "Il y a ton odeur..."
msgstr "Від тебе такий запах..."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`everyday`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "D_ACCORD_A_TE_D_RANGERAIT_PAS_ED2E7F"
msgid "D'accord... Ça te dérangerait pas si j'en profitais pour faire quelques courses de mon côté ?"
msgstr "Гаразд... Чи заважало б тобі, якби я скористався цією нагодою, щоб сходити за покупками?"

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PAS_DU_TOUT_TANT_QUE_TU_REVIEN_F0D4D8"
msgid "Pas du tout, tant que tu reviens vite !"
msgstr "Зовсім не обов’язково, головне – щоб ти швидко повернувся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_VAIS_ALLER_VOIR_UN_AMI_JE_N_635BA6"
msgid "Je vais aller voir un ami, je n'en aurai pas pour longtemps, c'est promis."
msgstr "Я збираюся зайти до друга, не затримаюся довго, обіцяю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "REPOSE_TOI_BIEN_421F67"
msgid "Repose-toi bien."
msgstr "Відпочивай добре."

#. Character:`asami`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OH_QUE_OUI_PAS_LA_PEINE_DE_ME_C74291"
msgid "Oh que oui, pas la peine de me le dire deux fois."
msgstr "О, звісно, немає потреби казати мені це двічі."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`excited`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "BAH_ALORS_ELLE_N_EST_PAS_L_ASA_F50C90"
msgid "Bah alors ? Elle n’est pas là, {{asami.n}} ?"
msgstr "Ну і що з того? Вона ж не тут, {{asami.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_PAS_CE_SOIR_ELLE_PASSE_DU_7E156A"
msgid "Non, pas ce soir, elle passe du temps avec sa mère."
msgstr "Ні, не сьогодні ввечері – вона проводить час зі своєю мамою."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`disgusted`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PFFF_C_EST_M_ME_PAS_DR_LE_4EDBAB"
msgid "Pfff... c’est même pas drôle."
msgstr "Пфф... Це навіть не смішно."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OK_SI_TU_LE_DIS_9F1994"
msgid "Ok... si tu le dis..."
msgstr "Гаразд... якщо ти так кажеш..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "MON_CH_RI_A_TE_D_RANGE_PAS_SI_55D673"
msgid "Mon chéri... ça te dérange pas si je dors avec toi cette nuit ?"
msgstr "Мій коханий... ти не проти, якщо я переночую з тобою сьогодні ввечері?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_ME_SENTIRAIS_MOINS_ANXIEUSE_C674CE"
msgid "Je me sentirais moins anxieuse."
msgstr "Я б почувалася менш тривожною."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_BIEN_S_R_AUCUN_PROBL_ME_52AF41"
msgid "Oui, bien sûr, aucun problème !"
msgstr "Так, звісно, жодних проблем!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "TU_ES_UN_AMOUR_EBB053"
msgid "Tu es un amour !"
msgstr "Ти справжній ангел!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "CA_NE_D_RANGERA_PAS_ASAMI_N_DD33DA"
msgid "Ça ne dérangera pas {{asami.n}} ?"
msgstr "Це не завадить {{asami.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`guilty`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NON_ON_A_PAS_DU_TOUT_CE_GENRE_818CDB"
msgid "Non... On n'a pas du tout ce genre de relation, c'est simplement une amie."
msgstr "Ні... У нас зовсім не такі стосунки; вона просто моя подруга."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_C_EST_PARCE_QUE_E94685"
msgid "[font_size=14]C'est parce que tu es trop aveugle pour t'en rendre compte ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Це тому, що ти занадто сліпа, щоб це усвідомити![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "NE_L_COUTE_PAS_VOUS_AVEZ_TOUT_C2A3CA"
msgid "Ne l'écoute pas, vous avez tout le temps devant vous."
msgstr "Не слухайте його, у вас є всій час перед собою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "PROMIS_JE_NE_DIRAI_RIEN_ASAMI_B6868F"
msgid "Promis, je ne dirai rien à {{asami.n}}, ça reste entre nous deux !"
msgstr "Обіцяю, я нічому не розповім {{asami.n}}, це залишиться між нами двома!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "FONT_SIZE_14_MOI_JE_LUI_RACON_0CB335"
msgid "[font_size=14]Moi je lui raconterai tout ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Я їй все розкажу![font_size=14]"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_SUIS_SUR_QU_ELLE_PLAISANTE_8E303F"
msgid "Je suis sûre qu'elle plaisante, ne t'en fais pas."
msgstr "Я впевнена, що вона просто жартує, не хвилюйся."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_saito_room.dialogue
msgctxt "VOUS_PASSEZ_LA_NUIT_AVEC_YASUK_0E7284"
msgid "Vous passez la nuit avec {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "Ви проводите ніч з {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_b881d841"
msgid "Je ferais mieux d'aller dormir."
msgstr "Я краще піду посплю."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3a599c5f"
msgid "Je sens que quelqu'un est très excité."
msgstr "Здається, хтось схвильований."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d6516fa2"
msgid "Euh..."
msgstr "Е-е..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2247e873"
msgid "Hihi, je parlais de moi !"
msgstr "Хе-хе. Я говорила про себе!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_06578e92"
msgid "Alors ? Tu as envie de quoi ce soir ?"
msgstr "І що? Чим хочеш зайнятися сьогодні ввечері?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc44c37b2d6"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t17276d5bed"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t883c43b7cd"
msgid "Spooning"
msgstr "Обіймашки"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0423ea197e"
msgid "Missionary"
msgstr "Місіонерська"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2f5560a78f"
msgid "Sexe avec {{yasuka.n}}"
msgstr "Секс з {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb09c6ff4b8"
msgid "La laisser dormir."
msgstr "Дати їй поспати"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_sleeping_5775cedd"
msgid "Il est tard, je ferais mieux de la laisser se reposer."
msgstr "Уже пізно, краще дам їй відпочити."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ta0ddccc070"
msgid "Quelqu'un voulait un peu de tendresse ce soir ?"
msgstr "Хтось хоче бути затисканим сьогодні?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8b5696d616"
msgid "Pas seulement ce soir... J'en voudrais tous les jours."
msgstr "Не тільки сьогодні... Я хочу щоб це було щодня."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te47f666780"
msgid "Et encore plus si cela vient de toi."
msgstr "І тим більше коли це робиш ти."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t1936b5aafb"
msgid "Alors viens mon chéri."
msgstr "Тоді йди до мене, любий."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t839da3351d"
msgid "Hmmm."
msgstr "Мммммм."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tb80883c431"
msgid "Je suis si heureuse !"
msgstr "Я такий щасливий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t776f1b292d"
msgid "Oui c'est parfait."
msgstr "Так, це прекрасно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tc2cef3a190"
msgid "Juste comme ça..."
msgstr "Так, ось так..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "te824b1b295"
msgid "Mon chéri, je sens que ça vient !"
msgstr "Любий, я відчуваю що скоро кінчу!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t257a32ac70"
msgid "Oh ouiii !"
msgstr "Ох тааак!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "td5a137123a"
msgid "Mon dieu... Tu es toujours aussi incroyable."
msgstr "Боже мій... ти як завжди неперевершений."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t8c416a4d99"
msgid "J'ai beau être restée allongée, je suis épuisée."
msgstr "Я вже виснажений. Хоча просто лежав."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tba3ef1f831"
msgid "La prochaine fois ce sera à mon tour de me laisser faire."
msgstr "Наступного разу я візьму ініціативу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2695116478"
msgid "Pourquoi pas..."
msgstr "Чом би й ні..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t310ee9fa6e"
msgid "J'ai passé une merveilleuse nuit avec toi."
msgstr "Я провів чудову ніч з тобою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "tf257c0882b"
msgid "Passe une très bonne journée mon amour."
msgstr "Гарного дня, любий."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_44ad9d1b"
msgid "Tu as passé une bonne journée mon chéri ?"
msgstr "Як пройшов твій день, любий?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_5b69bfb5"
msgid "Je ne te cache pas que je suis un peu épuisé."
msgstr "Чесно кажучи, я трохи виснажений."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e0f53a66"
msgid "Désolé si je souris, mais...[w] Bienvenue dans le monde du travail."
msgstr "Вибач, що посміхаюся, але...[w] Ласкаво просимо у світ праці."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b14bf260"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_9957e2d0"
msgid "Allez, je voulais juste te taquiner !"
msgstr "Та годі, я просто хотіла тебе подражнити!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_108d9c55"
msgid "Allonge-toi à côté de la vieille femme que je suis."
msgstr "Лягай поруч зі старою, якою я є."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3b8993b4"
msgid "Vieille ?"
msgstr "Старою?"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_1aedc676"
msgid "Arrête de dire des bêtises, tu es magnifique."
msgstr "Не говори дурниць. Ти прекрасна."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_bc73fee0"
msgid "Si je ne te connaissais pas, je te donnerais entre 25 et 28 ans."
msgstr "Якби я тебе не знав, то сказав би, що тобі від 25 до 28 років."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b0bff4f1"
msgid "Oh... Je ne m'attendais pas à ça."
msgstr "О-о... Я не очікувала цього."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_89088db8"
msgid "Tu es si gentil."
msgstr "Ти такий милий."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_05b32477"
msgid "Ce n'est pas de la gentillesse, juste un fait."
msgstr "Це не мило. Це просто факт."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_221874e5"
msgid "Merci..."
msgstr "Дякую..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_7301a7a0"
msgid "Dis...[w] Tu veux bien me parler de toi ?"
msgstr "Скажи...[w] Розкажи мені більше про себе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4d62792e"
msgid "Comment ça ?"
msgstr "А?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b5e61368"
msgid "Je veux savoir... Ce que tu fais, qui sont tes amis, à quoi tu penses..."
msgstr "Я хочу знати... Що ти робиш, хто твої друзі, про що ти думаєш..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_deb52b8b"
msgid "Quelles sont les difficultés que tu rencontres au quotidien."
msgstr "На які труднощі натрапляєш щодня..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a3b4ecab"
msgid "Est-ce que {{noriko.n}} est toujours aussi dure avec toi ?"
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} завжди така сувора до тебе?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_6e89e86b"
msgid "Quoi, tu étais au courant ?"
msgstr "Що, ти знала про це?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a085624b"
msgid "{{saito.n}}... Je suis sa mère, je ne suis pas aveugle."
msgstr "{{saito.n}}...Я її мати. Не сліпа."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b0076dcb"
msgid "Elle se donne une image de fille gentille aux premiers abords, mais je sais que parfois, elle peut se montrer plutôt cruelle."
msgstr "На перший погляд, вона вдає із себе милу дівчину, але я знаю, що іноді вона може бути досить жорстокою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_582d7d51"
msgid "Je suis sincèrement désolé de ce qu'elle t'a fait subir..."
msgstr "Я щиро шкодую про все, що вона тобі зробила..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_6579c4f9"
msgid "Bin merde alors..."
msgstr "Що ж, чорт..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3b776a61"
msgid "Si je m'attendais à ça."
msgstr "Я цього не очікував."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_fc457694"
msgid "Elle savait tout."
msgstr "Вона знала про все."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_642d9acc"
msgid "Si tu savais tout de ce qu'elle me faisait subir, pourquoi n'as-tu rien fait ?"
msgstr "Якщо ти знала про все те, що вона зі мною робила, чому ти нічого не зробила?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_fe37300d"
msgid "{{noriko.n}}... a toujours eu des rapports compliqués avec les hommes."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}}... завжди мала складні стосунки з чоловіками."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e65d0dea"
msgid "Elle n'a jamais connu son père qui de toute façon ne l'a jamais voulu."
msgstr "Вона ніколи не знала свого батька, який ніколи не хотів її."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_770a3352"
msgid "Je crois qu'en grandissant, elle a développé une sorte d'aversion envers les garçons."
msgstr "Думаю, у неї з'явилася якась відраза до хлопчиків, коли вона виросла."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2b43b7a4"
msgid "Je vois... Je commence à comprendre."
msgstr "Зрозуміло... Починаю розуміти."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e72af3a2"
msgid "J'espérais qu'avec le temps, tu arrives à... l'apprivoiser."
msgstr "Сподівався, з часом тобі вдасться... помиритися з нею."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d2fd49b2"
msgid "Lui faire comprendre que tous les hommes ne sont pas prêts à l'abandonner."
msgstr "Допоможи їй зрозуміти, що не всі чоловіки можуть так швидко її покинути."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_061eb3a0"
msgid "Que certains peuvent être fiables."
msgstr "Що деяким можна довіряти."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4eedabe8"
msgid "...Dernièrement, les choses ont évolué."
msgstr "...Останнім часом усе змінилося."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_746fa107"
msgid "Vraiment ? Dis-moi tout !"
msgstr "Справді? Розкажи мені все!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_dd4adafd"
msgid "J'arrive à communiquer avec elle, sans insultes, sans agressions."
msgstr "Мені вдалося поспілкуватися з нею без образ і агресії."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_8a29e03a"
msgid "L'autre jour, elle s'est même inquiétée pour moi."
msgstr "Одного разу вона навіть хвилювалася за мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_72cf0c29"
msgid "Oooh, je suis si contente !"
msgstr "О-о, я така щаслива!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_41a055d7"
msgid "Je ne sais pas ce que tu as fait, mais tes efforts semblent avoir payé."
msgstr "Я не знаю, що ти зробив, але твої зусилля, здається, окупилися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_24b785a0"
msgid "Je crois..."
msgstr "Здається, так..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e521ea80"
msgid "Je suis certaine que tu pourras l'aider à ouvrir son cœur."
msgstr "Я вірю, ти зможеш допомогти їй відкрити своє серце."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2d17f020"
msgid "Tu crois ?"
msgstr "Ти так думаєш?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_eb9101dc"
msgid "Crois-en l'intuition féminine."
msgstr "Довірся жіночій інтуїції."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_928cd497"
msgid "Je sais que tu en fais déjà beaucoup pour moi... Hmmm... Non, pour nous."
msgstr "Я знаю, ти вже багато для мене робиш... Гм... Ні, для нас."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2950f4ca"
msgid "Mais aide {{noriko.n}}, j'aimerais la voir heureuse de nouveau."
msgstr "Але {{noriko.n}}, не міг би ти допомогти їй? Я хочу знову побачити її щасливою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_79a790cc"
msgid "Je compte sur toi."
msgstr "Я розраховую на тебе."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e00e4ad1"
msgid "Tu es un peu son seul espoir."
msgstr "Ти її єдина надія."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ce380db5"
msgid "Si je réussis, j'aurais droit à une récompense ?"
msgstr "Якщо мені вдасться, я матиму право на винагороду?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a3ac8c51"
msgid "Si tu es réussi... Tu pourras me demander ce que tu veux."
msgstr "Якщо тобі вдасться... Я дозволю тобі запитати мене про все, що ти захочеш."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a3cf3d5b"
msgid "Tout ce que je veux ?"
msgstr "Усе, що захочу?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e134188a"
msgid "Bien sûr ! Il faut une récompense à la hauteur de la mission."
msgstr "Звісно! Нагорода має бути гідною місії."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_c3258ac4"
msgid "Mais... Quand tu dis tout ce que je veux... Tu veux dire... Tout ce que je veux ?"
msgstr "Але... Коли ти кажеш те, що я захочу... Тобто... Усе, що я захочу?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_16595d74"
msgid "Je croyais pourtant avoir été clair."
msgstr "Я думала, що висловилася досить чітко."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_00566add"
msgid "Je ne sais pas ce qui se trame de ton esprit à cet instant, mais tant que c'est dans mes cordes."
msgstr "Я не знаю, про що ти зараз думаєш, але поки я можу це зробити..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_22f8cc02"
msgid "Je le ferai."
msgstr "Я зроблю."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b14bf260_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e4535e7b"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "Боже мій..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a837157c"
msgid "Est-ce que je dois comprendre qu'il y a un sous-entendu ?"
msgstr "Я правильно розумію, на що вона натякає?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_fb6ba617"
msgid "Que je pourrais demander vraiment tout ce que je veux ? Même..."
msgstr "Те, що я дійсно можу попросити все, що захочу? Навіть..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t497ebbd8ef"
msgid "Je ferai de mon mieux."
msgstr "Я зроблю все, що зможу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_561ca10f"
msgid "Je vois..."
msgstr "Зрозуміло..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_57e6339c"
msgid "Je verrai ce que je peux faire."
msgstr "Я подивлюсь, що зможу зробити."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f6e17b57"
msgid "Merci mon chéri !"
msgstr "Дякую, любий!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t89b7055883"
msgid "Ça va être compliqué"
msgstr "Це буде складно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_40b9fc80"
msgid "Oh, le temps passe si vite."
msgstr "Ох, час так швидко летить."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3581d58b"
msgid "On devrait vraiment prendre le temps de discuter plus souvent."
msgstr "Нам варто частіше спілкуватися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_c143bf96"
msgid "Oui... On devrait faire ça plus souvent."
msgstr "Так... Треба робити це частіше."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d066b4f5"
msgid "Alors, on remet ça demain !"
msgstr "Тож повторімо завтра!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_946802da"
msgid "Repose-toi bien."
msgstr "Відпочивай."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4da8d3db"
msgid "Héhé, je t'ai attendu toute la journée."
msgstr "Хе-хе, я чекала на тебе цілий день."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f8779a26"
msgid "Quoi ? Sur ce lit ?"
msgstr "Що? На ліжку?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_577a6383"
msgid "Toute la journée ?"
msgstr "Увесь день?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_46bd08b8"
msgid "Quoi ? Je n'avais pas le droit ?"
msgstr "Що? Мені не можна?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b724e69e"
msgid "Mais si, tu peux faire absolument tout ce que tu veux !"
msgstr "Звісно, що так. Ти можеш робити абсолютно все, що завгодно!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_1c45c4a6"
msgid "Alors... On s'était arrêté où hier ?"
msgstr "Отже... На чому ми зупинились учора?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_23a7dba8"
msgid "Tu m'avais donné pour mission de rendre heureuse {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Ти дала мені завдання зробити {{noriko.n}} знову щасливою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_634ea843"
msgid "Aujourd'hui, je répondrai à une de tes questions."
msgstr "Сьогодні я відповім на одне з твоїх запитань."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_5b64e6c6"
msgid "Alors, choisis bien !"
msgstr "Тож обирай добре!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_44c00809"
msgid "Vraiment, tu n'esquiveras pas, tu répondras honnêtement ?"
msgstr "Справді? Ти не будеш ухилятися і відповідатимеш чесно?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_656f5f81"
msgid "Dis donc toi ! Je vais me vexer si tu penses que je n'ai pas été honnête avec toi."
msgstr "Скажи це! Я ображуся, якщо ти вважатимеш, що я не була чесною з тобою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_fc4f6da3"
msgid "D'accord, d'accord... Voyons voir."
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд... Подивимось."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_5049b461"
msgid "Oh, je sais !"
msgstr "О, я знаю!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ebf19491"
msgid "Tu es une femme magnifique et..."
msgstr "Ти красива жінка, і..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2b73c348"
msgid "Et... ?"
msgstr "І?.."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_5b38d6c5"
msgid "Je ne comprends vraiment pas pourquoi tu n'as jamais retrouvé quelqu'un pour refaire ta vie."
msgstr "Я справді не розумію, чому ти так і не знайшла когось, з ким могла б почати все спочатку."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_c4ab69a3"
msgid "Oh, c'est..."
msgstr "О-о, це..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d1d92072"
msgid "Tu le penses vraiment ?"
msgstr "Ти справді так думаєш?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_c4a6c691"
msgid "Jamais je ne pourrais te mentir."
msgstr "Я б ніколи не збрехав тобі."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b154c698"
msgid "Tu es si gentil..."
msgstr "Ти такий милий..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d6026bac"
msgid "Très bien, je vais te le dire, mais tu devras garder ça pour toi."
msgstr "Гаразд, я скажу, але ти повинен тримати це при собі."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f638c76b"
msgid "De toute façon, je ne vois pas à qui je pourrais en parler."
msgstr "Я не знаю, з ким би я ще міг про це поговорити."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f51ebcc4"
msgid "N'en parle pas à {{noriko.n}} !"
msgstr "Не кажи {{noriko.n}}!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_0f954d6b"
msgid "Promis !"
msgstr "Обіцяю!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_edcbdaf1"
msgid "Tu ne te moqueras pas non plus ?"
msgstr "Ти теж не будеш сміятися?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_adb66523"
msgid "Quoi ? Mais bien sûr que non !"
msgstr "Що? Звичайно ні!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b8d7d070"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_eeeb8ff6"
msgid "Je n'en ai jamais parlé à personne, je garde ça en moi depuis des années."
msgstr "Я ніколи ні з ким про це не говорю. Я тримала це в собі роками."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b22b8025"
msgid "Ça remonte au temps de ma première fois."
msgstr "Це ще з тих часів, коли у мене був перший раз."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_585f49b9"
msgid "J'étais jeune et surtout bien trop naïve."
msgstr "Я була молода, а головне — надто наївною."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_7f5106a8"
msgid "Une simple conquête."
msgstr "Просте підкорення."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_9477f4ce"
msgid "C'est tout ce que j'étais pour lui."
msgstr "Це все, ким я була для нього."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_8e35f35a"
msgid "Nous l'avons fait une fois et il ne m'avait pas dit qu'il n'utilisait pas de protection."
msgstr "Ми робили це один раз, і він не сказав мені, що не користується ніякими засобами захисту."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ac57858a"
msgid "Le plus ironique dans l'histoire, c'est que ça n'a duré que quelques secondes..."
msgstr "А іронія в тому, що він протримався лише кілька секунд..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_6a124402"
msgid "...il s'est senti tellement honteux qu'il est parti à toute vitesse en me laissant toute seule."
msgstr "...Йому стало так соромно, що він втік, залишивши мене саму."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b043036b"
msgid "Il a vraiment fait ça ?"
msgstr "Він справді це зробив?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b9492ba5"
msgid "Partir sans se retourner, t'abandonner là comme ça ?"
msgstr "Втекти безоглядно, ось так кинути тебе?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a0a20f6d"
msgid "Mais quel sale type !"
msgstr "Який жахливий тип!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_5097b2e5"
msgid "Je suis ravie de voir la réaction que ça provoque en toi !"
msgstr "Я рада бачити таку реакцію від тебе!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a7a13acc"
msgid "Je crois que je t'ai bien élevée."
msgstr "Думаю, я добре тебе виховала."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_0dd2314a"
msgid "Que s'est-il passé ensuite ?"
msgstr "Що було далі?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_40b028ff"
msgid "Plusieurs mois se sont écoulés avant que je ne m'en rende compte."
msgstr "Минуло кілька місяців, перш ніж я це зрозуміла."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_9eea2820"
msgid "Et quand c'était enfin visible, il était trop tard."
msgstr "А коли це нарешті стало помітно, було вже занадто пізно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_43d86677"
msgid "Je suis retourné le voir, mais..."
msgstr "Я повернулася до нього, але..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9c9d9448bd"
msgid "Il n'a pas assumé..."
msgstr "Він не припускав..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3e12a6f4"
msgid "Non, en effet..."
msgstr "Ні, справді..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a81798e6"
msgid "Il s'est moqué de moi."
msgstr "Він сміявся з мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_20dea96b"
msgid "A répandu de sales rumeurs sur moi."
msgstr "Розпускав про мене брудні чутки."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_72a1f0cf"
msgid "Et n'a jamais voulu reconnaitre {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "І він ніколи не хотів визнати {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_bf2664c1"
msgid "Tout comme elle, je crois que j'ai un peu perdu foi dans la confiance que j'avais pour les hommes en général."
msgstr "Так само як і вона, я думаю, що трохи втратила віру в чоловіків взагалі."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4d7de276"
msgid "J'ai la trentaine passée."
msgstr "Мені трохи за тридцять."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_45736be8"
msgid "Je n'ai jamais vraiment eu de vraies relations avec un homme."
msgstr "І у мене ніколи не було справжніх стосунків з чоловіком."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_7f8bc214"
msgid "J'ai fini par me dire que c'était peine perdue."
msgstr "Зрештою, я сказала собі, що це буде марною тратою часу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_1b8639a4"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}}... Je suis tellement désolée..."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}}... Вибач мені..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e5a2045b"
msgid "Ce n'est rien... Je m'y suis fait à force."
msgstr "Нічого... Я вже звикла."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2c68c293"
msgid "Non ! Je refuse d'imaginer ça."
msgstr "Ні! Я відмовляюся це прийняти!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f821a857"
msgid "Il n'y a pas que {{noriko.n}} qui a le droit d'être heureuse."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} не єдина, хто заслуговує бути щасливою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_507761a5"
msgid "Toi aussi, tu y as droit."
msgstr "Ти теж."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_7f1701b4"
msgid "Tu es adorable, mais...[w] qui voudrait d'une femme âgée comme moi, inexpérimentée, avec déjà des enfants ?"
msgstr "Ти чарівний, але...[w] Кому потрібна така старенька, як я, недосвідчена, з дітьми?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_315a478c"
msgid "Je n'ai pas de travail sérieux, je suis criblée de dettes."
msgstr "Я не маю справжньої роботи, по вуха в боргах..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_9fc4e1ee"
msgid "Et..."
msgstr "І..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t4178cfcc4e"
msgid "Moi, je le voudrais."
msgstr "Я хотів би цього."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_8a987e3d"
msgid "Hein ?!"
msgstr "Га?!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_c4dcc652"
msgid "Tu n'as peut-être pas une bonne opinion de toi-même."
msgstr "Можливо, ти не дуже гарної думки про себе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f5e7863d"
msgid "Mais moi... Je ferai tout."
msgstr "Але я... Я зроблю все, що завгодно."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_420cf6a7"
msgid "Je remuerais le ciel et la terre pour être avec toi..."
msgstr "Я б перевернув небо і землю, щоб бути з тобою..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a6fc8bda"
msgid "Mais... mais... Je suis..."
msgstr "Але... але... Я..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f4900aaf"
msgid "Peu importe, c'est justement parce que je sais qui tu es que je suis prêt à tout ça pour toi."
msgstr "Це не має значення. Саме тому, що я знаю, хто ти, я готовий зробити це для тебе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_9668016a"
msgid "Donc ne pense plus du mal de toi."
msgstr "Тож не варто більше думати про себе так мало."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_43d259ec"
msgid "Tu as le droit au bonheur aussi."
msgstr "Ти теж маєш право бути щасливою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b8d7d070_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_90153983"
msgid "Je vais te laisser, je crois."
msgstr "Думаю, я піду."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_1cacd97c"
msgid "Tu as tellement ouvert ton cœur que j'ai machinalement fait la même chose."
msgstr "Ти так відкрила своє серце, що я зробив те саме, не задумуючись."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_8cdee1f8"
msgid "Tu... Tu pensais vraiment ce que tu disais ?"
msgstr "Ти... Ти справді мав на увазі те, що сказав?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_81107bda"
msgid "Pas une seule, fois, je ne t'ai menti."
msgstr "Я не збрехав тобі жодного разу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b8d7d070_2"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_c413821f"
msgid "Peu importe ce qui se passe ou ce que tu peux penser."
msgstr "Що б не сталося, або що ти не подумала..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_63d4de8b"
msgid "Je continuerai de te soutenir quoi qu'il arrive."
msgstr "Я буду підтримувати тебе, незважаючи ні на що."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_32b2f05a"
msgid "Je continuerai de soutenir cette famille quoi qu'il arrive."
msgstr "Я продовжуватиму підтримувати цю сім'ю, незважаючи ні на що."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_7f0c3a21"
msgid "Bonne nuit, {{yasuka.n}}."
msgstr "На добраніч, {{yasuka.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ad0f190c"
msgid "Je suis désolé pour {{noriko.n}}."
msgstr "Вибач за {{noriko.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_be3d4a87"
msgid "Elle a mal interprété ce qu'elle a vu hier soir et c'est retombé sur toi."
msgstr "Вона неправильно витлумачила те, що побачила вчора ввечері, і зірвалася на тебе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b9637cf6"
msgid "Elle m'a dit que je t'avais fait pleurer."
msgstr "Вона сказала, що ти плакала через мене."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f44c4b13"
msgid "C'est moi qui suis désolé."
msgstr "Це я маю вибачатися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ecf55fa6"
msgid "J'ai peut-être trop parlé."
msgstr "Можливо, я сказав забагато."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_28687696"
msgid "Non, non, ce n'est pas ça."
msgstr "Ні, ні, це не так."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_174cd0a0"
msgid "Hier, j'ai effectivement pleuré, mais ce n'était pas de tristesse."
msgstr "Учора я плакала, але не від смутку."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ea55a3a6"
msgid "J'étais tout simplement heureuse."
msgstr "Я була просто щаслива."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_bde62a83"
msgid "Heureuse de voir la personne que tu es devenu."
msgstr "Щаслива бачити, якою людиною ти став."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_08ce9b2c"
msgid "OH ! C'était donc ça !"
msgstr "О! Так ось воно що!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_8216ef71"
msgid "Tu penses toujours ce que tu m'as dit ?"
msgstr "Ти все ще маєш на увазі те, що сказав мені?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_11ea4cb1"
msgid "J'en ai fait l'expérience il y a quelque temps, mais..."
msgstr "Я пережив це нещодавно, але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ff19b2c3"
msgid "Un homme ne revient jamais sur sa parole !"
msgstr "Чоловік ніколи не відмовляється від свого слова!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b8d7d070_3"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_9fe06e3e"
msgid "Tu es sûr que tu ne t'ennuierais pas avec quelqu'un comme moi ?"
msgstr "Впевнений, що тобі не буде нудно з такою людиною, як я?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b1bd70a8"
msgid "Je veux dire... Je ne suis plus aussi jeune et intéressante que les filles de ton âge."
msgstr "Маю на увазі... Я вже не така молода і цікава, як дівчата твого віку."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ffedd335"
msgid "Arrête de te rabaisser constamment."
msgstr "Перестань постійно принижувати себе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_5f456ec1"
msgid "Je ne regretterai pas ce que j'ai dit."
msgstr "Я не пошкодую про свої слова."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_07085ee1"
msgid "Tu vas finir par me vexer si tu continues à vouloir me faire changer d'avis."
msgstr "Ти мене ще більше засмутиш, якщо будеш намагатися змінити мою думку."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_dfd645c3"
msgid "Pardon, pardon, je ne voulais pas."
msgstr "Вибач, вибач, я не хотіла."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_7860a760"
msgid "On fait quoi maintenant ?"
msgstr "Що ж нам тепер робити?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f49d4ad8"
msgid "Je ne sais pas à toi de me dire..."
msgstr "Я не знаю. Це ти мені скажи..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_8d09a51a"
msgid "Je... J'ai le cœur qui bat si vite, j'ai presque la tête qui tourne."
msgstr "Я... Моє серце б'ється так швидко, що голова йде обертом."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a568b2a3"
msgid "Tu veux que j'aille te chercher un verre d'eau ?"
msgstr "Хочеш, принесу склянку води?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a3b6483f"
msgid "Non, ce n'est pas de l'eau que je veux..."
msgstr "Ні, я не води хочу..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ea765d25"
msgid "Je veux...[w] juste..."
msgstr "Я просто...[w] хочу..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_ba84a983"
msgid "Woah, woah, woah..."
msgstr "Воу, воу, воу..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a044b610"
msgid "Je suis vraiment en train de faire ce que je suis en train de faire ?"
msgstr "Я справді роблю те, що роблю?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_582602ee"
msgid "Je suis bien en train d'embrasser {{yasuka.n}} ?"
msgstr "Я дійсно цілуюся з {{yasuka.n}}?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_31669b6b"
msgid "Ou plutôt, c'est elle qui m'embrasse..."
msgstr "Точніше, це вона мене цілує..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_503adf63"
msgid "Je... Je n'avais jamais emb-"
msgstr "Я... Я ніколи не цілу..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_12586825"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} et {{saito.n}} s'embrassèrent un long moment."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}} довго цілувала {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_0ae3a538"
msgid "C'est après plusieurs dizaines de minutes qu'elle se décida enfin à s'éloigner un peu."
msgstr "Лише через кілька десятків хвилин вона нарешті вирішила трохи відійти."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_76c10465"
msgid "Je suis désolée... Il faut croire que j'en avais terriblement envie."
msgstr "Вибач... Напевно, я дуже хотіла це зробити."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_61195119"
msgid "Ne t'excuse pas."
msgstr "Не треба вибачатися."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2345346c"
msgid "Tu n'étais pas la seule personne à en avoir envie."
msgstr "Ти не єдина, хто хотів цього."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2b779caf"
msgid "Que va dire {{noriko.n}} ?"
msgstr "А що скаже {{noriko.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3a924122"
msgid "J'ai déjà ma petite idée là-dessus, mais..."
msgstr "Я вже уявляю, але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2524f9b4"
msgid "Elle veut aussi que tu sois heureuse donc je pense qu'elle l'acceptera."
msgstr "Вона також хоче, щоб ти була щаслива, тому, думаю вона прийме це."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_33af8eed"
msgid "Sinon... On n'est pas obligé de lui dire non plus tout de suite."
msgstr "Але все ж... Ми не мусимо їй одразу казати."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_36ce393e"
msgid "Oui, tu as raison, ça peut attendre !"
msgstr "Так, твоя правда. Це може почекати!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2dfaa7fd"
msgid "Allez, sauve-toi avant qu'elle ne se doute de quelque chose !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, тікай, поки вона нічого не запідозрила!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4cf5b048"
msgid "Mais-"
msgstr "Але..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_880e4295"
msgid "Allez, ouste !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_b8d7d070_4"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_34af1194"
msgid "Tu m'attendais ?"
msgstr "Ти мене чекала?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d14927a5"
msgid "Oui."
msgstr "Так."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_573786bd"
msgid "Tu as réussi à dormir cette nuit ?"
msgstr "Ти добре спала минулої ночі?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_32233aa8"
msgid "Non, trop de choses qui se bousculaient dans ma tête."
msgstr "Ні, у мене в голові було занадто багато всього."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4ae3f849"
msgid "Et surtout, beaucoup trop d'émotions."
msgstr "А головне — забагато емоцій."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_a8100078"
msgid "Tu veux en parler ?"
msgstr "Хочеш поговорити про це?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2f371d33"
msgid "Non, je veux juste..."
msgstr "Ні, я просто хочу..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_535f178b"
msgid "Oh ! Pas de problème !"
msgstr "О! Без проблем!"

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4c57d503"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} et {{saito.n}} s'embrassèrent si longtemps qu'ils ne virent pas le temps passer."
msgstr "{{yasuka.n}} та {{saito.n}} цілувалися так довго, що втратили лік часу."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_d90def55"
msgid "Au bout d'un long moment, {{yasuka.n}} repoussa tendrement {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "Через довгий час {{yasuka.n}} ніжно відштовхнула {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_1a2d4fe8"
msgid "Quelque chose ne va pas ?"
msgstr "Щось не так?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_bfe6df0e"
msgid "Non, bien au contraire, tout va merveilleusement bien."
msgstr "Ні, навпаки. Усе йде чудово."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_595174cb"
msgid "C'est juste que si tu restes plus longtemps..."
msgstr "Просто, якщо ти залишишся надовше..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_95b96c46"
msgid "Oui ?"
msgstr "Так?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_3e0f96db"
msgid "Je... Je vais te sauter dessus."
msgstr "Я... Я стрибну на тебе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_aea38473"
msgid "...[w] Oh, je vois, en effet ça me parait très grave !"
msgstr "...[w] О-о, зрозуміло. Як на мене, це звучить дуже серйозно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_4a5bee05"
msgid "Je suis prêt à prendre le risque !"
msgstr "Я можу з цим жити!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_23f9e2f9"
msgid "Je... Je ne suis pas encore prête à franchir cette étape."
msgstr "Я... Я ще не готова зробити цей крок."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_49715a8d"
msgid "Peux-tu me laisser un peu de temps pour mettre en ordre ce que je ressens ?"
msgstr "Можеш дати мені трохи часу, щоб я прийшла до тями?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_2c652546_1"
msgid "Je comprends..."
msgstr "Я розумію..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_e146018d"
msgid "Prend le temps qu'il te faudra, je n'ai pas l'intention de te quitter."
msgstr "Не поспішай. Я не маю наміру залишати тебе."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_6b55cc5a"
msgid "Merci, d'être aussi compréhensif."
msgstr "Дякую за розуміння."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "talk_yasuka_f67258ad"
msgid "Bonne nuit, {{yasuka.n}} !"
msgstr "На добраніч, {{yasuka.n}}!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_71c529d8"
msgid "Tu as finalement pris ta décision ?"
msgstr "Ти вже прийняла рішення?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a0952f7e"
msgid "Oui, j'attendais d'avoir enfin l'esprit libre."
msgstr "Так, я чекала, коли нарешті зможу мати вільний розум."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6504c431"
msgid "Et tout ça est arrivé grâce à toi."
msgstr "І все це сталося завдяки тобі."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_33ae4f66"
msgid "Tu m'as rendu ma liberté."
msgstr "Ти повернув мені свободу."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ed65f2c7"
msgid "Et tellement plus encore."
msgstr "І багато чого іншого."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_024d5522"
msgid "Tu m'as rendue heureuse !"
msgstr "Ти зробив мене щасливою!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_07b6dccb"
msgid "Ne te sens pas obligée de faire ça pour moi parce que je t'ai aidé."
msgstr "Не відчувай себе зобов'язаною робити це для мене тільки тому, що я тобі допоміг."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_c0180c2d"
msgid "Même sans..."
msgstr "Навіть без цього..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`happy`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_096bf6d4"
msgid "Shhhhht ! Plus un mot, tu ne m'obliges à rien."
msgstr "Цить! Більше не слова. Ти мене ні до чого не зобов'язуєш."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_2840ef5a"
msgid "Justement, à partir d'aujourd'hui, je fais ce que je veux pour la première fois dans ma vie."
msgstr "Відтепер я можу робити те, що дійсно хочу, вперше в житті."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_e67bfc01"
msgid "Et qu'est-ce que tu veux ?"
msgstr "І що ти хочеш?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`moved`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6b12fcd4"
msgid "Je te veux en moi..."
msgstr "Я хочу тебе всередині себе..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_32248e78"
msgid "Je veux enfin pouvoir ressentir cet amour que tu dis avoir pour moi."
msgstr "Я хочу нарешті відчути ту любов, про яку ти говориш, що відчуваєш до мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_69c0919d"
msgid "Je ne suis plus la {{yasuka.n}} qui t'a élevée."
msgstr "Я більше не та {{yasuka.n}}, яка тебе виховувала."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_46383e76"
msgid "Je suis {{yasuka.n}}, la femme que tu as comblée et à qui tu vas faire l'amour."
msgstr "Я {{yasuka.n}}, жінка, яку ти наповнив щастям і з якою ти збираєшся зараз займатися коханням."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_535ff888"
msgid "Voilà ce que je veux."
msgstr "Це те, чого я хочу."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4a95a6b6"
msgid "Aucune pression !"
msgstr "Ніякого тиску!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_69f6d8d0"
msgid "Allez ! Rejoins-moi vite !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо! Приєднуйся до мене!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_1c0968a5"
msgid "Enfin.... Après toutes ces années."
msgstr "Нарешті .... Після стількох років."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_b2f511c3"
msgid "S'il te plait... Soit doux."
msgstr "Будь ласка... Будь ласкавим."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4bab01ff"
msgid "J'ai un peu peur."
msgstr "Я трохи боюся."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_9d7fb10a"
msgid "Tout va bien se passer, ne t'en fais pas."
msgstr "Усе буде добре, не хвилюйся."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_05ccb53c"
msgid "Ça te va comme ça ?"
msgstr "Так добре?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a2ece1df"
msgid "Mmhh, oui..."
msgstr "М-м-м, так..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_c4ab69a3"
msgid "Oh, c'est..."
msgstr "О-о, це..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_bb1597f2"
msgid "C'est parfait."
msgstr "Прекрасно."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ca068995"
msgid "Je vais accélérer un peu."
msgstr "Я трохи прискорюсь."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a9dad176"
msgid "D'accord."
msgstr "Добре."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_52864ba2"
msgid "Oh, oh, oh..."
msgstr "Ох, ох, ох..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_45c3efc7"
msgid "Un souci ?"
msgstr "Щось не так?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_00ba2a58"
msgid "Non, ne t'arrêtes surtout pas !"
msgstr "Ні, не зупиняйся!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_b6cbab73"
msgid "Oui, ouiii, comme ça !"
msgstr "Так, так, саме так!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_e39bd71e"
msgid "C'est trop bonnnn !"
msgstr "Це так файно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_26e61273"
msgid "Plus vite !"
msgstr "Швидше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6e73e668"
msgid "Oh, ouii !"
msgstr "ТАК"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6748d606"
msgid "Continues, continues !"
msgstr "Продовжуй, продовжуй!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_84cde651"
msgid "Oh, ça monte, ça monte !"
msgstr "Воно наближається!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_5273ee49"
msgid "Je vais jouir."
msgstr "Я кінчаю."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_65c4dcee"
msgid "S'il te plait embrasse-moi !"
msgstr "Поцілуй мене, будь ласка!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_fe7da786"
msgid "Ohhh, j'ai des frissons partout..."
msgstr "Боже мій, у мене мороз по шкірі."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_63a3d3e3"
msgid "C'était tellement bon !"
msgstr "Це так добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_56992702"
msgid "Laisse-moi reprendre un peu mon souffle."
msgstr "Дай мені перевести подих."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_1096b23c"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "Боже мій..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_376a7866"
msgid "Je t'en prie, appelle-moi juste {{saito.n}}."
msgstr "Будь ласка, називай мене {{saito.n}}."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_17b85ae6"
msgid "*Rires* Tu es bête."
msgstr "*Сміх* Дурник."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_257438e6"
msgid "Mais je suis si heureuse."
msgstr "Але я така щаслива."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_5cbbcc60"
msgid "Dire que j'ai attendu si longtemps pour quelque chose d'aussi fantastique."
msgstr "Подумати тільки, я так довго чекала на щось настільки фантастичне."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_2d5d9227"
msgid "Hey, je tiens à préciser que c'est fantastique parce que c'est avec moi !"
msgstr "Гей, хочу уточнити, що це було фантастично, бо було зі мною!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a47b78f6"
msgid "Oui, pardon mon chéri !"
msgstr "Так, звичайно, любий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4e7a255a"
msgid "Je pourrais y prendre goût, tu sais..."
msgstr "Знаєш, я могла б звикнути до цього..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_efb65060"
msgid "Tu risquerais de ne plus avoir un moment pour toi."
msgstr "Ти ризикуєш більше не мати часу на себе."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_8f9c55f3"
msgid "Je ne vois pas ça comme un problème en fait, mais plutôt comme une chance."
msgstr "Не бачу в цьому проблеми. Скоріше, як можливість."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_e97c5627"
msgid "Tant mieux !"
msgstr "Тим краще!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_59cd6e15"
msgid "Dis..."
msgstr "Гей..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_acb4819d"
msgid "J'ai envie d'essayer autre chose !"
msgstr "Я хочу спробувати щось ще!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_5095498f"
msgid "Dis-moi !"
msgstr "Скажи мені!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_fa8ce102"
msgid "Allonge-toi sur le dos !"
msgstr "Лягай на спину!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_49838c21"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Добре..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6c7fe877"
msgid "J'ai toujours voulu essayer cette position..."
msgstr "Завжди хотіла спробувати..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_e258426c"
msgid "Mais je me suis jamais imaginée le faire avec..."
msgstr "Але ніколи не уявляла, що буду робити це з..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_2e823751"
msgid "Moi ?"
msgstr "Зі мною?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_896a4cd9"
msgid "Non...[w] Avec un engin aussi...[w] massif !"
msgstr "Ні...[w] З чимось таким...[w] величезним!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_d8fc2980"
msgid "On va y aller doucement ne t'inquiète pas !"
msgstr "Не хвилюйся, все буде добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_fda0ca4b"
msgid "Mmmhhhh..."
msgstr "М-м-м-м-м"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_8e8ab8d9"
msgid "Je la sens tout au fond de moi."
msgstr "Я відчуваю його глибоко в собі."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_22e825df"
msgid "Et c'est comment ?"
msgstr "І як воно?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_8a0b5aa2"
msgid "C'est... tellement... agréable."
msgstr "Це... так... приємно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_d3265ab0"
msgid "Je la sens palpiter."
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як він пульсує."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_55b9c611"
msgid "Je... Je crois que je vais jouir !"
msgstr "Я... думаю, я зараз кінчу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4f6d6757"
msgid "Déjà ?"
msgstr "Уже?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4472e58e"
msgid "C'est... C'est ta faute, c'est trop... bon !"
msgstr "Це... твоя провина, це дуже... добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_05c3f8fd"
msgid "Hannnnn..."
msgstr "А-а-а-х-х-х"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ae02476f"
msgid "Dis...[w] C'est normal que tu sois encore aussi dur ?"
msgstr "То...[w] Це нормально, що він все ще такий твердий?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ea17b549"
msgid "Et toi, c'est normal que tu sois encore aussi excitée ?"
msgstr "А ти, це нормально, що ти досі так збуджена?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_3ff3d86f"
msgid "Je... Je ne sais pas."
msgstr "Я... Я не знаю."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a8b149e4"
msgid "Je veux juste continuer !"
msgstr "Я просто хочу продовжувати!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_90f34032"
msgid "Cette fois-ci, je vais essayer autre chose."
msgstr "Цього разу я спробую щось інше."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_29505e89"
msgid "Même pas une seconde de répit !"
msgstr "Ані секунди спокою!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_dcf1814a"
msgid "Mais soit !"
msgstr "Але добре, мені це подобається."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_1c9878f9"
msgid "Mon Dieu... Les sensations sont encore meilleures !"
msgstr "Боже мій... Відчуття ще кращі!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_2dc8976c"
msgid "J'ai l'impression que je pourrais jouir à tout moment."
msgstr "Я відчуваю, що можу кінчити будь-коли."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_212d391f"
msgid "Alors essaye d'aller plus vite."
msgstr "Тому намагайся рухатись швидше."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ccbbaba5"
msgid "C'est encore mieux."
msgstr "Так навіть краще."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_901a98f0"
msgid "La... La sensation est trop forte !"
msgstr "Відчуття... занадто сильне!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ebdcf69d"
msgid "Oh, c'est trop bon, c'est trop bon !"
msgstr "О-о, як добре, як добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ea7d11de"
msgid "Je... Je jouis, ça ne s'arrête plus !"
msgstr "Я... Я кінчаю, це більше не припиняється!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_b0fa850d"
msgid "Moi aussi... Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я теж..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ccf62854"
msgid "Ne te retire pas, jouis en moi !"
msgstr "Не відступай, увійди в мене!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_7928ef19"
msgid "[i]*respirations haletantes*[/i]"
msgstr "[i]*задишка*[/i]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_913b3015"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "Боже мій..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6e67dd3d"
msgid "Tu as aimé ?"
msgstr "Тобі сподобалося?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_3892724d"
msgid "La question ne se pose même pas."
msgstr "Це навіть не питання."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_bf9a8d67"
msgid "C'était incroyable !"
msgstr "Це було неймовірно!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4f2ac091"
msgid "D'ailleurs, ça m'a donné envie d'essayer encore énormément de choses ?"
msgstr "Тепер я хочу спробувати ще стільки речей!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_695f174e"
msgid "Voyez-vous ça."
msgstr "Що ж, як щодо цього."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_1f9c11bb"
msgid "Et qu'as-tu en tête exactement ?"
msgstr "І що саме ти маєш на увазі?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_b9764f6e"
msgid "Tu vas voir !"
msgstr "Ось побачиш!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_4363285e"
msgid "Maman ?"
msgstr "Мамо?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_9403ad93"
msgid "Où sont-ils passés ?"
msgstr "Куди вони пішли?"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`shame`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_e83b7e81"
msgid "La façon dont elle s'est débarrassée de moi est bien trop louche."
msgstr "Спосіб, у який вона мене позбулася, занадто схематичний..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_96001c67"
msgid "D'ailleurs, ils sont bien trop suspects tous les deux depuis quelque temps."
msgstr "До того ж останнім часом вони обидва були надто підозрілими."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_6ef2c241"
msgid "[font_size=9]Ouiiii, ouiii, ouiiiii ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=9]Так, та-а-ак, та-а-а-ак![/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_1c497a30"
msgid "[font_size=9]Continues ! Ne t'arrête pas, je sens que ça vient ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=9]Продовжуй! Не зупиняйся, я відчуваю, як воно наближається![/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_b105c547"
msgid "C'est quoi ces bruits ?"
msgstr "Що це за звуки?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_f6a0ba7c"
msgid "Ça vient de la chambre de ma mère."
msgstr "Вони доносяться з маминої спальні..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_c6a3ac5f"
msgid "[font_size=9]Maman ? Tout va bien ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=9]Мамо? Усе в порядку?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_db56e51c"
msgid "Tout... va... bien... mmmh... ma... chérie."
msgstr "Усе... добре... м-м-х... моє... сонечко!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_f03590c6"
msgid "Oh, mon Dieu, c'est trop bon."
msgstr "О Боже, як добре!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_8ed39b54"
msgid "[font_size=9]Ta voix est étrange, tu es malade ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=9]У тебе дивний голос. Ти захворіла?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_2b4e2008"
msgid "Oh, je sens que ça vient encore..."
msgstr "Ох, я знову кінчаю..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_d073fa81"
msgid "Ma chérie, maman est occupée."
msgstr "Сонечко, мама зайнята."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a8a3eded"
msgid "[font_size=9]As-tu vu {{saito.n}} ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=9]Ти бачила {{saito.n}}?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_8ee16a32"
msgid "Il... Il est en train de... de me... masser !"
msgstr "Він... Робить... Мені масаж!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_12a5d183"
msgid "[font_size=9]Il te fait un massage ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=9]Він робить тобі масаж?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_f551f99d"
msgid "C'est vraiment trop louche, je suis sûr qu'elle me ment."
msgstr "Це занадто схематично. Я впевнена, що вона бреше."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_ab7afb05"
msgid "On dirait des bruits de..."
msgstr "Ці звуки схожі на..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_39ae63bf"
msgid "Oh bon sang, j'adore... J'y suis presque !"
msgstr "Боже, як мені це подобається... Я майже все!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_9f3f4748"
msgid "Ouiii, Ouii, Ouiiiii !"
msgstr "Та-а-ак, та-а-ак, та-а-а-ак!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_29cd7803"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_0da8f27e"
msgid "Des massages ? C'est tout ce que tu as trouvé ?"
msgstr "Масаж? Це найкраще, що ти змогла придумати?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_0e19e63c"
msgid "Je n'avais que cette excuse en tête..."
msgstr "Це було єдине виправдання, яке я могла придумати..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_597cb186"
msgid "Elle s'en rendra bien compte un moment ou un autre."
msgstr "Рано чи пізно вона це зрозуміє."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_e54cafd6"
msgid "Je m'en fiche !"
msgstr "Мені всеодно!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_1df4c593"
msgid "Je veux continuer d'être heureuse et c'est avec toi que je le suis."
msgstr "Я хочу продовжувати бути щасливою, а це можливо лише тоді, коли я з тобою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_af9a0385"
msgid "{{noriko.n}} ne restera pas éternellement dans cette maison."
msgstr "{{noriko.n}} не залишиться у цьому домі назавжди."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_a14bde6d"
msgid "Elle finira bien par avoir son indépendance un jour au l'autre."
msgstr "Зрештою вона стане незалежною."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_16bf352c"
msgid "Exact..."
msgstr "Твоя правда..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_3102439e"
msgid "En attendant...[w] Continue à prendre soin de moi."
msgstr "А поки що...[w] продовжуй піклуватися про мене."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_0cd6c5af"
msgid "Tu n'avais même pas besoin de demander."
msgstr "Навіть не питай."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_46e6a45c"
msgid "Ils continuèrent encore longtemps jusqu'à ce que la nuit tombe."
msgstr "Вони продовжували так ще довго, поки не настала ніч."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_92f18943"
msgid "Mmmh..."
msgstr "М-м-м-х..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_c9ec7a17"
msgid "[font_size=14]De quoi as-tu envie ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Що ти хочеш?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_c3cca299"
msgid "Quand tu me chuchotes à l'oreille comme ça, j'en ai des frissons."
msgstr "У мене мурашки по шкірі, коли ти так шепочеш мені на вухо."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_yasuka_room_116a1580"
msgid "[font_size=14]Dis-moi ce que tu veux me faire et peut-être que je continuerais...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Скажи мені, що ти хочеш зі мною зробити, і, можливо, я продовжу...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t36d3400917"
msgid "[next]"
msgstr "[next]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_93f64652"
msgid "Allez, dépêche-toi !"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, поквапся!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_d65f10a2"
msgid "Tu sembles vraiment impatiente..."
msgstr "Ти така нетерпляча..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_b8d7d070"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_ce218a40"
msgid "C'est bon, c'est bon, à vos ordres !"
msgstr "Добре, добре, як скажеш!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_7b2a2d8c"
msgid "Mhhh, enfin..."
msgstr "Мх-х-х, нарешті..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_878e28dd"
msgid "Si j'avais su que ce serait si bon..."
msgstr "Якби я знала, що буде так добре..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_c80ee6e1"
msgid "Je t'aurais sauté dessus bien plus tôt !"
msgstr "Я б стрибнула на тебе раніше!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_bcfd080f"
msgid "Et j'aurais surement adoré ça..."
msgstr "І мені б це дуже сподобалося..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_f25bd397"
msgid "Je sens que ça viens !"
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як воно наближається!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_ffa8294d"
msgid "Plus fort !"
msgstr "Сильніше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_1c91e4ec"
msgid "Embrasse-moi !"
msgstr "Поцілуй мене!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_428ca705"
msgid "Oh, c'était si bon !"
msgstr "Ох, це було так добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_17475cfa"
msgid "J'espère que tu ne comptes pas t'arrêter là ?"
msgstr "Ти ж не плануєш на цьому зупинятися?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ted9e85052a"
msgid "Levrette"
msgstr "Собачий стиль."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_e7393e80"
msgid "J'avais hâte de refaire cette position..."
msgstr "Я з нетерпінням чекала, щоб знову спробувати себе в цій позиції..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_90f0b994"
msgid "Je te sens encore plus profond en moi !"
msgstr "Я відчуваю тебе ще глибше всередині себе!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_05b0106b"
msgid "Voilà, c'est cette sensation que je voulais retrouver !"
msgstr "Ось, це те відчуття, яке я шукала!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_64fce604"
msgid "C'est... Tellement... Mieux...."
msgstr "Ось... так... набагато... краще..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_18d11f53"
msgid "Est-ce que... Tu peux aller plus vite mon chéri ?"
msgstr "Ти... можеш швидше, любий?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_bc8c59ae"
msgid "Bien sûr !"
msgstr "Звичайно!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_80f0680a"
msgid "Ouiii, ouiii, ouiii !"
msgstr "Та-а-ак, та-а-ак, та-а-ак!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_de3887e4"
msgid "Comme ça !"
msgstr "Отак!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_18e6d678"
msgid "Encore !"
msgstr "Ще!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_318c7ab4"
msgid "Ça vient, je vais jouir !"
msgstr "Я кінчаю! Я зараз кінчу!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_8169b899"
msgid "Oh, c'est trop bon !"
msgstr "О, це так добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_047f8522"
msgid "Je tremble de partout."
msgstr "У мене все тіло тремтить."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_033f107b"
msgid "Tu sais que tu es incroyable..."
msgstr "Ти знаєш, ти дивовижна..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_33229f34"
msgid "C'est moi ou j'ai l'impression que tu n'es toujours pas satisfaite ?"
msgstr "Мені здається, ти все ще не задоволена?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_b8d7d070_1"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_73970114"
msgid "Ouiii, j'en veux encore."
msgstr "Та-а-ак, я хочу ще."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_73f6f149"
msgid "Je vais prendre les choses en main !"
msgstr "Цього разу я візьму ініціативу на себе!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_c40864fe"
msgid "Mmh..."
msgstr "Ммх..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_52defc2a"
msgid "Tu peux aller plus vite si tu veux."
msgstr "Якщо хочеш, можеш рухатись швидше."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_20633d6d"
msgid "Comme ça ?"
msgstr "Ось так?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_09bee5af"
msgid "Tu peux aller encore plus vite si tu veux !"
msgstr "Ти можеш рухатись ще швидше, якщо захочеш!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_a3bb2df8"
msgid "Oh, ouii !"
msgstr "О-о та-а-ак!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_d2cc785f"
msgid "Encore plus vite !"
msgstr "Навіть швидше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_ecbd03a2"
msgid "C'est trop bon ! C'est trop bon !"
msgstr "Це так добре! Дуже добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_b6492418"
msgid "Ahh, je vais jouir ! Je vais jouir !"
msgstr "Ах, я зараз кінчу! Я зараз кінчу!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_4429ca61"
msgid "Moi aussi je... ça vient !"
msgstr "Я теж! Я... Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_4226a81e"
msgid "Reste en moi, s'il te plait !"
msgstr "Не витягуй його, прошу!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_431eb3d7"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu..."
msgstr "Боже мій..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_7e097f2d"
msgid "J'espère que tu ne comptes pas t'arrêter là, non ?"
msgstr "Ти ж не плануєш зупинятися на досягнутому?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t7b174ea365"
msgid "Amazone"
msgstr "Амазонка."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_a1c7928a"
msgid "Oui, oui, oui !"
msgstr "Так, так, та-а-ак!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_ffa8294d_1"
msgid "Plus fort !"
msgstr "Сильніше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_7c7da694"
msgid "Continue !"
msgstr "Не зупиняйся!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_641381dd"
msgid "C'est tellement bon !"
msgstr "Це так добре!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_ae4ad53b"
msgid "[font_size=14]Maman ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Мамо?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_1345035e"
msgid "Je suis occupée ma chérie."
msgstr "Мама зайнята, сонечко."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_5c599ea4"
msgid "Reviens plus tard !"
msgstr "Приходь пізніше!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_cb34eab4"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu es avec {{saito.n}} ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Ти з {{saito.n}}?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_a8559f90"
msgid "Oui !"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_05109271"
msgid "[font_size=14]Vous faites quoi ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Що ви робите?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_dad79f7a"
msgid "Oh, bon sang !"
msgstr "О, Боже!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_02aa3d16"
msgid "Tu es infatigable..."
msgstr "Ти невтомний..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_66dbe0e7"
msgid "C'est toi qui me donnes envie de me dépasser !"
msgstr "Саме завдяки тобі я хочу перевершити себе!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_9fc616da"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_dfbd72bc"
msgid "Je suis sûre qu'elle me ment !"
msgstr "Я впевнена, що вона бреше мені!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_df6fa795"
msgid "Ma chérie, je suis très occupée avec {{saito.n}} !"
msgstr "Сонечко, я дуже зайнята з {{saito.n}}!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_157cf316"
msgid "Repasse dans une... Non, deux heures !"
msgstr "Приходь за годину... Або ні, за дві години!"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_c6d5b18e"
msgid "Quoi, deux heures ?! M-"
msgstr "Скільки, дві години?! Але..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_6aa0ac01"
msgid "Je t'avais dit que cette situation serait compliquée."
msgstr "Я ж казав, що ситуація буде складною."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_edfa2d71"
msgid "Je sais..."
msgstr "Я знаю..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_283f1b0c"
msgid "Mais je m'en fiche."
msgstr "Але мені байдуже."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_fe787873"
msgid "Je veux en profiter sans être dérangée !"
msgstr "Я хочу насолоджуватися життям, щоб мені ніхто не заважав!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_77b103d4"
msgid "Vos désirs sont des ordres !"
msgstr "Твоє бажання — мій наказ!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t0184c7b5e1"
msgid "Timelapse"
msgstr "Таймлапс"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_34ec5686"
msgid "Mon Dieu..."
msgstr "О, Боже..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_7d28106d"
msgid "Je n'en peux plus !"
msgstr "Я більше не можу!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_1c6454c3"
msgid "Dis-moi que tu as eu ton compte ?"
msgstr "Будь ласка, скажи, що з тебе досить?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_b25c2222"
msgid "[font_size=14]Merci mon chéri...[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Дякую, любий...[/font_size]"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_f96b0c16"
msgid "[font_size=14]Tu veux rester dormir ici ?[/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Хочеш переночувати тут сьогодні?[/font_size]"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_53c814c7"
msgid "Allez, j'ai du pain sur la planche !"
msgstr "У мене ще багато справ!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t5de7c9f377"
msgid "Pourquoi pas !"
msgstr "Чому ні?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_a9dad176"
msgid "D'accord."
msgstr "Гаразд."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_124b9811"
msgid "Bonne nuit mon chéri."
msgstr "На добраніч, любий."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_70821b2f"
msgid "Tu m'as épuisée, je crois que je pourrais m'endormir d'une seconde à l'autre."
msgstr "Ти мене виснажив. Схоже тепер я можу заснути в будь-який момент."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_9ffdfbf9"
msgid "Bonne nuit !"
msgstr "На добраніч!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_c14d9a6c"
msgid "Bonne nuit mon chéri !"
msgstr "На добраніч, любий!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t93a60f627c"
msgid "J'ai encore des choses à faire."
msgstr "У мене ще є справи."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t4a3aa2f59a"
msgid "Ça ira pour aujourd'hui !"
msgstr "На сьогодні все!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_8e2b7d21"
msgid "Tu es vraiment infatigable..."
msgstr "Ти справді невтомний..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_9d9c47d0"
msgid "[font_size=14]Mais j'adore ça ![/font_size]"
msgstr "[font_size=14]Але мені подобається![/font_size]"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t9568e93c9b"
msgid "Encore !"
msgstr "Ще!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_64c09b00"
msgid "Elle a l'air de dormir à poing fermé."
msgstr "Вона, здається, міцно спить."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_3c746642"
msgid "Je ferai peut-être mieux de m'assurer qu'elle n'est pas fait un malaise."
msgstr "Треба переконатися, що вона не знепритомніла."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_4bc5f2cf"
msgid "Ou autre chose."
msgstr "Або щось ще."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_edb624be"
msgid "J'allume la lumière quelques secondes, ça devrait me permettre d'avoir la conscience tranquille."
msgstr "Я увімкну світло на кілька секунд. Цього має бути достатньо для мого спокою."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_4ad13b11"
msgid "Eh bien, eh bien, qui voilà ?"
msgstr "Ну-ну, хто це там?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_005e16fd"
msgid "Moi qui pensais devoir venir dans ta chambre pour une petite visite nocturne..."
msgstr "І тут я подумала, що мені треба буде зайти до тебе в кімнату сьогодні ввечері..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_14bfc72d"
msgid "{{yasuka.n}} est-ce que tout va bien ?"
msgstr "Усе гаразд, {{yasuka.n}}?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_57a791c0"
msgid "Il semblerait qu'au club, tu aies été droguée par..."
msgstr "Схоже, у клубі тебе накачали наркотиками..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_fb13de64"
msgid "Shhhh, ne dit rien !"
msgstr "Тсс, нічого не кажи!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_18ed30a1"
msgid "Je promets de t'écouter autant que tu le souhaites, mais avant..."
msgstr "Обіцяю, що буду слухати тебе стільки, скільки захочеш, але спочатку..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_50d4b793"
msgid "Avant ?"
msgstr "Спочатку?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_cfdda3c3"
msgid "Je veux que tu viennes te glisser sous les couvertures avec moi."
msgstr "Я хочу, щоб ти заліз зі мною під ковдру."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_8baf7f76"
msgid "Non {{yasuka.n}}, justement, c'est ça le problème !"
msgstr "Ні, {{yasuka.n}}, саме в цьому й проблема!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_dc45f29b"
msgid "Tu n'es plus dans ton état normal, t-"
msgstr "Ти не в нормальному стані душі!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_750aa037"
msgid "Il me semble pourtant que tu n'étais pas aussi timide la dernière fois que je suis venu dans ta chambre..."
msgstr "Я пригадую, що минулого разу, коли я заходила до тебе, ти не був таким сором'язливим..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_66332e88"
msgid "Ce grand lit est vraiment très froid, et j'aimerais beaucoup que tu viennes me réchauffer."
msgstr "Це величезне ліжко дуже холодне, і я дуже хочу, щоб ти прийшов і зігрів мене."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_7f9d4463"
msgid "Je... Je..."
msgstr "Я... Я..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_00dc0725"
msgid "Je dois te parler de quelque chose d'important avant !"
msgstr "Спершу я маю поговорити з тобою про дещо важливе!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_3969010e"
msgid "Mais tu as été dr-"
msgstr "Ти була докт-"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_b0f7b963"
msgid "Tututu ! Je ne veux rien entendre. Promis, j'écouterai ce que tu as à me dire après !"
msgstr "Тсс! Я не хочу нічого слухати. Обіцяю, що потім вислухаю!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_889d3700"
msgid "Mais avant ça..."
msgstr "Але перед тим..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_a05e5d3f"
msgid "J'ai envie de toi maintenant, rejoins-moi tout de suite dans ce lit !"
msgstr "Я хочу тебе прямо зараз, тож приєднуйся до мене в цьому ліжку!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_b57b8c90"
msgid "Bon... Elle n'en démordra pas."
msgstr "Що ж... Вона не збирається здаватися."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_8965df4e"
msgid "Après, c'est peut-être affreux de penser ça mais..."
msgstr "Хай там як, це може бути жахливо з мого боку навіть думати про це, але..."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_bd58c0f4"
msgid "Le faire avec elle est loin pour me déplaire."
msgstr "Робити це з нею мені зовсім не неприємно."

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_c88feff6"
msgid "Mais est-ce que ça ne serait pas abuser de son état ?"
msgstr "Чи не було б це зловживанням її станом?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_cf47fddc"
msgid "Rhaaaa ! Pourquoi je me prends la tête comme ça ?"
msgstr "Гаааа, навіщо я все ускладнюю?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_030ce30c"
msgid "Mon chéri... Maman veut ton sexe en elle !"
msgstr "Милий... Матуся хоче твій член в собі!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_417d9d8f"
msgid "Dépêche-toi, sinon c'est moi qui viendrai te chercher !"
msgstr "Поквапся, або я прийду за тобою!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_65d86c48"
msgid "Mam- Je... Oui, tout de suite !"
msgstr "Ма- Я... Так, негайно!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_5cf01dee"
msgid "Oh et puis merde, je suis bien trop excité maintenant pour penser de manière rationnelle !"
msgstr "О, чорт, я занадто схвильований, щоб мислити раціонально!"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_1f978e50"
msgid "Quitte à passer à l'acte, je préfère que ce soit avec moi."
msgstr "Якщо їй доведеться це зробити, я б вважав за краще, щоб вона була зі мною."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_a5acbba5"
msgid "Eh bien, tu vois quand tu veux..."
msgstr "Ну, бачиш, коли хочеш..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_8bb19557"
msgid "Mmmmh... Oui !"
msgstr "Ммммх... Так!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_2c2b9cea"
msgid "J'attendais ça depuis si longtemps."
msgstr "Я так довго чекала."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_6eef6615"
msgid "Pourquoi tu ne voyais pas tous les signaux que je t'envoyais ?"
msgstr "Чому ти не реагував на всі сигнали, які я тобі надсилала?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_ac6d81a7"
msgid "Pourquoi as-tu pris autant de temps ?"
msgstr "Чому так довго?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_a4518ba4"
msgid "Tu aurais dû me prendre sauvagement contre le mur il y a bien longtemps !"
msgstr "Ти вже давно повинен був притиснути мене до стіни!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_f0f9fcc8"
msgid "Mhhh..."
msgstr "Мххх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_e4947321"
msgid "Continue tes va-et-viens !"
msgstr "Не зупинятися!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_6fd6cad9"
msgid "Maman veut son câlin et elle l'aura !"
msgstr "Матуся хоче своїх обіймів, і вона їх отримає!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_738d74ac"
msgid "Maman ?"
msgstr "Матуся?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_3c867bfc"
msgid "Oui ! Appelle-moi maman !"
msgstr "Так! Називай мене матусею!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_6fca0a49"
msgid "Maintenant embrasse-moi mon chéri !"
msgstr "А тепер поцілуй мене, любий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_c80cff1e"
msgid "Hannnn, encore... encore !"
msgstr "Аххх, більше... Більше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_eec52e93"
msgid "Mhhh, je te sens vibrer en moi."
msgstr "Я відчуваю, як ти смикаєшся усередині мене."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_d26dca79"
msgid "Plus vite mon chéri, plus vite !"
msgstr "Швидше, любий, швидше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_0be12655"
msgid "Je... Ça vient !"
msgstr "Я... Я кінчаю!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_78a5207a"
msgid "Ne te retire pas !"
msgstr "Не витягай!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_61d11360"
msgid "Reste en moi !"
msgstr "Залишайся в мені!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_0beda12d"
msgid "Oh mon Dieu !"
msgstr "Боже мій!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_0d57e626"
msgid "Encore, s'il te plait, encore !"
msgstr "Ще! Будь ласка, ще!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_e4dc69c7"
msgid "Je ne veux pas que tu te retires."
msgstr "Я не хочу, щоб ти витагнув."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_4e829ccf"
msgid "C'est tellement bon..."
msgstr "Це так добре..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_296ea0f8"
msgid "Je voudrais que ce moment ne s'arrête jamais."
msgstr "Хотілося б, щоб ця мить ніколи не закінчувалася."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_cf060e12"
msgid "Mmmmh..."
msgstr "Ммммх..."

#. Character:`centered`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "sleeping_with_yasuka_2_c9d99a4f"
msgid "Après avoir continué encore et encore jusqu'au petit matin, {{saito.n}} tomba d'épuisement et sombra dans un profond sommeil."
msgstr "Продовжуючи знову і знову до світанку, {{saito.n}} від виснаження впав і заснув глибоким сном."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_7d534ea9"
msgid "Oh, la vache, quelle nuit..."
msgstr "О Боже, що за ніч..."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_c0d41020"
msgid "Mais...! C'est déjà le soir ?!"
msgstr "Що!... Вже вечір?!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_d2c105d0"
msgid "J'ai tellement bien dormi que j'ai presque fait le tour du cadran."
msgstr "Я спав так добре, що майже цілодобово."

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_c3e2c8da"
msgid "Je peux savoir ce que tu fais dans la chambre de ma mère en caleçon, espèce de gros pervers ?"
msgstr "Скажи мені, що ти робиш у кімнаті моєї матері в одній білизні, виродку?"

#. Character:`noriko`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_76b9e916"
msgid "T'étais en train de te branler dans ses sous-vêtements, j'en suis certaine."
msgstr "Я впевнена, що ти дрочив на її білизну."

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_13417148"
msgid "NON ! Je... Il y a une explication à ça, mais..."
msgstr "Ні! Я... Я можу пояснити, але..."

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_d0244fff"
msgid "Quand elle apprendra ça, j'en connais un qui va dormir dehors !"
msgstr "Коли вона дізнається про це, я знаю когось, хто буде спати на вулиці!"

#. Character:`saito` | Attributes:`upset`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_928806ee"
msgid "...peu importe, pense ce que tu veux !"
msgstr "...Та пофіг! Думай, що хочеш!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_d6fa2e29"
msgid "Maintenant bouge de là, je suis pressé !"
msgstr "А тепер відвали! Я поспішаю!"

#. Character:`noriko` | Attributes:`afraid`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "yasuka_love_sexe_repeat_79977168"
msgid "M-"
msgstr "Але..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_c0dc4e1d"
msgid "Eh bien alors ?"
msgstr "І що далі?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_a9d66e94"
msgid "Tu vas rester longtemps comme ça à me regarder ?"
msgstr "Як довго ти збираєшся витріщатися на мене?"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_f38977c8"
msgid "Je n'osais pas te réveiller."
msgstr "Я не хотів тебе будити."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_a9f7d45e"
msgid "Et puis, tu étaies magnifique donc je voulais en profiter encore un peu."
msgstr "До того ж ти була такою красивою, що мені хотілося насолоджуватися цим трохи довше."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_e284369c"
msgid "Et si tu me rejoignais pour profiter encore plus ?"
msgstr "Як щодо того, щоб приєднатися до мене, щоб отримати ще більше задоволення?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_df906ab5"
msgid "Tu aurais attendu encore un peu plus et c'est moi qui t'aurais trainé sous la couverture !"
msgstr "Якби ти ще трохи почекав, я б затягнула тебе під ковдру!"

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_32e787e0"
msgid "Je suis désolé, mais je crois que j'aime bien te faire languir"
msgstr "Вибач, але мені подобається змушувати тебе чекати."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_cadc479d"
msgid "Tu es si cruel."
msgstr "Ти такий жорстокий."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_283c7dca"
msgid "Mmmh..."
msgstr "Мммх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_ffa8294d"
msgid "Plus fort !"
msgstr "Сильніше!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_f7599ffc"
msgid "Voilà, comme ça, c'est bien !"
msgstr "Так! Ось так! Так добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_1c91e4ec"
msgid "Embrasse-moi !"
msgstr "Поцілуй мене!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_b50f4b43"
msgid "Mmmhh, c'est tellement bon."
msgstr "Мммхх, це так добре!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_e6406a34"
msgid "Dors avec moi cette nuit."
msgstr "Поспи зі мною сьогодні."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_3aefee92"
msgid "Je ne veux pas dormir seule dans un lit aussi grand !"
msgstr "Я не хочу спати одна у такому великому ліжку."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_317145de"
msgid "Bien sûr, je n'irai nulle part ailleurs !"
msgstr "Звичайно! Я більше нікуди не піду!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_c2922c37"
msgid "Oh ! Oh, ça vient, ça vient !"
msgstr "Ах! Ах, воно наближається! Наближається!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_65c12a51"
msgid "Oh, c'est si fort !"
msgstr "О, він такий твердий!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_bf7b511c"
msgid "Reste en moi !"
msgstr "Залишайся в мені!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_283c7dca_1"
msgid "Mmmh..."
msgstr "Мммх..."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_4d624d38"
msgid "Reste en moi comme ça !"
msgstr "Залишайся в мені ось так!"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_899398e3"
msgid "Je suis tellement bien contre toi."
msgstr "Мені так добре перед тобою."

#. Character:`saito`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_813a9c0c"
msgid "Tu veux recommencer ?"
msgstr "Хочеш повторити знову?"

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "spoon_with_yasuka_7ad51698"
msgid "Je ne sais pas... Tu as encore un peu d'énergie pour moi ?"
msgstr "Не знаю... Ти ще маєш трохи енергії для мене?"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2345145b7b"
msgid "Oui"
msgstr "Так"

#. Character:`narrator`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "t2da98ada4a"
msgid "Non"
msgstr "Ні"

#. Character:`netoru`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "AH_VOUS_TIEZ_ICI_B68829"
msgid "Ah vous étiez ici !"
msgstr "А, ви тут були!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`sad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_D_SOL_E_JE_CROIS_QUE_TOUS_74B32B"
msgid "Oui désolée, je crois que tous ces soudains changements m'ont épuisée."
msgstr "Так, вибач, здається, всі ці раптові зміни мене виснажили."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_N_AI_PAS_L_HABITUDE_D_TRE_A_3CE0C8"
msgid "Je n'ai pas l'habitude d'être autant en froid avec eux comme ça."
msgstr "Я не звикла ставитися до них настільки холодно."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "J_AI_L_IMPRESSION_DE_LES_AVOIR_55542F"
msgid "J'ai l'impression de les avoir trahis."
msgstr "Мені здається, що я їх зрадила."

#. Character:`netoru`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LES_JEUNES_SONT_SOUVENT_INGRAT_774F86"
msgid "Les jeunes sont souvent ingrats, il n'y a qu'en grandissant qu'on finit par comprendre pourquoi nos parents ont agi ainsi plutôt qu'autrement..."
msgstr "Молодь часто буває невдячною; лише з віком починаєш розуміти, чому наші батьки поступили саме так, а не інакше..."

#. Character:`netoru`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "LES_CICATRICES_S_EFFACERONT_AV_10309F"
msgid "Les cicatrices s'effaceront avec le temps."
msgstr "Шрами з часом зникнуть."

#. Character:`yasuka`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "OUI_VOUS_AVEZ_PROBABLEMENT_RAI_88C838"
msgid "Oui... Vous avez probablement raison, je fais ce qui doit être fait !"
msgstr "Так... Ймовірно, ви маєте рацію, я роблю те, що потрібно зробити."

#. Character:`netoru` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "JE_CHANGE_DE_SUJET_MAIS_VOUS_A_D1A8F0"
msgid "Je change de sujet mais vous avez une chambre ravissante..."
msgstr "Я змінюю тему, але у вас дуже чарівна кімната..."

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`neutral`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "home_player_livingroom_8e15be81"
msgid "Merci..."
msgstr "Дякую..."

#. Character:`netoru` | Attributes:`bad`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "ET_VU_QUE_NOUS_AVONS_LA_MAISON_767F21"
msgid "Et vu que nous avons la maison rien que pour nous, que diriez-vous d'en profiter ?"
msgstr "І оскільки весь будинок тепер у нас, що скажете, якщо ми скористаємося ним?"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`surprised`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUOI_MAIS_ON_A_D_J_PASS_LA_NUI_D28F6F"
msgid "Quoi mais, on a déjà passé la nuit au Love-hotel et..."
msgstr "Але ми вже провели ніч в любовному готелі..."

#. Character:`netoru`
#: game/story/home_player_livingroom.dialogue
#: game/story/home_player_yasuka_room.dialogue
msgctxt "QUE_VOULEZ_VOUS_RIEN_QUE_LE_FA_A64C15"
msgid "Que voulez-vous, rien que le fait d'être avec vous me fait retrouver mes vingt ans, et je compte bien profiter de cette nouvelle jeunesse !"
msgstr "Що ви хочете? Всього лише те, щоб бути з вами, вже дає мені відчуття, ніби я знову двадцятирічний, і я збираюся повною мірою насолоджуватися цією новою молодістю!"

#. Character:`yasuka` | Attributes:`upset`
